window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4401,"title":"Chapter 4401 Mutual Destruction","paragraphs":["4401 Mutual Destruction","At that moment, the strong wind blew Jian Wushuang’s black hair. He looked at the chaotic divine Thunder with a serious expression.","The Hundun divine lightning hadn’t even struck yet, but the overwhelming pressure already made him unable to hold on and his body began to tremble.","In front of this divine lightning, he was as small as an ant looking up at the sky.","The Hundun divine lightning was much more powerful than the five elements divine lightning!","“Break!”","Jian Wushuang growled and his body glowed with a golden light. His blood Qi was boiling and his purple-gold eyes were even more dazzling!","Bang!","Facing this divine lightning, he took a step forward and went against the flow of the divine lightning. He then punched the divine lightning!","BOOM!","With a loud explosion, Jian Wushuang’s figure drew an arc in the air like a kite with a broken string and fell to the ground.","Jian Wushuang was defeated by only one divine Thunder!","His God Body, which was as bright as gold and stone, had thousands of cracks. He was like a ceramic doll that was glued together and was about to break.","“Hahahaha, good blow! Kill Jian Wushuang!”","Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog burst into laughter upon seeing this.","As for the Ninth Kalpa King, his eyes narrowed, and his heart continued to sink.","He had just received a message from the Blood Wave Supreme, ordering him to return to the Divine Life Palace as soon as possible. The Divine Life Palace was in a state of extreme urgency under the pressure of the five great factions.","Before his eyes, Jian Wushuang was facing the chaotic Lightning Tribulation and was in a situation where he had a slim chance of survival.","Cough, cough, cough.","Jian Wushuang coughed heavily, as if he was about to suffocate. He spat out black smoke.","He took a deep breath and turned to Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog. He asked coldly, “Do you think it’s funny?”","Hearing this, Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog felt even more amused. They looked at each other and shook their heads, “Jian Wushuang, the sins of the heavens can be forgiven, but the sins of one’s own self can not be lived. Now that even the heavens want to kill you, who can you blame?”","Buzz, buzz, buzz.","In the sky, the second chaotic divine lightning was gradually accumulating.","Its power was even stronger than before!","Jian Wushuang raised his head to look at the Lightning Tribulation in the sky, then looked at Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog again. The corners of his mouth gradually pulled up into a sinister sneer.","Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog looked at Jian Wushuang, who had a malicious look on his face, and for some reason, their hearts suddenly quivered.","“Jian Wushuang, what do you want?”","Long Qing asked, pretending to be calm.","“What are you doing? Didn’t you say that the heavens wanted to kill me?”","With a sneer, Jian Wushuang stomped his feet and charged toward Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog!","The primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation above Jian Wushuang’s head also moved along with his movement!","“Not good! Jian Wushuang, this little thief, wants to drag us to bear the Lightning Tribulation with him!”","Supreme Green Dog’s scalp went numb as he shouted.","Long Qing’s face also turned blank.","The Thunder calamity did not have an active consciousness. It would only lock onto Jian Wushuang. As for the others that appeared within the range of the Thunder calamity, it would only treat them as Jian Wushuang’s Secret skill, super power, and so on, and attack them indiscriminately!","Rumble!","As Jian Wushuang stepped on the air and rushed to Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog’s side, the chaotic divine lightning that had already condensed and was about to strike Jian Wushuang split into three again. Its power did not weaken at all, and it turned toward Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog and struck them as well!","Damn it!!!","Long Qing growled as he looked at the incoming chaotic divine lightning. He had no choice but to raise his hand and block it!","Supreme Green Dog quickly formed hand seals with both hands and used his Supreme divine arts to resist the primal Chaos Divine lightning!","Bang!","Three bolts of divine lightning struck down at the same time!","Jian Wushuang took out the Wuxu chaotic cauldron again, drew out the primordial chaotic Qi, and hit the chaotic divine Thunder!","Boom, boom, boom!","Three earth-shaking sounds of collision rang out. After the three chaotic divine thunders, Jian Wushuang, Long Qing, and Supreme Green Dog were all heavily smashed.","Jian Wushuang and Long Qing were better off. After all, one had chaotic Ruleric body and the other was a Dragon. Their bodies were at the top level of the universe. Other than their qi and blood boiling and their bodies exploding, their vitality was not severely damaged.","As for Supreme Green Dog, he was in a miserable state. Countless secret techniques were directly destroyed by the lightning and he spat out an endless amount of divine blood. His face instantly turned pale and he was on the verge of collapsing.","“Crazy! This was a lunatic! Jian Wushuang wants to take us down with him!”","Supreme Green Dog’s eyes were filled with anger as he roared.","In the next moment, he turned around and was about to flee into the distance.","Long Qing wiped away the faint golden blood from the corner of his mouth. After giving Jian Wushuang a death stare, he also fled.","The chaos Divine lightning was getting stronger and stronger. Who knew how powerful it would be if a few more bolts of Chaos Divine lightning came?","When some Supreme-beings in the distance saw this scene, they trembled and quickly retreated, afraid that Jian Wushuang would drag a few people down with him before he died.","“You want to escape? Don’t you want to see how we die? Why aren’t you watching?”","...","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and sneered. He took a step forward and was about to chase after Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog.","The primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation was too terrifying, and he didn’t even know if he could survive it. If he were to die in the Tribulation, he might as well drag Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog down with him!","Just as he was about to give chase, the Ninth Kalpa King’s voice suddenly rang in his mind.","Jian Wushuang, this place is not far from the Divine Life Palace. Let’s return to the Divine Life Palace quickly!","“What?”","Jian Wushuang’s body trembled slightly. He turned to look at Ninth Kalpa King and said, “What’s wrong with the Divine Life Palace?”","The Ninth Kalpa King took a deep breath and replied in a deep voice, “Jian Wushuang. The Divine Life Palace is in grave danger now that the five Forces are attacking it!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s right hand trembled. He looked deeply at Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog. He no longer chased after them. Instead, with a flash of his body, he flew toward the Divine Life Palace!","The primal Chaos tribulation lightning above his head also began to move!","The Ninth Kalpa King looked at the Lightning Tribulation above his head and Jian Wushuang, who was flying away quickly, and the corners of his mouth lifted into a smile.","If this Primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation were to join the battle, it would definitely be a ‘huge surprise’, right?","...","The next moment, the Ninth Kalpa King did not hesitate at all. He took a step forward and also chased in the direction of the Divine Life Palace.","....","In the distance.","Supreme Green Dog, who was still in shock, and Long Qing, who had a gloomy expression, stood in the air.","Long Qing, it seems like Jian Wushuang is planning to bring the Lightning Tribulation to the battlefield in the Divine Life Palace. What should we do? ”","Supreme Green Dog asked with an unsightly expression.","The Divine Life Palace was currently being attacked by the five great forces. The number of Supremes on the battlefield was probably more than his hands and feet combined. Once Jian Wushuang brought the primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation, what kind of scene would it be?","Dozens of Supreme martial artists transcending their tribulations at the same time?","Just thinking about it made Supreme Green Dog’s scalp go numb.","“What else can we do? Let’s go to the battlefield of the Divine Life Palace!”","Long Qing replied with a dark expression."]},{"number":4402,"title":"Chapter 4402 Living and Dying Together","paragraphs":["4402 Living and Dying Together","At the same time.","In the Divine Life Palace.","Many space cruisers stopped at the entrance of the Divine Life Palace. One could not see the end of it.","Dozens of Supreme martial artists stood on the deck with their hands behind their backs, not saying a word.","!!","Although they didn’t speak, their powerful auras had already spread out to cover the sky and earth, enough to suffocate people.","The leader was a young man with two horns on his head and white scales on his cheeks.","He didn’t appear to be very old, but everyone knew that this Dragon Tribe member known as Long Bai was actually an old freak who had lived through more than a thousand chaos cycles.","He was also the younger twin brother of Long Ye, the third-generation dragon clan member who had participated in the battle of the Divine Life Palace tens of thousands of years ago.","Not long ago, he had broken through to become an invincible Ruler and was now in charge of leading the Dragon race to raze the Divine Life Palace.","“This is my first battle after breaking through to the invincible Ruler level. I’ll use this battle to make my name known throughout the universe!”","Long Bai’s eyes flickered with excitement. He waved his right hand forward and sneered, “Kill!”","In an instant, the dozen or so Dragon Tribe powerhouses behind him all transformed into their true forms and crashed toward the Divine Life Palace.","Beside him, Supreme Bing Ye, Scarlet Sun Demon Master, and the Blood Sky Hall Master also had a glint in their eyes. They led their disciples and charged toward the Divine Life Palace.","For a moment, the void in front of the Divine Life Palace was filled with Supremes and Rulers of all levels. It was a dark mass that stretched as far as the eye could see.","In this battle, the five forces had sent a total of more than 20 Supremes. Among them, Long Bai had the highest cultivation and was an expert who had just entered the invincible Supreme realm. Supreme Bing Ye and Scarlet Sun Demon Master were slightly inferior and were half-step invincible Supremes. As for the Blood Sky Hall Master, he was a peak Supreme!","This lineup was not small, and it was not any weaker than the battle when the six great forces besieged the Divine Life Palace!","On the other hand, the Divine Life Palace.","Supreme Master Gai Fu was in a deep sleep, Supreme Master White Tiger was dead, and Supreme Giant Axe had only just recovered from his serious injuries. It was hard to say how much battle strength he had.","...","At the entrance of the Divine Life Palace.","The Blood Wave Supreme, the Supreme Giant Axe, and the Heavenly Dipper Supreme were standing side by side.","Behind them, seven junior, middle, and advanced Supreme martial artists followed closely.","There were a total of ten Supreme martial artists!","This was all the combat power that the Divine Life Palace could bring out at the moment!","“Lord Blood Wave, I just received news that Hei Yu has already led Cosmos Temple to intercept the reinforcements from the Starry Sky Sword Sect! I’m afraid...the Starry Sky Sword Sect won’t be here any time soon.”","An ordinary Supreme martial artist said bitterly behind him.","“Lord Blood Wave, I just received a message from the nine thearchs Pavilion. The Great Sun Divine Kingdom, which has been saying that they will no longer participate in the war, has been blocked by the King of Day’s men outside the universe passage!”","The other ordinary Supreme-being said with an unsightly expression.","The Ruler Blood Wave fell silent upon hearing this.","The two great reinforcements had been cut off.","This time, the six great forces had schemed to completely destroy the Divine Life Palace!","It could be said that the life force of the Divine Life Palace had been completely cut off.","Only after a long time did the Ruler Blood Wave take a deep breath. He turned to Supreme Heavenly Dipper and asked, “Heavenly Dipper, how’s the construction of the channel that connects the edge of the universe in the Divine Palace going?”","Supreme Heavenly Dipper nodded his head and replied in a deep voice, “Blood Wave, that passage has been tested and is almost stable. It is enough to send the disciples of the Divine Palace to the edge of the universe. I have already sent people there to receive them.”","The Ruler Blood Wave could not help but smile in relief upon hearing this. “That’s good. As long as they’re still here, the roots of the Divine Life Palace will still be here. Sooner or later, they’ll be able to return to us.”","The ‘universe channel’ he mentioned was their last resort. Once the Divine Life Palace was broken, the universe channel would be able to accommodate any cultivator below the Supreme-being level. They would be able to leave the Divine Life Palace and be transported to the edge of the universe.","“Giant Axe, how’s your situation?”","The Blood Wave Supreme turned to look at the Supreme Giant Axe beside him and asked worriedly.","“Hahaha, Blood Wave, you don’t have to worry about me. Even if I die today, I won’t let them have a good time!”","Supreme Giant Axe laughed and raised the Giant Axe in his hand. He didn’t show the slightest fear and instead rushed into the sky!","“Alright!”","The Ruler Blood Wave also laughed heartily. Now that things had come to this, there were no more restraints and nothing to worry about.","“Giant Axe, Heavenly Dipper, we will fight to the death!”","Bang!","Blood Wave took a heavy step forward and raised his head to look at the many Supreme martial artists who were flying over in an overwhelming manner. His eyes were filled with a cold killing intent!","“Kill!”","die! Supreme Blood Wave spat out coldly. He pulled out a river of blood with his right hand and charged forward with unparalleled divine power!","“I will fight you to the death!”","Supreme Giant Axe roared and transformed into a giant that was a hundred thousand feet tall. Raising his heaven splitting giant axe, he cleaved down at one of the Dragon race supreme beings!","“Come on! Just kill me!”","He let out a violent roar, and every step he took produced a muffled boom. The giant axe in his hand released a sharp axe light, like an ancient God that split the primordial chaos and dispersed all the clear and turbid air. He was about to split the world!","“Only...fight to the death!”","Ruler Heavenly Dipper muttered to himself with a cold expression.","He slowly pulled his right hand back, and a Scarlet arrow automatically condensed on the sun shooting bow. He aimed at a top Supreme-being and instantly shot!","...","The three chief Supremes of the Divine Life Palace had died!","Behind the three of them, the seven ordinary Supreme martial artists also unleashed their strongest power and turned into several streams of light, charging toward the black mass of the dragon clan’s Alliance Army!","The battle had entered its most intense state from the very beginning!","At the same time, in the Divine Life Palace.","A dark light mirror that looked like a heavenly curtain was reflected in the sky above the Divine Life Palace. The mirror was broadcasting the battle outside the Divine Life Palace.","All the disciples of the Divine Life Palace, including the river Spirit of the Dao Comprehension River, were gathered under the dark light mirror. They clenched their fists tightly and stared at the mirror.","The Divine Life Palace was their home!","“Alright, little guys, quickly go into the passageway and prepare to teleport.”","A muffled voice was emitted. It was precisely Yan Shan.","Because he could not move, he could not participate in the war outside the Divine Palace.","He was left behind to be in charge of the transportation of the disciples of the Divine Life Palace.","...","At the same time, he was also the last obstacle in the Divine Life Palace, guarding the last gate for the palace!","Once the Ruler Blood Wave and the others fell, the Divine Life Palace would fall, and he would be the final line of defense here!","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh.","However, the Divine Life Palace was silent.","Not a single person left.","They clenched their fists tightly and did not move an inch.","“What are you guys doing?”","Yan Shan’s voice became rough as he said.","One of the disciples of the Divine Palace gritted his teeth and said, “Supreme martial artist Yan Shan, the Divine Life Palace is my home. Now that my home is gone, what’s the point of me living?”","“Not bad! Rather than living in secret, I would rather die!”","“We are willing to live and die with the Divine Life Palace!”","For a moment, the Divine Life Palace was in high spirits, and their voices resounded through the sky and shook the earth!"]},{"number":4403,"title":"Chapter 4403 The Return","paragraphs":["4403 The Return","On top of a towering mountain, Supreme Yan Shan’s human face couldn’t help but reveal a moved expression when he saw this scene.","A warm current was flowing in his body.","As the saying goes, when a tree falls, monkeys scatter, and when a great disaster strikes, they fly away on their own. How fortunate was the Divine Life Palace to have such a group of disciples who were willing to live and die together?","The Divine Life Palace might not be the most powerful force in the universe, but it was far from comparable to other top forces!","!!","Taking in a deep breath, Supreme Yan Shan’s expression darkened as he berated, “Don’t mess around! The Ruler Blood Wave and the others are using their lives to buy time for you. If you don’t leave, won’t their sacrifices be in vain?”","As his voice fell, Supreme Yan Shan’s tone became slightly gentler as he continued, “Listen up, you are the root of the Divine Life Palace. As long as you don’t die, even if the Divine Life Palace is destroyed today, I believe that you will come back one day and restore the Divine Palace!","“But if you die, the Divine Life Palace will really be destroyed!!”","Toward the end, Supreme martial artist Yan Shan’s voice was like the voice of the heavenly Duke striking the head, deafening even the deaf!","As soon as he said that, the Divine Life Palace fell into a dead silence, leaving only the sound of heavy breathing.","How could they not understand what Supreme martial artist Yan Shan had said?","“Supreme martial artist Yan Shan, just watch a little longer. We’ll leave after a little longer!”","A female disciple of the Divine Palace bit her lower lip, her eyes full of reluctance.","When Supreme Yan Shan heard this, he could only sigh and agree to this request.","...","Outside the Divine Life Palace.","“Hahaha, I, Long Bai, am destined to be famous in this battle!”","Long Bai’s eyes flickered with excitement as he continued to command the experts on the battlefield to kill Supreme Blood Wave and the others!","The Supremes of the Divine Life Palace were powerful, and because each of them was a special life form, they were able to unleash power several times stronger than those of the same realm!","The Blood Wave Supreme went all out, suppressing Supreme Bing Ye with his attacks.","As Supreme Giant Axe faced Scarlet Sun Demon Master, each of his axe strikes brought with it the power to split the sky, pressing Scarlet Sun Demon Master down.","Heavenly Dipper Ruler was not to be outdone either. Every arrow he shot was able to accurately lock onto the Blood Sky Hall Master, who was moving erratically, forcing him to retreat time and time again.","As for the seven ordinary Supreme martial artists, their strength far exceeded those of the same realm. They often fought one against one, or even three against one.","However, even so, they were still being suppressed and pushed back.","There was no other reason than the fact that too many experts had been mobilized this time.","In addition to the twenty-plus Rulers, there were also hundreds, if not thousands, of Ultimate Rulers. They had all gathered together and formed a battle formation, each of them transforming into a war giant that, when combined, was no weaker than a Ruler.","“An arrow at the end of its flight.”","Long Bai stuck out his tongue and licked the corner of his mouth, shaking his head in disdain.","He didn’t need to do anything in this battle. He just needed to stand here quietly and watch over the battlefield.","“Blood Wave, we can’t hold on much longer.”","Supreme Heavenly Dipper sent the Blood Sky Hall Master, who was about to kill an ordinary Supreme, flying with another arrow. He panted slightly as he transmitted his voice.","“As long as we can hold on. At least, we have to safely transfer all the disciples of the Divine Palace.”","Killing intent flickered in the Ruler Blood Wave’s eyes as the ground beneath his feet turned into a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood. The terrifying power of laws suppressed Supreme Bing Ye.","“Alright, I understand.”","Ruler Heavenly Dipper took a deep breath and said no more.","Rumble!!","On the battlefield, destructive divine arts were used one after another, annihilating everything!","Sword Qi, saber radiance, secret skills, and all sorts of other powers exploded. They were vast and boundless, like a scene of destruction.","Time passed by slowly. After an ordinary Supreme-being from the Divine Life Palace was killed by a joint attack, the already precarious situation of the Divine Life Palace became even more dangerous.","The three lead Supremes, who had the upper hand, were besieged by the other Supremes who had their hands free. The pressure on them increased, and the situation was reversed.","“Kill them all!”","Seeing this, Long Bai laughed cruelly.","Bang!","All the dragons transformed into their true forms and spat out their Dragon Pearls, annihilating everything!","In an instant, the Divine Life Palace suffered more casualties.","“Let’s die together!”","An ordinary Supreme-being, who was severely injured and on the verge of death, saw the three Supreme-beings charging toward him. A crazed look appeared in his eyes, and he suddenly chose to self-destruct!","For a moment, the scene was extremely heroic.","“Bang! Bang!”","Two more ordinary Supreme-beings from the Divine Life Palace chose to self-destruct, one after another. It was as if a sad song had been played.","“Go to hell!”","Supreme Giant Axe’s chest was bleeding, and he went completely mad. With a deafening roar, he chopped three advanced Supreme martial artists into pieces.","As for Scarlet Sun Demon Master, he finally seized the opportunity. With a flash in his eyes, he struck Supreme Giant Axe with a Supreme sacred art, almost tearing his divine body apart!","...","Within the Divine Life Palace.","...","Many disciples of the Divine Life Palace could not help but look sad when they saw this.","There were even some gentle female disciples who couldn’t help but cry out.","“Alright, you guys should go.”","Supreme Yan Shan’s voice was hoarse.","He knew that the Ruler Blood Wave and the others wouldn’t be able to hold on for much longer. It was time for him to face the enemy.","Many disciples fell silent upon hearing this. They turned around silently and walked toward the passageway that led to the edge of the universe.","No matter how reluctant, angry, sad, and aggrieved they were, they knew that it was just as Supreme martial artist Yan Shan had said. As long as they stayed, the Divine Life Palace would not be truly destroyed.","They couldn’t let the Ruler Blood Wave and the others sacrifice themselves in vain.","Pa da, pa da.","At this moment, their footsteps were as heavy as mountains. It was as if a stone was pressing on their chests, making it hard for them to breathe.","Just as someone was about to step into the entrance of the passage and almost everyone had turned around to face away from the dark light mirror ...","...","Suddenly.","A disciple of the Divine Palace seemed to have noticed something. He let out a soft gasp, then pointed at the dark light mirror and cried out in horror, “Look, what’s that?!”","“What?”","Hearing this, the crowd turned their heads in confusion and looked at the dark light mirror that the disciple of the Divine Palace had pointed to.","At the edge of the battlefield, which was reflected by the dark light mirror.","A cold-looking young man covered in mysterious runes, with purple-gold eyes and a head of black hair that reached his heels, was charging toward the battlefield while enduring the vast Lightning Tribulation!","His speed was extremely fast, and every step he took covered a distance of ten thousand miles, like a Thunderbolt between heaven and earth!","His entire body emitted a dazzling golden light, as if he was an immortal God who had walked out from the Nine Heavens. The next moment, he resolutely crashed into the turbulent battlefield with an extremely overbearing posture!","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","In an instant, countless terrifying black chaotic divine lightning bolts descended from the Lightning Tribulation, turning the entire battlefield of the Divine Life Palace into a hell of lightning!","“This person is...Jian Wushuang!”","“Jian Wushuang is back!!”","All of a sudden, the disciples of the Divine Life Palace who were about to leave stopped in their tracks at the same time. Their bodies trembled violently, and there was an uproar!"]},{"number":4404,"title":"Chapter 4404 Sweeping Across the Entire Scene","paragraphs":["4404 Sweeping Across the Entire Scene","Outside the Divine Life Palace.","The battlefield was constantly changing, but in general, the situation was almost one-sided.","Compared to the Allied forces of the four sides, the ten Supremes of the Divine Life Palace found it too difficult to deal with them.","The Blood Wave Supreme, the Supreme Giant Axe, and the heavenly spirit Supreme, the three lead Supremes, had all suffered different degrees of injuries. They were holding on with their last breath. As for the other seven ordinary Supremes, most of them had already been killed. There were only four Supremes left, who were struggling to hold on. However, it was expected that they would fall sooner or later.","!!","“Blood Wave, Heavenly Dipper, I’m afraid I’ll have to make a move!”","Supreme Giant Axe had just recovered from his serious injuries and had attracted most of the firepower on the battlefield. At this moment, his divine body, which was tens of thousands of feet tall, was full of cuts from knives and axes. His chest had been torn apart by Blood Sky Hall Master, and the black poison was burning his divine body, making it impossible for him to recover.","Just as he was about to self-destruct.","Suddenly!","A huge thunderous sound came from the distance!","Then, they saw a white light. At first, it was a small spot of light that was a million miles away. But the next moment, it enlarged in everyone’s eyes!","“What?”","Everyone noticed this scene, and their hands could not help but stop for a moment, looking over in confusion.","Long Bai, who was in charge of the rear, also frowned and said, “Who is this?”","He didn’t have much time to think.","Long Qing’s angry voice exploded in his ears.","“Third uncle, make them retreat!”","“Eh? Long Qing?”","Long Bai didn’t understand what Long Qing meant, but he knew that Long Qing wouldn’t do anything without a reason. So, he prepared to let the Allied forces retreat first.","However, just as he was about to speak...","The lightning figure who was bathed In lightning and had tribulation luck above his head had already crashed into the crowd!","“Let’s cross the tribulation together!!!”","On the battlefield.","Some of the Supreme martial artists still did not react in time and asked with a blank expression, “W-What’s this?”","The next moment!","“This is a f*cking Lightning Tribulation!!!”","One of the Supreme martial artists cried out in horror as he turned around to escape!","The other Supreme martial artists were so frightened that their bodies trembled, and they also used secret techniques to turn around and escape.","However, it was all too late!","“Boom boom boom!”","Dozens of chaotic divine lightning bolts, which had been condensed to the extreme, struck down!","In an instant, the entire battlefield of Thunder God Palace turned into a pool of purgatory lightning!","“Ah! This is chaos lightning!”","“Damn it, Jian Wushuang, that little thief, is back!”","“He even brought the Lightning Tribulation back with him!!","“He’s trying to drag us through the Tribulation together!!”","The entire Divine Life Palace battlefield was filled with cries of pain and the roars of the dragons. A primal lightning bolt struck down, and the formation Giants formed by hundreds and thousands of Ultimate Rulers were instantly reduced to dust.","A middle-grade Supreme martial artist gathered all of his divine power and tried to resist the divine lightning. However, after the divine lightning struck him, he was also annihilated and couldn’t be more dead!","The scene was extremely spectacular. The chaotic divine Lightning Tribulation above Jian Wushuang thought that these Supremes were helpers that Jian Wushuang had invited. It was furious and split into dozens of terrifying chaotic divine lightning bolts, striking down fiercely!","Countless Hundun lightning bolts as thick as a human’s waist fell like heavy cannonballs, bombarding the area.","The Blood Wave Supreme and the others, who had heard the news and retreated earlier, stood at the edge of the Lightning Tribulation and watched this scene in shock. They were petrified.","“Jian...Jian Wushuang, this little guy, brought back the Lightning Tribulation?”","The Ruler Blood Wave said in a daze.","“This is chaos lightning! They’re finished!”","Supreme Giant Axe gasped for breath and laughed heartily.","“Boom, boom, boom!”","After a wave of Lightning Tribulation, less than 10% of the people on the battlefield survived. Except for some advanced Supreme martial artists and top Supreme martial artists with strong physical bodies, the rest had all died!","The originally dark and dense battlefield suddenly became two or three lonely kittens.","Even those who were lucky enough to survive were in an extremely miserable state. Their bodies were charred black and their hair was disheveled.","“The Lightning Tribulation isn’t over yet! Quickly run!”","An advanced Supreme Master was so terrified that he couldn’t care less about flattening the Divine Life Palace. Seeing the Lightning Tribulation above Jian Wushuang’s head start to gather its power again, he was so scared that his soul left his body and he wanted to leave.","However, just as he walked out of the Tribulation Lightning zone ...","“The first tribulation, the great destruction!”","“The second tribulation, the great suppression seal!!”","“The third tribulation, the great yellow spring seal!!”","...","...","“The ninth tribulation, the great sky seal!”","An ice-cold voice exploded.","The Ninth Kalpa King, dressed in a white robe stained with blood, came from the other side!","A total of nine rays of light that blotted out the sky and covered the sun, carrying all kinds of strange phenomena, rolled over in a mighty manner. They crossed the sun and the moon, cut off the sky, and directly cut off all escape routes. Many Supreme martial artists who wanted to escape were killed one after another!","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King, one was responsible for leading the Lightning Tribulation and the other was responsible for supplementing the damage from the back. Although they did not communicate, they cooperated with great tacit understanding!","As soon as the two of them appeared, they instantly swept across the entire battlefield and killed the dragon clan’s Alliance Army.","Bang!","When the last chaotic divine lightning fell, the battlefield in the Divine Life Palace fell into a dead silence.","A million miles of the void turned into nothingness. On the side of the Allied forces, except for Supreme Bing Ye, Scarlet Sun Demon Master, the Blood Sky Hall Master and a few other top-tier Supremes, everyone else was gone.","A gust of wind with the smell of blood reverberated in the air. Long Bai looked at this scene in a daze, his heart dripping blood, and his whole body trembling.","...","No...what?","Just like this...all gone?","“Roar!”","In the next moment, Long Bai’s eyes widened as he roared madly!","This was the first war that he led, and it was also a war that he thought would make a name for himself and shake the universe!","However, everything turned into nothingness!","“Jian Wushuang! You should die!”","Long Bai’s eyes were wide open and he stared at Jian Wushuang with hatred.","“Third uncle!”","“Long Qing! What did you tell me before? You said that Jian Wushuang was nothing but a clay chicken and pottery dog. He wasn’t an opponent you could defeat with a snap of your fingers. You had to kill him! This is what you meant by ‘must kill’?”","“Senior Long Bai!”","At this moment, Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog arrived.","“Long Qing! What did you tell me before? You said that Jian Wushuang was nothing but a clay chicken and pottery dog. He wasn’t an opponent you could defeat with a snap of your fingers. You had to kill him! This is what you meant by ‘must kill’? Why didn’t you tell me that he was coming with the Lightning Tribulation?”","Long Bai opened his big hands and grabbed Long Qing’s collar tightly, squeezing these words out from between his teeth.","Long Qing’s heart trembled when he saw Long Bai’s ashen face, which was on the verge of exploding with rage.","“Third...Third uncle, didn’t I just tell you?”","Long Qing lowered his head and replied in a daze.","Long Bai glared at Long Qing, his chest heaving with anger. After a long time, he took a deep breath, pushed Long Qing forward, and released his hand, saying, “Long Qing, I’ll settle this score with you later!”","After saying that, he turned to Jian Wushuang and said with killing intent in his eyes, “Jian Wushuang destroyed many disciples of the dragon clan. He should be cut into pieces!”","Bang!","The next moment, he stomped his right foot heavily and turned into a stream of light. He stretched out his sharp dragon claws and grabbed Jian Wushuang’s head!","A second ago, he was still far away, and his body was still in a charging position.","In the next moment, he appeared directly above Jian Wushuang’s head!"]},{"number":4405,"title":"Chapter 4405 The Arrival of Sword Union","paragraphs":["4405 The Arrival of Sword Union","At the center of the battlefield.","Jian Wushuang gasped for breath. His chaotic domineering body was full of crisscrossing marks left by the Thunderbolts. It was ferocious and eye-catching.","Fortunately, he managed to arrive at the battlefield of the Divine Life Palace at the last moment by burning his divine power and using the secret skill of dragon blood.","He raised his head and looked at Supreme Blood Wave and the others in the distance. Although their auras were weak and they were all injured, they were fortunately not dead.","!!","Seeing this, he finally heaved a sigh of relief.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll take your life!!”","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyelids twitched as he felt a huge pressure suddenly descend.","A White Dragon with a ferocious expression was rapidly shuttling through the starry sky!","Just his power alone had surpassed everyone else!","“An invincible Ruler!”","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank when he saw this.","The Ruler Blood Wave and the others, who weren’t too far away, also noticed this and their expressions changed.","“Not good! Jian Wushuang is in danger!”","The Blood Wave Supreme, Supreme Giant Axe, and the others immediately stepped forward and rushed toward Jian Wushuang to stop Long Bai!","Supreme Heavenly Dipper’s eyes turned cold as he nocked an arrow on his bow and released his most powerful arrow, which was drawn by his blood essence.","But...","“Get lost for this seat!”","Long Bai’s expression was malevolent. With a rip of his right hand, he sent the Blood Wave Supreme and Supreme Giant Axe, who had come to intercept him, coughing up blood as they retreated!","The arrow shot by Supreme Tian Ji only left a small black dot on Long Bai’s body before it shattered!","This was Long Bai’s furious attack, and it was also an attack of an invincible Ruler!","It was not something they could resist!","With one blow, the three lead Supreme martial artists were all defeated!","Fortunately, it bought Jian Wushuang a breath’s time!","Jian Wushuang raised his head to look at the thundercloud, which had finished gathering power and was about to strike with chaotic divine lightning again. Then, he pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword and directly used the Eternal Night sword move to drag Long Bai into the Eternal Night Kingdom.","Boom! Boom!","In the next moment, two explosions were heard!","The first explosion was Long Bai tearing the Eternal Night Kingdom to pieces. The second explosion was the primal Chaos Divine lightning striking down!","BOOM!","The chaotic divine Thunder split into two, each as thick as a bucket. One of them went for Jian Wushuang and the other for Long Bai!","“This chaos lightning might be good enough to deal with others, but it’s not enough to deal with an invincible Ruler like me!”","Long Bai stepped out of the Eternal Night Kingdom and looked at the Hundun lightning that was charging at him like the whip of the Thunder God. He let out a long roar and released a terrifying sound wave that did not seem human!","Rings of sound waves spread out from his mouth and formed a whistling sound, shattering the Hundun lightning.","“Wuxu chaotic cauldron!”","What Jian Wushuang was facing was much more difficult.","Whoosh!","The Wuxu chaos cauldron shot up from his sleeve and attacked the sky!","Countless primordial chaos power spread out from the Wuxu chaotic cauldron and turned into a black ball of light, hitting the chaotic divine lightning!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Countless violent Thunderbolts exploded and smashed onto the Wuxu chaotic cauldron.","Suddenly, the Wuxu chaotic cauldron let out a wail and returned to Jian Wushuang’s hand.","The chaos Divine lightning was getting stronger and stronger. After such a long time, its power had become extremely terrifying. The Wuxu chaotic cauldron was incomplete and it was not an extreme weapon for defense or attack. It could not stop the chaos Divine lightning at all!","The next moment!","Under the furious gazes of Supreme Blood Wave and the others, the Lightning Tribulation and Long Bai’s furious attacks landed on Jian Wushuang one after another!","Clang!","Jian Wushuang’s chaotic domineering body, which was enshrouded in blazing golden flames, first let out a crisp sound like a Gong, then the entire domineering body exploded and broke into countless pieces.","This was the first time that Jian Wushuang’s divine body had been destroyed since he had achieved chaotic domineering body!","Huchi huchi huchi.","After three breaths, Jian Wushuang’s chaotic domineering body was condensed again. However, his face had turned sallow and he was on the verge of falling from the sky.","“Oh? Overlord body? Looks like you’re related to the Overlord tribe. What a great opportunity.”","Long Bai narrowed his eyes, and a cold glint appeared in his eyes. He then sneered contemptuously and said, “But so what if it’s an Overlord body? No one can stop me from killing you today! Even if the White Ape, the old ancestor of the tyrants, were to come, it would have to step aside obediently!”","After that, Long Bai stretched out his Dragon Claw again and grabbed at Jian Wushuang.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank and his heart sank.","In the end, at this moment!","A deep voice suddenly rang out in the void.","...","“You, try saying that again?”","The next moment!","A burly figure covered in white hair, shining like the sun, landed in front of Jian Wushuang.","His face was expressionless as he casually threw out a punch. It carried the vast power of the universe and directly sent Long Bai’s claw flying.","His aura was similar to Jian Wushuang’s, but he was much stronger!","The tyrants’ old ancestor!!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled and his face revealed a look of disbelief.","Immediately, a few more voices sounded from the horizon!","“Alliance master, the Overlord is late. Please forgive him!”","A figure rushed over from the horizon with surging qi and blood. It was the Overlord who had broken through to the Supreme-being level at the Great Clan Gathering!","“Alliance master, Nine Star Holy Land is late. Please forgive us!”","...","On the other side, the Nine Stars Saint, who had joined the Sword Union with the Overlord on the Ancient Path of Stars!","His white robe was fluttering in the wind. Although he hadn’t broken through to the Supreme-being realm, he was much stronger than when he was on the Ancient Path of Stars!","Behind him, several people from Nine Star Holy Land followed, including Supreme-level old experts!","“Alliance master, the Moluo clan is late. Please forgive us!”","A rough voice was heard. Then, a wild giant with two sharp curved horns on his head and a body burning with demonic flames led the people of the Moluo clan and strode over!","After not seeing him for tens of thousands of years, the young clan leader of the Moluo clan, Yan Gu, had also broken through to the Ruler realm!","Further away.","“Lord Blood Sword, I, Hao Jin, am here!!”","A chubby yellow-robed cultivator scrambled over, leading dozens of Ultimate Rulers behind him!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang was touched and a warm current flowed through his body.","The core members of the Sword Union he had established on the Ancient Path of Stars had all come!","Long Bai’s face instantly darkened to the extreme. Ignoring the Overlord and the others, he glared at the old ancestor of the tyrants and said in a hoarse voice, “White Ape, you’ve chosen to come out of the world?”","The tyrants’ old ancestor was expressionless when he heard that and could not be bothered to answer him. Instead, he said indifferently, “Long Bai, didn’t you just say that even if this old man was here, you’d still have to step aside obediently?”","As he paused, an endless chill appeared in the eyes of the old patriarch of the tyrants. Then, he said, “If you dare to say it again, this old master will kill you right now and take you back to make dragon head soup!”","“You, do you believe me or not?”"]},{"number":4406,"title":"Chapter 4406 The Last Divine Lightning","paragraphs":["4406 The Last Divine Lightning","Overbearing!","When the tyrants’ old patriarch finished speaking, an extremely overbearing and biting cold aura spread out, and the entire place fell into a dead silence!","Everyone looked at the tyrants’ old ancestor in a daze. Their expressions were frozen to the extreme.","Long Bai clenched his fists tightly, his snow-white eyes crazily shrinking, and his face turned ashen.","!!","He did not doubt the words of the tyrants ‘old ancestor at all. This lunatic had always been lawless and would do anything!","“I...I believe you!”","Finally, Long Bai squeezed out these words with great difficulty.","When the tyrants’ old ancestor heard that, he laughed in disdain and said, “Long Bai, you’re far worse than your brother, Long Ye.”","As soon as these words fell, Long Bai’s face became even more unsightly.","Long Ye had always been stronger than Long Bai in the dragon clan. Although they were brothers, it was a knot in Long Bai’s heart.","The reason why he had taken the initiative to challenge Long Ye and raze the Divine Life Palace was to prove that he was more capable than Long Ye!","After all, Long Ye’s last attempt to flatten the Divine Life Palace had ended in failure.","Taking a deep breath, Long Bai first looked at Jian Wushuang and then at the White Ape. He groaned and said, “White Ape, are you sure you want to protect Jian Wushuang? To tell you the truth, Jian Wushuang is already on the dragon clan’s must-kill list. You can’t protect him alone!”","“Even if I, Long Bai, retreat today, there will be other Dragon Tribe powerhouses coming to visit soon. If you really anger our Dragon Tribe, it’s not impossible for the second generation’s distant ancestor-level Dragon emperors to wake up and come to visit in person!","“At that time, what can you, the White Ape, use to stop me?”","The expression of the tyrants ‘old ancestor did not change at all when he heard this. He replied indifferently, ” Long Bai, you talk too much. It seems like you really want to become dragon head soup.","“You!”","Hearing this, Long Bai’s face immediately turned ashen again.","A towering rage was burning in his chest.","He was the third generation of the dragon clan and an invincible Ruler. When had he ever been humiliated like this in public?","If his reason had not told him that he was far from being the opponent of the tyrants’ patriarch, he would have long been unable to hold back the killing intent in his heart and fought the tyrants’ patriarch to the death!","“White Ape, I admit defeat this time!”","After taking a deep breath, Long Bai turned around and left.","He looked at Long Qing, who was standing at the side in a daze. He glared at him and scolded, “Trash, do you still want to stay here and embarrass yourself?”","With that, he stood up and turned into a huge white Dragon. After letting out a Dragon’s Roar, his figure shuttled through the void and left the place.","Long Qing first looked at Jian Wushuang unwillingly, then at the tyrants ‘old ancestor. He shuddered.","This was a peerless and ruthless man who had threatened to beat his third uncle Long Bai down to make dragon head soup. He couldn’t afford to offend him.","Whoosh!","His figure also disappeared on the spot.","Supreme Green Dog, on the other hand, was not so lucky. He lowered his head and pretended that no one had seen him. Just as he was about to sneak away, he saw the Ninth Kalpa King standing behind him. He pressed his shoulder and said in a faint voice, “Where do you want to go?”","His entire body stiffened.","...","There was silence on the battlefield of the Divine Life Palace. Only the Lightning Tribulation above Jian Wushuang’s head continued to make loud rumbles as if it was preparing for a destructive attack!","The others looked at Jian Wushuang from a distance and their hearts were in their throats.","The tyrants’ old master raised his head and squinted his eyes to look at the Lightning Tribulation. He then shook his head and said, “There are a total of 18 Lightning Tribulations and each one is more dangerous than the previous one. The last one is the total power of all the previous Lightning Tribulations. I’m afraid Jian Wushuang will not be able to survive it.”","Under the Lightning Tribulation, Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged with a serious expression.","Long Bai and the others had left. The crisis of the Divine Life Palace could be considered resolved.","However, Jian Wushuang’s crisis had just begun!","He had a premonition that this would be the last Lightning Tribulation, and also the most powerful one!","He wasn’t sure if he could pass it.","Crackling.","Within the thunderclouds, countless lightning snakes shuttled.","A series of loud drum-like sounds constantly exploded from the thunderclouds, making people’s hearts palpitate.","The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, and the others trembled and turned pale just by feeling the pressure of the Lightning Tribulation.","This wasn’t divine lightning, this was a world-ending catastrophe!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The entire sky above the Divine Life Palace was filled with rolling dark clouds. The sky covered the sun and extinguished all light.","“Roar!”","Finally, the last bolt of tribulation lightning was formed!","All of a sudden, the entire universe was filled with rumbling sounds, as if an ancient brass bell was ringing. The Dragon skin drum was beating, and a vast and majestic pressure swept in all directions.","The universe seemed to have fallen into chaos!","“Kacha!”","A black divine lightning bolt that was a hundred Zhang wide suddenly descended!","This black divine lightning had countless branches spreading out, and it was also derived from the heavenly Dao. It was as if the heavens were enraged and would not rest until one of them was dead!","...","“They’re here!”","“This is the last bolt of chaos Lightning Tribulation? It’s too terrifying!”","“How can there be such a powerful Lightning Tribulation in this world?!!”","In an instant, a huge wave was set off in the hearts of countless people as they lost their voices in shock!","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the black divine Thunder. His pupils shrank!","Before the Lightning Tribulation even landed, the biting cold aura of the lightning had already caused tens of thousands of cracks to appear on his divine body!","Break!!!","At this life and death moment, Jian Wushuang’s heart suddenly surged with a crazed intent to die and his face became ferocious!","“Sundering stars!”","With the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand, he slashed at the black divine lightning!","A 10,000-foot-long blue sword light instantly shot out from Jian Wushuang’s hand. With an unparalleled sharp sword Qi, it collided with the black divine Thunder!","...","This sword was enough to split open the heavenly gates and shake Kun Lun!","Bang!","A loud explosion was heard. Then, the blue sword radiance shattered inch by inch and turned into dust.","The black divine lightning struck down again without any hindrance!","Its power didn’t decrease at all!","The crowd was shocked by the scene. They knew that Jian Wushuang had to cross the Lightning Tribulation by himself and no one could help him!","Once Jian Wushuang passed it, he would have a meteoric rise and stand at the peak of the universe.","If Jian Wushuang couldn’t, he would die and everything would return to nothingness.","“Come!”","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth. He knew that guangguang could not stop the chaotic divine lightning with her own divine power!","The chaos Divine lightning was too powerful!","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang flipped his right hand again and the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","“Old friend, I’m counting on you this time.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with heartache. The Wuqi Divine Sword had accompanied him in his battles in the universe and had been undefeated. It had long been his closest companion.","The Wuqi Divine Sword seemed to have sensed something as well, and it let out a sword cry that pierced the Nine Heavens!"]},{"number":4407,"title":"Chapter 4407 The Ultimate Sublimation","paragraphs":["4407 The Ultimate Sublimation","The next moment!","Jian Wushuang’s Black hair flew in the air. He raised his head and stared at the vast Lightning Tribulation. He shouted, “Explode!!!”","Bang!","In an instant, the Wuqi Divine Sword soared into the sky, accompanied by a sharp sword radiance that shook the Nine Heavens and ten lands. It ruthlessly collided with the Hundun divine lightning!","!!","Boom~!","With a loud bang, the entire Wuqi Divine Sword exploded!","The Wuqi Divine Sword was a universe-limit true treasure, and its self-destruction was no weaker than the self-destruction of a top-tier Supreme Being!","Bang!","A huge mushroom cloud rose into the sky. The Wuqi Divine Sword shattered into pieces after releasing its final brilliance, disappearing into the world.","As for the chaos Divine lightning, its power finally decreased slightly.","“My old friend...”","Jian Wushuang felt something sweet in his throat. He spat out divine blood and his body shook.","The Wuqi Divine Sword had accompanied him in his campaigns and beheaded countless enemy chieftains for him. It had long formed a heart-to-heart connection with him. When it self-destructed, he immediately felt the same backlash.","“Again!”","Suppressing the surging blood Qi in his divine body, Jian Wushuang raised his head again to look at the chaotic divine thunder and shouted, “Explode! Explode! Explode!”","All of a sudden, countless treasures rushed out of Jian Wushuang’s interspatial ring to meet the chaotic divine Thunder!","In the past few years, Jian Wushuang had swept through the Tarot ruins, dominated the Ancient Path of Stars, and swept through the desolate areas of the universe. The number of Supreme-beings he had killed could be counted on two hands.","After these people died, all kinds of divine medicines, divine materials, and top-tier treasures in their Interspatial Rings fell into Jian Wushuang’s hands.","This was a shocking number!","“Bang bang bang!”","These top-tier true treasures gathered into a long Dragon and crashed toward the chaotic divine lightning. Then, they kept exploding.","Among them, there was also Young Master Qingmu’s limit true treasure, the divine demon halberd, and Supreme Green River’s Seven Star demonic blade.","The most valuable item was the nine-clawed dark fish shield that Jian Wushuang had obtained from the clan leader of the nine-clawed demonic octopus clan, who was an advanced Supreme Being, in the desolate area of the universe!","Rumble!","In an instant, hundreds of universe treasures of different grades exploded!","An earth-shaking explosion suddenly erupted!","No words could describe the power of these hundreds of ultimate treasures exploding at the same time. At this moment, the entire universe was speechless.","No one could hear the discussion, only the continuous rumbling.","In front of them, a wave of white waves rose up and spread out, destroying the surrounding space!","Countless specks of dust floated into the air, filling their vision.","In the midst of the White waves, a much dimmer and thinner Lightning Tribulation pierced through the White waves and shot toward Jian Wushuang!","The self-destruction of so many Supreme treasures still couldn’t stop the chaos Divine lightning!","Instantly, the surrounding people couldn’t help but exclaim,","“This Lightning Tribulation is unprecedented!”","“As expected of the Lord Alliance leader. Even the Lightning Tribulation he summoned is much stronger than ours!”","“Other than the tyrants’ old ancestor, who among everyone here can claim that they can withstand this Lightning Tribulation with a 100% success rate?”","“This Lightning Tribulation is too strong, but Jian Wushuang is stronger! If we were to face this Lightning Tribulation, I’m afraid we would have given up long ago, right?”","Hualala!","The last Lightning Tribulation broke through the clouds and fog, sweeping away all the evil spirits in the world. It was constantly magnified in Jian Wushuang’s eyes!","Although its power had been greatly diminished by the self-destruction of many ultimate treasures, the divine lightning that was nearly a thousand feet wide had also become as thick as a bowl.","However, to Jian Wushuang, it was still a fatal threat!","“Continue!”","Blood trickled from the corner of Jian Wushuang’s mouth. Under the power of the explosion of hundreds of true treasures, the shock wave also affected him and his divine body was close to being crushed!","“Go!”","He threw out the Wuxu chaotic cauldron again to collide with the black Lightning. Then, he stomped on the ground, put away his sword, and rushed into the sky!","He was going to take this divine Lightning head-on for the last time to reach the ultimate sublimation!","Clang.","The Wuxu chaos cauldron crashed into the black Lightning with unparalleled chaos power. The black Lightning was instantly slowed down and its power was reduced. The Wuxu chaos cauldron flew backward after letting out a wail.","As the Wuxu chaotic cauldron was sent flying, Jian Wushuang finally collided with the black divine Thunder!","“Roar!”","The Hundun divine lightning let out a deafening roar.","break!!!","Jian Wushuang’s face was ferocious and his eyes were filled with madness!","If he didn’t become a devil, he wouldn’t Live!","...","Today, either the Lightning Tribulation would be destroyed, or he would die!","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s body emitted a bright golden light. His five fingers were wrapped in raging flames and the divine patterns on his body lit up continuously!","Especially the purple ‘Chuan’ character between his brows, which became as demonic as blood. With his purple-gold eyes, he really looked like a god!","At that moment, heaven and earth seemed to have been split into two. On one side, Jian Wushuang was covered in dazzling golden light, and on the other side, the entire starry sky was plunged into the dark Divine Thunder of Lightning Tribulation!","The two forces continued to collide with each other like two semi-spherical light shields wrestling with each other!","Pfft!","The black Thunderbolts hit Jian Wushuang’s divine body like snakes and then entered his body. The violent power kept tearing his divine body apart!","The excruciating pain made Jian Wushuang scream.","However, Jian Wushuang did not retreat. Instead, the madness in his eyes grew stronger.","He knew that those who couldn’t kill him would make him stronger!","...","Crackling, Silver Snakes danced and dark clouds covered the city. The area within a thousand feet of Jian Wushuang turned into a terrifying pool of lightning.","His entire body was Bathed In Lightning, as if he was a sinful son who was being punished by lightning.","In the distance, the Ruler Blood Wave and the others watched this scene without blinking.","Jian Wushuang, you must hold on. Otherwise, all your efforts will be in vain!","The others also clenched their fists.","Jian Wushuang, hang in there!","“Bang bang bang!”","The branches on the chaotic divine lightning spread out again and turned into countless small divine thunders, which bombarded Jian Wushuang.","Divine blood flowed out of Jian Wushuang’s mouth and nose, making him look like a bloody man. He raised his head and looked at the Lightning Tribulation. Instead of being afraid, he laughed wildly.","“Don’t you just want me to die?”","“Come on, let’s see who will die first!!”","At that moment, in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, the Lightning Tribulation was no longer the Lightning Tribulation, but a wild monster that wanted to kill him!","Thump!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and his body soared into the sky again. With a deep and grim laugh, he rushed directly into the depths of the thick thunderclouds.","“Come! Just kill me!”","The next moment.","One after another, explosions came from the thunderclouds!","No one knew what had happened in the thunderclouds.","After the time for half an incense stick to burn, the thunderclouds slowly began to dissipate.","Seeing this, everyone’s heart tightened, and doubts welled up in their hearts.","‘Jian Wushuang...Did you make it through in the end?’"]},{"number":4408,"title":"Chapter 4408 Finally Becoming a Supreme Martial Artist","paragraphs":["4408 Finally Becoming a Supreme Martial Artist","“How is it? Did Jian Wushuang survive?”","“Hurry up! Let’s see how Jian Wushuang is doing!”","“Lord Alliance leader!”","Everyone looked at each other, then flew up and rushed toward the thunderclouds that had yet to completely dissipate.","!!","Before they could reach the thunderclouds, a beam of bright light suddenly shot out from the thick dark clouds.","Just like the first ray of sunlight in the morning, it pierced through the imprisonment of darkness and brought light back to the earth.","Chi chi chi.","Immediately, more and more beams of light appeared!","In the end, the bright light tore all the dark clouds apart!","The entire sky was dyed gold by the glow of the setting sun, just like the sunset by the sea, magnificent to the extreme.","Above the ninth heaven, Jian Wushuang was wrapped in a golden light ball. His broken divine body began to recover at a speed that could be seen by the naked eye.","He closed his eyes slightly and spread his arms, as if he was hugging heaven and earth.","The bright light also dyed every strand of his skin and hair golden.","His originally delicate and ordinary appearance, under the multicolored light, also appeared as handsome as a God.","The next moment!","The stars trembled, and the world changed!","Endless celestial light sprinkled down from the sky, as if the chaos had broken at dawn at the beginning of the world, and the Qi activity surged!","Above the sky, the great path played music for him, and the earth trembled. It was as if they were all congratulating him on his breakthrough to the Supreme level.","“Today, I, Jian Wushuang, have achieved the Supreme Dao!”","An indifferent voice was heard and Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes!","In his purple-gold eyes, countless divine patterns derived from the great path flowed, and his entire person exuded a sacred aura.","All the divine power in his body was mobilized and transformed into the divine power of the Supreme great Dao!","His indestructible chaotic domineering body also began to grow stronger inch by inch!","His head of black hair became as black as ink!","Boom, boom, boom!","With Jian Wushuang as the center, waves of powerful aura burst out continuously!","This aura was mixed with the charm of his perfect chaotic lifeform. In an instant, a feeling that made all races submit spontaneously arose!","So, so powerful!!","“It’s too terrifying! I have a feeling that Jian Wushuang can crush me to death easily!”","Countless disciples of the Sword Union were shocked to the extreme when they saw this scene. They were even more shocked when they felt the aura on Jian Wushuang.","However, the more they thought about it, the more they looked at Jian Wushuang with fanatical admiration!","In their dazzled eyes, Jian Wushuang was like a god who controlled the life and death of the world. He had walked out of the ancient chaos and once again ruled the world!","This included the Blood Wave Supreme, the nine-tribulation Lord, the Supreme Giant Axe, and the others. Their eyes were also filled with deep shock.","“The aura of Jian Wushuang...Even I feel like there’s a dagger on my back. I feel a sense of danger.”","Supreme Giant Axe took a deep breath and said in shock.","Supreme Blood Wave stood beside him and looked at Jian Wushuang. He laughed and said, “Giant Axe, he’s no longer the little fellow who needs our protection.”","After a pause, the Ruler Blood Wave smiled and continued, “He’s grown up now. He’s a giant arm that can truly take charge of everything on his own.”","Supreme Giant Axe couldn’t help but be startled when he heard this. He then laughed and sighed, “Yeah, time really flies.”","In the past, Jian Wushuang was only a Ruler of the third level and needed their protection.","But now, Jian Wushuang had unknowingly become a behemoth that could shake the universe and save the Divine Life Palace from its imminent collapse.","The Ninth Kalpa King’s face, which had always been cold, also showed a smile that he himself did not notice.","“You...how do you expect me to fight you?”","There were not many people in his life that he, the Ninth Kalpa King, could look up to. Jian Wushuang was one of them, and the only one who made him feel inferior for the first time was Jian Wushuang.","Above the Nine Heavens, among the clouds.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void, his black hair flying.","Wisps of golden light gushed into his body.","The Divine Ruler Realm had been formed!","Jian Wushuang could not help but smile as he felt the power in his body that was completely different from before.","“Is this the power of a Ruler God?”","He clenched his fist. He was more than a thousand times stronger than before.","A terrifying power that he had never felt before flowed in his body. It was a vast power that transcended all life and set foot on the peak of the universe!","Knowing that there were still people waiting for him, Jian Wushuang did not waste any time. After familiarizing himself with the power in his body, he took a step forward and walked toward the crowd.","His body didn’t seem to move at all, and he appeared in front of the Ruler Blood Wave and the others.","It wasn’t until several breaths later that the afterimages formed by the high speed of the sky slowly dissipated.","...","“Supreme Blood Wave, Supreme Giant Axe, Supreme Heavenly Dipper...”","Jian Wushuang greeted them with a nod.","The Blood Wave Supreme looked at Jian Wushuang and opened his mouth to say something. However, in the end, all the words that he had already prepared were condensed into one word.","“Alright,” he said.","He patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder and his eyes were full of gratification and admiration.","Jian Wushuang did not say much either. The relationship between the two of them was that of a teacher and a friend. It could no longer be explained by warm words.","After that, Jian Wushuang led Supreme Blood Wave and the others toward the tyrants’ patriarch.","“Many thanks for senior White Ape’s rescue.”","Jian Wushuang first saluted the tyrants’ patriarch respectfully. He had been greatly indebted to the tyrants’ patriarch. Not only had the latter saved his life, but he had also saved the entire Divine Life Palace.","The Ruler Blood Wave and the others also wore solemn expressions. They cupped their hands and said, “We are extremely grateful to senior White Ape!”","Logically speaking, the old master of the tyrants had saved them. In terms of strength, the old master of the tyrants was an existence whose cultivation base far exceeded theirs, so they naturally had to be respectful.","...","“No need for formalities.”","The tyrants’ old ancestor clasped his hands behind his back and shook his head. He muttered, “Speaking of which, I’m an old friend of the palace Master of the Divine Life Palace. He helped me once, and I’m just returning the favor this time.”","When the Ruler Blood Wave and the others heard this, their eyes narrowed. They exchanged a glance and asked respectfully, “Senior White Ape, do you know our Palace Master?”","“We’re all from the same era, of course I know him.” The tyrant patriarch nodded.","Hearing this, the Ruler Blood Wave and the others became excited. They suppressed their emotions and asked, “Then...Senior White Ape, do you know where our Palace Master is now? How’s the situation?”","When the tyrants’ old ancestor heard this, he first narrowed his eyes and muttered to himself for a moment. Then, he sighed softly and said, “Your Palace Master is trapped in that place. I’m afraid the situation is not good. He won’t be able to come back in a short time.”"]},{"number":4409,"title":"Chapter 4409 The Grand Banquet","paragraphs":["4409 The Grand Banquet","“Is that so?”","The Ruler Blood Wave and the others were slightly stunned. They seemed to have thought of something and were somewhat dazed.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything and just listened quietly.","He had always been curious about who the palace Lord of the Divine Life Palace was and why he had not appeared. Now that he had heard the discussion between the tyrants ‘old ancestor and Supreme Blood Wave, he immediately understood that the palace Lord of the Divine Life Palace seemed to be trapped in some place and could not come out.","!!","After a while, Jian Wushuang introduced the people from Sword Union to Supreme Blood Wave and the others.","This time, more than half of the sword Association’s people had come. According to the Overlord, some disciples from the sword Association who were far away were on their way.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang would not be negligent. He first thanked him and then discussed with Supreme Blood Wave to invite everyone who came to the rescue to the Divine Life Palace and hold a big banquet as a thank you gift.","When Jian Wushuang said that, the Overlord, Moro yangu, Ruler Hao Jin, and the others naturally had no choice but to follow his orders respectfully.","On the other hand, the old patriarch shook his head in refusal after some thought and turned to leave.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel a little regretful, but he wouldn’t force it. After a period of time together, he could be considered to have understood some of the personality of the tyrants ‘patriarch. He was free and easy, didn’t like to be restrained, and was a loner.","Supreme Blood Wave arranged for the people of the Sword Union to enter the Divine Life Palace. At the same time, he sent Supreme Giant Axe and Supreme Heavenly Dipper to the universe passages of the Nine Emperor Pavilion and the Starry Sky Sword Sect to see if they could cooperate with these two great powers and retain the great sun Emperor God and Supreme Black feather.","At the same time, it was also an invitation to the Starry Sky Sword Sect and the Nine Emperor Pavilion.","After making the necessary arrangements, the Ruler Blood Wave led everyone into the Divine Life Palace.","Within the Divine Life Palace.","The disciples of the Divine Life Palace, who had been watching the dark light mirror and the battlefield, had been waiting for this.","When they saw that the Blood Wave Master, Jian Wushuang, and the others had returned, they immediately cheered.","“The Ruler Blood Wave!”","The disciples of the Divine Life Palace greeted the Ruler Blood Wave one after another, but most of them looked at Jian Wushuang.","“This is senior brother Jian Wushuang!”","“Senior brother Jian Wushuang is so powerful!”","Some new disciples who had just entered the Divine Life Palace and had never seen Jian Wushuang before looked at him with admiration.","Jian Wushuang greeted them with a smile.","He immediately saw many familiar faces in the crowd of the Divine Life Palace.","For example, the demonic wind Ruler that he had once argued with had also broken through to the unparalleled Ruler level after nearly a hundred thousand years. His aura was restrained, and his eyes were ancient. He was much calmer than before.","The river Spirit of the Dao Comprehension River was also grinning from ear to ear when he saw Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wu...Forget it, I’ll forgive you. Good job!”","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and pinched the face of the river Spirit of the Enlightenment River. The river Spirit was so angry that he glared at him.","The Ruler Blood Wave felt a surge of warmth in his heart upon seeing this.","This was the Divine Life Palace, everyone’s home.","The disciples of the Divine Life Palace naturally did not have to leave after the calamity. Under the arrangement of Supreme Blood Wave, they returned to their posts. As for Supreme Yan Shan, he took a deep look at Jian Wushuang before he turned back into a mountain.","...","Three months later.","The banquet was held.","The Divine Life Palace was decorated with lanterns and colored banners, and it was a jubilant atmosphere.","Now that the palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had disappeared and Supreme Gai Fu was in deep sleep, Supreme Blood Wave was in charge of commanding the Divine Life Palace.","Supreme Giant Axe and Heavenly Dipper Supreme, who were in charge of welcoming the Starry Sky Sword Sect and the Nine Emperor Pavilion, had already returned. Behind them were Heart Slayer and Red-ear Supreme from the Nine Emperor Pavilion, as well as the Starry Sky Sword Sect’s Martial Sword Immortal.","It was a pity that when Supreme Black feather and King of Day heard that they had been defeated in the Divine Life Palace, they fled without hesitation. As a result, Supreme Giant Axe and the others were unable to keep them.","Jian Wushuang and master Heart Slayer were old friends, so they naturally exchanged pleasantries.","At the banquet, everyone was talking and laughing. When the mood was at its peak, a big matter was settled.","After today’s banquet, the Divine Life Palace, the Starry Sky Sword Sect, the Nine Emperor Pavilion, and the Overlord body clan had formed an alliance. From then on, they would support each other and advance and retreat together.","There was no oath between them because the core of the Alliance was Jian Wushuang. As long as Jian Wushuang was not dead, the Alliance would last forever.","At the banquet, Jian Wushuang felt a pair of beautiful eyes staring at him. He couldn’t help but sigh. He greeted the owner of the pair of beautiful eyes, Martial Sword Immortal, “Jian Wushuang greets Lord Martial Sword Immortal.”","Jian Wushuang respected the Martial Sword Immortal. There were not many Supremes in the universe, let alone female Supremes.","It was not easy for the Martial Sword Immortal to become an invincible Ruler, stand at the top of the universe, break the Galaxy with her sword, and control an orthodoxy as a woman.","“Yes.”","The Martial Sword Immortal nodded. She was tall and had sharp facial features. Her hair was tied up with a Platinum Jade hairpin, giving off an extremely capable and valiant feeling.","“You...It’s really good.”","She sized up Jian Wushuang and then said indifferently.","As an invincible Ruler who had entered the Dao with the sword, the Martial Sword Immortal’s horizons were naturally not low.","She could tell at a glance that Jian Wushuang’s aura was concealed and his comprehension of sword principle was very high, even not much behind her.","“Lord Martial Sword Immortal is too kind.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. He knew that Martial Sword Immortal wouldn’t just talk to him out of courtesy.","Indeed, after Martial Sword Immortal pondered for a moment, she finally said, “Jian Wushuang, can you let me see the Tarot Divine Sword?”","“The Tarot Divine Sword?” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He had heard a little about the history between the Martial Sword Immortal and Tarot Supreme. Therefore, he did not hesitate and nodded, “Alright,” he said.","...","Then, Jian Wushuang took out the Tarot Divine Sword and handed it to Martial Sword Immortal.","The Martial Sword Immortal looked at the Tarot Divine Sword. Her heart, which had never changed for ten thousand years, suddenly trembled as a look of reminiscence appeared in her eyes.","It was as if the Azure-robed Tarot Swordmaster, who had once dominated the universe, had returned.","“Tarot...” She said. The Martial Sword Immortal’s five slender fingers gently stroked the Tarot Divine Sword’s blade, somewhat intoxicated.","After a long time, she came back to her senses and returned the Tarot sword to Jian Wushuang. She said softly, “Thank you.”","Pausing for a moment, Martial Sword Immortal took a deep breath. With a flip of her right hand, a golden scabbard appeared in her hand.","“Jian Wushuang, you are the inheritor of Supreme Tarot. This item should belong to you.”","“What is this?”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank. He suddenly realized that after the scabbard appeared, the Tarot Divine Sword suddenly trembled slightly, trying to break free from Jian Wushuang’s hand and enter the scabbard."]},{"number":4410,"title":"Chapter 4410 Extreme Great Ancestral Weapon","paragraphs":["4410 Extreme Great Ancestral Weapon","Kachaa!","With a clear ring, the Tarot Divine Sword shot into the golden sheath.","In an instant, a muffled sound rang out from the scabbard. A sense of perfection was felt, as if the Tarot Divine Sword and the scabbard were one.","The Martial Sword Immortal smiled and said, “Jian Wushuang, the world only knows about the Tarot sword. They don’t know about the Tarot scabbard. Only when the Tarot Divine Sword has the Tarot scabbard can it be truly invincible!”","!!","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said, “What do you mean? please tell me.”","The Martial Sword Immortal pondered for a moment before saying, “Jian Wushuang, have you ever heard of an extreme weapon?”","“An extreme weapon?” Jian Wushuang thought for a while and replied, “I’ve heard a thing or two about it, but I don’t know much about it.”","Martial Sword Immortal explained, “The true name of the extreme weapons should be the extreme ancestral weapons. They are the seven strongest weapons that appeared when the universe was born at the beginning of chaos. They are powerful enough to suppress the universe!”","“These seven Supreme ancestral weapons have different functions. For example, your Wuxu chaos cauldron is one of the seven Supreme ancestral weapons, and it’s mainly used for creation.”","“The Tarot sword was also one of the seven Supreme great ancestral weapons, and it was mainly used for killing!”","“However, it was precisely because the Tarot Divine Sword was in charge of killing that it had the most violent personality among the seven Supreme great ancestral weapons. If it was not careful, it could easily devour its host and demonize them.”","“The Tarot scabbard was one with the Tarot Divine Sword, so it could suppress and nurture the Tarot Divine Sword.”","As long as it has the Tarot scabbard, the Tarot sword will be able to continue to grow and become stronger.”","After Martial Sword Immortal finished speaking, she saw that Jian Wushuang still looked like he did not understand. She shook her head and laughed, “Jian Wushuang, you might not understand the power of the Tarot sword sheath now, but you will know in the future.”","“Alright. I came to the Divine Life Palace today to see you and the Tarot Divine Sword. Now that my wish has been fulfilled, I’ll take my leave.”","With that, Martial Sword Immortal bade farewell to the Ruler Blood Wave and rode her flying sword away. Like a small boat, she sailed into the starry sea.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a touch of deep thought. Holding the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword that was exposed, he felt a sense of connection from his mind.","He could feel that the trace of evil intent Supreme Tarot had left on the Tarot Divine Sword was finally being gradually cleared away, and it was gradually returning to its purest and most perfect state.","Time slowly passed, and the three-day banquet finally came to an end.","This banquet not only settled the Alliance between the Divine Life Palace, the tyrants and the Nine Emperor Pavilion, but also promoted two new lead Supreme Masters.","The sixth Supreme martial artist, the Ninth Kalpa King!","The seventh Supreme Master, Jian Wushuang!","The entire Divine Life Palace had no objection to this. Originally, the chief Supreme of the Divine Life Palace could only be assumed by a top Supreme. However, although the Ninth Kalpa King was only a middle Supreme, he definitely had the battle strength of a top Supreme, or even stronger.","As for Jian Wushuang, there was no need to talk about him. When he was still an Ultimate Ruler, he was able to kill an advanced Supreme. Now that he had proven his Supreme great Dao and completely unlocked the Tarot Divine Sword, it was obvious that Jian Wushuang was now extremely powerful.","The Divine Life Palace was filled with congratulatory voices.","...","It was night.","The moon was high up in the sky, and the stars were shining.","On a mountain peak in the sixth mountain range of the Divine Life Palace.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and his whole body seemed to be one with the full moon beside the mountain peak. At first glance, he looked like an immortal who was untainted by the mortal world.","Behind him, the Overlord stood respectfully. Ever since Jian Wushuang had defeated everyone and broken through to the Supreme level, he had completely given up on him.","In the beginning, he had been ‘betting’ on the fact that Jian Wushuang would have great achievements in the future and that he would benefit himself and the entire Overlord body clan.","But now, he was sure that Jian Wushuang would become a giant arm of the universe in the future!","“Alliance master, do we need to bring Madam rushuang over?”","The Overlord said in a deep voice.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and shook his head. “No, I don’t think so. Let Shuang ‘er stay with the White Ape for now. I’ll pick her up personally after I’ve completely resolved the turmoil.”","When Jian Wushuang said the word ‘turbulence’, a cold killing intent flashed in his eyes!","Hearing this, the Overlord was shocked. He took a deep breath and said, “Alliance master, are you planning to attack the Dragon Tribe?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and then shook his head, “The dragon clan is a towering tree with deep roots. It’s not that easy to destroy. Such a good dish naturally has to be placed at the end. As for the Great Sun Divine Kingdom and the Great Void Temple...”","“Of course it’s time to settle old scores!”","Jian Wushuang’s tone suddenly turned cold.","He, Jian Wushuang, had never taken the initiative to bully others in his life. However, the Great Void Temple and the other major forces had taken advantage of him and bullied him again and again!","He, Jian Wushuang, had long decided to kill him!","“Then, Alliance master, when should we make our move?” The Overlord asked.","Jian Wushuang thought for a moment and replied, “I haven’t completely stabilized my Ruler Realm yet. Let’s talk about this after I’ve completely stabilized my Divine Ruler Realm.”","“Yes.”","The Overlord nodded and said, “Alliance master, I’ll take my leave first. I’ll make preparations with Yan Gu and the Nine Stars Saint.","Not long after, the Overlord respectfully retreated.","On the desolate mountain peak, only the bright moon and Jian Wushuang were left.","Jian Wushuang sat down cross-legged and with a flip of his right hand, the Tarot Sword Manual appeared in his hand.","Now that he had broken through to the Supreme-being realm, the three remaining sword forms of the zenith sword manual were no longer restricted and could be read and learned.","The first move of the Tarot sword Canon was called Eternal Night, and the second move was called dawn. The two moves seemed to have no connection, but they were closely linked.","The third move was called dusk!","The heroes were in their twilight, and the gods were in their twilight!","...","This move was a sword that could slay gods!","In Jian Wushuang’s eyes, the scene of the sun setting in the West appeared.","In this scene, a green-robed sword God opened the Heaven’s Gate with his sword. His vast sword Qi shook Kun Lun, rolled the Dragon wall, and annihilated all the Supreme beings in the sky.","Without much hesitation, Jian Wushuang continued to flip to the fourth move.","The fourth move of the Tarot sword Canon, Four Seasons!","As its name suggested, this Tarot Sword Manual was called the fourth move of the Four Seasons. It contained the four sword intents of spring, summer, autumn, and winter. There was the biting cold of winter, the continuous flow of spring, the violent and dry heat of summer, and the desolation and bleakness of autumn.","Compared to the first three moves, the conception of the single sword of Four Seasons was much more profound. It was so obscure and complicated that even Jian Wushuang found it difficult to comprehend it.","This made Jian Wushuang sigh with emotion. Tarot Supreme was indeed the number one sword Master since ancient times. His talent in sword principle was probably no less than Jian Wushuang.","“If I really want to catch up to the Tarot Swordmaster, I’ll have to at least become an advanced Supreme martial artist.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. After carefully comprehending the four seasons sword move, he took a deep breath and finally turned to the last page of the Tarot Sword Manual.","The fifth form-","...","Tarot!"]},{"number":4411,"title":"Chapter 4411 Ten Thousand Years in the Snap of a Finger","paragraphs":["4411 Ten Thousand Years in the Snap of a Finger","Tarot!","This was the last move of the Tarot Sword Manual, and it was named after the Tarot supremacy. One could imagine how domineering it was!","This sword technique was created by Supreme Tarot in his later years. It was also the Tarot Swordmaster’s greatest reliance in suppressing the universe and the ten thousand races!","This sword contained all of the comprehensions he had gained from the Supreme, invincible sword Dao of Tarot. It was the culmination of all of his comprehensions in his life!","“If I’m invincible, who else but me can do it! What a bold move!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he took a deep breath.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang’s thoughts sank into the Tarot sword move.","The next moment.","The scene in front of Jian Wushuang suddenly changed. The bright moon on the mountain peak disappeared, and the strong wind disappeared. He seemed to have fallen into a virtual space.","In front of him, a green-robed figure stood with his back to him and his hands behind his back.","“Tarot supremacy...?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and asked.","“My successor, you’ve finally turned to the last page.”","The green-robed figure said in a low voice as he slowly turned around.","He had a handsome face, a long and thin face, and sharp eyes. This was none other than the Azure-robed sword God from three hundred chaos cycles ago, Ruler zenith Tarot!","“I’ve been waiting for you for a long time.”","He sized up Jian Wushuang and said.","Jian Wushuang also sized him up. The person in front of him was naturally not the real Tarot Supreme. If he guessed correctly, the current Tarot Supreme should be the mark he had left in the Tarot Sword Manual before he died.","“Come on, little guy. Let me see how strong you are as my successor!”","The Tarot Ruler spoke indifferently, and a sharp glint flashed in his eyes.","A long sword condensed from divine power was held in his hand.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and his eyes were filled with excitement. He also condensed a long sword in his hand!","He had long since been entranced by this man, who had dominated the universe for thousands of chaos cycles before perishing three hundred chaos cycles ago. He wished he could be born in the same era as him so that he could fight him.","And now, this opportunity was finally placed in front of him.","Hence.","A battle that transcended time and space had begun!","Bang!","With a single step, Supreme Tarot disappeared.","In the next moment, he appeared behind Jian Wushuang and stabbed at him with his sword.","“So fast!”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank, but his reaction was not slow either. Without turning his head, he had already stabbed his sword back diagonally to block the stab!","“Your sword is too slow!”","Supreme Tarot said coldly as he swung his right leg like a giant axe and hit Jian Wushuang’s waist.","Pfft!","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang’s body fell and the huge force from his waist made him take a few steps forward.","Before he could come to his senses, Tarot Supreme’s figure flashed again and he appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang looked up and saw a black sword light growing bigger and bigger in his eyes. In the end, it slashed his body.","His consciousness collapsed.","After a long time, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness finally recovered in the virtual space.","With his hands behind his back and his back facing Jian Wushuang, Supreme Tarot said in a deep voice, “My successor, on the path of the way of the sword, the stronger the divine Art, the stronger the way of the sword.”","Even the most basic stabbing, slashing, and cutting techniques can be unleashed to their maximum power when they are trained to the extreme!","“As long as it’s a killing technique, it’s a killing sword!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang fell into deep thought.","When he was fighting with Tarot Supreme, Tarot had not used any powerful sword techniques. He had defeated him with just a stab and a slash.","He didn’t even have the chance to use his sword Dao sacred art.","Gradually, Jian Wushuang’s eyes glowed with enlightenment.","Clang!","At this moment, Supreme Tarot once again charged forward with his sword in hand!","“Don’t be distracted when you’re fighting an enemy,”","Supreme Tarot said coldly. His entire body turned into a green afterimage, and his speed was extremely fast. In the blink of an eye, he had already slashed out thousands of swords.","“Come!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fighting intent. He also took a step forward and his divine power exploded as he charged toward Tarot Ruler!","Ding, ding, ding!","...","The two of them exchanged hundreds of moves in an instant.","After the time for one incense stick to burn.","“Daybreak.”","Tarot Supreme suddenly turned into a ray of golden light and dashed forward, killing Jian Wushuang.","The way of the sword lies in the combination of moves, and how to kill the enemy in the fastest and most convenient way.","“Do you understand?”","...","Time slowly passed.","From the outside world, Jian Wushuang seemed to have turned into a statue, sitting cross-legged on the mountain peak without moving.","In fact, Jian Wushuang was immersed in the Tarot space, fighting with Tarot supreme day and night.","After all, Tarot supremacy had lived for thousands of chaos cycles and stood at the peak of the universe. In terms of comprehension of sword principle, he was much, much more profound than Jian Wushuang.","...","One had only trained for 700000 years, while the other had trained for thousands of chaos cycles. There was simply no way to compare the two.","As the two of them fought, Jian Wushuang was like a sponge, madly absorbing the comprehension of sword principle of zenith heaven.","Jian Wushuang’s realm of sword principle started to improve at a speed visible to the naked eye.","Tarot Supreme was like a golden sparring partner, constantly helping Jian Wushuang grow.","One year...ten years...a hundred years...a thousand years...","In the blink of an eye, 5000 years had passed in the trial space.","In the past five thousand years, Jian Wushuang had never stopped fighting with Tarot Ruler. He had been killed by Tarot Ruler Seven thousand eight hundred and sixty-nine times!","Gradually, Jian Wushuang’s power changed from being unable to fight back to being able to contend with Tarot Supreme.","In the blink of an eye, another five thousand years had passed.","In these five thousand years, Jian Wushuang had grown to the point where he could fight with Tarot Ruler without being at a disadvantage!","Moreover, as time passed, the victory was leaning toward Jian Wushuang!","If the outside world knew about this, it would probably set off another storm in the universe!","In just ten thousand years, Jian Wushuang had managed to catch up to several thousand chaos cycles of Supreme Tarot’s comprehension of the sword Dao!","What kind of terrifying learning talent and growth speed was this?","...","Clang!","Supreme Tarot turned into a green shadow, while Jian Wushuang turned into a black light.","The speed of the two was extremely fast, and they kept flashing and colliding in the void, leaving countless afterimages.","The sword light flickered, and the sword shadows intertwined with each other.","Supreme Tarot and Jian Wushuang were both suffused with soaring sword Qi, which was extremely sharp.","The two of them exchanged thousands of blows in an instant, and the long swords in their hands sparked.","“Daybreak!”","Supreme Tarot shouted coldly and suddenly became one with the sword. He turned into a ray of golden light that broke the dawn and rushed toward Jian Wushuang like a lightning that tore through the night.","“Sundering stars!”","Jian Wushuang’s black hair flew in the air as he slashed out a ray of blue sword light.","Bang!","This sword firmly locked on to Tarot Ruler and slashed down, causing Tarot Ruler’s dawnbreak sword light to slow down slightly.","The next moment.","“Daybreak!”","Jian Wushuang’s right foot stomped heavily and he also turned into a daybreak sword radiance, charging toward the Tarot Swordmaster!","Bang!","A huge shock wave exploded as the Tarot Swordmaster and Jian Wushuang’s longswords collided. The strong wind blew their hair up.","Their eyes were filled with fighting spirit!","Kacha kacha kacha.","Then, the sword in the Tarot Swordmaster’s hand started to shatter.","A satisfied smile slowly appeared on his handsome face.","“My successor, if you have the chance in the future, please kill a man named Emperor devour for me...”","After Tarot Supreme took a deep look at Jian Wushuang, his figure gradually disappeared and turned into black smoke.","Then, the black smoke entered Jian Wushuang’s forehead like a black line.","The fifth move of the Tarot Sword Manual, Tarot!","It was reflected in Jian Wushuang’s mind."]},{"number":4412,"title":"Chapter 4412 Exiting Seclusion","paragraphs":["4412 Exiting Seclusion","Ka-chak.","The virtual space continued to shatter.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a sharp sword light flashed in his eyes.","The strong wind on the mountain peak was still surging, and the full moon beside it was still bright.","To Jian Wushuang, he had already stayed in the virtual space for more than ten thousand years, but to the outside world, it was only half an incense’s time.","“I’ve gained a lot this time.”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help sighing.","Through these ten thousand years of training and teaching, he had not only mastered the five sword techniques of the Tarot Sword Manual, but he had also completely comprehended the Tarot sword technique. He had even strengthened his Foundation.","He had defeated Supreme Tarot in the virtual space, which meant that he was stronger than Supreme Tarot when he was an elementary Supreme.","This did not include Jian Wushuang’s other skills, such as chaotic domineering body and special life forms.","To Jian Wushuang, it was an epic enhancement!","The cold night wind blew Jian Wushuang’s long hair. After a while, Jian Wushuang lowered his head and a thoughtful look flashed in his eyes.","“Emperor devouring...”","According to what Tarot Supreme had said, if Jian Wushuang was not wrong, this man named ‘Emperor devouring’ was most likely the main culprit who had indirectly or directly caused Tarot Supreme’s death.","It must be known that when Tarot Supreme had been a top-tier Supreme, he had been able to sweep across the universe and suppress all races with the Tarot sword and his extremely terrifying sword Dao divine abilities. He was no weaker than an invincible Supreme, and he could even kill some of them.","There might be rare individuals in the universe who could defeat Supreme Tarot, but there were almost none who could kill him and destroy the Tarot divine Kingdom.","If there was such a person in the universe, it was impossible for Jian Wushuang not to know.","After all, it had only been three hundred chaos cycles since Ruler zenith had fallen. It wasn’t that far away.","“Who is this devouring Emperor?”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He was sure that he had never heard of this person.","However, when he was in nine Phoenix Star area, he was chased by a group of mysterious Supreme martial artists and almost lost his life.","Those mysterious Supremes were called Devour Seven and devour five.","After a while, Jian Wushuang shook his head. Since he couldn’t figure it out, he simply didn’t think about it.","“Fine. If I meet the devouring Emperor in the future and defeat him, I’ll kill him for you.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","Jian Wushuang was in no hurry to leave. Instead, he reported to the Blood Wave Supreme and announced that he was going to go into seclusion again.","He had comprehended far too many things in this ten-thousand-year battle with Tarot supremacy. He needed to carefully sort them out and thoroughly integrate them.","...","Time flew by, and another five thousand years passed.","The universe gradually returned to peace. The five great powers, including the Great Void Temple, the Blood Sky Hall, and the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom, seemed to have truly ceased all activities and did not mention anything about Jian Wushuang.","As for the most powerful dragon race, which had once dominated the universe, they did not come out to cause trouble for a while and fell into a state of silence.","The entire universe was a picture of peace.","5,000 years later, the Divine Life Palace returned to its former state.","The sixth mountain range was Jian Wushuang’s Manor. After he became the seventh Supreme, it had been transformed into a Supreme mansion.","Creak.","Suddenly, the gate of the manor, which had been locked for 5000 years, was slowly pushed open by a fair hand.","A cold-looking young man with purple-golden eyes, who was wearing a long robe with golden edges and had a sword hanging on his waist, walked out of the manor step by step.","“We pay our respects to Supreme Ruler peerless!”","At the entrance of the manor, two disciples of the Divine Life Palace were stunned to see Jian Wushuang. Then, they quickly bowed and greeted him.","“Yes.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly at them as a greeting. Then, he took a step forward and turned into a soaring sword light, shooting toward the Supreme shrine.","Huchi huchi.","The strong wind in the air passed by Jian Wushuang’s face quickly.","“Now that everything is ready, it’s time to settle the old scores.”","Jian Wushuang’s purple-gold pupils were cold.","In these 5000 miles, he had finally mastered the five heaven-connecting divine abilities of the zenith sword Codex and stabilized his supremacy stage.","Jian Wushuang, who was already terrifyingly strong, had his strength increased by another level.","After a while, they arrived at the Supreme shrine.","It had only been 5000 years, and the Supreme shrine had not changed much. Only Supreme Blood Wave seemed to have known that Jian Wushuang had come out of seclusion and was sitting quietly in the main seat of the Supreme shrine, waiting.","“Ruler Blood Wave.”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and nodded at the Blood Wave Master.","Jian Wushuang has completely stabilized his supremacy stage, right? ”","The Ruler Blood Wave asked with a smile.","“I didn’t fail you.” Jian Wushuang replied with a smile.","...","The two of them chatted for a while before the Blood Wave Supreme suddenly sighed and asked, “Jian Wushuang, I know why you are here. Are you ready to attack the Six Forces?”","There was nothing to hide. Jian Wushuang nodded and replied frankly, “That’s right, it’s time to settle the old scores with them.”","The Blood Wave Supreme looked at Jian Wushuang deeply and asked again, “Jian Wushuang, are you really ready?”","Jian Wushuang replied with a ‘hmm’. He was not confident to deal with the other forces except for the dragon clan.","Even if they had any trump cards, Jian Wushuang was confident that they would not pose a fatal threat to him.","“That’s good.” The Blood Wave Master smiled in relief. Although he did not know how powerful Jian Wushuang had become, he knew Jian Wushuang’s character. If he was not 80% confident, Jian Wushuang would not take such a risk.","After thinking for a moment, the Ruler Blood Wave muttered, “Jian Wushuang, I don’t think the Divine Life Palace can provide you with any help when you attack the Six Forces.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. This was within his expectations. After two great battles, the Divine Life Palace had lost many Supremes. There were many things that needed to be done, and they could no longer withstand any more turmoil.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang didn’t intend to drag anyone down with him, including the Sword Union.","“Here, Jian Wushuang. This is the information I’ve collected on The Six Forces for you. Take a look at it later.”","With a flip of his right hand, the Blood Wave Supreme took out a Jade cylinder and handed it to Jian Wushuang. He then said, “Jian Wushuang, I suggest you attack Blood Sky Hall first.”","...","“Blood Sky Palace is not only the weakest among The Six Forces, but it also has a shallow foundation. The strongest person is the master of Blood Sky Palace, who is a top-tier Supreme.”","“Blood Sky Palace? Alright, I’ll consider it. ”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a thoughtful look.","The two of them exchanged pleasantries for a while before Jian Wushuang put on a bamboo hat and left the Divine Life Palace."]},{"number":4413,"title":"Chapter 4413 Battle!","paragraphs":["4413 Battle!","In the universe, stars flickered and it was vast and boundless.","Among them, there was a group of small planets in the depths of the universe. There were thousands of stars of various sizes in this group of small planets. All kinds of people from all walks of life and extremely evil people were gathered in this group of small planets.","Therefore, this minor planetary system was also known as the sin Starfield.","The Blood Sky Palace was built in sin Starfield.","Among the top powers of the universe, the Blood Sky Palace was not considered strong. Firstly, the highest cultivation in the entire power was only the Blood Sky Palace Master, who was a top Supreme. Secondly, the Blood Sky Palace had a shallow foundation and had not been passed down for generations. It lacked a solid foundation.","However, the Blood Sky Hall was definitely the most difficult force to deal with.","They were like venomous snakes that lived in the dark corners. Once they targeted someone, they would be like gangrene attached to the bone, never stopping until one of them died.","Therefore, very few people in the universe were willing to provoke these ‘bugs’.","In the depths of sin Starfield, there was a Hall built on top of the poison mist swamp.","“Hall Master, this is the fresh blood food that has just been offered.”","There was no light in the hall. It was quiet and gloomy.","A black-robed man walked into the hall and spoke to the throne hidden in the depths of the hall.","A hoarse and tired voice came from the depths of the hall.","“Let out the blood food.”","“Yes.”","The black-robed man nodded respectfully. With a flip of his right hand, a Dark Iron cage appeared in the hall.","Dozens of Ultimate Rulers were locked up in the cage like animals, their faces filled with panic.","“Where is this place?”","“Quickly let me out!”","“My master is Supreme Nanming of the Nanming Galaxy. Let me go now. Otherwise, you won’t have a good time when my master comes to you!”","“I beg you, please let me go.”","All of a sudden, curses and pleas for mercy sounded one after another.","However, the more they shouted, the more uneasy they felt.","The next moment.","A ray of blood light suddenly shot out from the depths of the hall, and then rolled back, rolling the entire Darksteel cage in.","Puchi puchi puchi!","Countless muffled sounds and shrill cries rang out in the hall.","A moment later, the shrill cries stopped, and a middle-aged man with an evil appearance walked out from the depths of the hall.","He was the Blood Sky Palace Master, the Blood Sky Supreme.","“Blood Seven, the quality of the recent blood food isn’t that good.”","The Blood Sky Supreme’s lips were a little red. He licked the corner of his mouth and looked at the black-robed man as he spoke in a hoarse voice.","The black-robed man laughed bitterly and replied, “Hall Master, all the talented young ones in sin Starfield have been eaten up. If we want to find new food, I’m afraid we’ll have to leave sin Starfield.” Jiang Chen said.","The Blood Sky Supreme waved his hand and said, “Then forget it.”","The black-robed man nodded, then asked with concern, “Hall Master, how’s your recovery?”","“How is it?”","The Blood Sky Hall Master’s eyes flashed with hatred when he heard this.","He had tried to kill Jian Wushuang twice. The first time, Jian Wushuang had been saved by the tyrants ‘patriarch, but he had also been hit by the latter’s punch.","Although the old ancestor of the tyrants had just casually thrown out that punch and did not carry any killing intent, his divine body had still crumbled from the impact and he was seriously injured.","After that, when his injuries were almost fully recovered, he participated in the battle to flatten the Divine Life Palace. First, he fought against Supreme Giant Axe and was forced to retreat. Then, he was bombarded by Jian Wushuang’s chaotic divine lightning, which caused his injuries to worsen. If he had not left in time, he would have been in danger of dying that day.","If that wasn’t the case, he wouldn’t be relying on a few Ultimate Rulers as food to speed up his blood demon body’s recovery.","“Damn Jian Wushuang!”","At the thought of this, Blood Sky Supreme became even more resentful and wanted to skin Jian Wushuang alive.","“Jian Wushuang, just you wait. Sooner or later, I will turn you into blood food. I will eat your flesh and sleep on your skin.”","After taking a deep breath, the Blood Sky Ruler’s resentment gradually dissipated. He gathered his thoughts and asked the black-robed man, “Blood Seven, have there been any strange happenings in the Divine Life Palace recently?”","The black-robed man replied, “Hall Master, the universe has been peaceful in recent years. The Divine Life Palace has been recuperating, and Jian Wushuang has not made any moves. He should still be in the Divine Life Palace, consolidating his supremacy stage.”","“Okay, that’s good.”","The Blood Sky Ruler heaved a sigh of relief. He was now in an extremely weak state, and his battle strength had fallen many times from his peak. He was afraid that Jian Wushuang would take advantage of this time to cause him trouble.","The entire universe was well aware of Jian Wushuang’s talent and power. Although he had just broken through to the elementary Supreme realm, many people in the universe had classified his power as that of an advanced Supreme. Some people even bragged that Jian Wushuang already had the battle strength of a top Supreme.","“Hmph, when I recover, I’ll be able to break through to half-step unparalleled Supreme. By then, I’ll kill Jian Wushuang no matter where I go.”","The Blood Sky Ruler snorted.","“I’m about to break through.”","The black-robed man, Blood Seven, was overjoyed when he heard this. He quickly knelt down and congratulated, “Then, I shall congratulate the Hall Master first. I wish the Hall Master to rule the universe for generations to come!”","The Blood Sky Supreme laughed and patted Blood Seven’s head. He said, “Blood Seven, seeing how loyal you’ve always been, I promise you that as long as you follow me obediently, you’ll be treated well in the future...”","Before he finished his words.","...","An extremely cold voice suddenly exploded!","“Die with you?”","Bang!","In the next moment, the door of Blood Sky Palace cracked open, and a cold-looking young man wearing a bamboo hat, a black robe, and a sword at his waist walked in.","“Who are you.”","Jian Wushuang!","Instantly, the smile on the Blood Sky Supreme’s face froze, and his scalp went numb.","Blood Seven did not react for a moment and was stunned on the spot.","“Blood Sky Ruler, long time no see.”","Jian Wushuang’s mouth curved into a cold smile as he spoke.","“Jian Wushuang! What are you doing here?”","...","“What about the Scarlet guard? Where are the blood Lord and blood Marquis?”","It was only now that Blood Seven reacted and screamed.","He clearly remembered that there were many Scarlet guard guards outside Blood Sky Palace, and the two vice Palace Masters, Blood Lord and blood Marquis, were in charge of the entire situation!","The two Deputy Palace Masters were both middle-grade Supremes!","How could Jian Wushuang walk into the Blood Sky Palace without a sound?","The Blood Sky Supreme didn’t say anything, but his expression was extremely ugly.","He knew without a doubt that the two vice Hall Masters, Scarlet guard and blood Lord, who were in charge of guarding Blood Sky Hall, had been killed by Jian Wushuang.","As for why it was so silent, it could only prove that Jian Wushuang’s strength was far above them!"]},{"number":4414,"title":"Chapter 4414 Chase After","paragraphs":["4414 Chase After","“Jian Wushuang, what are you doing?”","The Blood Sky Supreme looked at Jian Wushuang gloomily and said coldly.","Jian Wushuang didn’t answer, but took off his cloak and let his black hair roll up. Then he said with a faint smile, “Blood Sky, you seem to be very weak right now.”","The Blood Sky Supreme snorted and narrowed his eyes. “Jian Wushuang, it seems like you want to kill me?”","!!","At the same time, he slowly began to accumulate Shen power.","“Blood Sky, I was only an Ultimate Ruler back then. You saw that I was weak, so you bullied me again and again. You even wanted to flatten the Divine Life Palace.”","Jian Wushuang said slowly.","Hearing this, the Blood Sky Supreme sneered and said, “Jian Wushuang, this universe is the law of the jungle. Don’t you understand this? Back then, you were weak, so you naturally deserved to be bullied. Who can you blame?”","Shaking his head in disdain, the Blood Sky Supreme continued, “Jian Wushuang, I’ll tell you the truth. I hate myself for not killing you earlier. I let a stray dog like you become so powerful!”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang nodded and then smiled.","“Blood Sky, you treated me like an ant that you could crush later. Now, you are also an ant in my eyes.”","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot and instantly shattered the entire Blood Sky Palace into pieces. Then, like a cannonball, he charged toward the Blood Sky Ruler!","He didn’t even draw his sword. Just the surging qi and blood from his body was enough to shake the entire place.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang appeared above Xue Tia Ruler. He clenched his right hand into a fist, which glowed with a golden light. It was as if he was pushing a Golden Chariot, and he smashed it toward Xue Tia Ruler’s head!","Jian Wushuang, do you really think that you can sweep across the universe just because you’ve broken through to the Supreme level? ”","The Blood Sky Supreme grinned hideously as a curved white sickle appeared in his hand.","“Go to hell!”","A large amount of supreme divine power gushed out from Xue Tia Ruler’s hand and poured into the demon Scythe in his hand. Then, he slashed it down at Jian Wushuang like a cold moon!","There was a layer of purple venom on the blade of the demonic scythe. It was enough to corrode and melt an advanced Supreme-being. Even a top-tier Supreme-being would be severely injured if they were touched by it.","Clang~~!","However, a terrifying scene happened. The indestructible white demonic scythe didn’t even break Jian Wushuang’s chaotic domineering body. Instead, it left a long trail of sparks.","How is this possible?!","The Blood Sky Supreme was shocked.","“Why is it impossible?”","Jian Wushuang sneered. Chaotic domineering body was the number one divine body in all of eternity. When he was still the Ultimate Ruler, he had sent a middle Supreme flying with one punch and then fought against chaotic divine lightning!","One could see how powerful it was from this.","After experiencing the baptism of the Lightning Tribulation and breaking through to the Supreme-being realm, not only did his cultivation level improve greatly, but the strength of his chaotic divine body also rose!","If the Blood Sky Supreme was still in his peak state, he would not be so arrogant. However, the Blood Sky Supreme was still injured, and it was already good enough that he could use half of his strength. How could he hurt him?","“Clay chickens and pottery dogs.”","BOOM!","Jian Wushuang’s punch was like a head-on cannon, piercing through the Blood Sky Ruler’s chest!","The remaining power of this punch caused the ground within ten thousand miles to shake violently, as if a terrifying earthquake had occurred.","In an instant, the Blood Sky Supreme’s face, which had recovered its red color, turned pale.","He stared at Jian Wushuang and was shocked to the extreme.","“This kid is already freakishly strong! I’m afraid he’s invincible among the top Supreme-beings!”","In an instant, thoughts ran wild in the Blood Sky Supreme’s mind. He pushed the dazed Blood Seven in front of him.","help me block Jian Wushuang!","The next moment, Supreme Blood Sky took a deep breath, turned around, and fled!","“Hall Master!”","In an instant, Blood Seven looked at Jian Wushuang, who was charging toward him, and his whole body shivered. He was so scared that his liver and guts were torn apart.","“Jian, Jian Wushuang, it’s not my fault!”","His lips trembled violently, and a glimmer of hope appeared in his eyes.","He was a middle Supreme, but he could not even think of resisting Jian Wushuang.","“None of your business?”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless and he said in a cold voice, “When you slaughtered the disciples of the Divine Life Palace, did you ever think that it was none of their business? When you chased me to the desolate area of the universe, did you ever think that it wasn’t your fault?”","The purple ‘Chuan’ character between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows was faintly visible, and his purple-gold eyes were filled with a cold killing intent!","Bang!","Then, Jian Wushuang stretched out his right hand and the sharp sword Qi between his five fingers was like a snake twining around him. He slapped Blood Seven into powder.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang raised his head and saw that the Blood Sky Ruler had already turned into a red light and was flying in a certain direction.","“You can’t escape!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was indifferent. He took a step forward, turned into a flowing light, and quickly chased after the Blood Sky Ruler.","The chase and escape immediately alarmed the entire sin Starfield.","There were tens of thousands of cultivators living in the cluster of asteroids. When they noticed this scene, they all looked up and were shocked to the extreme.","...","“Look! The Blood Sky Ruler is being chased!”","“What? Who can hunt down the Blood Sky Ruler?”","“That...that person seems to be Jian Wushuang!!!”","In an instant, the two words ‘Jian Wushuang’ were like a heavy bomb thrown into the crowd. The entire asteroid group was in an uproar.","The Blood Sky Supreme was a top Supreme in the past. In this small planetary group, he was the Overlord who controlled the power of life and death. Everyone’s respect and fear for him had long been engraved in their bones.","They had not expected that Jian Wushuang, who had just broken through to the Supreme-being realm, could actually force the Blood Sky Supreme to flee in panic!","“Go! Let’s catch up and see!”","“Hurry, hurry, hurry!”","At that moment, countless people looked at each other and rushed into the sky. They turned into flowing lights and chased after Jian Wushuang and the Blood Sky Ruler.","“Damn it!”","The Blood Sky Supreme looked at Jian Wushuang, who was pulling further and further away from him, and could not help but grit his teeth.","...","His divine body, which was already overwhelmed, was on the verge of breaking.","Jian Wushuang, you forced me to do this!","The Blood Sky Supreme took a deep breath and seemed to have made a decision. A pained look flashed in his eyes. He suddenly changed his direction and rushed toward a blood-red Planet not far away.","There, there was a Scarlet blood pool that was extremely evil.","Gulp.","The pool of blood was like boiling water, constantly producing fist-sized blood bubbles. As it bobbed up and down, one could vaguely see countless broken limbs and heads with ashen faces and wide eyes in the pool.","Puchi!","The next moment, the Blood Sky Supreme dashed into the blood pool like a sharp arrow."]},{"number":4415,"title":"Chapter 4415 Blood Devil","paragraphs":["4415 Blood Devil","Boom!","The Blood Sky Supreme’s body gradually sank into the depths of the blood pool and disappeared.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang, who was chasing after them, stopped in the void and looked down at the blood pool.","!!","Gulu.","Bubbles continuously emerged from the depths of the blood pool. Soon after, the entire blood pool began to spin, and a foul smell assailed his nose.","“You’re just pretending.”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He clenched his right hand into a fist and countless golden lights flickered. It was as if a sun was hanging on his fist and he punched at the blood pool!","Bang!","An earth-shattering explosion was heard!","Immediately after, the entire blood pool shook violently and broke into pieces.","Under this punch, the world seemed to be overturned, the sun and the moon seemed to be broken. The crowd who followed closely to watch the show only felt an extremely strong pressure being released from Jian Wushuang’s right fist. The charging figures seemed to have hit a piece of transparent glass and were forcibly stopped.","In the blood pool, blood water burst out!","In the blood water, a red light was extremely fast. It was holding a crescent sickle with a long iron chain in its hand, and it was slashing toward Jian Wushuang’s head!","Rip!","The strike created a series of sparks on Jian Wushuang’s golden divine body and forced Jian Wushuang to take three steps back.","A bell-like voice reverberated through the heavens and earth.","“Oh?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked at the figure that was coming at him. He raised his eyebrows slightly.","The red light dissipated, revealing the figure of the Blood Sky Ruler.","However, the Blood Sky Supreme was now a completely different person. His originally tall and burly body had become thin, as if his qi and blood had been sucked dry. His wrinkled skin was stuck to his bones.","The two sides of his cheeks were deeply sunken, making his eyes bulge out. He didn’t look like a living person, but more like a skeleton demon that had walked out of hell.","“Jian...Jian Wushuang, this blood pool was originally intended to be used to break through to the half-step unparalleled Supreme level, but because of you, I have to use it in advance to recover from my injuries. You deserve to die!”","The Blood Sky Supreme’s voice was hoarse, and he was panting slightly. His eyes had turned red.","“Go to hell!”","The Blood Sky Supreme took a heavy step forward and turned into a ray of blood light. He appeared in front of Jian Wushuang in a flash and slashed down with his sickle!","Clang!","The Blood Sky Ruler slashed 13 times in a row at an extremely fast speed. Each slash was filled with endless evil Qi and the strong wind that followed it directly created a 10000-foot long Gully on the ground of the star under him!","This might seem simple, but in reality, the power of each flash was enough to kill a middle-grade Supreme!","“Is this the power of a Supreme martial artist?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and his eyes were filled with fighting intent.","After breaking through to the Supreme-being realm, he had yet to unleash his true strength, and his hands were itching for a fight.","“Well, I’ll use this Blood Sky Ruler to test my strength!”","“Come!”","Jian Wushuang laughed and activated his chaotic domineering body completely. His divine body emitted a bright light from the inside out. Like a god of War descending from the Nine Heavens, he punched at Supreme Blood Sky!","A vast amount of qi and blood surged. Jian Wushuang’s punch triggered Qi movement and directly hit the demonic Moon Scythe that Blood Sky Ruler was slashing at.","Bang!","Suddenly, there was a muffled Thunder and a mighty strong wind swept across the entire star under Jian Wushuang’s feet, forming a sky-turning white wave.","That was not all. Jian Wushuang did not stop there. He laughed and punched thirteen times, hitting Blood Sky Supreme’s sickle thirteen times!","Jian Wushuang did not show any signs of retreat as he faced the Blood Sky Ruler, who had recovered to his peak. His fists landed on the Blood Sky Ruler’s sickle, causing it to tremble continuously.","Even when Blood Sky Ruler occasionally attacked Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang didn’t Dodge and took the hit with his body!","Ding ding dang dang!","The crescent-moon sickle hit Jian Wushuang’s body and made a sound as if it had hit a steel plate. Jian Wushuang’s divine light glowed and the golden light was like a raging wave. He stood like a god King, invincible and filled with the charm of unyielding, powerful, and eternal.","Blood Sky Ruler, even if you’ve recovered to your peak, you’re still nothing.","Jian Wushuang turned his head and said indifferently.","He had only used the power of the chaotic domineering body so far. If he pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword, the Blood Sky Ruler would be even more vulnerable.","The Blood Sky Ruler did not reply. Instead, he stared at Jian Wushuang and panted heavily.","In the distance, the people on the small planet who had been hit by Jian Wushuang’s vibration force were shocked to the extreme.","“The Blood Sky Ruler...it couldn’t even break his defense? Is Jian Wushuang still human?”","Someone gasped and said in fear.","Naturally, they had heard of Jian Wushuang’s achievements. They also knew that after Jian Wushuang broke through to the Supreme level, he would definitely be incomparable to ordinary elementary Supreme.","However, they did not expect that Jian Wushuang had already reached the level where he could fight a Supreme with his bare hands!","This was nothing.","Most importantly, they knew that Jian Wushuang’s real trump card and strength was not his invincible body, but his powerful swordsmanship that could suppress the world!","...","If Jian Wushuang were to use the Tarot Divine Sword, how powerful would he be?","Everyone did not dare to think any further, only feeling their scalps go numb.","On the star, the Blood Sky Ruler’s sunken face turned ashen. He had obviously realized this as well.","After taking a deep breath, the Blood Sky Supreme’s eyes were filled with madness as he said, “Jian Wushuang, I won’t rest until I kill you!","“Secret skill, blood devil!!”","He bit the tip of his tongue and used all his strength to shout.","In an instant, his black robe fluttered in the wind as if it was being blown by a strong wind.","His originally thin and shriveled body began to swell up rapidly like a balloon being inflated!","Ka-Chak.","In just a few breaths, he had turned into a mountain-like meatball.","That wasn’t the end. One after another, arms twisted and struggled to reach out from his body.","...","On his stomach, countless ashen faces appeared. Some of these faces were filled with fear, some were filled with hatred, and most of them were filled with despair and pain.","These people were all cultivators who had been devoured by the Blood Sky Supreme as food.","In an instant, the Blood Sky Ruler had turned into an ugly and disgusting human-shaped monster.","Seeing this, everyone felt as if they had fallen into an Icehouse, and their bodies turned cold.","A powerful aura emanated from the Blood Sky Supreme.","Jian Wushuang, you should be proud to be able to see my real body.","When the Blood Sky Supreme spoke, he emitted a terrifying sound wave that was unlike a human’s. It was as if thousands of people were speaking at the same time. The overlapping sound waves made one’s hair stand on end.","Pfft!","The next moment, he raised his hand and slapped Jian Wushuang.","A blood-red vital Qi bullet as thick as a bucket condensed in his palm. Then, with a bang, he charged at Jian Wushuang!","“Is this your true strength?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and he understood.","As expected, the Blood Sky Supreme was not as simple as he seemed, as he was the leader of a force.","“But...”","“You’re still not enough.”","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang’s five well-defined fingers slowly grasped the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword at his waist.","The Tarot Divine Sword started to come out of its sheath inch by inch."]},{"number":4416,"title":"Chapter 4416 Crushing Everything Like Rotten Wood","paragraphs":["4416 Crushing Everything Like Rotten Wood","Boom, boom, boom!","The Tarot Divine Sword had only been unsheathed half a second, but a tornado of sword Qi had already spread out, forming a powerful sword pressure!","Jian Wushuang’s Black hair flew up and his purple-gold eyes flashed with a touch of coldness.","“Sword draw!”","!!","In an instant, the Tarot Divine Sword seemed to have turned into a wild snake and slashed down at the blood pillar Yuan Qi bullet that was flying toward Jian Wushuang!","At this moment, the vast sky seemed to have been split into two, leaving only a line.","Everyone’s vision turned black, and all that was left was a golden sword energy that slashed down in a beautiful arc!","The Tarot Divine Sword’s true power suddenly exploded!","The blood pillar energy ball shot out by the Blood Sky Ruler was easily split into two as if it was tofu. The zenith sword radiance continued to slash toward the Blood Sky Ruler!","“This kid!”","The Blood Sky Supreme gritted his teeth and stomped on the ground. Suddenly, he bounced up like a big meatball and dodged the sword.","Although his body had become huge, his speed did not slow down at all. On the contrary, it increased rapidly!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The sword cut the small planet under the Blood Sky Supreme’s feet, and the entire planet was cut into two sides as if it was an egg.","And this was not the end. After the sword light cut through the star without any hindrance, its power continued to shoot into the depths of the universe without any reduction. It only dissipated after it had rushed out tens of thousands of feet.","The terrifying sword Qi spread out wantonly, turning the area within a thousand feet of Jian Wushuang into a forbidden zone.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was indifferent. Now, he could break the Milky Way and destroy planets with a casual sword!","“Secret skill, blood demon arrow!”","The Blood Sky Supreme said quickly as he looked at Jian Wushuang.","In an instant, the tens of thousands of arms that grew out of his body formed hand seals at the same time.","A mighty, evil, and demonic sound came out of Blood Sky Ruler’s stomach. It was as if his intestines were squirming. Then, blood arrows that looked like small snakes crawled out of his thousands of arms and shot toward Jian Wushuang.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","No words could describe the magnificence of this scene.","Countless blood arrows blotted out the sky, filling the entire world as they shot over at an incredible speed.","Each of these blood arrows was as terrifying as a beginner-level Supreme martial artist’s full-force attack. At this moment, 10000 arrows were fired at the same time, and after converging together, they were enough to turn a top-tier Supreme martial artist into a sieve.","When the cultivators of the asteroid group who were watching the battle from a distance saw this, their eyelids twitched and they couldn’t help but swallow their saliva.","The Blood Sky Ruler was indeed too powerful!","However, a scene that left them dumbfounded happened.","Facing the tens of thousands of blood arrows, Jian Wushuang only squinted his eyes and said indifferently, “Sundering stars.”","In an instant, countless energies in the universe gathered in Jian Wushuang’s hand and formed a 10000-foot blue sword rainbow that fell down!","This sword cut across the sky and pierced through the sun and moon!","As the sword fell, the sharp and powerful sword Qi directly minced in all directions, crushing countless Blood Swords into powder with a crushing force!","One sword breaking all techniques!","The Blood Sky Ruler was powerful, but Jian Wushuang was even more terrifying!","Du, du, du.","A dull sound rang out.","Some of the blood arrows that were lucky enough not to be crushed by the star slashing sword rainbow hit Jian Wushuang’s body. However, they did not penetrate Jian Wushuang’s body. Instead, they were like arrows that had hit a 100-feet-thick steel plate. After sparks flew, they were actually deflected by the missile.","Jian Wushuang even stretched out his hand, lowered his head, and grabbed a blood arrow. Then, he threw it at Blood Sky Ruler as if he was throwing a javelin!","The blood arrow that Jian Wushuang had shot out had increased in both speed and power!","Bang!","The Blood Sky Supreme was hit by the reflected blood arrow, and he was forced to take three steps back. His face was flushed.","This was not the end. The star slashing sword that Jian Wushuang had previously slashed out had only dimmed a little after shattering the countless blood arrows. It then struck the Blood Sky Ruler’s chest fiercely again and sent him flying like a baseball.","In an instant, the hearts of countless people watching the battle from afar trembled, and their bodies trembled.","Among them, there were many people whose cultivation was far superior to Jian Wushuang’s, and there were even senior Supreme existences. However, at this moment, they were all shocked and exclaimed, “Jian Wushuang is a freak!”","“A strong body and unparalleled swordsmanship! Not only was its attack unrivaled, but its defense was also unrivaled! Who else can beat Jian Wushuang?”","“I’m afraid there’s no one below the half-step unparalleled Supreme level who can pose a threat to Jian Wushuang!”","“This is too terrifying!”","At that moment, everyone stared at Jian Wushuang with extreme fear in their eyes.","Before this, they had never imagined that the Blood Sky Hall Master, who had dominated the asteroid belt for nearly 500 chaos cycles, would one day be forced back by someone who wasn’t an invincible Ruler!","It was as if the Blood Sky Supreme was not the brutal blood demon in Jian Wushuang’s hands, but a pellet that he could casually knead!","no wonder people said that without seeing Jian Wushuang’s skills, they would never understand his strength and his amazing talent!","Countless people thought of the rumors that had once spread in the universe. At first, they were disdainful and thought that Jian Wushuang’s several moves were either by relying on Supreme treasures like the Tarot Divine Sword and the Wuxu chaotic cauldron, or by using the power of the Lightning Tribulation. His actual level was not that great.","However, at this moment, they suddenly realized that they were wrong, and they were ridiculously wrong!","They thought of another saying that had been circulating in the universe.","...","How lucky he was to be in the same era as Jian Wushuang, and how unfortunate he was to be in the same era as Jian Wushuang!","Ever since Jian Wushuang’s rise, the Holy Sons of Holy Lands and divine sons of divine nations who had been galloping in the depths of the universe had all disappeared. They had been suppressed by Jian Wushuang’s name and could not even release any light.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm as he stepped on the ground. His eyes were burning with golden flames and his voice shook the world like thunder, ”","Blood Sky Hall Master, if this is all you’ve got, you won’t be able to live past the time it takes for an incense stick to burn.","The Blood Sky Supreme’s face turned ashen when he heard this.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re too arrogant. I, Blood Sky, have experienced thousands of battles. What kind of storms have I not seen? I’m telling you, Jian Wushuang, you don’t have the final say in my life!”","“You’re still far from being able to kill me!”","The Blood Sky Supreme roared and used his secret skill again!","At this moment, he still hadn’t given up and wanted to fight to the death with Jian Wushuang!","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then shook his head, “You’re so stubborn.”","As soon as he finished speaking, a cold killing intent flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. He said slowly, “Tarot Sword Manual, second move.”","...","The first beam of light that was torn apart in the deepest darkness.","“Daybreak!”"]},{"number":4417,"title":"Chapter 4417 Beheading","paragraphs":["4417 Beheading","A golden light suddenly appeared!","Immediately after, Sword Qi filled the entire Hall and swept across the starry sky!","At this moment, all that was within everyone’s sight was darkness, as if it was an Eternal Night.","Only one golden light kept on shining.","!!","This golden light was like the first ray of light before the sunrise between heaven and earth. It was like the first force that opened up the chaos, tearing apart all the blurry darkness!","This beam of light was getting brighter and brighter!","Finally, it suddenly occupied everyone’s pupils!","It replaced everything!","“Slash!”","kill! a cold voice rang out. Then, everyone felt a blur in front of their eyes. The golden light was like a Thunderbolt that flashed across the world and headed toward the Blood Sky Ruler!","When Jian Wushuang performed daybreak, he was much stronger than before!","In addition to the great improvement brought by the breakthrough to the Supreme level, Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the Tarot Sword Manual had improved too much after fighting with Tarot Supreme for ten thousand years in the virtual space.","In those ten thousand years, Jian Wushuang had fought with Tarot Supreme eight thousand times. Each time they fought, it was like Tarot Supreme was teaching him!","Close to 8000 exchanges were equivalent to close to 8000 lessons!","How terrifying was this?","Even an uncivilized pig could become a Grandmaster after comprehending one thing eight thousand times, let alone a person with extraordinary talent and comprehension like Jian Wushuang.","It could be said that Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of Eternal Night and daybreak had reached the point of perfection and familiarity, even if it was not at the peak!","“Rumble!!!”","The golden light approached the Blood Sky Supreme at a high speed, leaving a long white wave in the void.","Jian Wushuang!","The Blood Sky Supreme’s pupils immediately contracted, and he shouted with all his strength, “Supreme Divine Art, blood demon’s wrath!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the human faces on his stomach, neck, and legs, which were in pain and fear, opened their mouths and roared.","Shrill howls sounded out, as if they were evil ghosts who were being executed in hell. They kept letting out shrill howls, and terrifying sound waves spread out.","Their expressions became even more pained.","Then, the Blood Sky Supreme took a deep breath, and a Whirlpool the size of a small lake appeared in his mouth like a whale sucking in water.","The countless arms and human faces on his body were all sucked into his mouth.","The next moment, the Blood Sky Supreme’s cheeks bulged like a crouching Toad that was about to attack.","In the Blood Sky Supreme’s mouth, countless energy twisted and condensed.","“Go to hell!”","The Blood Sky Supreme opened his mouth, and an extremely foul-smelling blood-red ball shot out of his mouth like a missile!","“Roar! Roar! Roar!”","This blood-red ball was even larger and more majestic than the sun. As it rolled, everything in the universe seemed to be overshadowed and could not be compared to it.","Other than...","The golden light that could tear the sky apart!","Buzzzzzz!","In an instant, the golden light and the blood-red ball collided!","Shockwaves spread out, causing an earthquake with a magnitude of a million. The surrounding void shattered inch by inch like glass being smashed by a sledgehammer!","“Jian Wushuang, let’s see if you’ll die this time!”","The Blood Sky Ruler laughed madly.","Now, in order to kill Jian Wushuang, he had cut off the road ahead and was crazy enough to do it at any cost.","“Break!”","An indifferent voice came from the golden light of dawn!","Then, the golden sword energy, which cut the sky and the earth and split the ocean, stabbed into the blood-red ball!","Zi zi zi!","A terrifying sound came from the blood-red ball. The people who were watching the battle from a distance only saw a blur before they saw Jian Wushuang rushing out from the other end of the blood-red ball and penetrating through the middle like a candied fruit!","Sharp and overbearing!","This was the unique characteristic of the Tarot Divine Sword as a Supreme ancestral weapon that was in charge of killing!","If it was the Wuqi Divine Sword, it would have been crushed by the blood-red ball. However, the Tarot Divine Sword didn’t lose any of its brilliance!","After all, this was a peerless weapon that could suppress the universe!","In the next moment, the golden light of dawn rushed out of the blood-red ball and continued to press forward. It crashed into the Blood Sky Ruler’s body and pierced through him!","“No!”","The Blood Sky Supreme finally looked horrified and let out a heart-wrenching scream.","Immediately after, everyone saw the universe’s starry sky in the great dark sky gradually regain its clarity.","Jian Wushuang’s figure had already appeared behind the Blood Sky Ruler.","...","The golden light gradually dissipated, revealing Jian Wushuang’s emotionless face. He held the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword with his five well-defined fingers and looked back indifferently.","Crack!","A huge human-shaped hole appeared in the Blood Sky Supreme’s meatball divine body, which was as tall as a mountain. Countless strong winds whistled through the hole.","Immediately after, cracks started to appear from the sides of the bloody hole on his stomach. Like a spider web, countless cracks extended out!","Bang!","Finally, with a loud boom, the blood demon’s body of the Blood Sky Supreme exploded!","Green liquid and divine blood fell from the sky like a rain of blood, and a foul smell filled the air.","In that instant, the countless cultivators who were watching the battle from afar were all shocked. They looked at this scene in a daze and were tongue-tied.","“One...he killed it with a single sword strike?”","“The Blood Sky Supreme is no match for Jian Wushuang?”","“The Blood Sky Ruler was one of the top Supremes, but he was killed by Jian Wushuang, who had just entered the Supreme realm, with one stroke?”","...","At this moment, countless people felt as if there was a Fishbone stuck in their throats, unable to speak.","The Blood Sky Supreme had been defeated!","This Ruler who had dominated the entire asteroid belt for nearly a thousand chaos cycles had finally been defeated. Countless eyes were fixed on Jian Wushuang. In their eyes, it was as if a sun was setting and a brighter sun was rising!","They knew that the owners of this small group of planets, where nearly ten thousand cultivators from all walks of life gathered, had changed.","The Blood Sky Palace, which was feared by countless people in the universe, would no longer exist.","At this moment, many people’s expressions were extremely complicated.","Xiu, xiu, xiu.","No one noticed that after the Blood Sky Supreme’s divine body exploded, a drop of divine blood quietly shot into the distance.","It was the Blood Sky Ruler.","It was also his last life-saving magical ability.","“Jian Wushuang, the green will never change. After I recover, it’s still unknown who will win.”","The Blood Sky Ruler’s venomous voice came from the drop of divine blood.","Pa da.","Suddenly, he seemed to have hit something and stopped.","“What?”","Blood Sky Ruler raised his head and saw Jian Wushuang looking down at him expressionlessly.","“Where do you want to go?”","Jian Wushuang spoke in an indifferent voice.","“How did you find me?”","The Blood Sky Supreme felt a chill down his spine. This was the first time he had ever felt such a great horror when he was on the verge of death!","Bang!","In the next moment, he saw Jian Wushuang reach out his big hand to grab him.","“No! Jian Wushuang, don’t! I...I, Blood Sky, am willing to submit to you. Please spare me...”","At this moment, all the resentment and dignity of a top Supreme had disappeared. Only the fear of death remained in his heart. He begged Jian Wushuang to spare his life.","However, it was useless.","“Rumble!”","The surging divine power squeezed out of Jian Wushuang’s palm and crushed the divine blood that was Ruler Blood Sky into powder!","The Blood Sky Supreme had finally died!"]},{"number":4418,"title":"Chapter 4418 The Universe Shakes","paragraphs":["4418 The Universe Shakes","The Blood Sky Ruler was dead.","The man, who had once stood at the peak of the universe and was the leader of a force, had died in the hands of Jian Wushuang.","Above the starry sky, Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back. His black hair was flying, his eyes were burning with fire, and his handsome face was indifferent.","Countless stars were under his feet. He was like a god, the master of the stars.","!!","For a moment, everyone in the minor planetary system had their mouths wide open, and there was silence.","The Blood Sky Ruler had ruled over them for nearly a thousand chaos cycles, and their fear of him had been etched into their bones.","They had never thought that the Blood Sky Ruler would fall at the hands of others one day.","All of this had happened too suddenly. It was like a dream, giving people a sense of surrealism.","After a long time, when Jian Wushuang had left, they slowly came back to their senses. They looked at each other and instantly became excited!","“He’s fallen! The Blood Sky Supreme, a giant star, has fallen!”","it seems that Jian Wushuang will have to settle the old scores now that he has broken through to the Supreme Master level!","“That’s right. If I’m not wrong, the Blood Sky Ruler is just the beginning. Jian Wushuang will not let any of the six major forces go!”","“It seems that something big is going to happen in the universe!”","Countless people thought of this, and their hearts trembled.","Then, the news that Jian Wushuang had come out of seclusion cultivation to kill Blood Sky Ruler spread at an extremely fast speed and instantly swept the entire universe!","Immediately, the universe was in an uproar as if a heavy bomb had been dropped!","...","Divine Life Palace, Supreme Divine Palace.","“Hahaha, this kid, I knew he would succeed!”","The Ruler Blood Wave’s hearty laughter rang out from the usually solemn Hall.","This morning, the news had reached the Divine Life Palace. Jian Wushuang had killed the Hall Master of the Blood Sky Hall, the Blood Sky Supreme, in the small planetary group. The entire universe was shocked!","The Ninth Kalpa King, Supreme Giant Axe, and the core members of the Sword Union were all sitting on both sides, and they also smiled when they heard this.","Jian Wushuang is always calm when he doesn’t make a move, but when he does, it’s earth-shattering.","The Ninth Kalpa King shook his head and said. His expression was one of helplessness, but he was also happy for Jian Wushuang.","Blood Sky Ruler is considered an expert among the top-tier Rulers. Even I found it difficult to deal with him. I didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to be able to kill him by himself.","Supreme Giant Axe sighed with emotion. He then turned to look at Ruler Blood Wave and laughed,","“Blood Wave, I’m afraid Jian Wushuang’s power is no longer less than yours and mine.”","The Ruler Blood Wave nodded with a smile and replied, “That’s right. In my opinion, it won’t take long for Jian Wushuang to grow to the point where he can protect my Divine Life Palace.”","This kid’s talent is too shocking.","The Supreme martial artists chatted and laughed with each other. However, the Overlord of the Sword Union seemed to have thought of something, and his expression was a little worried.","Upon seeing this, the Ruler Blood Wave couldn’t help but tease, “Little friend Overlord, what are you worried about? Could it be that you still can’t get over the fact that Jian Wushuang didn’t bring you along with him?”","Hearing this, the Overlord quickly collected his thoughts and replied, “No. Since the alliance leader did this, he must have his own considerations.","“Oh? Then, little friend Overlord, why do you look so worried?”","The Ruler Blood Wave couldn’t help but be surprised.","The great Overlord took a deep breath and cupped his hands. Ruler Blood Wave, everyone knows that the alliance leader killed the Blood Sky Ruler. Many people have already expected that the alliance leader wants to find the six great forces one by one. I’m afraid that the other forces have already made preparations. I’m worried that Lord Alliance leader will fall into an ambush.”","The Ruler Blood Wave didn’t look as worried as the Overlord had imagined. Instead, he patted the Overlord’s shoulder and looked through the entrance of the Supreme divine Hall into the distant void.","“Little friend Overlord, don’t worry. Whatever you can think of, Jian Wushuang will naturally think of it as well. We don’t need to care about this. We just need to wait here for Jian Wushuang’s good news.”","Hearing this, the Overlord was stunned. Then, he said with a bitter smile, “That’s true.”","...","As the news of Jian Wushuang killing the Blood Sky Ruler spread, the originally peaceful universe was once again in turmoil.","In the depths of the universe, in the Great Void Temple.","Bang!","Supreme Bing Ye smashed the armrest of his throne into pieces with a single slap. His face was ashen as he said, “Bastard! We haven’t even gone to find trouble with Jian Wushuang, but he dares to find trouble with us? Does he really think he’s a big shot?”","Supreme Bing Ye’s voice was filled with rage.","Below him, less than 10% of the Supreme martial artists who had been sitting in the hall were left. There were only two or three small cats left.","“Hall Master, please calm your anger.”","A Supreme-being from the Great Void Temple comforted.","As soon as these words were spoken, the already unsightly expression on Supreme Bing Ye’s face became even more unsightly.","“I’ve said it many times. I’m now the divine Emperor of the Great Void Temple, not the Hall Master.” Supreme Bing Ye shot him a cold look.","Hearing this, the Supreme martial artists looked at each other and sighed.","Ever since Supreme Bing Ye failed to kill Jian Wushuang and was humiliated by the white-haired ancestor, he had become more temperamental.","“I know.”","The Supreme martial artist nodded, then said with a slightly worried tone, “Sir Emperor God, now that Jian Wushuang has grown up, I’m afraid he will come to our door in a few days. It’s better for us to be prepared.”","“Make early preparations? With just Jian Wushuang?” Supreme Bing Ye sneered contemptuously upon hearing this and shook his head.","...","“Do you think I’m that trash, Blood Sky? Would I be afraid of Jian Wushuang? Hmph, it’s fine if he doesn’t come, but if he dares to come, I’ll make sure he won’t be able to return!”","“This...”","When the Supreme martial artists heard this, hesitation flashed across their faces. They felt that Supreme Bing Ye was too conceited.","Supreme Bing Ye saw through their thoughts and snorted coldly,”I think you’re all scared out of your wits by Jian Wushuang. No matter how strong he is, he’s only a beginner Supreme. What a disgrace!”","After casting a cold glance at the Supreme martial artists, Supreme Bing Ye strode out.","In the hall, the few Supreme-beings could not help but laugh bitterly. After looking at each other, they felt that Jian Wushuang alone would not cause any trouble for the Great Void Temple. After all, besides Supreme Bing Ye’s half-step unrivaled cultivation, they still had other trump cards.","At the thought of this, they heaved a sigh of relief. However, for some reason, they still felt an inexplicable sense of uneasiness."]},{"number":4419,"title":"Chapter 4419 The Great Sun Divine Kingdom","paragraphs":["4419 The Great Sun Divine Kingdom","At the same time.","In the universe.","A universe boat was traveling in the starry sky, breaking through the nebulas.","The speed of this universe boat wasn’t fast. It was neither fast nor slow, and it seemed to be quite leisurely.","!!","Inside universe boat, a cold-looking young man in a black robe was sitting cross-legged and playing with a Jade cylinder in his hand.","The man was none other than Jian Wushuang. The jade cylinder was given to him by the Blood Wave Supreme when he left the Divine Life Palace. It contained detailed information about The Six Forces.","If it weren’t for the Blood Sky Ruler’s blood demon division technique, he might have escaped.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and sighed.","No one who could cultivate to the top of the Supreme-being level was weak. Not only was the Blood Sky Supreme powerful and had many tricks up his sleeve, but he also had an innate divine power similar to his ‘divine power disintegration’.","“However, from this, I can also deduce that my current strength is definitely far above that of a top-tier Supreme martial artist.”","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile.","After fighting with the Blood Sky Ruler, he finally had a rough understanding of his own strength.","He was now able to fight a top Supreme-being with just the chaotic domineering body. For example, he could fight evenly with the Blood Sky Hall Master and the others.","If he were to use the Tarot Divine Sword, he would have the ability to kill a Supreme-being!","Furthermore, this was not even the situation where he had to use his trump card.","For example, the last three moves of the Tarot Sword Manual, dusk, Four Seasons, and Tarot.","Each of the three sword skills was stronger than the last. Once he used them, he could probably kill a Supreme-being like the Blood Sky Hall Master in an instant.","My current battle prowess should be above that of a top-tier Supreme, but I’m still not at the level of an invincible Supreme.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes revealed a thoughtful look.","Ever since he started cultivating, he had never seen many unparalleled Supremes in action, such as Supreme Gai Fu, Supreme Black feather, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, and the tyrants’ patriarch.","Any one of them had the power to kill a top Supreme-being with a wave of their hands. In front of them, a top Supreme-being was nothing but a clay chicken or a pottery dog.","Even Long Bai of the dragon clan, who had just broken through to the invincible Ruler level, had repelled the Joint Forces of Supreme Blood Wave, Supreme Giant Axe, and the Ninth Kalpa King with just a slight bump on the battlefield in the Divine Life Palace.","“In that case, my current strength should be around that of a half-step unparalleled Ruler, or perhaps even slightly stronger!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glowed.","After a while, Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and opened the second page of the bamboo tube. The information recorded on it was about the Great Sun Divine Kingdom!","“The Great Sun Divine Kingdom...”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and there was a flash of coldness in his eyes.","BOOM!","The next moment, universe boat accelerated and disappeared into the starry sky.","...","In the depths of the universe.","The Great Sun Divine Kingdom had a vast territory and occupied three star areas. It ruled over tens of billions of people and was considered a well-known top force in the universe.","After the last King of Day was destroyed in the war, the power of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom had been reduced, but it was still not to be underestimated.","Today was the day the Great Sun Divine Kingdom would pay their respects to their great sun patriarch.","A sacrificial ceremony was a grand event that was held every hundred chaos cycles in the Great Sun Divine Kingdom. It was a ceremony to sing praises to the founding Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom for the series of heroic feats he had accomplished.","As a result, the Imperial City of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom was filled with decorations and festooned with festoons. It was a festive scene, regardless of whether it was the sects that ruled the Great Sun Divine Kingdom or the other forces that had always been on good terms with the Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","Today, they all brought all kinds of expensive gifts to the Great Sun Divine Kingdom to congratulate him.","In the middle of the city, there was a towering Palace. It was the palace of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","The Empyrean terminus divine sect has brought ten pills of fortune, twenty top grade offensive Supreme treasures, and five hundred thousand universe origin stones to congratulate the Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","“Supreme Jade Cauldron has come with the resources of ten planets to congratulate the Great Sun Divine Kingdom...”","The servants of the ceremonial Department began to sing. Early in the morning, the representatives of the forces that were on good terms with the Great Sun Divine Kingdom arrived.","In the throne room of the Royal Palace, the King of Day sat on the throne.","The messengers who had come to visit were listed next, and the princes of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom were listed at the end.","Everyone talked and laughed about the wind and pointed out the rivers and mountains. It was very enjoyable.","“King of Day, have you heard of the major event that happened in the universe recently?”","After three rounds of drinks, a strong man looked at the King of Day and said with a smile.","“Rainforest Supreme, are you talking about how Jian Wushuang killed the Blood Sky Hall Master?”","The King of Day’s smile faded and he asked.","“Not bad.”","The rainforest Ruler nodded and kindly reminded, “King of Day, you’re not far from the Blood Sky Palace. You have to be careful of Jian Wushuang.”","Now that Jian Wushuang had achieved his goal, many of the Supreme Masters present were afraid of him.","The King of Day nodded his head. He was also a top Supreme. In terms of power, he was not much weaker than the Blood Sky Hall Master. Since Jian Wushuang could kill the Blood Sky Hall Master, it meant that Jian Wushuang had the same ability as him.","Taking a deep breath, the King of Day looked at the old man who was ranked first and said, “Don’t worry, everyone. I’ve already made preparations and specially invited Supreme Jade Cauldron to come and protect me. Furthermore, Supreme Jade Cauldron has already promised me that he will kill Jian Wushuang if he dares to cause trouble!”","After a pause, the King of Day looked at Supreme Jade Cauldron and smiled apologetically, “Don’t you agree, Supreme Jade Cauldron?”","...","Supreme Jade Cauldron had a skinny figure, and his silver hair was tied up with a wooden hairpin. He looked like an immortal.","that’s right. With me around, Jian Wushuang won’t be able to do anything.","Supreme martial artist Jade Cauldron nodded with a proud expression.","When the other Supreme martial artists heard this, they heaved a sigh of relief.","Supreme Jade Cauldron was a well-known Supreme in the universe. He had already broken through to become a half-step unparalleled Supreme hundreds of chaos cycles ago. With him around, there was naturally no need to fear Jian Wushuang.","haha, since the King of Day has already asked Supreme Jade Cauldron to help, everything will be fine.","“It’s fine if Jian Wushuang doesn’t come. If he does, Supreme Jade Cauldron will teach him a good lesson. Otherwise, Jian Wushuang will really be lawless and think that no one in the world can suppress him.”","“With Supreme Jade Cauldron here, we can drink to our heart’s content. Jian Wushuang is not worth mentioning.”","Disdainful sneers were heard and the palace became lively again. The words were full of disdain and contempt for Jian Wushuang.","One of the princes, who was wearing a luxurious robe, stood up and said, “Father, it’s just Jian Wushuang. Why does Supreme Jade Cauldron need to take action? If he dares to come, I can cut off his head by myself!”","The King of Day laughed and said, “It’s not easy for my son to have such courage. After he inherits my position, he’ll definitely achieve great things. However, Jian Wushuang is indeed powerful, and you have just broken through to the Supreme level. You should stabilize your realm first before talking about killing Jian Wushuang.”","...","When the Prince heard this, he respectfully agreed, but he was quite dissatisfied in his heart.","In his opinion, Jian Wushuang was the same as him. He had just broken through to the supremacy stage and could not be that strong.","“Hmph, if Jian Wushuang didn’t have the Tarot Divine Sword, it’s hard to say who’s stronger.”","The Prince snorted in his heart."]},{"number":4420,"title":"Chapter 4420 Jian Wushuang Is Here to Attend the Ceremony","paragraphs":["4420 Jian Wushuang Is Here to Attend the Ceremony","At the same time!","A handsome young man in a loose black robe, with a sword hanging at his waist and a bamboo hat covering half of his face, with only his chin exposed, had already walked into Great Sun Divine Kingdom step by step.","“This Great Sun Divine Kingdom sure is prosperous.”","Jian Wushuang walked on the Imperial Road and looked around casually.","!!","This Great Sun Divine Kingdom occupied nearly half of the planet’s position. The land was vast, but it did not seem empty at all. Instead, it was particularly lively.","There were constantly people walking past him in a hurry, discussing with each other.","“Quick, quick, quick! I heard that the Imperial Palace has taken out hundreds of divine medicines for this ancestral worship ceremony and is going to reward them to the world.”","“Today was supposed to be the day when the old Emperor abdicated and the new emperor ascended the throne. But in the end, the young Emperor was killed by Jian Wushuang on the Ancient Path of Stars. Everything turned into a dream.”","“Do you think Jian Wushuang will come to the wedding today?”","“Who knows? But I heard that the Emperor God has hired an expert to guard the palace. If Jian Wushuang dares to come, he will make sure that he will not be able to return.”","“Let’s not talk about this anymore. Let’s hurry to the Imperial Palace and fight for a share of the divine medicine and universe origin stones. What does the battle between these great figures have to do with us?”","“That’s true. Let’s hurry up. Don’t let others get there first.”","Discussions were heard. Jian Wushuang walked with his hands behind his back, so no one recognized him.","“Is today the Grand ceremony of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom? They even hired experts to guard the place?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and then a smile appeared on his face.","He didn’t know if the King of Day would like his gift.","While thinking, Jian Wushuang walked toward the great sun Palace.","There were more and more pedestrians on the way, and they were all in a hurry. Among them, a Ruler carrying an axe saw that Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry and even kindly reminded him, “Little brother, you have to hurry up and hold on tight. If you are any slower, there will be nothing left.”","Jian Wushuang replied with a smile, “It’s fine. I’m not there to receive the reward. I’m there to give you a gift.”","The chief Ruler carrying the axe was stunned when he heard this. He shook his head and didn’t say anything else. He just continued to rush forward.","The King of Day Imperial Palace had a total of nine halls and three doors. The side doors on both sides were for ordinary cultivators to walk through, and they were also used to distribute rewards.","The arched door in the middle was used to welcome the congratulatory emissaries. Only those who had received the invitation of the King of Day could enter.","“Halt!”","Jian Wushuang had just walked to the middle Palace door when two divine generals at the Ultimate Ruler Realm blocked him with their halberds.","“Do you have an invitation?”","The two divine generals spoke coldly.","“No, I don’t.”","Jian Wushuang replied indifferently. He was wearing a bamboo hat that only revealed his chin.","“So you’re here to collect your reward? The items are at the side doors, please leave.”","The two divine generals sized up Jian Wushuang and found his aura ordinary. He didn’t seem to be an important person, so they immediately rebuked him.","Jian Wushuang could not help but smile and replied, “I’m here to give you a gift to congratulate you.”","“Eh? Then take off your bamboo hat and let us confirm your identity.”","The two divine generals looked at each other and said.","“Alright.”","Jian Wushuang nodded his head and then slowly took off the bamboo hat.","A cold and handsome face was immediately revealed.","In the next moment, a thunderous voice suddenly exploded.","Jian Wushuang from the Divine Life Palace is here to attend the ceremony and congratulate you!","BOOM!","In an instant, the sound reverberated for thousands of miles, and the entire city was in an uproar!","“What? Jian Wushuang!”","“Jian Wushuang is here!!”","“Not good! Quickly stop him and report to the Divine Emperor!”","The two divine generals trembled, their faces turning pale.","Jian Wushuang’s reputation was too great. The number of Supremes who had died in his hands was no less than ten. There was even a giant-armed existence like the Blood Sky Hall Master who dominated a region!","The cultivators who were receiving the rewards in the distance were also shocked. The axe-bearing cultivator who had greeted Jian Wushuang before was so shocked that his eyes almost fell out. He said, “He...He is Jian Wushuang?”","The two divine generals shuddered and hurriedly shouted, “Quickly activate the city’s defensive array!”","With that, they clapped their hands and retreated into the palace. Divine power surged.","Buzz!","A blazing sun suddenly rose from the center of the palace. Immediately, countless rays of divine light spread out from the sun, forming a light shield that was like an egg shell, protecting the entire Palace!","“Is this how the Great Sun Divine Kingdom treats their guests?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and immediately took a step forward. His body suddenly soared into the sky and turned into a golden light, sweeping above the entire Palace.","Bang!","The next moment, Jian Wushuang looked down at the entire Palace and stomped his right foot heavily!","...","Boom~!","Suddenly, a surge of violent power that was surging to the extreme hit the light shield that protected the palace hard as Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot.","In an instant, the entire Great Sun Divine Kingdom shook violently like an earthquake. The Imperial Palace in the center of Great Sun Divine Kingdom was like a small boat in the raging sea, as if it would break at any time!","Jian Wushuang from the Divine Life Palace is here to congratulate the Great Sun Divine Kingdom!","Jian Wushuang’s indifferent voice boomed again. The residents in the entire Great Sun Divine Kingdom felt as if a heavy bomb had been dropped in their ears. It was so loud that even the deaf could hear!","Inside the King of Day Palace.","The faces of the King of Day and the others who were drinking and having fun suddenly changed.","“Jian Wushuang!”","“Bastard!”","The King of Day stood up and his face was dark.","Pa!","...","The wine glass in his hand was smashed to the ground, shattering into pieces.","He was not surprised that Jian Wushuang would come.","But today, it had to be the ancestor worship ceremony!","This was too much!","“Ruler Jade Cauldron...”","The King of Day took a deep breath and turned to Supreme Jade Cauldron.","Supreme Jade Cauldron’s expression was indifferent. Seeing this, he nodded slightly and drank the divine Wine in his cup. He then said, “Don’t worry. I’m here today. Jian Wushuang won’t be able to cause any trouble. Go ahead and fight him. If you can’t defeat him, I’ll take action.”","“That’s good.”","The King of Day heaved a sigh of relief and just as he was about to head out, Great Sun Prince, who was sitting at the back, stood up and said, “Father, please calm down. Jian Wushuang is just an early-stage Supreme. He has the same cultivation as me. Why do you need to lower yourself and attack him?”","“Hmph, this child will go and meet him and see what kind of ability he has to dare be so arrogant!”","With that, Prince King of Day strode out of the palace.","“My son, you mustn’t!”","The King of Day’s expression changed. Just as he was about to stop him, Great Sun Prince took a step forward and flew into the sky like a flowing light, facing Jian Wushuang!","“This is bad!”","The King of Day’s heart sank. He didn’t dare to waste any time and quickly chased after Great Sun Prince."]},{"number":4421,"title":"Chapter 4421 Three-Foot Swords Hanging All Over the City","paragraphs":["4421 Three-Foot Swords Hanging All Over the City","The Imperial Palace of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","Jian Wushuang stepped on the void and his black hair flew in the air. Under him, the majestic Great Sun Divine Kingdom was like an ant.","At that moment, thousands of people in Great Sun Divine Kingdom looked up at Jian Wushuang and they couldn’t help but feel terrified.","They had never thought that Jian Wushuang would barge into the great sun Imperial Palace in such an arrogant and overbearing way without any fear.","!!","“This is Jian Wushuang? You’re indeed a heaven’s favorite.”","I heard that Jian Wushuang has only cultivated for 700000 years, but he has already stepped into the Great Sun Divine Kingdom. He is really admirable.","“This is how a man should be.”","In Great Sun Divine Kingdom, countless people looked up at Jian Wushuang’s figure and spoke.","“How audacious!”","At this moment, a handsome young man in luxurious clothes rushed out of the palace!","“Jian Wushuang! This is a forbidden area of the Imperial Palace, how dare you be so presumptuous?”","The young man in luxurious clothes looked at Jian Wushuang coldly and scolded him.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and asked, “Who are you? Where is the King of Day?”","“I am the seventh Prince of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, Haoji! Jian Wushuang, you want to see my father?”","Great Sun Prince flicked his sleeve and snorted.","“Great Sun Prince is here!”","“Great Sun Prince has recently broken through to beginner Supreme. It’s highly possible that he will inherit the throne of Emperor God in the future!”","“In terms of aura, Great Sun Prince isn’t any weaker than Jian Wushuang!”","The city was abuzz with discussion. Great Sun Prince’s face was expressionless, but his eyes flashed with pride.","Why did he volunteer to be the first one to come out? Wasn’t it because he wanted this effect?","“Jian Wushuang, leave now. I’ll let it go today. If you dare to act so arrogantly here again, don’t blame me for being impolite to you!”","Great Sun Prince snorted.","This heavy snort was like a thunderbolt. It was like a bolt from the blue. He had already used his supreme divine power, and it shook the entire Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","“You won’t be polite?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile, “Even your father, the King of Day, wouldn’t dare to say this to me. Where did you get the guts to threaten me?”","“Impudent!”","Great Sun Prince was instantly enraged. “ian Wushuang, you dare to insult my father? I see that you’re only relying on the Tarot Divine Sword to achieve your ambitions. Do you dare to fight me without the Tarot Divine Sword?”","“Are you even worthy?”","Jian Wushuang laughed contemptuously and shook his head, “Go back and ask your father to come see me.”","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang pointed his finger at the prince.","In the void, there was a sudden trembling sound!","A sword Qi gathered at Jian Wushuang’s fingertips and shot out. It turned into a palm that looked like rolling black waves. It crossed the sky and landed on Great Sun Prince’s face!","Bang!","A red handprint instantly appeared on Great Sun Prince’s face. He was dizzy from the slap and saw stars.","In the next moment, a huge force exploded on his face and he fell like a meteor into the Imperial Palace, smashing countless halls. He was in an extremely sorry state.","In the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, all the people were petrified when they saw this scene.","“Great Sun Prince was so arrogant just now, but...but it’s all gone with one slap?”","“What just happened?”","“This, this is just a f*cking suicide mission!”","Everyone swallowed their saliva and said in shock.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was indifferent, neither sad nor happy. To him, cultivators below the Supreme-being level were not even the slightest bit of interest.","At this moment, a furious roar suddenly sounded!","Jian Wushuang!","Boom~!","A dignified middle-aged man wearing a crown and a dragon robe flew up from the palace. He stared at Jian Wushuang and was extremely furious.","This man was none other than the King of Day!","“Jian Wushuang, you killed my son! The young Emperor, and now you destroyed my Palace and seriously injured my son. You’ve gone too far!”","The King of Day shouted.","An extremely terrifying aura, like an angry ocean, constantly set off violent waves, beating in all directions.","This energy came from the same source as Great Sun Prince, but it was much stronger. They were not on the same level.","“Now this is interesting.”","Jian Wushuang nodded his head in admiration. The Emperor God of the great sun’s divine power was so strong that it was much stronger than Blood Sky Ruler’s.","...","Then, Jian Wushuang looked at the King of Day as if he had heard the funniest joke in the world. He sneered and said, “Bullying? back then, the six of you chased me all the way from the Ancient Path of Stars to the Divine Life Palace. In the end, you even wanted to flatten the Divine Life Palace to kill me! “Supreme White Tiger had fallen, Supreme Gai Fu had fallen into a deep sleep, and countless disciples of the Divine Palace had died!”","“Do you remember this debt? Have you ever thought of going too far?”","“Now you say that I, Jian Wushuang, am a bully. What a joke!”","Toward the end, Jian Wushuang’s words became heavier and heavier, like a thunderclap, deafening even the deaf!","He had come to annihilate the Six Forces not only for him, but also for the dead souls of the disciples of the Divine Life Palace who had been killed to protect him and him!","As long as he didn’t destroy these six forces, he wouldn’t be at ease!","“You!”","The King of Day’s face changed and he couldn’t say anything to refute Jian Wushuang. He gritted his teeth.","“Jian Wushuang! Enough nonsense, this King might as well tell you that you won’t be able to walk out of this Great Sun Divine Kingdom today!”","After taking a deep breath, the King of Day’s eyes shone.","“Is that so?”","...","Jian Wushuang sneered and slowly held the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand. He said, “Emperor God, prepare to receive the gift that I, Jian Wushuang, am giving you.","“A gift for me? What gift?” The King of Day’s eyes narrowed, and divine power surged from his body, transforming into a blazing sun behind him!","“I’m sending you to your death!”","BOOM!","In an instant, the Tarot Divine Sword was unsheathed!","A huge and terrifying sword pressure instantly descended on the whole area, and sword Qi filled the air!","Under this sword pressure, it was as if the King of Swords had come to the world. All the cultivators who used swords in the entire Great Sun Divine Kingdom instantly threw their divine swords out of their hands and shot into the sky, bowing to the Tarot Divine Sword.","In just a few breaths, the entire city was filled with three-foot swords!","“What?”","“How did this happen?”","“My sword!”","For a moment, the whole place fell into a dead silence, then it burst into an uproar!","Everyone’s eyes were wide open as they looked at the scene of the ten thousand swords.","In the void, the divine swords that filled the sky were all like subjects, floating under the Tarot Divine Sword.","The Tarot Divine Sword was one of the seven extreme ancestral weapons that were born when the universe was created. It specialized in killing and could be said to be the ancestor of swords!","Jian Wushuang, who was holding the Tarot Divine Sword, looked like a peerless sword God. His eyes were cold and untainted by the mortal world!"]},{"number":4422,"title":"Chapter 4422 Vulnerable to a Single Blow","paragraphs":["4422 Vulnerable to a Single Blow","“Kill!”","At the next moment, Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot and flew up. He held his sword and charged at the King of Day.","With one step, ten thousand swords moved!","Under Jian Wushuang’s feet, the thousands of divine swords turned their tips and gathered like a long Dragon. They were stepped on by Jian Wushuang and they crashed toward the King of Day!","!!","This sword cut across the sky and split the sea of clouds!","Jian Wushuang, who was protected by thousands of swords, raised his right hand and slashed down at the King of Day.","He raised his hand and used the heaven-opening sword move!","“Good timing!”","The King of Day was not afraid at all. Instead, he laughed in anger and a red light surged from his hand. He was like an eternal Divine King who held the sun, moon, and stars in his hand as he charged at Jian Wushuang!","“Jian Wushuang, I was planning to write off all the old scores since you’ve broken through to the Supreme level. Who knew that you’d be so insensible and dare to come to my door! Then don’t blame me for making you stay here today!”","“You’re noisy.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. The sky-opening sword light that he had casually slashed down collided with the boundless red light. An extremely profound sword principle true meaning exploded and directly disintegrated the boundless red light inch by inch!","Jian Wushuang’s understanding of the sword principle had reached a terrifying level after he had obtained the sword principle inheritance from Tarot Ruler. It would not be an exaggeration to say that it had reached the peak!","Jian Wushuang, your talent is indeed outstanding. Whether it’s your comprehension of the divine power or your use of the great Dao, you’re above me. It’s a pity that you’ve forgotten one thing. No matter how strong you are, you’re still a beginner Supreme-being. The total amount of divine power between you and me is not on the same level!”","“Even if you are a perfect chaotic lifeform, you can’t cross this gap!”","“Close!”","The King of Day snorted and two small Suns gushed out from his palms. As they came together, a huge amount of divine power burst out and crushed Jian Wushuang’s heaven-opening sword light.","The thousands of divine swords under Jian Wushuang’s feet, which had gathered into a long Dragon, scattered and flew back in all directions.","“It’s indeed not bad.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and showed an interested expression.","The Emperor god of the day and the Blood Sky Hall Master were about the same in terms of power, but their fighting methods were completely different.","The Blood Sky Palace Master was like a venomous snake lurking in a dark corner, ready to pounce at any time to deliver a fatal blow.","The King of Day, on the other hand, was unstoppable and overwhelming.","“Come!”","Jian Wushuang stretched his neck and his eyes were filled with fighting spirit. He grabbed at the King of Day again!","Clang!","Jian Wushuang’s sword was caught by the King of Day’s hands. His right leg was like a whip, sweeping across and hitting the King of Day’s waist.","Dong!","With a muffled sound, the King of Day felt a strong vibration from his waist, which bounced off Jian Wushuang’s right leg. He laughed, “Jian Wushuang, don’t think that I don’t know that you’ve awakened the undying Overlord body. It’s a pity that my divine Sun Body is also one of the primordial divine bodies! Although it’s not as good as your undying Overlord body, this King’s realm is much higher than yours!”","“Is that so?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with surprise. One should know that his foot could collapse a thousand mountains with a trillion tons of force. Ordinary Supreme-beings would be injured upon contact, let alone withstand it.","However, Jian Wushuang quickly regained his calm. He swung his right hand and the Tarot Divine Sword cut off the King of Day’s hands. Then, he stabbed forward again.","“Hmph,” he snorted.","The King of Day snorted and took a few steps back to avoid the attack.","However, before he could reassemble his hands and launch a move, Jian Wushuang’s indifferent figure flashed and appeared behind him like a ghost, leaving a long trail of afterimages. Then, he attacked again!","“Rip!”","The next moment, the Tarot Divine Sword tore a long hole in the divine Sun Body, and divine blood spurted out.","how could he be so fast?!!","The King of Day’s pupils shrunk. In a moment of shock and anger, he reorganized his hands, held the two small Suns, and raised his fists to kill Jian Wushuang!","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","There were explosions one after another. Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. As he moved, he swung the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand, tearing open wounds on the body of the King of Day.","A sword technique didn’t need to be so powerful. It only needed the simplest hacking, slashing, stabbing, and stabbing to kill the enemy!","This was the reason why Supreme Tarot had spent ten thousand years in the virtual space to teach Jian Wushuang!","“Ah!”","The King of Day was furious, he stared at the void around him.","His body was covered with dense sword wounds. Divine blood seeped out of the sword wounds, and it rained blood.","Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was so profound that it was far beyond his imagination. No matter how he attacked, Jian Wushuang’s figure was like a ghost, constantly moving. He either blocked or dodged thousands of attacks and left a three-inch-deep sword mark on his divine body.","He wanted to use an earth-shattering divine power, but once he did, the great sun Imperial City that he had painstakingly built for nearly a thousand chaos cycles and covered a million miles would definitely be destroyed. Millions of people would flow with blood and be reduced to bones.","Jian Wushuang!","The King of Day gritted his teeth and his body was covered in blood.","“Daybreak!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. He turned a deaf ear to the Emperor God of sun’s roar and performed daybreak swordsmanship. He turned into an unparalleled sharp golden light and pierced through the chest of the Emperor God of sun!","Bang!","In an instant, the King of Day’s face turned yellow and he almost fell from the sky.","...","Fortunately, the divine Sun Body of the Emperor God of sun was much tougher than that of the master of Blood Sky Palace. Under the rotation of the endless divine power, the sharp sword Qi that Jian Wushuang had exploded in his body was suppressed.","But even so, the King of Day had lost all his strength.","“King of Day, if this is all you’ve got, then prepare to die.”","Jian Wushuang stepped on the void, took a deep breath, and said, “Sundering stars!”","In an instant, the clouds in the void, the surging wind, the floating dust, and the palaces and houses in the capital all rose from the ground and gathered in Jian Wushuang’s hand as if they had been guided. They turned into the purest energy and formed a blue sword light that was nearly 10000 feet long!","Sundering stars was the most powerful killing move created by Jian Wushuang!","“Slash!”","In the next moment, the Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand struck down with a loud bang. The overbearing and sharp sword pressure shook the entire area!"]},{"number":4423,"title":"Chapter 4423 Give Me Some Face","paragraphs":["4423 Give Me Some Face","Within Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","A sword streaked across the sky, piercing through the sun and moon.","All the citizens who noticed this scene trembled and said in disbelief, “Did...did the King of Day lose just like that?”","“Jian Wushuang is too strong! His strength is far beyond that of a top Supreme martial artist!”","“Will the King of Day be the second top Supreme Master to be killed by Jian Wushuang after the master of Blood Sky Hall?”","Discussions broke out. Inside the great sun Palace, Great Sun Prince shuddered as he watched this scene.","“Fa...Father...”","His lips trembled. At this moment, he didn’t even have the courage to stop Jian Wushuang.","He and Jian Wushuang were both in the elementary Supreme realm, but only now did he understand how big the gap between them was!","Above the King of Day Palace.","The King of Day’s pupils shrunk as he looked at The Blue Sword that covered the entire sky.","He still had many trump cards that he had yet to use and many limit true treasures in his Interspatial Ring. However, at that moment, he was very sure that he would not be Jian Wushuang’s match even if he used all his skills!","Taking a deep breath, the King of Day lowered his head, looked at the palace, and shouted with all his strength, “Supreme Jade Cauldron, please lend me a hand!”","Buzzzzzz!","There was no response from the palace. It was as if a pause button had been pressed in the void. The mighty Blue sword light seemed to be caught by an invisible hand and could not fall.","“AI.”","A sigh was heard in the air.","A moment later, a Sage-like elder walked out of the palace. He was wearing a Daoist robe and holding a horsetail whisk, his silver hair tied up with a wooden hairpin.","Every step he took was in the void without using any power. It was as if the heavens and earth had laid a ladder for him and lifted him up.","“Disperse.”","He looked at Jian Wushuang indifferently without any emotion on his face. He just gently waved the horsetail whisk in his hand, and the star-slashing sword light that suppressed the world suddenly went away with the wind inch by inch like a sand painting, disappearing into the void.","“Ruler Jade Cauldron!”","The King of Day’s anger was slowly replaced by calmness. He stood behind Zhong Yue respectfully and saluted.","“I’ve been entrusted by others, and I’m loyal to them. Great Sun, leave it to me.”","Ruler Jade Cauldron nodded his head at him.","“Eh? And who are you?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He could feel that although Supreme Jade Cauldron looked plain and had an ordinary aura, upon closer inspection, he realized that he had already integrated with the great Dao of heaven and earth. His entire body was filled with the true meaning of the great Dao, but it was hidden.","In terms of strength, this man was much more terrifying than the King of Day. He was probably already at the half-step unparalleled Supreme realm.","“I’m Jade Cauldron. You may not have heard of my name since you’re young, but you can go back and ask the Blood Wave Supreme of your Divine Life Palace. He’ll naturally tell you who I am.”","Supreme Jade Cauldron’s expression was calm as he sized up Jian Wushuang. He then said, “Jian Wushuang, your talent is indeed outstanding. I heard that you were favored by the Lord Cosmos God during the gathering of all races in the universe. If it is possible, I do not wish to harm your life.”","After a pause, he said calmly, “Jian Wushuang, give me some face and let it go. Previously, you had all sorts of grudges with King of Day because you killed his son, the young Emperor. In addition, you were indeed weak back then and you had a powerful weapon. That’s why King of Day attacked you.”","“Since you’ve proven yourself to be a Ruler, we can naturally let bygones be bygones. I can make the decision on behalf of the great sun. As long as you back off now and never step foot in the Great Sun Divine Kingdom’s territory again, I will not pursue the matter of you humiliating him. How about it?”","Then, he looked at the King of Day and asked, “King of Day, do you have any objections to my decision?”","“I’ll follow your arrangements, Supreme Jade Cauldron,” the King of Day replied.","He had no desire to fight with Jian Wushuang anymore. He just wanted to get the God of killing to leave as soon as possible.","Supreme Jade Cauldron nodded his head in satisfaction. Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Jian Wushuang, are you going to give me face?”","In his opinion, what Jian Wushuang needed was a way out. Now that he had given Jian Wushuang a way out, he was confident that Jian Wushuang would follow the way out.","After all, if he were to really take action, it would inevitably lead to the discussion of the strong bullying the weak in the universe. If he won, it would still be fine, after all, it was only natural. If he lost, his reputation as Supreme Jade Cauldron would be destroyed.","In Great Sun Divine Kingdom, countless people fixed their eyes on Jian Wushuang’s face and waited for his answer.","“Your face?”","However, Jian Wushuang replied with a blank expression, “I’m sorry. I, Jian Wushuang, have never taken the initiative to bully others in my life. However, if someone bullies me, I will definitely take revenge and return the favor a hundred times over!","“Back then, the Great Sun Divine Kingdom slaughtered thousands of disciples of my Divine Life Palace, causing the death of many supreme beings. They even rewarded me with thousands of gold coins in the universe for my head. Now, you’re going to let this matter go just because you want to give you face?”","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang held the Tarot Divine Sword horizontally and pointed the tip of the sword at Supreme Jade Cauldron. He said coldly, “Let me tell you the truth. The King of Day is dead today. Even your Jade Cauldron can’t save him!","“If you know what’s good for you, then get out of my way and I’ll let you off. If you’re determined to protect him, then I’m sorry, I’ll kill both of us, let alone you!”","Audacious!!!","In an instant, Supreme Jade Cauldron’s face turned ashen, and his eyes were filled with killing intent.","He, Jade Cauldron, was a half-step unparalleled Supreme-being, and no matter where he went, all the Overlords and giant arms would treat him with respect.","Jian Wushuang, a mere elementary Supreme, dared to humiliate him?","“You can try to see if I’m bold or not!”","Jian Wushuang looked at him coldly without any intention of backing down.","“Good, good, good. Jian Wushuang, since you don’t want face, don’t blame me for not giving you a chance!”","Ruler Jade Cauldron said in a cold voice. Then, he flicked his horsetail whisk, and his entire body turned into a stream of light. Like a wave of smoke, he rose up and rushed into the Nine Heavens.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll be waiting for you outside the star!”","...","Supreme Jade Cauldron’s cold voice rang out from the sky.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked at Great Sun Divine Kingdom. If the two of them started a battle here, the entire star would be destroyed and thousands of people would die.","Every injustice had its perpetrator, and every debt had its debtor. This was not what he wanted.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot and instantly gathered endless sword Qi. The last sharp and brilliant sword light shot up into the sky and beyond the stars."]},{"number":4424,"title":"Chapter 4424 Battling Jade Cauldron","paragraphs":["4424 Battling Jade Cauldron","Above the King of Day palace.","The King of Day’s face was gloomy and his eyes kept flashing.","He had not expected that Jian Wushuang would not even give face to Supreme Jade Cauldron and was determined to kill him.","“Father.”","Great Sun Prince flew up and stood beside King of Day. He said, “Father, it seems that Jian Wushuang is determined to fight to the death with the Great Sun Divine Kingdom. In that case, why don’t we catch up and kill Jian Wushuang while he is fighting with Supreme Jade Cauldron?”","“Oh?”","The King of Day raised an eyebrow and nodded, ” that’s right. If we can’t kill Jian Wushuang today, I’m afraid there will be endless trouble in the future.","After saying that, the Emperor God of the great sun turned into a huge sun and chased after Jian Wushuang and Supreme Jade Cauldron like a fireball.","Great Sun Prince wasn’t slow either.","A moment later, only the raggle great sun Imperial City, the many citizens, and the guards were left.","quick, quick, quick! This battle concerns the life and death of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom. How can we miss it? ”","“Not bad! One of them is the number one genius of the universe, while the other is a half-step unparalleled Supreme-being who has been famous for a long time. This battle is bound to be extremely exciting. Let’s quickly catch up!”","All of a sudden, everyone looked at each other and used their divine arts one after another. They either turned into light or divine beams and shot out into the sky.","...","The universe was boundless.","The stars shone and the Milky Way stretched across.","Jian Wushuang, you’re too arrogant. You don’t understand the meaning of the extreme hardness fold.","Supreme Jade Cauldron’s expression was cold as he held his horsetail whisk and looked at Jian Wushuang.","“If you focus on training for a hundred chaos cycles and improve your cultivation base to the level of a Supreme Ruler, then I definitely won’t dare to interfere. In fact, I might even refuse to participate in the Great Sun Divine Kingdom’s ancestral worship ceremony out of fear of you. It’s a pity that you’ve just broken through to the Supreme-being realm, and you’re already so full of yourself that you came to seek revenge. You’re simply courting death!”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and his purple-gold eyes flickered. A shocking battle intent burst out from his body.","“What a coincidence! I was just thinking of arm wrestling with a half-step unparalleled Supreme!”","“Jade Cauldron, let me see what you’re capable of. Who gave you the confidence to interfere in my business?”","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang took a heavy step forward and turned into a vast daybreak sword light that charged toward Supreme Jade Cauldron!","The entire starry sky was left with only one golden light!","“Oh? Was this sword move from the Tarot Sword Manual? When Supreme Tarot dominated the universe, I was fortunate enough to witness it. In terms of proficiency and power, this sword technique of yours is probably not inferior to Supreme Tarot back then.”","Ruler Jade Cauldron exclaimed in admiration, but the coldness in his eyes didn’t decrease in the slightest.","“This sword move is enough to threaten the life and death of a top-tier Supreme martial artist. Unfortunately, it’s far from enough to defeat me.”","Supreme Jade Cauldron shook his head and gently flicked the horsetail whisk in his hand. A ray of seven-colored divine light instantly shot out and hit Jian Wushuang with unparalleled power!","Bang!","In an instant, a powerful repulsive force appeared from the seven-colored divine light and began to disintegrate the Daybreak sword ray from its original energy.","Pfft!","Jian Wushuang’s figure seemed to have hit an Invisible Glass. His charging figure came to a halt and then he was sent flying back thousands of feet.","Da da da da.","Jian Wushuang took three steps back before he could stabilize himself. His blood and Qi were boiling.","“So, this is what a half-step invincible Ruler is like? He is indeed much more powerful than a Supreme-being.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. Then, he didn’t hold back any of his divine power and it exploded!","“Again!”","A wave of battle intent erupted from Jian Wushuang and soared!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang appeared above Supreme Jade Cauldron and slashed down with the Tarot Divine Sword, carrying a strong sword pressure.","“Small tricks.”","Ruler Jade Cauldron coldly snorted as he swiped his right hand across the horsetail whisk. In an instant, the white threads of the horsetail whisk in his hand straightened up and became as hard as iron, transforming into the shape of a long blade.","Clang!","The Tarot Divine Sword struck the long blade of the horsetail whisk, but it was unable to cut it in half. Instead, it created a long string of sparks.","“Jian Wushuang, if the Tarot Supreme had the Tarot Divine Sword, I would have been killed in one move. But in your hands, the Tarot Divine Sword is just a Pearl covered in dust.”","“In the end, the gap between our cultivation bases is too big!”","Supreme Jade Cauldron sneered disdainfully. Then, he quickly changed his wrist and slashed out 32 times in succession, each strike fiercer than the last, forcing Jian Wushuang to retreat.","“Secret skill, Galaxy slash!”","Seeing Jian Wushuang retreat, Supreme Jade Cauldron’s right hand shook again, and the horsetail whisk changed again. Countless white threads grew wildly and combined to form a long steel whip, which swept toward Jian Wushuang!","Pipa, pipa, pipa~","This whip cracked the void and made a cracking sound like glass breaking. It caused countless QI activities to surge and set off a wild wind.","Pfft!","Then, the whip landed on Jian Wushuang’s chest. The violent power tore a long palm-sized wound on his chaotic domineering body.","This scene caused a wave of exclamations in the eyes of the people who had come to watch the battle from afar.","...","“As expected of Supreme Jade Cauldron, a half-step unparalleled Supreme. His offensive power and combat techniques have already reached the point of perfection!”","“The horsetail whisk in Supreme Jade Cauldron’s hand is a replica of the thousand opportunity whisk, one of the seven Supreme ancestral weapons. It can transform into any weapon, and its power is only slightly weaker than the real thousand opportunity whisk.”","“It seems that Jian Wushuang, who has been invincible all the way, is in big trouble this time!”","The audience’s gazes were focused as they began to discuss.","The King of Day and Great Sun Prince were even more delighted.","“Father, it seems like Jian Wushuang is no match for Supreme Jade Cauldron.”","“Let’s go,” Great Sun Prince said.","The King of Day smiled and nodded. His nervous expression turned into a relaxed one.","Supreme Jade Cauldron is a super expert who survived the great catastrophe. Jian Wushuang is just a young kid who relied on his talent and some opportunities. Naturally, he is no match for Supreme Jade Cauldron.","The King of Day shook his head and laughed.","In the starry sky, Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked at the hideous wound on his chest. His eyes flickered and he sighed, “As expected of a half-step unparalleled Supreme. He’s already so mature in all aspects. He won’t be easy to deal with.","...","Hearing this, a look of ridicule appeared on Supreme Jade Cauldron’s face.","“Jian Wushuang, now you know the difference between you and me? It’s not too late for you to admit defeat now. As long as your attitude is better and you’re willing to apologize to me in front of everyone, I can still let you live.”","“Jian Wushuang, this is the last chance I am giving you. You must cherish it.”","After saying that, Supreme Jade Cauldron looked down at Jian Wushuang with a condescending look in his eyes.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help grinning and only replied with four words.","“You are being whimsical!”"]},{"number":4425,"title":"Chapter 4425 Qian Ji Fu","paragraphs":["4425 Qian Ji Fu","“You’re so stubborn!”","Ruler Jade Cauldron’s face darkened upon hearing this. He coldly replied, Jian Wushuang, since you lack discipline, I’ll teach you a lesson on behalf of the elders in your Divine Life Palace!","Bang!","He waved his right hand, and the horsetail whisk in his hand suddenly turned into a divine brush. He drew a line in the void in front of him, directly drawing a golden Yin Yang Tai Chi pattern.","“Secret technique, seal the sky with one seal!”","Supreme Jade Cauldron shouted in a low voice as the horsetail whisk in his hand turned into a divine brush and he tapped it heavily on the yin-yang Taiji diagram.","In an instant, the yin-yang Tai Chi pattern let out a low hum, spun, and rose into the sky. Then, it continued to expand and expand with the wind. In just a few breaths, it was like a curtain cover, sealing the entire sky and the surrounding area!","After that, Supreme Jade Cauldron took a step forward and flew up. The horsetail whisk in his hand turned into a huge sky-splitting axe and he chopped down at Jian Wushuang!","Innate divine power, original universe!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fighting intent as he activated his innate super power. In an instant, an extremely powerful force descended on the world and turned the void around him into a dark magnetic field.","BOOM!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s aura soared again, and Supreme Jade Cauldron’s flying chariot couldn’t help but slow down.","It was at this moment that Jian Wushuang said coldly, “Sundering stars!”","BOOM!","The Blue Sword light condensed in Jian Wushuang’s hand and slashed down with a strong sword pressure. The starry sky was split open as if it was splitting the sea.","“Oh?”","Ruler Jade Cauldron narrowed his eyes and sneered, “What a surprise. But it’s a pity that it’s useless against me!”","“Thousand movement, change!”","He let out a roar, and in an instant, the White threads of his horsetail whisk spread out like a goddess scattering flowers. In the next instant, the White threads merged together to form a diamond-shaped shield that firmly protected Ruler Jade Cauldron!","Bang!","When the astral Slash sword hit the shield, a deafening sound was heard. It was as if the entire universe was experiencing a 10000-magnitude earthquake. The force of the impact spread out in all directions along the shield!","“Quickly retreat!”","“The battle between these two is too terrifying!”","All of a sudden, those who had not reached the cultivation of an advanced Supreme martial artist among the spectators retreated and flicked their sleeves to resist the violent shock wave.","After blocking the Sundering stars sword radiance, Supreme Jade Cauldron took a step forward and charged toward Jian Wushuang like a wave of smoke.","“Come!”","The divine light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes intensified. He held the Tarot Divine Sword horizontally and slashed out ninety-nine streaks of sword Qi in succession. They tore through the vast sky and howled arrogantly at Supreme Jade Cauldron!","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","The two of them exchanged more than a hundred moves in an instant. Sharp and cold sword Qi swept across, and destructive divine arts smashed everywhere. It seemed as if the entire universe was going to be destroyed, and black holes appeared in the void one after another.","The speed of the two was extremely fast. Even though the audience had already used all their strength to capture the movements of the two people with their eyes, they were still much slower.","The Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand continued to slash and stab. The overlapping sword shadows were like a dream, giving people a feeling of extreme poignance.","As for the horsetail whisk in Supreme Jade Cauldron’s hand, it was ever-changing. At times, it would transform into a long blade that could tear apart the heavens, at other times, it would transform into a Giant Axe that could split the heavens and earth, and at other times, it would transform into a long spear that could sweep across the world.","The two of them kept moving around, from one star to another. They were like two divine lightning bolts that constantly crossed each other. They collided again and again, and the aftershocks they produced turned the surrounding stars into dust. It was as if they were going to reopen the chaos and cause the universe to boil.","“These two are too strong!”","“No wonder Supreme Jade Cauldron is a half-step unparalleled Supreme. Previously, the king god of the day was helpless against Jian Wushuang, but Supreme Jade Cauldron was able to deal with him with ease. He wasn’t afraid of Jian Wushuang at all and could even suppress him!”","“Jian Wushuang is the truly terrifying one! Think about it. Ruler Jade Cauldron has cultivated for thousands of chaos cycles to become so powerful, but how long has Jian Wushuang been cultivating? More than seven hundred thousand years!”","“It’s been more than seven hundred thousand years and Jian Wushuang is already on par with Supreme Jade Cauldron. What kind of concept is this?! Even if I go into seclusion, it’ll take me 70000000 years!”","“It’s a good thing they didn’t fight in the great sun Royal City. Otherwise, the entire Great Sun Divine Kingdom would have been annihilated.”","“The difference between people is too great.”","The audience exclaimed one after another. Some Supreme-beings who had been cultivating for a long time sighed in despair when they saw Jian Wushuang’s surging battle intent.","“Jian Wushuang, go to hell!”","Supreme Jade Cauldron frowned as if he was tired of fighting with Jian Wushuang. He quickly formed a seal with both hands.","“Supreme Divine Art, purple cloud Holy curse!”","In an instant, a golden word ‘curse’ appeared in the air, and an extremely powerful pressure spread out. It was enough to make all the races in the world submit.","In the next moment, the ‘curse’ was like a person carrying two huge cauldrons and it came crashing down on Jian Wushuang!","In the void, a passage of destruction was blasted out.","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with solemness. He slashed Nine Heaven-opening sword lights in a row to stop the curse!","Peng peng peng!","The first strike caused the speed of the curse to slow down slightly.","With the second strike, a crack the size of a strand of hair appeared on the seal.","The third strike...","The fourth...","After Jian Wushuang’s Nine Swords, the curse could not hold on any longer. It shook for a while and then burst out with a loud bang. Countless Qi Ji and divine power of the Chinese shot out in all directions.","...","“Huu.”","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief and beads of sweat appeared on his forehead.","He had used all the divine power in his body to swing the nine Swords in a row. It had also consumed a lot of his energy.","And at this moment.","Jian Wushuang, go to hell!!","A ferocious laugh rang out.","Then, the King of Day turned into a ball of fire and hit Jian Wushuang’s body.","This attack was the killing move that the King of Day had been saving for a long time!","Bang!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body flew backward under the huge force. He pierced through a star in the distance and flew back for thousands of feet before he finally stopped.","There was a hole the size of a cuju ball on Jian Wushuang’s chest, and countless sparks were burning on his body.","...","Drip, drip, drip.","The blood of the Overlord body dripped down from the hideous wound and burned black holes in the void. White smoke was ignited and covered Jian Wushuang’s body.","“Great sun!”","Supreme Jade Cauldron’s face changed slightly as he looked at the King of Day unhappily.","Originally, he wanted to deal with Jian Wushuang even if he was bullying the weak. Now that the King of Day had launched a sneak attack, if the news spread, wouldn’t his reputation be destroyed?"]},{"number":4426,"title":"Chapter 4426 Evening","paragraphs":["4426 Evening","“Ruler Jade Cauldron, it’s only safe if we join forces to kill this little thief. I’ll promise you that I’ll double your benefits later, alright?”","The King of Day laughed.","Upon hearing this, Supreme Jade Cauldron’s expression softened. He shook his head and said, “The current Jian Wushuang is just an arrow at the end of its flight. He’s no longer a threat. He won’t live past today.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Jade Cauldron walked toward Jian Wushuang with a cold expression, ready to launch his final killing blow.","The King of Day and Great Sun Prince walked to the side, their eyes filled with killing intent and their lips curved into cold smiles.","The three of them moved together and approached Jian Wushuang quickly.","In the distance, the spectators’ expressions changed slightly when they saw this.","“How shameless! Jian Wushuang is just a beginner Supreme, but he wants to team up?”","“The King of Day is the leader of a force and a top Supreme. I didn’t expect him to be so weak. He couldn’t defeat Jian Wushuang in a direct battle, so he sneaked an attack on Jian Wushuang.”","“It seems that the King of Day hates Jian Wushuang to the core. He will do anything to stop him.”","Someone said in disdain.","Someone sighed and shook his head, “You can’t blame the great sun. Since Jian Wushuang decided to raze the Great Sun Divine Kingdom to the ground, he should have thought of this.”","“It’s a pity for Jian Wushuang. He should have been a treasure of our universe. I didn’t expect him to die here.”","Jian Wushuang is too conceited and arrogant. “If I were him, I would hide in the dark and wait until the ancestral worship ceremony is over and all the guests have left. Then, I will find a chance to slowly kill the King of Day. It’s a pity that Jian Wushuang chose the most arrogant and high-profile way to appear, which is also the easiest way to be targeted.”","The crowd discussed in low voices. They had different opinions, but in general, almost all of them felt pity for Jian Wushuang.","Pa da, pa da.","The King of Day’s every step in the void made a muffled sound. He was like a death god approaching and announcing Jian Wushuang’s death.","“Jian Wushuang, aren’t you the number one genius in the universe? Didn’t you want to flatten my Great Sun Divine Kingdom? Try being arrogant again.”","Great Sun Prince smiled sarcastically and said.","Supreme Jade Cauldron, on the other hand, said indifferently, “Jian Wushuang, I admit that you are very strong. It’s a pity that you chose the wrong opponent. You shouldn’t be my enemy.”","The three people’s eyes were all shining with different lights, some cold and others mocking.","They were confident that Jian Wushuang would definitely die under their joint attack.","The waves of smoke that filled the sky gradually dispersed.","The three of them were only ten Zhang away from Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, a calm voice was heard from the smoke that had not completely dissipated.","“I didn’t want to use this move at first. I planned to save it for Bing Ye.”","“But why? Why?”","“Why do you all have to court death?!”","Bang!","In the next moment, the smoke waves in the sky were all shattered, revealing Jian Wushuang’s cold figure.","The hole in his chest that was created by the King of Day God had been healed. His body was shining with golden light, as if he had the perfect body of a God.","In his hand, the eye on the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword became more and more ferocious.","Waves of enormous sword pressure were released from the Tarot Divine Sword.","“Jian Wushuang!”","Ruler Jade Cauldron and the other two immediately stopped in their tracks, their pupils constricting.","They did not know why, but they felt a terrifying aura from Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang looked indifferent and ignored them. He raised his head to look at the boundless starry sky, then slowly closed his eyes and said, “The third move of the Tarot Sword Manual, dusk.”","Whoosh.","The wind started to blow.","The Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand started to turn into sand from the tip of the sword and gradually disappeared.","The entire world fell silent.","The stars that were originally floating in the universe seemed to have lost their gravity and began to fall, as if they were about to fall into a bottomless abyss.","“What is this?”","The King of Day and Great Sun Prince sensed something wrong and frowned.","A feeling of fear kept growing in their hearts.","However, no matter how they spread their divine power around, they could not sense where the fear came from. They only knew that it was definitely related to Jian Wushuang.","Ruler Jade Cauldron’s expression changed drastically.","The King of Day and Great Sun Prince didn’t know what was going on, but he had seen Tarot dominate the universe, so how could he not know?","This was one of the five ultimate techniques that Supreme Tarot had used to dominate the universe, the sword technique, sunset!","Back then, Supreme Tarot had used the Twilight sword technique to annihilate three great races with a single sword strike, shocking the entire universe!","Originally, with the death of Tarot supremacy, this heaven-shaking and earth-shattering sword Dao Divine Art was also sealed.","Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang had opened it again today!","Quickly escape!!","Supreme Jade Cauldron’s eyes widened as he roared at the King of Day and Great Sun Prince.","...","At the same time, he stomped heavily with his right foot, and the horsetail whisk in his hand instantly turned into a flying shuttle, allowing him to step on it as he flew away at an extremely fast speed.","“What?”","The King of Day and Great Sun Prince were stunned for a moment, but they quickly understood what was going on. Supreme Jade Cauldron must have sensed the danger.","Thus, the two of them also used their divine abilities in an attempt to escape.","“It’s too late!”","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes. Under his feet, the void slowly caved in, forming a huge pit. Then, it began to spread at an extremely fast speed.","Rumble!","This pit was like a giant Taotie beast with its mouth wide open. An irresistible suction force came from the center of the pit.","Countless stars, galaxies, and everything floating in the universe fell into the pit as if they had lost control, and then disappeared without a sound.","The dark night would eventually be replaced by the dawn, and the sun would eventually fall into the arms of the dark night.","In the middle of this process, it was dusk!","...","“Hiss!”","The King of Day, who had already flown a thousand feet away, saw this scene and his scalp went numb.","The next moment!","He had been charging forward, but he stopped. The huge suction from the pit that could annihilate everything in the world was like an invisible arm that pulled him back.","He was clearly still maintaining his forward charging posture, but his entire body was constantly retreating, and then falling...if he continued to fall...","Until he sank into the pit.","He wasn’t the only one. Great Sun Prince and the other spectators were also caught in it.","This was not the end.","Even Supreme Jade Cauldron, who had been the first to react and had fled the furthest, was dragged back into the pit with an unwilling roar.","“No! Jian Wushuang, I will not interfere in this matter anymore. Let me go!”","Just as he was about to sink into the pit, Supreme Jade Cauldron stared at Jian Wushuang and said, “It’s too late!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and his eyes were cold. Then, he opened his mouth and uttered a word.","“Bury.”"]},{"number":4427,"title":"Chapter 4427 The Four Seasons","paragraphs":["4427 The Four Seasons","“Bury!”","Jian Wushuang stood in the void and quickly formed a seal with both hands as he shouted coldly.","As soon as he finished speaking, the pit began to collapse rapidly like a black hole in the desert.","At Jian Wushuang’s current level, the Super power of sword principle was no longer limited to swordsmanship!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Earth-shaking rumbles were heard in the universe.","First, the stars that had been swallowed by the pit began to shatter one by one, turning into nothingness. Then, Great Sun Prince, who was the weakest among them, felt like he was being crushed by heaven and earth. His divine body instantly crumbled.","Father, save me!","Great Sun Prince shouted in fear.","Bang!","In the next breath, Great Sun Prince’s body and soul were destroyed, leaving only his screams that echoed in the universe.","“Haoji, my son!”","In an instant, the King of Day’s eyes opened wide.","Ever since the young Emperor was killed by Jian Wushuang on the Ancient Path of Stars, Great Sun Prince had become the last of the great sun God’s blood and sweat. He was also the heir that the great sun god had chosen.","If Jian Wushuang had not been there, the King of Day would have pushed Great Sun Prince as the king God during the ceremony.","His love for Haoji was even greater than his love for Emperor Shao!","But now, Great Sun Prince had been killed by Jian Wushuang in front of him.","Great Sun Prince’s last words stabbed into his heart like a knife.","He was an Emperor God, a top-tier Supreme. He was the all-powerful giant arm that controlled the life and death of thousands of people in the universe.","But he was also a father.","Great Sun Prince died in front of him, and the King of Day went crazy!","“Jian Wushuang, you deserve to die!!”","The King of Day raised his head and stared at Jian Wushuang through the huge pit. His eyes were filled with hatred.","“It seems like you’re in a lot of pain?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him expressionlessly, and the corners of his mouth lifted into a cold arc.","“Don’t worry, you’ll be reunited with your son soon.”","Peng peng peng!","The speed at which the pit collapsed became even faster!","Waves of destructive power formed by sword Qi continued to Harvest life in the pit.","Dusk fell, and everything withered.","From then on, the world fell into an Eternal Night.","This was the true meaning of the sunset sword!","“Roar roar roar!”","The King of Day used his divine power to resist the attack of the twilight sword, roaring.","The blazing sun-like aura on his body was rapidly fading away. The Divine Sun Body, which was also ranked in the top ten of the universe, was constantly cracking and leaking Qi.","Ten breaths passed.","The divine body of the Emperor God of sun finally started to explode inch by inch. In the end, only his head was left, and he stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, I curse you to die a terrible death! This King curses your entire clan to the netherworld! I curse you...”","Bang!","Before he could finish, the head of the King of Day exploded like a watermelon.","The life force of the King of Day disappeared.","At this moment, loud rumbles continued to ring out from the pit, but the people watching the battle from afar seemed to have gone deaf. They stared at this scene in a daze, their mouths so wide that an egg could fit in.","After a long time, someone said with trembling lips, “The King of Day, the hero of a generation, has fallen just like that?”","“The King of Day was one of the most powerful people in the universe. How could he be killed by Jian Wushuang? ”","“The Young Emperor is dead, Great Sun Prince is dead, and the King of Day is dead...I’m afraid that the Great Sun Divine Kingdom will no longer have a place in the universe.”","“It’s too terrifying. How strong is Jian Wushuang?”","Countless people said in shock.","They turned to look at Jian Wushuang with deep respect in their eyes.","...","Peng peng peng!","The sword technique of dusk had not ended. It continued.","That was because there was one person who was still holding on. That was Supreme Jade Cauldron.","Within the crater, waves of destructive aura continuously crashed against Ruler Jade Cauldron.","Meanwhile, Ruler Jade Cauldron was sitting cross-legged in the air. The silver strands of his horsetail whisk rapidly grew longer and longer before wrapping around him like an eggshell. No matter how the sword Qi bombarded him, he remained motionless.","...","“Jian Wushuang, this move is indeed powerful. However, it’s a pity that your cultivation is too much weaker than mine and you can’t exert the battle power of this move. Otherwise, I would have been killed in one move.”","Supreme Jade Cauldron shook his head regretfully before changing the topic.","“Jian Wushuang, now that the King of Day is dead and you have taken your revenge, why don’t you let me out? Are you going to waste your time here with me?”","As he said this, the corners of Supreme Jade Cauldron’s mouth curled up slightly in a mocking manner.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He had to admit that Supreme Jade Cauldron was indeed powerful. Even huanghun had not been able to kill him with one move.","After a moment of silence, Jian Wushuang said, “Jade Cauldron, do you still remember what I said before?”","“What?”","Supreme Jade Cauldron narrowed his eyes and asked in confusion, “What did he say?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently and replied calmly, “I’ve said it before, if you stop me, I’ll kill you! Do you think I’m joking with you?”","BOOM!","In an instant, the deep pit that had buried countless lives disappeared.","...","The Tarot Divine Sword reappeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","However, before he could show any joy on his face, it was suddenly replaced by an unprecedented fear!","“Tarot Sword Manual, fourth move, Four Seasons!”","Jian Wushuang stared at Supreme Jade Cauldron coldly.","In an instant, the entire universe changed again.","The temperature of the entire starry sky suddenly dropped by thousands of degrees!","In all directions, a strong and cold Blizzard blew, freezing the entire star field!","At that moment, the world seemed to have fallen into the bitter cold of Midwinter.","Countless snowflakes were falling from the sky, exuding a bone-chilling coldness.","Each snowflake was a ray of Four Seasons sword Qi!","“This...this is the Four Seasons sword!”","Ruler Jade Cauldron cried out in alarm.","If he had been shocked when Jian Wushuang had used the Twilight sword move, then he was terrified now!","The Four Seasons sword technique looked ordinary and was far less powerful than the first three sword techniques. However, it was far from comparable to the first three sword techniques in terms of concept and power!","It could be said that the Four Seasons sword technique was a huge watershed!","The Four Seasons sword technique was like a needle hidden in cotton, impossible to guard against, and the most insidious!","Chi chi chi chi!","A poignant, beautiful snowflake drifted down. Ruler Jade Cauldron raised his horsetail whisk to block it, but just as he was about to do so, the snowflake passed through his horsetail whisk and landed on his divine body.","In an instant, his divine body was sealed in ice where the snowflakes touched. He couldn’t even use his divine power!","“This...!!”","Supreme Jade Cauldron’s expression changed drastically. Before he could change his technique, the Four Seasons sword technique had already changed!"]},{"number":4428,"title":"Chapter 4428 Killing a Half-Step to Unrivaled Expert","paragraphs":["4428 Killing a Half-Step to Unrivaled Expert","“Boom!”","It was like the sound of spring thunder!","The Four Seasons sword technique suddenly changed again. The cold winter melted and turned into a warm spring that nourished everything silently.","Chi Chi Chi.","The cold wind and snow that filled the sky gradually faded away. What was left was a soft drizzle that fell from the sky.","Midwinter, warm spring, scorching summer, and cold autumn.","The four great solar terms were the four sword essences contained in the Four Seasons sword technique!","Its complexity and profoundness were beyond one’s imagination!","Warm spring wasn’t a sword move that specialized in killing among the Four Seasons sword intent, but it was the most dangerous sword move!","The solar term of spring brought about the revival of all living things. Under the peaceful surface, there was brutal killing and plundering!","“Rumble!”","In the universe, it was as if the entire starry sky had disappeared at this moment. There was a continuous spring rain and thunder, as if it was playing a divine song of destruction.","Ruler Jade Cauldron held his horsetail whisk as he stared at the world around him.","The rain falling from the sky was sword Qi, the rumbling Thunder was sword Qi, and even the gentle wind was sword Qi!","One after another, the sword Qi filled the entire world!","There was no way to avoid it, and it was an ambush from all sides!","In just half an incense’s time, Ruler Jade Cauldron’s divine body was cut apart by countless sword Qi, and a rain of blood fell. He was like a bloody man.","His hair was disheveled and his Daoist robe was in tatters. He was in an extremely sorry state.","“Jian Wushuang, do you really want to fight to the death with me?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently and replied, “If you can survive this strike, I’ll spare your life. What’s the harm in that?”","“Good! Jian Wushuang, is this the reason why you weren’t afraid when you faced me? However, don’t forget that you’re not the only one in the world who has a trump card. I, Jade Cauldron, also have one!”","Ruler Jade Cauldron took a deep breath, and the look of contempt in his eyes was replaced by a grave expression.","The next moment.","He said word by word, “Supreme Divine Art, Nine Cauldrons suppress the world!”","“Break!!!”","In an instant, Supreme Jade Cauldron’s body began to glow with divine light, and countless true intents of the great Dao appeared in his eyes.","His already powerful aura rose sharply again!","In the void, nine huge cauldrons were formed!","These nine huge cauldrons were ancient and magnificent. As soon as they appeared, they were like the ocean-stabilizing godly needles that suppressed the raging sea, instantly freezing the overturned heaven and earth!","One hundred thousand rays of sword Qi, which were constantly emitting cold light and turning into spring rain, collapsed at the same time!","This remarkable power was Supreme Jade Cauldron’s most powerful technique, and he had once relied on this remarkable power to instantly kill a half-step unparalleled Supreme!","His title of Supreme Jade Cauldron originated from this divine ability!","Kachacha.","The void seemed to be unable to withstand the nine Cauldrons as it shattered inch by inch.","“Explode!”","Ruler Jade Cauldron shouted with all his might.","In an instant, the nine Cauldrons were like divine dragons rising into the abyss. They spun and rose into the sky!","The nine Cauldrons were connected to each other, and muffled sounds kept coming out of them, as if the war drums of the ancient heavenly court were being beaten, deafening everyone!","BOOM!","In the next moment, the nine Cauldrons exploded at the same time!","An indescribable magnificent force exploded and turned into a destructive shock wave that swept in all directions!","Under this power, no matter if it was the continuous spring rain, the surging spring breeze, or the rolling Thunder, the wind and clouds were all blown away.","At the same time, they were all crushed!","“Good skill!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and took half a step back. He opened his fists and his fists emitted a bright golden light. The purple ” River ” character between his eyebrows became more and more dazzling, as if the God of War had descended!","“Come!”","Jian Wushuang struck out with his fists and the shock waves that were sweeping toward him were continuously destroyed.","Peng peng peng!","Each punch was extremely powerful and had the power to blow up a planet!","Jian Wushuang was like a warrior on the shore who was facing the tide. No matter how the shock waves hit him, he broke them one by one!","The Four Seasons sword Qi that Supreme Jade Cauldron had destroyed didn’t dissipate. Instead, it began to evolve again!","Winter turned to spring, spring turned to summer, summer turned to autumn, autumn turned to winter!","The four solar terms were endless and formed a cycle!","Once the Four Seasons sword Qi was formed, it would be a life and death situation!","...","This was the most powerful aspect of the Four Seasons sword Qi!","It was not like daybreak and dusk, where all the power of the attack would burst out at the same time and cause a destructive blow. It was like a millstone, moving slowly but constantly obliterating the enemy’s vitality.","After a few breaths.","A blazing sun rose up, and a scorching and violent force pounced on them!","The entire starry sky began to turn dry and red.","As for Supreme Jade Cauldron, his entire body began to emit white smoke. Like a withered flower bud, his skin gradually became dry and dry, and his hair began to fall off one by one.","His entire body seemed to be roasted into a human jerky. His blood began to boil and then turned into smoke.","A sense of great terror at the moment of life and death grew in his heart!","“Jian Wushuang, stop!!”","“I apologize to you! I shouldn’t have meddled in the matters between you and the King of Day!”","“Let me go! From now on, wherever you are, I, Jade Cauldron, will avoid you and respect you like a god!”","...","“Let me go!!!”","At this moment, all of Supreme Jade Cauldron’s pride and dignity had been shattered. All that was left was the fear of death and the desire to live!","He looked at Jian Wushuang in despair, his face full of pleading.","“Now you want to beg for mercy?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently and shook his head, “I’m sorry. I, Jian Wushuang, have always been a vengeful person. I will kill anyone who wants to kill me!”","“Die!”","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang stretched out his five fingers and grabbed at the void!","Bang!","In an instant, the blazing sun formed from the Four Seasons sword Qi shot out with a loud bang and ruthlessly crashed into Supreme Jade Cauldron!","In an instant, Ruler Jade Cauldron’s face turned ashen.","With an earth-shattering explosion, the Tarot Divine Sword stabbed into Supreme Jade Cauldron’s chest. In the next moment, Supreme Jade Cauldron’s body and soul were destroyed.","The half-step unrivaled Ruler Jade Cauldron had fallen!","He was also the one with the highest cultivation who had died at Jian Wushuang’s hands!","Whoosh!","The Four Seasons world formed by the Tarot Divine Sword gradually collapsed. The Tarot Divine Sword turned into a golden light and flew back into Jian Wushuang’s hand.","The entire starry sky turned deathly silent.","As Jian Wushuang held the Tarot Divine Sword, he felt a connection with it.","“Eh? You’ve become stronger?”","Jian Wushuang could vaguely feel that the Tarot Divine Sword had become stronger and more demonic after killing Supreme Jade Cauldron.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang recalled what Martial Sword Immortal had said to him at the banquet in the Divine Life Palace.","The most terrifying part of a Supreme great ancestral weapon was that it could continuously grow stronger!","As for the Tarot sword, it was the one that was in charge of killing.","“Killing...can it make the Tarot Divine Sword stronger?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a hint of thought. He immediately pulled out his sword and inserted the Tarot Divine Sword into the Tarot scabbard, letting the scabbard nurture the Tarot Divine Sword."]},{"number":4429,"title":"Chapter 4429 One Sword to Banish the Mortal World","paragraphs":["4429 One Sword to Banish the Mortal World","The void was deathly silent!","Only the strong wind continued to reverberate.","The spectators who had already retreated far away looked at this scene in a daze and felt chills all over their bodies.","Great Sun Prince was dead.","The King of Day was dead.","Even Supreme Jade Cauldron, who was a half-step unrivaled Supreme and had an all-powerful cultivation base in the universe, had been killed by Jian Wushuang!","No words could describe the shock in their hearts.","Originally, it was already shocking enough that Jian Wushuang had killed a Supreme when he was an Ultimate Ruler. Now, Jian Wushuang, who was a beginner Supreme, had killed a half-step unparalleled Supreme!","This was too shocking!","Such a thing had never happened in the universe!","Whether it was the number one genius from 100000 chaos cycles ago, the East boundary, or the Ninth Kalpa King, who had been regarded as a monstrous genius, none of them could compare to the current Jian Wushuang.","“Jade...it seems like the universe is really going to change!”","an elementary-level Supreme killed a half-step unrivaled Supreme. If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn’t have believed it!","“Number one heaven’s favorite of all time!”","from now on, the entire universe will remember one name, Jian Wushuang!","“Legendary! Jian Wushuang is a legend!”","from today on, there will be one more person at the peak of the universe, and that is Jian Wushuang!","“If the invincible Ruler doesn’t show up, I’m afraid Jian Wushuang will be able to sweep across the universe!”","Countless people spoke.","At that moment, they looked at Jian Wushuang in black with deep adoration and fanaticism in their eyes.","There were even female cultivators who were dazzled and seeing stars.","If it were not for the rumors in the universe that Jian Wushuang had already married, they would have rushed forward on the spot and become his wife and concubine!","No one present was an idiot. Jian Wushuang was powerful and had amazing talent. No one dared to say how amazing Jian Wushuang’s future achievements would be!","If not for the fact that Jian Wushuang’s enemies, such as the dragon clan and Cosmos Temple, many people in the universe would have wanted to get close to Jian Wushuang and form a good relationship.","But now, after Jian Wushuang had killed the half-unrivaled Supreme Jade Cauldron, these people suddenly became bold and fearless!","“Hmph! Jian Wushuang has only cultivated for 700000 years, but he already has the strength to kill a half-step unparalleled Supreme. If Jian Wushuang is allowed to cultivate for another 700000 years, the dragon clan may not be his match!”","“The Dragon race has lived in peace for too long, and they’ve been arrogant for too long. It’s time for someone to teach them that they’re no longer universe Masters!”","“The dragon clan sounds powerful, but it’s just that. A few second-generation dragon clans who have been struggling to survive can only rely on sleeping to keep their lives. The remaining third-generation dragon clans may be powerful, but when Jian Wushuang grows up completely, he might have a chance to overthrow them!”","“I’m certain that this universe will belong to Jian Wushuang after ten thousand chaos cycles!”","Countless people’s eyes were burning as they spoke with determination.","Then, they looked at each other and walked toward Jian Wushuang, intending to form a good relationship with him.","Among them, there was a concierge who came to the ancestor worshipping ceremony. He ran quickly as he was afraid that Jian Wushuang would vent his anger on them. He quickly tried to explain.","“Supreme peerless, I’m Supreme Golden Saber of the limitless divine sect. I’ve come to greet you...”","“Supreme Wushuang I’m the island master of five Turtle Island. I’m here to apologize to you. My participation in the great sun God’s ancestral worship ceremony is because my ancestor is an old friend of his...”","All of a sudden, all kinds of fawning voices were heard.","These people were all experts above middle Supreme Master level. However, they were all flattering Jian Wushuang and dared not show any disrespect.","If this scene fell into the eyes of an uninformed person, it would definitely make one’s eyes pop out.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm. These people were just grass on the wall that swayed with the wind. Fortunately, he had won today. If he had lost, these people would definitely have spat at him in disdain after he was killed by Supreme Jade Cauldron and the others.","Jian Wushuang didn’t pay much attention to them. He extended his right hand and the interspatial rings of Emperor God of the great sun and Supreme Jade Cauldron flew toward him.","After grabbing the Interspatial Ring, Jian Wushuang used his divine power to scan the inside of the ring and he could not help but be moved.","The wealth in their interspatial rings was simply terrifying. Even before the Supreme Lightning Tribulation had begun and he had many Supreme treasures to self-destruct, he was far inferior to these two.","These two people must have stolen many opportunities from others because of their powerful cultivation!","Jian Wushuang snorted and shook his head. He put away the two Interspatial Rings and turned to the Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang turned into a sword light and crossed the sky like a shooting star. He then fell into the Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","...","Within Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","Many people who had not rushed out of the starry sky to watch, as well as the Royal descendants who had stayed behind to guard the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, were discussing.","They looked relaxed and even had the time to drink tea. It seemed like they were not worried that the King of Day and the others would lose.","“Queen, His Majesty the celestial Emperor and the others haven’t returned after such a long time. Could something have happened to them?”","A guard from the Great Sun Divine Kingdom said with worry in his eyes.","The Queen was a beautiful woman. She put down her teacup and said casually, “Jian Wushuang is only a beginner Supreme. How can he be Your Majesty’s opponent? Moreover, with the help of Supreme Jade Cauldron, Jian Wushuang will be executed no matter how powerful he is.”","“This...”","The guard couldn’t help but hesitate for a moment before saying, “Queen, for safety’s sake, I think we should go and take a look.”","...","Hearing this, Great Sun Queen frowned and was about to reprimand him.","At this moment!","Accompanied by a loud rumble, a deep voice exploded like thunder and rolled down.","“The King of Day is dead. The other members of the great sun royal family are also guilty. Although they are not dead, their cultivation should be cut off as a warning to the others!”","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang’s figure condensed in the void.","In an instant, countless descendants of the great sun Heavenly King’s Royal family were scared out of their wits. They couldn’t believe it. The King of Day’s face turned pale instantly.","How is this possible?!","How could His Majesty be defeated?!","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold and his black hair was flying in the air. He stood proudly in the void.","He looked down at Great Sun Divine Kingdom, shook his head, and slashed down with his sword!","...","“This sword will strip you of your cultivation!”","BOOM!","In an instant, the sword did not seem to cause any damage. It did not even move a blade of grass. Instead, it directly cut into everyone who had the bloodline of the King of Day!","This sword move was a variant of the Eternal Night sword move!","It had the power to strip everything!","It was a small super power that Jian Wushuang had derived after he had comprehended the sword essence of Tarot Supreme.","“Argh! My, my cultivation!”","“What’s going on? Why is my cultivation level declining?”","“Don’t!”","In an instant, the King of Day Imperial Palace was filled with screams!","Countless people could feel their cultivation levels rapidly declining, and their faces were filled with extreme shock.","The people who had come with Jian Wushuang noticed this scene and shivered all over.","One sword to cut off his cultivation!","What kind of supernatural method was this?","One must know that there were nearly 10000 people in the great sun royal family!","Jian Wushuang looked at them indifferently and slashed out four sword lights again!","The four sword radiances shot up into the sky and then hid in the void.","“From today on, for the next 90 million years, no one from the King of Day royal family is allowed to step out of the King of Day Palace!”","“The King of Day Imperial Palace has been sealed for tens of millions of years!”","Buzzzzzz!","The four sword radiances hidden in the void turned their tips and would kill anyone who dared to step out of the great sun Imperial Palace!","In an instant, countless great sun royal family members ‘faces turned ashen.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. He took a step forward and turned into a ray of light."]},{"number":4430,"title":"Chapter 4430 Shocking","paragraphs":["4430 Shocking","Jian Wushuang left!","All that was left was the Great Sun Divine Kingdom and the disciples of the Great Sun Royal Family.","When he entered the city, the entire city was in a festive mood, and everyone was smiling.","After he left the city, the walls were in ruins and the place was covered in white.","At this moment, countless cultivators who were still in the Great Sun Royal City looked at the Great Sun Royal Family who was suppressed and sealed by the four Sword Lights. They were all silent.","They knew that the Great Sun Divine Kingdom was finished!","90 million years!","For 90 million years, he was not allowed to step out of the palace. What kind of concept was this?","Although 90 million years was a long time for a Supreme martial artist, it was not unacceptable. However, for the descendants of the Great Sun Royal Family who had been stripped of their cultivation and demoted to ordinary people, 90 million years was countless reincarnations and thousands of generations!","This meant that they would never be able to rise again!","“No!”","In the Great Sun Palace, countless disciples of the royal family of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom were in despair. The Great Sun Queen even fainted on the ground.","From being the queen of a high and mighty kingdom, no one dared to disobey her, and then to being reduced to a mortal who had to go through life, old age, illness, and death. This was even more painful than killing her!","Among them, there were some disciples of the Great Sun Royal Family who tried to cultivate, but they were shocked to find that a restrictive spell had been planted in their bodies, blocking all their cultivation paths!","“We’re really finished...”","At this moment, countless people fell to the ground, their faces full of despair.","A few days later.","The news that Jian Wushuang had killed the Great Sun Divine Emperor, Zhu Yuding, spread across the universe rapidly.","In an instant, the universe was in an uproar. All the races were shocked and the world was in an uproar!","The commotion caused this time was far greater than anything in the past. It was even comparable to the battle at the gate of the Divine Life Palace!","The Great Sun Divine Emperor had died in Jian Wushuang’s hands. Although they were shocked, they were not overly surprised.","The impact of Zhu Yuding’s death was simply too great!","Zhu Yuding had a Half Invincible Supreme cultivation base. He had become famous thousands of chaos cycles ago, and had survived that Great Catastrophe War!","Of course, Zhu Yuding was still weak during the Great Catastrophe War. He was only a High Supreme, so he did not officially participate in the Great Catastrophe War. Even so, he was still an Ancient Almighty!","However, such an Almighty expert had died at the hands of Jian Wushuang, who had cultivated for only 700,000 years!","This was too shocking!","Jian... Jian Wushuang’s talent and strength are unprecedented!","A clan leader who was ranked at the top of the universe stood there, his lips trembling, and his eyes were filled with shock.","“As long as the Invincible Surpeme doesn’t show up, I’m afraid no one in the universe can stop Jian Wushuang now!”","Someone else took a deep breath and said.","“Hurry up! pass down my order. From now on, all disciples of the Divine Sect should stay away from Jian Wushuang. Even when they are wandering in the universe, they should be polite to other disciples of the Divine Life Palace. They should not be offended! Otherwise, I’m afraid it will bring a great disaster to our sect!”","There was a Sect Master who was considered an Overlord in the universe. He issued three decrees in a row that day, and each of them was about Jian Wushuang!","The sects and forces that had once said that Jian Wushuang would definitely die under the Dragon clan’s oppression or had participated in the killing of Jian Wushuang either announced their apologies in the universe or quickly sent people to the Divine Life Palace to apologize.","Some of them were from Immortal orthodoxies, some were from ancient Holy Lands, and some were Holy kingdoms. They were usually Big Shots in the universe and controlled life and death. However, at this moment, without any surprise, they all expressed their goodwill to Jian Wushuang.","From the moment Jian Wushuang killed Zhu Yuding, he was no longer a junior who could be bullied by anyone. Instead, he was another rising star that rose in the universe and was strong enough to step on the top of the universe!","As for the forces that were on good terms with Jian Wushuang, they included Nine Emperor Pavilion, Starry Sky Sword Sect, Nine Stars Holy Land, Moluo clan, and so on.","They also announced to the universe that they would form an alliance with the Divine Life Palace and become Jian Wushuang’s supporters!","At that moment, many people were shocked to find that Jian Wushuang had become an Almighty in the universe who could stir up the universe and shake the Nine Heavens and ten lands!","Countless top forces were connected to him!","There were still people in the universe who were watching from the sidelines. Although they no longer said anything to defame Jian Wushuang, they were sneering in their hearts. Sooner or later, Jian Wushuang would still die at the hands of the Dragon clan.","All of a sudden, the universe was changing and all kinds of discussions were emerging. The name Jian Wushuang occupied all the topics in the universe.","...","In the universe, in a quiet and lonely starry sky.","The Cosmic Boat was constantly breaking through the wind and waves as it sped forward.","Jian Wushuang did not stay in the Cosmic Boat. Instead, he stood on the deck of the Cosmic Boat with his hands behind his back and let the strong wind brush past him.","His black hair was fluttering in the wind.","Jian Wushuang looked straight ahead, his eyes constantly flickering.","“From the looks of this battle, killing a Half invincible Supreme should be the limit of my power.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with deep thought as he recalled the details of his fight with Zhu Yuding.","In that battle, other than the last move of the Tarot Sword Manual, ‘Tarot’, he had used almost all of his techniques.","As for the other superpowers, like the chaotic force in the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron, even if they were used, they would not affect the result.","The Tarot Sword was the trump card that Jian Wushuang had prepared for himself. It was also a trump card that he had never used before in the event that the Dragon clan sent their strongest experts to kill him. It might be able to save his life at a critical moment.","Unless he had no other choice, Jian Wushuang would not use the Tarot sword move.","He had yet to fully comprehend this sword technique. He was not sure what the consequences would be if he used it.","...","The loss of control was too great.","“However, even so, at least I have the power to protect myself in the universe.”","Muttering to himself, Jian Wushuang smiled.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang finally thought that he had the power to protect himself in the universe. He did not dare to say that he could sweep across the universe and defeat his enemies. However, he was confident that he would never need to return to the situation where he could only hide from people who were chasing him.","After a while, Jian Wushuang opened the bamboo tube that Supreme Blood Wave had given him. The third page was marked with the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom!","“Scarlet Sun Divine Emperor, a Half Invincible Supreme who became famous three thousand chaos cycles ago...”","Whoosh! Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang stepped on the Cosmic Boat and kept flying toward the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom.","The Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom was his third target!"]},{"number":4431,"title":"Chapter 4431 Committing Suicide","paragraphs":["4431 Committing Suicide","At the same time.","Just as Jian Wushuang was steering universe boat toward the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom!","Many gazes within the universe were also focused on the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom.","Through the previous two Crusades, they finally understood that Jian Wushuang’s targets grew from weak to strong.","For example, the Blood Sky Hall Master, who had died first, was the weakest of The Six Forces that had killed Jian Wushuang. He had the weakest Foundation and was only a top Supreme.","As for the remaining Five Forces, apart from the King of Day, who had already died, the weakest of them had already reached the half-step unparalleled Supreme level.","“The Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom is finished.”","Countless people shook their heads.","...","Within the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom.","“Father, what should we do now?”","“Your Majesty, say something!”","The Imperial Palace was in chaos.","Countless commanders and ministers of the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom, including Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s descendants, looked at Scarlet Sun Demon Master on the throne in despair.","The news that Jian Wushuang had killed the Emperor God of sun and Supreme Jade Cauldron was like a bolt of lightning that struck everyone in the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom.","Even the Supreme King of the great sun and Supreme Jade Cauldron had died. What could the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom do to resist?","At that moment, endless regret welled up in the hearts of countless people in the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom.","Why?","Why did he have to provoke Jian Wushuang?","“Alright, stop quarreling!”","Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s face was square, and his entire person was filled with a sense of authority.","He slammed the armrest of his throne and glanced coldly at the people in the hall who were trembling like quails because of Jian Wushuang’s name. He snorted and said, “Back then, when I was going to flatten the Divine Life Palace and kill Jian Wushuang, you were the ones who made the most noise. You wanted to get a share of the loot after I flattened the Divine Life Palace!","“Now, Jian Wushuang is powerful. He hasn’t even arrived yet, but you’re all so scared that you’re all in danger. It’s really embarrassing!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the originally chaotic Hall immediately returned to silence.","Everyone present lowered their heads, not King of Day to look at the Scarlet Sun Demon Master.","How could they have imagined that Jian Wushuang, who was only at the Ruler realm, would have the cultivation to kill a half-step unparalleled Supreme with a leap?","“Alright, let’s all calm down. Since Jian Wushuang is here, I’ll naturally find a way to solve it.”","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master took a deep breath and said in a deep voice.","“Report!”","At this moment, a divine general rushed in from outside the hall and entered it.","“Your Majesty, Jian Wushuang is less than three star areas away from the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom. He will arrive within the next few days!”","The divine general raised his head and looked at the Scarlet Sun Demon Master with a terrified expression.","“It’s so fast?”","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s pupils shrank, and his expression changed slightly.","Then, he stood up and looked at the people in the hall. He said coldly, “You guys stay here. I will bear all the punishment for Jian Wushuang!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master stood up and walked out of the Imperial Palace under the complicated gazes of everyone in the hall.","Before he could walk out of the palace, a deep and cold voice exploded in the sky above the entire yunwu city.","Jian Wushuang from the Divine Life Palace is here to pay a visit to the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom!","His words were like a bombshell in the Great Sun Divine Kingdom.","Countless people’s expressions changed drastically. Their faces turned pale and their bodies trembled like screening chaff.","“He’s here, he’s here. Jian Wushuang is here.”","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s eyes also lost color for a moment before he regained his calm. He took a step and landed on the city wall of the Scarlet Sun Royal City.","After all, he was the man who stood at the peak of the universe. He had been a hero for a long time and had long been used to the ups and downs of the waves. Although Jian Wushuang was strong, he was not so strong that he would be afraid of him.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ve been waiting for you for a long time.”","Scarlet Sun Demon Master looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated gaze and said in a deep voice.","‘He didn’t call me by name anymore, which meant that he regarded Jian Wushuang as an equal.’","“Oh?”","Jian Wushuang came over with his black clothes fluttering in the wind. He squinted his eyes and asked, “”You’ve been waiting for me for a long time?”","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master nodded and replied, “Jian Wushuang, in this world, only the strong are respected. Back then, you were weak, so I bullied you. I was following the way of heaven. But now, you are stronger than me. Even if you come to me, I have nothing to say. I am willing to accept my punishment.”","“Hehe, you’re quite frank.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him with a faint smile.","Seeing that Jian Wushuang didn’t express his opinion, Scarlet Sun Demon Master seemed to be struggling. He gritted his teeth and said, “Jian Wushuang! No matter how angry and murderous you are, I, Scarlet Sun, will bear it alone! Let my descendant go, and leave some leeway!”","After that, he saw that Jian Wushuang did not speak, so he took a deep breath, as if he had made a decision, and said again, “Jian Wushuang! As long as you don’t vent your anger on my descendants and strip them of their cultivation, I...I’m willing to commit suicide!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the people of Scarlet Sun who were watching the scene in the Imperial Palace held their breaths.","...","They had never expected that the Scarlet Sun Demon Master would be willing to commit suicide for their sake!","Even Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly.","On the path of cultivation, the further one cultivated, the more selfish and emotionless one would become. As long as one could cultivate the great Dao, an ordinary person could even cut off their parents and Dao companions to verify their Dao, let alone blood and kinship!","There were very few people like the Scarlet Sun Demon Master who were willing to sacrifice themselves in order to preserve their bloodline.","However, Jian Wushuang quickly understood.","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master probably knew that he would not be able to escape today and was destined to die. In that case, it would be better to exchange his death for some bargaining chips, so that his death would be more valuable.","After a moment of silence, Jian Wushuang looked at Scarlet Sun Demon Master and replied indifferently, “Yes.”","Upon hearing this, Scarlet Sun Demon Master heaved a sigh of relief and looked at Jian Wushuang with gratitude.","“Many thanks.”","Then, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master turned his head and looked at his descendants and clansmen in the Imperial City who had long been in grief. He rebuked, “Remember, after I die today, you must keep a low profile, behave yourselves, and leave the depths of the universe. Cultivate well, and don’t mention anything about revenge!”","“Do you all understand?”","...","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s voice was like a blow to the head, exploding in the minds of every descendant and clansman.","When these descendants heard this, they immediately understood that the Scarlet Sun Demon Master had already decided to die and was leaving behind his funeral arrangements. The burly man couldn’t help but say, “No...no!”","Scarlet Sun Demon Master didn’t care about them anymore. Instead, he looked at Jian Wushuang and laughed bitterly, “Jian Wushuang, remember your promise and let them go!","“I’ll taste the consequences of the seed I planted that day!”","“I, Scarlet Sun, will go!”","Bang!","He stretched out his hand and hit his forehead!"]},{"number":4432,"title":"Chapter 4432 The Decisive Battle","paragraphs":["4432 The Decisive Battle","Bang!","After the Scarlet Sun Demon Master slapped the space between his eyebrows, his whole body began to tremble violently. His powerful and surging aura immediately subsided, and a painful expression appeared on his face.","Scarlet Sun Demon Master was aging at a speed visible to the naked eye, and his vitality began to fade away quickly. In a short while, his face was covered with mottled wrinkles.","Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back and looked at Scarlet Sun Demon Master with a calm expression. He didn’t stop him.","!!","It had to be said that Scarlet Sun Demon Master was a rarely seen magnanimous and responsible person. If it were an ordinary expert, he would have entered the vast sea of stars before Jian Wushuang arrived. Where would Jian Wushuang go to find him?","As for his clansmen, descendants, cultivation partners, and disciples, so what if Jian Wushuang killed them all in a fit of anger?","As long as he, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master, was still around, everything could be turned around again.","But he did not choose to do so.","Instead, he would take responsibility for his own actions and sacrifice himself to protect the lineage of Scarlet Sun.","Jian Wushuang appreciated this.","However, it was only admiration.","The blood feud of the Divine Life Palace and the countless dead souls of the Divine Life Palace could not forgive this man!","They had died to protect Jian Wushuang. How could Jian Wushuang let go of the enemy who had killed them?","After a few breaths.","Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s life source was shattered, and his body gradually dissipated.","At the last moment, he stared at the crowd of people in the Scarlet sun Divine Palace who were already sobbing. He used all his strength to shout, “Remember what I just said! After I leave, I’ll immediately withdraw from the depths of the universe, behave myself, and concentrate on cultivation. There will be no more fighting! Not a single word about revenge!","“Remember!","“Otherwise, I won’t be able to die in peace!”","Weng!","As soon as he finished speaking, the Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s body turned into sand from head to toe. Then, he was blown away by the wind and disappeared into the void.","The Scarlet Sun Demon Master, another Almighty being with huge arms, had fallen!","In an instant, the world was twisted and the great Dao wailed.","In the Imperial Palace, countless people were crying.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He lowered his head and glanced at the people from the Scarlet Sun Palace.","In the next moment, countless invisible sword Qi shot out from Jian Wushuang’s body toward the people in the palace.","The sword Qi wouldn’t hurt them, but it would make it so that the descendants of Scarlet Sun Demon Master wouldn’t be able to break through to the supremacy stage for the rest of their lives. They would only be stuck at the Ultimate Ruler Realm.","As for the few remaining beginner and intermediate-level Supremes, he set up a restriction in their divine bodies. As long as Jian Wushuang thought about it, the sword Qi would explode in their bodies and kill them.","Scarlet Sun Demon Master’s clansmen obviously didn’t notice the sword Qi, but the few Supremes did. However, after they took a look at Jian Wushuang, they kept quiet out of fear and didn’t dare to make a sound. They only pretended to know nothing.","Bang!","“Let’s go.”","Jian Wushuang took a heavy step with his right foot and turned into a flowing light, disappearing from the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom.","With another flash, Jian Wushuang appeared in the vast starry sky. He released universe boat and sailed into the boundless sea of stars.","...","Scarlet Sun Demon Master had committed suicide in front of Jian Wushuang!","Seven days later, the universe shook again!","However, the races in the universe weren’t as shocked this time. After all, Jian Wushuang had killed Supreme Jade Cauldron before. In their opinion, the death of Scarlet Sun Demon Master was basically a sure thing.","However, the only thing that made people feel sad was that Scarlet Sun Demon Master, who was a mighty Lord of the universe, had been forced to commit suicide by Jian Wushuang.","However, the discussion about the death of the Scarlet Sun Demon Master did not last long. Everyone’s attention was instantly taken away by the Great Void Temple!","Just seven days after the news of the Scarlet Sun Demon Master spread, Supreme Bing Ye of the Great Void Temple made an announcement to the universe.","“Jian Wushuang, I will wait for you in the Great Void Temple. I will cut off your head!”","As soon as these words came out, everyone in the hall was shocked.","They did not expect that before Jian Wushuang went to the Great Void Temple, Supreme Bing Ye would take the initiative to jump out and say that he wanted to kill Jian Wushuang!","Immediately, countless people in the universe had a wonderful expression.","Everyone knew that there was going to be a good show to watch!","...","Divine Life Palace.","Blood Wave, Giant Axe, Big Dipper, and the Ninth Kalpa King, who came later to fill in the position, were the four lead Supremes.","Several ordinary Supreme-beings and the Overlord, who had been in the Divine Life Palace, were sitting on the ground below them.","“Tsk, tsk. Even a half-step unparalleled Supreme is no match for Jian Wushuang. This little guy is growing too fast.”","The Ruler Blood Wave laughed heartily.","His strength was on par with a half-step unparalleled Supreme, and the fact that Jian Wushuang had killed a half-step unparalleled Supreme meant that Jian Wushuang’s strength was already above his.","The others also looked at each other and smiled.","However, a moment later, he said in a deep voice, Jian Wushuang is strong, but Bing Ye is not easy to deal with.","“Supreme Bing Ye is also a half-step unrivaled expert. He shouldn’t be Jian Wushuang’s match, right?”","...","The Overlord asked with a frown.","Supreme Giant Axe didn’t reply. Instead, Blood Wave Supreme’s smile disappeared and he shook his head solemnly. “It’s not that simple. Bing Ye broke through to become a half-step unparalleled Ruler several thousand chaos cycles ago, and he entered the Dao through slaughter. He’s one of the most powerful half-step unparalleled Rulers in the universe, far more powerful than Jade Cauldron and Scarlet Sun.”","After a pause, the Blood Wave Supreme continued, “When Jian Wushuang met with an accident in the Tarot ruins, Giant Axe and I went to the Great Void Temple and fought with Bing Ye.","“It’s just that the Divine Life Palace and the Great Void Temple had not completely fallen out, so I did not use my full power. Bing Ye, on the other hand, showed even less power than I did. I had already sensed that if I were to fight Bing Ye to the death, I would definitely not be his match.”","After saying that, the Blood Wave Supreme said something that made everyone present gasp.","“Bing Ye has hidden himself very well...I’m afraid he’s not far from being an invincible Supreme...”","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone except for Supreme Giant Axe, who had a calm expression on his face and probably knew about this news, was shocked.","“Then isn’t the Alliance master in danger...”","The Overlord’s face was filled with worry.","“That’s right. Why don’t we let Jian Wushuang return first? We can discuss the matter of the crusade against the Great Void Temple.”","Ruler Heavenly Dipper said with a frown.","...","The Ruler Blood Wave looked at the two of them and shook his head with a smile. “Of course, we don’t have to worry too much. Even if Bing Ye is infinitely close to being an invincible Supreme, he is still not an invincible Supreme. There is a qualitative difference. Even if Jian Wushuang is not his match, it will be easy for him to leave.”","When everyone heard this, they heaved a sigh of relief.","However, the worry in his heart could not be completely erased."]},{"number":4433,"title":"Chapter 4433 The Focus of Thousands","paragraphs":["4433 The Focus of Thousands","Within the universe.","Jian Wushuang drove universe boat forward.","He sat cross-legged in the universe cabin with a frosty look in his eyes.","Supreme Bing Ye!","!!","This person was definitely one of the people that Jian Wushuang wanted to kill the most!","If the Blood Sky Hall Master, the great sun Emperor God, and Scarlet Sun Demon Master were accomplices, then Supreme Bing Ye was the culprit!","The White Tiger Supreme had been forced by Supreme Bing Ye to self-destruct.","The enmity between him and Supreme Bing Ye was absolutely irreconcilable!","Supreme Master Bing Ye had led troops to kill him countless times. For example, if it wasn’t for white-hair ancestor’s help, he would have died at that time!","Even earlier on the Ancient Path of Stars, Qiu Long was sent by Supreme Bing Ye to kill Jian Wushuang. If it wasn’t for this incident, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t have gradually become enemies with the dragon clan.","Of course, Jian Wushuang had no fear of this. However, his hatred for Supreme Bing Ye was already monstrous!","“Waiting to kill me in the Great Void Temple?”","Jian Wushuang sneered.","He had naturally heard of this declaration of war that Supreme Bing Ye had issued to the entire universe.","This caused his killing intent toward Supreme Bing Ye to rise to another level!","Even today, Supreme Bing Ye’s intention to kill him had not died!","“Very good. I’d like to see how you’re going to kill me!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and there was a flash of coldness.","...","Within the Great Void Temple.","Supreme Bing Ye sat on his throne with a sneer on his face. He was constantly stroking the blade of a dark blue divine sword in his hand.","This sword was called the God Killer.","Back then, he had tried to kill Jian Wushuang in the savage Lands of the universe, but the tyrants’ patriarch had appeared and saved Jian Wushuang. His sword, the ice ye divine sword, which had the same name as him, had been swallowed by the tyrants’ patriarch.","He had spent a fortune to buy this sword from an unrivaled Supreme martial artist. It was as powerful as the Bing Ye divine sword, and might even be stronger.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll use you as a sacrifice to my sword!”","Clang!","Supreme Bing Ye flipped his right hand and pointed the tip of his sword at the void outside the palace, emitting a chilling aura.","“Hmph! Don’t wait until I break through to become an invincible Ruler! Otherwise, the Divine Life Palace and the tyrants ‘patriarch will all die for me!”","He snorted coldly in his heart. He was also brooding over the fact that the tyrants’ patriarch had destroyed his divine sword and sent him flying with a single punch.","“Men, come.”","After a while, he put away the God-slaying sword and called out to the outside.","Da da da da.","A disciple of the Great Void Temple immediately walked in.","“Let me ask you. Where is Jian Wushuang now? Is there anything unusual?”","The disciple kneeled on the ground and replied, “Sir Emperor God, Jian Wushuang is rushing toward the Great Void Temple. There is nothing unusual.”","“Well, that’s good.”","Supreme Bing Ye nodded his head and sneered in a low voice.","“Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang, this is the first time I’ve seen someone so eager to die in the universe.”","...","Jian Wushuang steered universe boat and approached the Great Void Temple.","Along the way, he did not have any intention of concealing his aura. Therefore, wherever he went, a wave of exclamations would surge forth.","“Look, this, this aura is Jian Wushuang!”","“Jian Wushuang’s target is the Great Void Temple!”","“Tsk tsk, Supreme Bing is not a kind person. This battle is going to be interesting.”","“Jian Wushuang is indeed strong, but Supreme Bing Ye is also a tough nut to crack. Many half-step invincible Supremes have died at his hands. It’s hard to say whether Jian Wushuang can gnaw off this tough nut. It’s all up to Jian Wushuang’s own fortune.”","“If Jian Wushuang can kill him, let alone kill Supreme Bing Ye, then Jian Wushuang can be almost certain that he is the strongest person below the invincible Supreme!","“Let’s go, let’s go. This battle is unprecedented and rare. We must not miss it!”","“Hurry to the Great Void Temple. It’s going to be lively this time!”","“I heard that all the major forces have sent people to watch the battle. Once Jian Wushuang wins, they will make him their new king!”","Countless people were discussing fervently.","After that, they all flew in the direction of the Great Void Temple.","Among them, there were representatives sent by the major forces. They had already brought the mystic Light mirror with them, planning to record the details of the battle.","Even the Water Sorcerer Ruler and his two disciples, whom Jian Wushuang had once saved in the Tarot ruins, had come from the extremely distant desolate area of the universe to cheer for Jian Wushuang.","There was also Emperor Golden Crow, commander Mountain Shaker, Stardust Ruler, and many others who were related to Jian Wushuang.","...","Everyone was looking forward to this battle!","...","Three months later.","Jian Wushuang arrived at the star Domain where the Great Void Temple was located.","The great void Star field was already filled with people who came from all directions to watch the battle. Their flags fluttered like waves.","Jian Wushuang stopped universe boat and walked out of the cabin.","He heard a lot of noise and many familiar faces.","“Lord Blood Sword, good luck!” Ruler Hao Jin had an excited look on his face as he called out loudly from afar.","“Blood Sword, you will definitely win! Go!” Water Sorcerer Ruler and the other two were red-faced as they stood at the very edge of the crowd, waving flags and cheering.","“Your Excellency Sword doesn’t abandon, be careful!” The Stardust Ruler, who was now all alone, clenched his fists and shouted.","Jian Wushuang was slightly stunned. He glanced at the familiar faces and smiled faintly.","...","“Don’t worry!”","Jian Wushuang nodded at them, then turned to look at the center of the great void Star area, where the Great Void Temple was floating quietly. He took a deep breath.","Like a whale sucking in water, he sucked in all the wind energy within a thousand feet into his mouth.","The next moment.","He opened his mouth and spoke. His voice was like a thunderclap, rolling down and shaking all Nine Heavens and ten lands!","“Bing Ye, why don’t you come and die?”","BOOM!","As soon as he finished speaking, the starry sky within ten thousand miles was shaken to the point that the earth and mountains shook, as if a tsunami had been set off.","“Hmph, Jian Wushuang, you’re the one who should die today!”","Then, a cold voice came from the center of the Great Void Temple and destroyed the sound waves that Jian Wushuang had turned into.","Whoosh!","A white flowing light shot out and landed ten feet in front of Jian Wushuang.","The flowing light shattered, revealing the figure of Supreme Bing Ye.","Jian Wushuang, only one of us can walk out of this star area alive today.","Supreme Bing Ye stood with his hands clasped behind his back and a cold expression on his face.","“Just what I wanted.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered with killing intent. He held the Tarot Divine Sword in his right hand and pulled it out of the scabbard inch by inch.","A vast sword pressure instantly descended on the entire area.","“Then come.”","Supreme Bing Ye snorted coldly. With a flip of his right hand, a Scarlet and demonic god-slaying sword appeared in his hand.","There was no nonsense between the two.","The two extremely powerful auras seemed to have taken physical form as they collided and pressed against each other in the void, setting off terrifying void storms!","When the spectators saw this, their eyes narrowed.","They knew.","The curtains were about to open on this earth-shattering battle!"]},{"number":4434,"title":"Chapter 4434 A Competition!","paragraphs":["4434 A Competition!","Boom, boom, boom!","Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye stood 100 feet away from each other, and an extremely powerful aura pressed down on the void!","The void was constantly shattered, and storms were formed out of thin air. The powerful auras squeezed and collided with each other, directly changing the magnetic field of the universe and repelling the surrounding stars.","Jian Wushuang stepped into the void, his black hair fluttering in the wind, and his sword Qi spread out in all directions. It was as if a peerless sword God had walked out of the heaven Gate and descended to the mortal world.","!!","Supreme Bing Ye stood with his hands clasped behind his back. His silver hair fluttered slightly, causing the surrounding temperature to drop rapidly as a frosty sword Qi suppressed the surroundings.","Both of them were giant arms of sword principle. Before Jian Wushuang rose to power in the universe, Supreme Bing Ye was once known as the number one sword principle genius at that time!","“Alright...so strong!”","These two people’s comprehension of the sword Dao is different, but they are both powerful, each with their own merits!","“If these two fight, I’m afraid the entire universe will be overturned, the earth will shake, and the mountains will shake!”","“That’s too terrifying!!!”","“If the invincible Ruler doesn’t appear, who can keep these two in check?”","Many people who were watching the battle from afar gasped and exclaimed.","The next moment!","The battle erupted!","“Jian Wushuang used to run away like a dog in my hands. How dare he claim to be the hero now?”","Supreme Bing Ye sneered contemptuously and raised his sword to attack Jian Wushuang.","With every step he took, the place where his foot landed would be directly frozen into frost.","“Haha...you’ve only reached the level of a half-step invincible Ruler after cultivating thousands of primordial chaos incarnations. If I were you, I’d find a piece of tofu to smash myself to death with.”","Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a sneer as he slashed his sword toward Supreme Bing Ye!","“Hmph, Jian Wushuang, no matter how glib your tongue is, you will not be able to escape death today...”","Supreme Bing Ye’s face turned cold as he casually blocked Jian Wushuang’s sword. He then leaped up and engaged in close combat with Jian Wushuang again!","“The one who can’t escape death today is you, Bing Ye!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and his killing intent turned into killing intent. His entire body emitted a dazzling golden light as he continued to battle with Supreme Bing Ye!","Peng peng peng!","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","The two of them were extremely fast. In the blink of an eye, they had exchanged hundreds of moves. Countless sword Qi burst out, annihilating all the Starlight and causing chaos to boil!","A vast amount of Ruler divine power turned into thousands of icy sword Qi and gushed out from the God-slaying sword in Supreme Bing Ye’s hand, bombarding Jian Wushuang.","“Good!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fighting spirit. Not only was he not afraid, but he also laughed out loud. His supreme divine power, which had been integrated with the power of great Daos, also whizzed out with an overwhelming force and fought with Supreme Bing Ye!","Although there was a huge gap between their realms, Jian Wushuang was a perfect chaotic lifeform and his divine power was also 10000 times that of an ordinary elementary Supreme. Therefore, although there was still a gap between his total divine power and Supreme Bing Ye’s, he could still compete with him.","Clang clang clang!","The Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand kept clashing with the God-slaying sword in Supreme Bing Ye’s hand. They either stabbed straight at each other or collided with each other at a slant, creating a series of sparks!","Every time the two of them exchanged blows, it was as if thunder had exploded, and loud rumbles were constantly heard in the void.","Logically speaking, any ordinary true treasure, no matter how powerful and dense it was, would have been cut into thousands of pieces by the Tarot sword. No one knew where the God-slaying sword had come from, but it had actually managed to withstand the Tarot sword’s overbearing attacks.","“Jian Wushuang, is this all you’ve got?”","Supreme Bing Ye snorted coldly and slashed down with his sword, forcing Jian Wushuang to retreat a hundred miles.","The next moment!","“Tarot sword code, second form, daybreak!”","Jian Wushuang said in a low voice.","Ding! Ding!","A ray of golden light suddenly appeared and Jian Wushuang turned into a dawnbreak sword light that cut off everything. With a destructive power, he quickly attacked Supreme Bing Ye!","The golden light was the only thing left in the world.","The Daybreak swordsmanship was Jian Wushuang’s well-known unique skill, which could kill any expert who was not a half-step to unparalleled Supreme.","The majestic sword Qi tore through the void and pierced through the entire sky, leaving a long white wave.","Countless explosions followed.","However, Supreme Bing Ye’s expression didn’t change in the slightest as he faced this sword. He lifted his eyelids slightly and said,","“Divine power, mirror flower water Moon.”","Kacha!","He didn’t move at all, allowing the Daybreak sword ray to crush through his body.","Jian Wushuang’s figure condensed on his back.","Bang!","A muffled sound was heard. Supreme Bing Ye, who had been pierced by the Daybreak sword light, suddenly appeared behind Jian Wushuang and stabbed him!","Jian Wushuang’s face was calm as if he had expected this. He raised his sword without looking back!","Clang!","...","Countless sparks flew as Supreme Master Bing Ye was forced back by the sword. He raised his eyebrows slightly and said in surprise,","“Your reaction is quite fast.”","Ka-cha-cha.","At this moment, the ‘Supreme Ice ye’ that was pierced by Jian Wushuang’s dawnbreak sword light finally broke into pieces like ice!","What Jian Wushuang pierced through Supreme Bing Ye just now was a divine power clone!","“Supreme Bing Ye’s response is so fast. He’s already set up a trap and turned into a fake body before Jian Wushuang even attacked! If it was someone else who had been careless and thought that Supreme ye ice was dead, they would have fallen into his trap!”","“Jian Wushuang’s reaction is faster! Didn’t you notice? Jian Wushuang’s backhanded sword attack just now was executed before Supreme Bing Ye’s body condensed behind his back!”","“In other words, both of them are predicting! They can predict each other’s moves!”","“Hiss! It’s too terrifying!”","Countless people exclaimed in admiration.","In the void, Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye stood in a cold confrontation.","...","“Jian Wushuang, I’m afraid you’ve already comprehended the seventh level of the origin of sword principle, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Supreme Bing Ye narrowed his eyes and asked.","Jian Wushuang did not deny it.","“That’s right. During the ten thousand years he had fought Tarot Ruler in the trial space, Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of sword principle had improved and he had reached the peak of the seventh level!”","He looked at Supreme Bing Ye with an expressionless face. This person was definitely a formidable opponent. If his guess was correct, this person’s comprehension of the sword Dao origin was not inferior to his. He had probably also reached the seventh level!","In the early years, he had heard that when Supreme Master Bing Ye had just become a Supreme Master, he had tested the world’s swordsmanship and fought with many Almighty swordsmen to temper his own swordsmanship. Now, it seemed that the rumors were not false.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang understood that if it was just a battle of that level, the two of them would probably fight for another ten thousand years without any results.","“Then...”","Jian Wushuang slowly closed his eyes and said, “Tarot Sword Manual, third move, dusk!”","Hu!","A gust of wind suddenly rose between heaven and earth."]},{"number":4435,"title":"Chapter 4435 A Dangerous Situation","paragraphs":["4435 A Dangerous Situation","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were slightly closed and he looked solemn.","The Tarot Divine Sword in his hand began to dissipate like smoke and sand, starting from the tip.","A palpitating feeling suddenly magnified in everyone’s hearts!","“What a powerful pressure!”","!!","“The heavens are about to change!”","“Quickly retreat!”","In an instant, the audience, who had already retreated far away, retreated again to increase the distance!","“Oh?”","Supreme Bing Ye’s originally calm eyes narrowed for the first time, revealing a hint of surprise.","Hualala!","The ground under Jian Wushuang’s feet began to collapse rapidly with him as the center.","A pit was expanding at an extremely fast speed, like a black hole that swallowed everything silently. A huge gravitational force came from the center of the pit and vortex, constantly swallowing all kinds of energy in the starry sky and turning them into nothingness!","Even the sun that was hanging high in the sky and the brilliant Galaxy that stretched across the sky for millions of miles were guided by this gravitational force. They rolled over and fell into the huge pit.","Twilight sword, twilight of the Gods!","Pfft!","Supreme Bing Ye, who had been standing in the void and thinking, was suddenly pulled into the pit as if he had been pulled by a large hand!","Instantly, the hearts of all the spectators trembled!","In the face of this move, everyone knew that Supreme Jade Cauldron had lost the initiative when he had been dragged into the twilight pit. He had lost the power to fight and could only be worn down by the power of the Twilight pit. In the end, he had been killed by Jian Wushuang’s Four Seasons sword move!","Immediately, an expert from the Great Void Temple berated, “Jian Wushuang! Release our Sir divine Emperor!”","“Right! Otherwise, don’t blame us for swarming you!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang looked at them with contempt and sneered, “Just you guys?”","Whoosh!","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang stretched out his finger and pointed. Suddenly, a sharp sword Qi shot out from his fingertip and ruthlessly hit the loudest elementary Supreme expert!","Bang!","In an instant, the sword Qi pierced through the elementary Supreme-being expert’s forehead, and the sharp sword intent directly crushed every inch of divine power in his divine body!","“You...”","In an instant, before the elementary Supreme-being could finish his sentence, his divine body collapsed and his soul was destroyed!","In an instant!","At that moment, the other experts from the Great Void Temple narrowed their eyes. They only dared to point at Jian Wushuang with trembling hands and did not dare to say another word.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang turned his head and looked coldly at the extremely ugly-looking Supreme Bing Ye. He slowly stretched out his hand and grabbed at the void.","“Bury.”","BOOM!","In an instant, the dusk pit began to revolve, and an extremely terrifying and boundless energy crashed down on Supreme Ice.","Even someone as strong as Supreme Bing Ye felt his body sway and his cheeks flush red from the immense force of the collision.","The next moment.","Jian Wushuang, this move of yours might work on others, but it can’t trap me!","Supreme Bing Ye sat cross-legged and took a deep breath. Then, he coldly shouted,","“Divine power, ice-sealing heaven and earth!”","Kachaa!","As soon as he said this, the cold light on Supreme Bing Ye’s body intensified. A bone-piercing chill that was visible to the naked eye spread out, freezing the energy in the void!","The void was suddenly frozen!","In just a few short breaths, the dusk pit, which had sucked Supreme Bing Ye to the center and was continuously refining and compressing him, was actually frozen solid, like an egg shell.","Supreme Bing Ye stood up, the corners of his mouth curling into a cruel arc.","“Divine power, heavenly wings of ice!”","“Break!”","In an instant, Supreme Bing Ye took a step forward and shot out of the dusk pit, which was hundreds of thousands of feet deep, and soared into the sky.","Under his foot, the dusk pit that had been frozen into a Glacier instantly crumbled into pieces, forming an avalanche that scattered in all directions.","From this move alone, it wasn’t hard to see that Supreme Bing Ye was much more powerful than the...","“Divine power, mirror flower water Moon.”","Said Supreme Bing Ye.","Rip!","He waved the God-slaying sword in his hand, and in an instant, thousands of copies of him appeared!","“Jian Wushuang, die!”","In the next moment, these words came out of the mouths of the thousands of Supreme Bing Ye, forming a terrifying sound wave. It was as if a God had opened his mouth and was reprimanding them, deafening the deaf.","...","“Kill!”","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","Then, the thousands of Supreme Bing Ye stepped forward at the same time and raised their swords to attack from all directions!","All of a sudden, the terrifying sword Qi was like rolling waves, and the momentum it emitted was enough to suffocate people!","“Is that so?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. He didn’t dare to be careless at all and a touch of solemness surged in his heart.","He tried to spread out his divine power to sense which one of the thousands of Supreme Bing Ye was the real one. However, he couldn’t help but discover that every Supreme Bing Ye was exactly the same, be it the strength of their divine power or their aura and vitality.","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown.","In the distance, the spectators watched this scene with burning eyes. Some of the old powerhouses who were familiar with Supreme Bing Ye immediately said in a deep voice, “Supreme Bing Ye’s technique is different from those inferior cloning techniques. It might seem like a lot, but it’s actually devastating. Each of these clones contained the full power of Supreme Bing Ye’s attack! We can’t underestimate them!”","“Ah? Then wouldn’t these thousands of clones be the equivalent of Supreme Bing Ye’s thousands of all-out attacks being used at the same time?”","Immediately, someone exclaimed.","...","“Not bad.”","The eyes of the old expert who spoke earlier flickered as he nodded, ” that’s not the most troublesome thing. The most troublesome thing is that the real Supreme Bing Ye is still hiding among them. Once Jian Wushuang is tired of dealing with them and his divine power is exhausted or his mind is exhausted, he will give Jian Wushuang a real fatal blow at any time!","“It’s impossible to guard against! It can’t be avoided!”","As soon as he said this, the spectators looked at each other and said in disbelief, “Then...doesn’t that mean that Jian Wushuang is dead for sure?”","The old master nodded, then shook his head and said, “Nothing is absolute. If Jian Wushuang has a unique skill that can kill the thousands of doppelgangers at the same time, this skill will naturally be broken.”","As soon as these words fell, not only did everyone’s faces not show any joy, they instead sank.","These clones of Supreme Bing Ye weren’t like those low-level clone techniques, which were just for show. Instead, each clone contained all of Supreme Bing Ye’s divine power. If Jian Wushuang wanted to destroy these thousands of clones at the same time, it meant that Jian Wushuang had the power to withstand a thousand of Supreme Bing Ye’s attacks!","This, how could it be easy?","Instantly, those who were close to Jian Wushuang, such as Ruler Hao Jin, Nine Stars Saint Son, Water Sorcerer Ruler, and Stardust Ruler, clenched their fists tightly and felt their hearts in their throats.","At this moment, countless people were silent.","Jian Wushuang had fallen into a dangerous situation!"]},{"number":4436,"title":"Chapter 4436 The Reappearance of the Four Seasons!","paragraphs":["4436 The Reappearance of the Four Seasons!","“Whoosh!”","At that moment, thousands of Supreme Bing Ye’s shadows flew up and charged at Jian Wushuang!","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened and his eyes flashed with solemness. He didn’t dare to be careless and directly activated the strongest state of chaotic domineering body!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s purple-gold eyes shone brightly and the ‘river’ between his eyebrows became more obvious. On his divine body, there were ancient divine patterns that criss-crossed!","!!","“Break!”","Jian Wushuang let out a loud roar and raised his fist to punch at one of the Supreme Bing Ye’s phantoms. A vast and vigorous power fell like a waterfall and hit the phantom ruthlessly!","Bang!","Suddenly, the world shook!","The phantom shattered into pieces, while Jian Wushuang’s body trembled and his face turned pale.","Before he could take a break, the second shadow had already arrived!","Weng!","Jian Wushuang could only dodge sideways.","After half an incense’s time.","Jian Wushuang gasped for breath. There were a few more wounds on his body. He looked at the illusionary figure of Supreme Bing Ye, which was still covering the sky, and a thoughtful look flashed in his eyes.","“I can’t let this continue!”","Although each of these illusory figures wasn’t strong and only contained the power of a single strike from Supreme Bing Ye, there were simply too many of them.","If they continued to fight like this, he was afraid that he would be dragged to death here!","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang no longer hesitated and shouted, “The fourth form of the Tarot Sword Manual, Four Seasons!”","Whoosh!","As soon as he finished speaking, the area within a radius of 10000 feet around Jian Wushuang turned into the middle of winter!","Countless snowflakes fell from the sky and shot towards the illusory figure of Supreme Bing Ye!","Jian Wushuang shouted again, “Innate divine ability, life intimidation!”","“Innate divine power, original universe!”","BOOM!","In an instant, two extremely strong suppressive forces descended on the world again!","The world was completely under Jian Wushuang’s control!","The power of the Four Seasons sword Qi’s icy Blizzard, enhanced by the original universe and the intimidation of life, instantly increased dramatically. A gale whistled and landed on every projection of Supreme Ice with a chilling killing intent!","Ka-cha-cha.","At once, the thousands of Bing Ye phantoms froze and their movements toward Jian Wushuang slowed down.","“What is this?”","Supreme Bing Ye, who was hidden among the thousands of people, had a slight change in his expression. He could also feel the extremely strong power of ice. Under this power of ice, even his movements had become somewhat sluggish.","“It’s rumored that Supreme Tarot left behind five universe-suppressing techniques. This move should be one of Supreme Tarot’s five techniques, the Four Seasons sword Qi.”","Supreme Bing Ye thought quickly. His contempt for Jian Wushuang gradually disappeared and was replaced by solemness.","“Four Seasons, turn!”","Jian Wushuang quickly formed a seal with both hands and shouted again.","Instantly, the biting cold wind and snow disappeared, and a spring thunder exploded out of nowhere!","Chi chi chi!","Then, countless drizzles fell from the sky!","This drizzle covered the entire Great Void Star system!","A Great Void Divine Hall cultivator’s eyes were filled with doubt as he reached out to catch a raindrop.","“Pfft!”","In an instant, the raindrop pierced through his entire palm!","“Not good! This was sword Qi! Quickly retreat!”","The man immediately shouted in surprise.","As for the apparition of Supreme Master Bing Ye, which had been slightly frozen by the Midwinter sword Qi, it was instantly sliced apart by the overwhelming raindrops. With a loud explosion, it shattered into pieces!","For a moment, the dense raindrops fell, as if a lute was played in the universe. The small strings were like whispers, the rustle was like a mess, and the big and small beads fell on the jade plate.","“How was this the spring rain? This was clearly a calamity!”","In just a few breaths.","The thousands of apparitions of Supreme Bing Ye crumbled under the dense raindrops, leaving only the real Supreme Bing Ye, who was constantly flying in the void, dodging the sword Qi raindrops and defending with his sword.","Clang, clang, clang, clang.","When the dense raindrops hit Supreme Bing Ye’s God-slaying sword, the crisp sound of nails hitting a steel plate was heard.","Beads of sweat began to form on Supreme Master Bing Ye’s forehead as he flapped his ice-crystal wings continuously. With a single flap, he was able to cover a distance of a thousand miles!","Although he was in a difficult position, he did not pose much of a threat to him.","“Bing Ye, it seems that your strength is only so-so.”","...","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold. He closed his fingers and sneered, “Four Seasons, turn again!”","Boom~!","Suddenly, as Jian Wushuang’s voice fell, the spring rain disappeared and a blazing sun rose up in the starry sky.","Waves of heat engulfed the sky and the earth, baking the earth. The extremely high temperature was enough to bake a Supreme-being into a dried corpse!","Supreme Bing Ye, who had initially felt slightly relieved, tensed up once more as he stared at the fiery sun.","In the center of the huge Sun, Jian Wushuang stood in the void. His black hair fluttered in the wind as he looked down at the human world.","“Godly swordsmanship!!!”","“Hiss! If I didn’t see it in person today, I wouldn’t even dare to imagine that this spell was actually formed from sword Qi!”","“Ruler Jade Cauldron died from this move. I wonder if Ruler Bing Ye can survive it!”","Jian Wushuang’s strength is too terrifying!","The crowd watching the battle from afar exclaimed in shock.","...","Although they were far away from Jian Wushuang, the powerful surging energy was like the brightest star in the universe, dazzling them and subduing them!","“Die!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glinted as he waved his hand at Supreme Bing Ye.","In an instant!","The fiery-red sun behind Jian Wushuang rumbled and rolled toward Supreme Bing Ye!","This move was currently Jian Wushuang’s most powerful attack!","Jian Wushuang!","Supreme Bing Ye looked at the fiery sun that was surging towards him like it was the end of the world and was instantly enraged to the extreme.","Divine power, protection of Ice Wings!!!","Supreme Bing Ye roared.","In the next moment, the pair of wings formed by countless ice crystals stuck in his back expanded once again. Finally, they became like a pair of arms and enveloped Supreme Bing Ye’s divine body, forming an eggshell-like ice shield!","Bang!","The fiery sun crashed into the light barrier formed by Supreme Bing Ye’s wings, instantly producing an indescribable loud boom!","This roar was like the wrath of the God of Thunder and the opening of the heavens. It shook the world and shook the deaf!","All the sounds were drowned out by this huge roar!","Countless people who were watching the battle from afar covered their ears with painful expressions.","There were even those with lower cultivation levels who were directly killed by this roar!","Waves of shock waves swept across and crushed the countless halls in the Great Void Divine Hall into dust!","The rumbling sound lasted for three breaths before it gradually weakened and disappeared.","A huge mushroom cloud rose from the place where Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye were fighting and covered the entire area."]},{"number":4437,"title":"Chapter 4437 I Am the Frost Monarch, I Am the Tarot!","paragraphs":["4437 I Am the Frost Monarch, I Am the Tarot!","Had Supreme Bing Ye fallen?","At this moment, countless spectators who had recovered from their shock stared at the area covered by the huge mushroom cloud.","Their line of sight was blocked by the mushroom cloud. Even if they used their divine power, they wouldn’t be able to see through the thick haze. It was completely silent inside, and not a single voice of Supreme Bing Ye could be heard.","“Lord Blood Sword has definitely won!”","!!","“The Alliance master is invincible!!”","“Your Excellency is too strong!!”","Ruler Vast Ember and the others couldn’t help but be overjoyed when they saw this, and they waved their fists.","The other experts watching the battle held their breaths and did not even dare to blink.","“Supreme Master Bing Ye...did he die or not?”","...","In the void above the nine Heavens.","Jian Wushuang looked down at the place where Supreme Bing Ye had been. He did not look happy as everyone had expected. Instead, he frowned.","He couldn’t sense the aura of Supreme Bing Ye within the mushroom cloud. Normally, when a person’s aura disappeared, it meant that he had died.","However, for some reason, Jian Wushuang did not feel relaxed at all. On the contrary, he felt a great horror of life and death!","It was as if he was being stared at by an ancient wild giant beast, and all the hair on his body stood up.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","At that moment, the muffled sound of a heartbeat came from the mushroom cloud.","It was as if someone had struck the war drums of the ancient heavenly court.","Thump!","“Thump! Thump!”","“Thump! Thump! Thump!”","The sound was getting louder and louder!","And finally-!","“Roar!”","The thick mushroom cloud that covered an area of 10000 miles was torn apart!","Supreme Bing Ye strode out!","His robe was torn, his hair was disheveled, and divine blood flowed down from his eyes.","Even the wide wings on his back, which were made of ice crystals, were blown to pieces.","However, his entire person was filled with an extremely dangerous and violent aura!","His bloodied face was covered in frost, as if he was wearing a mask, and half of his face was frozen.","Jian Wushuang, you have forced me to this point. I have to say that I have underestimated you.","Supreme Bing Ye’s voice was hoarse and inhuman. It was as if there were two iron plates rubbing against each other in his throat.","“It’s a pity that you can kill Jade Cauldron with this move, but you can’t kill me.”","Jian Wushuang didn’t reply. The Tarot Divine Sword silently condensed in his hand, and he was extremely vigilant.","In the distance.","The smiles on the faces of Ruler Vast Ember and the others, who had already begun to cheer, gradually froze.","“He didn’t die?”","“Supreme Bing Ye is indeed worthy of being a Supreme expert among the half-step unparalleled Supremes. How could he die so easily?”","“Jian Wushuang, we are in trouble.”","The others sighed.","...","“Alright, Jian Wushuang. The game ends here.”","Supreme Bing Ye raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang with a strange smile.","The next moment!","“Divine power, I am the Frost Monarch!”","“BOOM!”","Suddenly, Supreme Bing Ye’s aura rose sharply and his entire body rapidly expanded as if he was being inflated.","One Zhang ... Ten Zhang ... A thousand feet ... A thousand feet ...","... One million Zhang *!","In just a few breaths, Bing Ye’s divine body rose from the ground and turned into a 100000-foot ice giant!","His entire aura changed, as if the heavens and earth were crowning him. An emperor’s crown appeared on his head.","His skin was covered with thick ice crystals, as if he was wearing a heavy armor!","In his hand, an extremely wide ice sword formed from ice crystals condensed in his hand!","He held the ice sword as if he was holding an Ice Mountain in his hand.","...","Jian Wushuang was as small as an ant under his feet.","In an instant, countless people turned pale with shock.","what kind of divine power is this?!!","I can feel that the current Supreme Master Bing Ye is at least 10 times stronger than before!","no wonder the previous emperor God Taixu was willing to hand over his position to Supreme Bing Ye and leave with peace of mind. It was because Supreme Bing Ye had hidden such a trump card!!","“Previously, I said that Supreme Bing Ye was too conceited when he announced to the universe that he would kill Jian Wushuang here. Now, it seems that he is not conceited at all. He clearly has absolute confidence!”","As for Ruler Vast Ember and the others, their hearts were tightly clenched.","Why ... How did this happen?","BOOM!","In an instant, Supreme Bing Ye moved!","He stomped on heaven and earth, crossing tens of thousands of feet in one step, and stomped on Jian Wushuang!","...","Jian Wushuang, my divine power is far beyond your imagination!","Supreme Bing Ye laughed in a low and sinister manner, revealing a hint of madness!","Under this kick, the entire world seemed to be under heavy pressure and collapsed inch by inch!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and said in a deep voice, ”","“Daybreak! Slash!”","Buzzzzzz!","Once again, Jian Wushuang transformed into a daybreak sword light and flew forward on his sword, ruthlessly stabbing into Supreme Bing Ye’s calf!","This sword could kill a God!","Ding ~!","Countless ice crystals flew in all directions. However, they were unable to even pierce through the layer of ice covering Supreme Bing Ye’s skin.","“Sundering stars!”","Jian Wushuang did not let it go. A blue sword light that was close to 10000 feet condensed in his hand and he slashed down again.","However ...","No, it was still useless!","It was all useless!","“An ant trying to shake a tree, laughable.”","Supreme Bing Ye shook his head and laughed in disdain. He casually swept his giant foot and sent Jian Wushuang, who was using all kinds of supernormal abilities, flying.","Pfft!","Jian Wushuang’s body flew backward and he spat out a mouthful of divine blood.","“Again!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with battle intent and his body glowed with golden light. Once again, he controlled his sword and charged towards Supreme Bing Ye!","The fourth form of the Tarot Sword Manual, Four Seasons!","In the void, the sword Qi that filled the sky turned into spring rain and descended upon the world!","However, the Four Seasons sword Qi, which had previously been invincible and unstoppable, was only able to cut off the ice crystals on Supreme Bing Ye’s body. It was unable to cause any damage to him!","“Foolish struggle.”","Supreme Bing Ye smiled faintly and slashed down with his ice sword!","In an instant, the entire world was filled with this sword!","The vast Qi activity caused the universe to boil, as if it was going to reopen the chaos and create a new world!","The Four Seasons sword Qi was crushed to pieces!","BOOM!","Then, the sword fell on Jian Wushuang and sent him flying!","Under the sword, even though Jian Wushuang had chaotic domineering body, he was destroyed.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re not the only genius in the world, and you’re not the only person with extraordinary super power.”","The corners of Supreme Bing Ye’s mouth curled into a mocking smile.","“You won’t be able to catch up to my divine arts even if you cultivate for tens of thousands of years. Do you understand?”","After a few breaths.","Jian Wushuang’s divine body reassembled.","He took a deep breath and stood up from the ground. He looked at Supreme Bing Ye, who seemed to have victory in his hands, and his expression suddenly calmed down.","“Bing Ye, you really won?”","Upon hearing this, Supreme Bing Ye raised his eyebrows and looked at Jian Wushuang with interest. He said, “Oh? Jian Wushuang, if you have any other tricks up your sleeve, just use them. I’ll take them all on.”","“Alright,” he said.","What answered him was Jian Wushuang’s calm voice.","The next moment.","Jian Wushuang opened his arms and closed his eyes, as if he was embracing heaven and earth.","His black hair gradually floated up.","A calm and slow voice came out of his mouth, one word at a time.","“Tarot Sword Manual, fifth move, Tarot.”"]},{"number":4438,"title":"Chapter 4438 Tarot Descends!","paragraphs":["4438 Tarot Descends!","“Jian Wushuang... is he going to be defeated?”","Ruler Hao Jin and the others looked up at Jian Wushuang, who was trembling in the void and continuously being sent flying by Supreme Bing Ye, and their hearts turned cold.","The others were also silent, their expressions complicated.","After a long time, they sighed and said, “Jian Wushuang is indeed powerful, and each of his divine techniques can be called a unique skill of the universe. However, it’s a pity that he has cultivated for too short a time. His cultivation foundation is far inferior to Supreme Bing Ye’s.”","!!","“I’m sure that if Jian Wushuang were to cultivate for another ten million years, perhaps Jian Wushuang can easily defeat Supreme Bing Ye.”","Jian Wushuang did not have much time left.","Countless people looked at each other, their hearts silent.","Jian Wushuang’s defeat was a foregone conclusion.","The disciples of the great void divine Hall looked at the 100,000-feet-tall Supreme Bing Ye and were all excited. They waved their fists and shouted, “Master Bing Ye is unbeatable!”","“Jian Wushuang is just an ant! How would he dare to compete with Master Bing Ye?”","“He’s just a weakling! Is he trying to show-off?”","In the starry sky of the great void, Supreme Bing Ye’s expression was cold, as if he was a God who controlled life and death. He was about to sentence Jian Wushuang to death.","At this moment, even the races in the universe who were watching the battle through the Xuanguang Mirror shook their heads and stood up, ready to recall the emissaries who had sent gifts to the Divine Life Palace.","Jian Wushuang was dead for sure.","This scene played out in every corner of the universe at the same time.","Until...","“Tarot Sword Manual, fifth move, Tarot!”","As soon as Jian Wushuang finished speaking, the entire universe and starry sky rumbled!","It was not just the space where Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye had fought, but the entire universe!","Whoosh.","The sky began to tear and the wind suddenly blew in all directions. With Jian Wushuang as the center, an aura spread out for thousands of feet.","There were countless people watching the battle in the distance. All the cultivators who had entered the path of swordsmanship, whether they had their swords hanging on their waists or lying quietly in their Interspatial Rings, were shocked.","At this moment, they all let out a loud and clear sound!","Countless sword Qi shot up to the Nine Heavens!","It was as if he was welcoming the ancient Sword God who was about to descend to the world!","Stepping into the void, Jian Wushuang’s aura changed little by little.","His aura had become unfamiliar, sharp, and domineering!","“This...”","Supreme Bing Ye raised his huge ice crystal sword and was just about to slash down when he stopped and frowned.","Jian Wushuang’s appearance had not changed. Jian Wushuang was standing in front of him, but he was still in the elementary Supreme realm.","However, for some reason, Jian Wushuang’s body suddenly emitted an aura that made him feel frightened!","“He’s not Jian Wushuang!” An outrageous thought rose in Supreme Bing Ye’s mind as he shouted, “Stop him!”","Although he did not know what had happened to Jian Wushuang, he could vaguely feel that Jian Wushuang was in extreme danger!","“Go to hell!” Supreme Bing Ye sneered and the huge ice crystal sword in his hand slashed toward Jian Wushuang like a collapsing mountain!","Swish!!","The speed of this sword was extremely fast!","Jian Wushuang was smiling like an idiot. He closed his eyes tightly and waited for the sword to land.","Seeing this, the disciples of the Great Void Temple burst into laughter.","“Hahaha, I thought Jian Wushuang had some big move up his sleeve. It turns out that he’s just waiting for death.”","“How pretentious!”","Even Supreme Bing Ye, who had been slightly nervous, relaxed.","Just as the sword was about to land on Jian Wushuang’s head...","Boom!","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes!","Two earth-shaking divine lights burst out from his eyes!","Countless immortal radiance swirled up as if it was welcoming the arrival of the sovereigns of heaven and earth. Countless starlight surged from all directions and enveloped Jian Wushuang’s divine body in a brilliant starlight. He was full of divinity.","In the distance, the countless divine swords shrieked and trembled madly. Even the sword owners lost their sense of connection with their swords, and were unable to recall them.","“What is this?!”","Under the shocked and dazed eyes of countless people, Jian Wushuang slowly opened his mouth. A low, hoarse, but extremely sharp voice came out of Jian Wushuang’s mouth.","“I am Tarot!”","Thump!","The Heavenly Divine Gate suddenly opened and a golden light beam fell from the sky. On Jian Wushuang’s back, it formed an illusionary image that wore a green robe, walking on a sword, holding a gourd, and drinking the entire world!","The huge ice crystal sword that was slashing down was shattered instantly!","“What? How did this happen?”","...","Supreme Bing Ye’s expression was dazed.","He was very familiar with this figure!","Who else could it be but Supreme Tarot?","300 chaos cycles ago, Supreme Tarot had swept through the entire universe as a Supreme cultivator. He had been undefeated in 10,000 battles and had suppressed the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","He was simply invincible!","Supreme Bing Ye, had also been a Top Supreme realm cultivator in the past and had entered the Dao with the sword.","At that time, he was testing his Sword Dao. He used many mighty swordsmen as stepping stones to integrate his own sword principle.","At that time, Supreme Tarot was like the sun in the sky, so how could he let him go?","He had challenged Tarot to a battle at the peak of the universe, but he had been utterly defeated in that battle.","All it took was a single sword strike!","Supreme Bing Ye had been defeated!","...","From then on, Supreme Tarot had become a nightmare for Supreme Bing Ye.","The reason why he had such a strong killing intent towards Jian Wushuang was because of this.","“How is that possible? What’s going on?”","Supreme Bing Ye stared at Jian Wushuang and growled continuously.","The aura coming from Jian Wushuang almost suffocated him and made him tremble. He could not compare to Jian Wushuang at all!","In the distance, more people were frozen as if they had been struck by lightning. Their minds were filled with thoughts and stormy waves!","“Supreme Tarot! It’s the aura of Supreme Tarot!”","“Not bad! I was fortunate enough to have met Supreme Tarot once before he died, and I’m absolutely certain that this is his aura!”","A veteran powerhouse took a deep breath and said in a serious tone.","There was also an old friend of Supreme Tarot, who said with tears streaming down his face, “Fellow Daoist Tarot, we parted ways 300 chaos cycles ago, separating life from death. I thought that we would never meet again in this life. I didn’t think that we would meet again here.”","Countless people sighed.","However, even more people were puzzled. What was going on?","Only Jian Wushuang knew the answer.","Above the Nine Heavens.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless as he looked down at Supreme Bing Ye and said coldly, “Who’s the ant now?”","A powerful aura and pressure descended upon Supreme Bing Ye, causing him to gradually kneel and prostrate himself on the ground.","“No! Supreme Tarot is already dead! You can’t be Supremacy Tarot! I don’t believe it!”","Supreme Bing Ye clenched his fists tightly and gritted his teeth.","The next moment!","“Jian Wushuang! Even if you are Supreme Tarot, I will still kill you today, let alone the fact that you are not Tarot!”","Roar!","There was a crazed look in Supreme Bing Ye’s eyes as he stood up from the pressure of the sword.","Then, he smacked the void with his right hand and jumped up to kill Jian Wushuang!","“Divine Technique, Destruction!!!”"]},{"number":4439,"title":"Chapter 4439 Crushing With a Single Sword","paragraphs":["4439 Crushing With a Single Sword","Roar!","At this moment, Supreme Bing Ye’s entire body was burning with divine power, and his entire being was filled with an extremely dangerous aura.","With every step he took, a pit was created in the void, and an earth-shaking explosion was heard.","“Come on! Jian Wushuang! If I’m going to die, you’ll die too!”","!!","Supreme Bing Ye laughed madly, his eyes filled with a crazed look.","He hated Supreme Tarot. Back then, they had the same cultivation base, but Supreme Tarot was much stronger than him and had reached the peak of the universe!","He hated Jian Wushuang, who was such a rare talent. Jian Wushuang’s cultivation was much lower than his, but he could still fight with him and force him to fight to the death!","The heavens were so unfair!","First, there was Supreme Tarot, and now, Jian Wushuang had appeared!","When had the heavens ever dote on him?","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Supreme Bing Ye closed in madly, his aura expanding like a bomb that was about to explode. It was extremely dangerous!","“Not good! Let’s quickly retreat!”","“Supreme Bing Ye is going all out!”","“Supreme Bing Ye is already prepared to die in this attack! He wants to drag Jian Wushuang down with him!”","“He’s crazy! Supreme Master Bing Ye has gone completely crazy!”","At this moment, countless people who were watching the battle from afar were so angry that their eyes were about to pop out of their sockets. They were shocked and angry to the extreme, and they hurriedly used their divine techniques to escape.","One had to know that Supreme Bing Ye’s destructive divine techniques was the most powerful forbidden technique of the Great Void Temple. Not only did it destroy the enemy, it also destroyed the user!","The power that erupted in that instant was enough to drag all of them who were watching the battle into destruction!","“Hahahaha, you want to escape? Anyone who comes here today must die!”","Upon seeing this, Supreme Bing Ye let out a maniacal laugh and quickly formed hand seals. He immediately executed the Sky-Sealing Divine Technique and sealed the surrounding 100,000 miles of space!","The spectators who were retreating suddenly stopped as if they had hit an invisible wall!","All the mighty beings of the myriad races across the universe who were watching the battle through the Xuanguang Mirror turned pale.","Divine Life Palace, Supreme Divine Palace.","Supreme Blood Wave Supreme, Supreme Jun Fu, and the others raised their heads and stared at the Xuanguang Mirror. They were so solemn that one could hear a pin drop.","Just as Supreme Bing Ye unleashed his destructive divine technique...","“Bastard!”","Supreme Blood Wave stood up abruptly, a sharp glint in his eyes!","“In order to kill Jian Wushuang, Supreme Bing Ye has lost his mind and disregarded the consequences. He really deserves to be killed!!”","Although the other Supreme martial artists did not say anything, their faces were extremely dark.","Similar scenes were happening all across the universe.","...","In the starry sky above the Great Void Temple, there were cries of fear and begging for mercy.","“No! Let us go!”","“Supreme Bing Ye, your target is Jian Wushuang. It has nothing to do with us!”","“Right! You can just target Jian Wushuang!”","Someone tried to rouse Supreme Bing Ye’s rationality.","“Bing Ye, if you do this, you will drag the entire Great Void Temple into a land of eternal damnation!”","“Stop!”","There were also people who tried to threaten Supreme Bing Ye.","However, when Supreme Bing Ye saw this, he laughed even more madly.","“Hahaha, are you guys afraid? If you don’t want to be buried with me, it’s easy. Kill Jian Wushuang with me!”","Everyone’s hearts trembled at his words.","Immediately, a few of them looked at Jian Wushuang and their eyes revealed their struggle.","Jian Wushuang, who was at the center of the destruction, had an indifferent expression on his face the entire time. He was expressionless.","Jian Wushuang’s black hair fluttered in the wind as he faced the incoming Supreme Bing Ye. Starlight surrounded his body as he calmly spat out a word.","“Slash!”","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang slowly raised his hand and the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand was raised.","Behind him, the huge shadow of Supreme Tarot followed him like a shadow. He also raised his hand and made a sword-slashing motion.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang and Supreme Tarot merged.","Buzz!","Suddenly!","A scarlet sword light shot out from the Tarot Divine Sword!","Rumble!","...","Thunder rumbled.","No words could be used to describe this poignant and beautiful sword.","It was as if the universe had been split into two, and the sky was torn apart like a scroll!","The boundless night sky was torn open, turning into a long hole in the broken void.","It was like a hidden dragon rising to the sky, or like a heavenly river flowing backward.","This sword covered the sun and the moon, suppressing the sky!","This sword was enough to make all the races bow down to him and suppress all those who were not convinced!","After the sword was slashed out, Supreme Bing Ye’s maniacal laughter, the begging and threatening voices of the spectators all came to an abrupt stop.","Everyone held their breath as they stared at the dazzling sword that filled the entire starry sky.","This sword’s brilliant might could not be seen by the naked eye.","Swish!","...","In the next moment, the sword cut through Supreme Bing Ye’s divine body as if it was tofu.","Supreme Bing Ye continued to stomp on the ground as he charged forward.","However, there was a huge hole as thick as a tree trunk on his chest.","No divine blood spilled out, no divine power scattered, and no ice crystals flew out.","This sword strike had destroyed everything Supreme Bing Ye had possessed!","Plop.","Supreme Bing Ye’s huge body knelt on the ground. He lowered his head and stared blankly at the gradually expanding hole in his chest. His crazed expression slowly froze and was replaced by disbelief.","“I... I’ve been defeated?”","Whoosh.","His godly body shrank quickly and returned to its normal state. The ice crystals on his skin disappeared like sand.","He could sense that his vast life force and divine power were rapidly dissipating.","The world in front of him turned black quickly. He saw that Jian Wushuang had become extremely weak after he had unleashed his sword strike. The phantom image of Supreme Tarot behind him had started to collapse inch by inch.","If he attacked now, he would definitely be able to kill Jian Wushuang.","However, he had no chance.","Just when he thought he was about to die.","In this world, a sigh suddenly sounded.","“Bing Ye, you have disappointed me.”","In the next moment, a middle-aged man wearing a crown, a black-gold nine-clawed dragon robe, and a purple-gold crown walked out of the void. He was bathed In lightning.","Great Void Divine Emperor!","The true person behind the scenes of the Great Void Temple was also the mighty figure that founded the Great Void Temple. It was the Invincible Supreme realm cultivator, the Great Void Divine Emperor!","In an instant, the spectators who had heaved a sigh of relief after the crisis was averted cried out in surprise!","“Jian Wushuang, let’s drop this matter.”","Great Void Divine Emperor’s eyes flashed with lightning and he looked indifferently at Jian Wushuang, who was using the Tarot Divine Sword to support his body and was on the verge of collapsing after his divine power was drained.","His words were very calm, but they were filled with an unquestionable might!","“Cough... cough, cough!”","As Jian Wushuang coughed violently, he raised his head and looked at the real monster of the universe, the Great Void Divine Emperor, who stood at the peak of the universe."]},{"number":4440,"title":"Chapter 4440 Great Void Divine Emperor","paragraphs":["4440 Great Void Divine Emperor","Great Void Divine Emperor!","He was the founder of the Great Void Temple, a powerful being who had truly expanded his territory and suppressed an area of the universe!","In the entire universe, the number of people who could stand shoulder to shoulder with him could be counted on two hands. If they were not the patriarchs of a race, then they were the leaders of the Immortal Holy Lands.","After his appearance, the entire universe suddenly fell into a dead silence.","!!","Everyone looked at Great Void Divine Emperor and lowered their heads, not even daring to breathe.","“Jian Wushuang, I don’t care about the grudges between the two of you. From now on, let’s forget about all the past. How about it?” Great Void Divine Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang indifferently and said.","After he finished speaking, he waved his sleeve.","Supreme Bing Ye, who had been gradually dying, was actually recovering at an extremely fast pace.","Supreme Bing Ye first looked at Jian Wushuang with hatred and then looked at Great Void Divine Emperor with fear in his eyes.","“Lord Emperor...”","He was in a daze and was about to open his mouth to speak.","The moment he said that, Great Void Divine Emperor glared at him coldly and chided, “Don’t you think that you’ve embarrassed yourself enough? Go back and follow me to Offworld Battlefield.”","When Supreme Bing Ye saw Great Void Divine Emperor, he was like a mouse that saw a cat. His body trembled when he heard what Jian Wushuang said and he looked at Jian Wushuang with hatred. Then, he quickly took a step forward and turned into a flowing light that shot into the Great Void Temple.","Jian Wushuang struggled to stand up in the starry sky. When he saw this scene, his face turned extremely ugly.","It was not easy for him to finally gain an advantage over Supreme Bing Ye, but he did not expect Great Void Divine Emperor to appear and save Supreme Bing Ye.","If he could not kill Bing Ye today, it would be extremely difficult to kill him in the future.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and said, “Lord Divine Emperor, Bing Ye has tried to kill me time and time again. He was the main force that had twice trampled on the Divine Life Palace in the past. Countless disciples of the Divine Life Palace have died at the hands of your Great Void Temple. Isn’t it a little too easy for you to ask me to just let go of the past?”","“Oh?”","Great Void Divine Emperor raised his eyebrows as if he was surprised that Jian Wushuang dared to disobey his orders. His voice turned cold and he replied, “Jian Wushuang, do you think I’m discussing this with you?”","Bang!","As he finished his sentence, an aura that was as vast as the mountains and seas exploded from Great Void Divine Emperor’s body!","In an instant!","Jian Wushuang felt as if he had been hit by a giant hammer. He fell to the ground and his divine body almost shattered!","The aura came and left quickly. In a breath’s time, it was recalled by Great Void Divine Emperor.","He looked at Jian Wushuang, who was lying on the ground with a pale face, and said coldly, “Jian Wushuang, if it wasn’t for the sake of Senior Gai Fu, I would have killed you.”","Jian Wushuang lay on his stomach in the void. Even though Great Void Divine Emperor had already retracted his aura, there was still an invisible mountain pressing down on his back, causing him to be unable to stand.","“Is this the power of an Invincible Supreme?”","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists tightly and his eyes were filled with endless humiliation.","He had thought that after breaking through to the Supreme realm, even if he could not run amuck in the universe, he would at least have the power to protect himself.","However, it was only at this moment, when he was truly facing an Invincible Supreme, that he realized how insignificant he was.","In front of Great Void Divine Emperor, he was like Supreme Bing Ye in front of Overlord Patriarch. He had no power to resist at all.","The gap between a Half Invincible Supreme and an Invincible Supreme was simply too great.","Great Void Divine Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang and the corners of his lips curled up into a cold smile. He said, “Jian Wushuang, from the way I look at you, you seem to be unconvinced?”","Jian Wushuang did not reply.","In the face of absolute power, all words were useless.","Great Void Divine Emperor shook his head and said, “Jian Wushuang, if you are not convinced, you can come to Offworld Battlefield to find me after you recover. I will wait for you there.”","After he finished speaking, Great Void Divine Emperor wanted to leave.","However, just as he turned around, he seemed to have thought of something. He stopped and said, “Jian Wushuang, for the sake of Supreme Master Gai Fu, I’ll give you a kind reminder. You should keep a low profile. Your strength is not enough for you to act arrogantly in this universe!”","“The universe is much more vast than you can imagine. You think that you have extraordinary talent and can fight at a higher level, which is enough for you to be proud and arrogant. However, your vision is too narrow and limited by your cultivation base, so you can only see this world.”","“In this universe, you are nothing. Even I am just a drop in the ocean. You are not qualified to see the real experts and Heaven’s Favorites.”","As Great Void Divine Emperor said this, he squinted his eyes and the corners of his mouth curved upwards. His expression was difficult to understand. He lowered his voice so that only the two could hear. He said slowly, “Jian Wushuang, how do you think Supreme Tarot died? That Heaven’s Favorite who was invincible in the universe.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled.","Great Void Divine Emperor shook his head and said, “Alright, Jian Wushuang. Now that Supreme Master Gai Fu is asleep, there isn’t anybody in the Divine Life Palace that can support you. Don’t bring great trouble to the Divine Life Palace just because of your lowly life!”","After saying that, Great Void Divine Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang with disgust and playfulness. He did not say anything else and disappeared into the starry sky.","With Great Void Divine Emperor’s departure, this battle finally came to a close.","“We won!”","“Lord Xue Jian has won!!”","“Supreme Bing Ye is no match for Jian Wushuang!!!”","Ruler Hao Jin and the others who were close to Jian Wushuang immediately cheered excitedly.","The other powerhouses who came to watch the battle also had a look of awe.","They all rushed forward and surrounded Jian Wushuang in the middle, flattering him.","However, Jian Wushuang was not happy at all.","Was this a victory?","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly in his heart.","...","Great Void Divine Emperor’s last words were like a heavy bomb that exploded in his mind.","Was he really ignorant about the real universe?","At this moment, the universe that he thought he had figured out suddenly became blurry, as if it was covered by a mysterious veil.","And... how did the powerful Supreme Tarot die?","According to the remnant will of Supreme Tarot, it seemed to be related to a person named ‘Devouring Emperorer’.","Who was Devouring Emperor?","Countless thoughts flooded Jian Wushuang’s mind, but he could not figure it out. He could only shake his head and say, “Weak, weak, weak, weak!”","In the end, he was still too weak!"]},{"number":4441,"title":"Chapter 4441 The Shock","paragraphs":["4441 The Shock","“Lord Xue Jian? Do you have something on your mind?”","Ruler Hao Jin noticed that there was something wrong with Jian Wushuang. He raised his eyebrows and asked in confusion.","Jian Wushuang did not reply, but Hao Jin seemed to have guessed something. He laughed and said, “Lord Xue Jian, you’re able to defeat Bing Ye, who is a Half Invincible Supreme, even though you’re only a Primary Supreme! That itself shows how powerful you are! You don’t need to take the words of Great Void Divine Emperor to heart.”","Jian Wushuang smiled but did not reply.","!!","He just raised his head and looked at the boundless starry sky with his hands behind his back, his eyes revealing a thoughtful look.","The Offworld Battlefield...","He had caught the words ‘Offworld Battlefield’ from Great Void Divine Emperor’s mouth.","He was no stranger to these words.","When he had just broken through to the Supreme realm, Supreme Blood Wave had vaguely mentioned it to him.","The Offworld Battlefield was a battlefield located at the edge of the cosmos. It was personally suppressed by Lord Cosmos God!","Hence, Cosmos God’s Universe Dao impartation was exceptionally rare. That was because the Cosmos Gods were stationed in the Offworld Battlefield all year round and would rarely return to the depths of the universe.","Moreover, according to Blood Wave, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had gone to the Offworld Battlefield and had never returned.","In addition, most of the Invincible Supremes in the universe were gathered at the Offworld Battlefield.","“Offworld...”","Jian Wushuang kept thinking about what the ‘Offworld’ referred to.","A moment later, Jian Wushuang bid his farewell to Ruler Hao Jin and the others before leaving the Great Void Temple.","However, he didn’t choose to go to Cosmos Temple or the Dragon Tribe. Instead, he set up universe boat and headed toward the Divine Life Palace.","...","Three days later.","The news that Jian Wushuang had killed Supreme Bing Ye in the Great Void Temple spread throughout the universe!","In an instant, the universe trembled and boiled again!","The great beings of all races in the universe were in an uproar. Then, they could not sit still anymore. They all went to the Divine Life Palace, wanting to form a war alliance with it.","Then, the details of the battle between Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye were spread to the entire universe through the Xuanguang Mirror!","Countless people watched this battle with great interest, exclaiming and clapping in admiration.","Jian Wushuang’s talent and swordsmanship are both exceptionally rare!","Jian Wushuang will become the second Supreme Tarot!","“No! When Supreme Tarot was at Jian Wushuang’s realm, he was far from being as powerful as Jian Wushuang!”","“How do you think Jian Wushuang released his last move? Could it be that Supreme Tarot really didn’t die? Or is Jian Wushuang the reincarnation of Tarot?”","All of a sudden, all kinds of bizarre discussions were going on.","The universe was filled with discussions about Jian Wushuang.","Unknowingly, Jian Wushuang had already become a legendary figure that others looked up to.","Solar Star Field, the territory of the Golden Crow clan.","Nine fireballs formed a line and revolved around a huge sun.","This was the old nest of the Golden Crow clan!","The huge sun in the middle was the chamber of the Golden Crow Emperor.","“Jian Wushuang... He was actually able to kill a Half Invincible Supreme?”","Golden Crow Prince stood in the sun and looked into the distant starry sky with a dazed expression.","Once upon a time, the two of them had fought on the Ancient Path of Stars. He had been working hard to improve himself so that he could fight Jian Wushuang again one day.","While Jian Wushuang was attending the Great Clan Gathering, he was in seclusion.","When Jian Wushuang had dominated the Four Great Forces, he had been in seclusion.","Now, he had finally come out of seclusion.","In the clan, he had become the second person to reach the Supreme realm other than Golden Crow Emperor.","He had thought that he, who had broken through to the Supreme level, would have the power to fight Jian Wushuang.","In the end, just as he made the vow and was ready to go out to find Jian Wushuang, he heard the news that Jian Wushuang had killed Supreme Bing Ye!","What kind of person was Bing Ye?","He was a famous Half Invincible Supreme in the universe, the leader of a powerful force!","In terms of strength and reputation, he was no weaker than his father, the Golden Crow Emperor. In fact, Bing Ye was even stronger than his father!","In the end, such a mighty being was almost killed by Jian Wushuang? If Great Void Divine Emperor had not arrived in time, Bing Ye would have been killed!","“This guy, Jian Wushuang...” Golden Crow Prince muttered to himself. He felt that the more he understood Jian Wushuang, the more he felt that the gap between the two was too great. It was so great that he could not even look up to him.","Thud, thud.","At this moment, he heard footsteps behind him.","It was Golden Crow Emperor, who was walking out from the depths of the palace.","Golden Crow Emperor glanced at Golden Crow Prince and said, “Lin’er, quickly pack up and follow Father to the Divine Life Palace.”","“Huh?” Hearing this, Golden Crow Prince was stunned and asked, “Father, what are we going to the Divine Life Palace for?”","...","Golden Crow Emperor glared at him and replied, “Aren’t you going to clean up your mess in the past? Back then on the Ancient Path of Stars, you had a conflict with Jian Wushuang, and it was the divine thoughts that I placed in you that saved you.”","“Although it had happened a long time ago and there was not much hatred between you two, no one knows if Jian Wushuang is a person who would take revenge for the smallest grievance.”","“Now, Jian Wushuang could match with a Half Invincible Supreme with his sword. In terms of strength, even I am not his match. I can’t win him with martial arts alone, so I naturally have to apologize to him. If he holds a grudge, then we can forget about the grudge, but if he doesn’t, then we can also be considered to have formed a good relationship.”","Hearing this, Prince Golden Crow was shocked. Was Jian Wushuang so powerful that his father had to travel so far just to please him?","“Alright, don’t think too much. Everyone has their own destiny. Jian Wushuang is a rare monster. Why are you comparing yourself to him?”","Golden Crow Emperor patted his son’s shoulder and said with a smile, “Let’s go. Come with me to the Divine Life Palace.”","“Yes.” Golden Crow Prince nodded slightly.","Similar scenes were happening across the universe.","...","Within the universe.","Jian Wushuang drove the Cosmic Boat, braving the wind and breaking the waves. He was travelling at a high speed.","...","He did not rush back to the Divine Life Palace. Instead, he went to the Glacial Forbidden Land in the far north of the universe to pick up Leng Rushuang. Then, he returned to the Divine Life Palace.","To him, suppressing Supreme Bing Ye with his sword was already his limit.","Cosmos Temple and the Dragon clan were both behemoths that were personally guarded by Invincible Supremes!","Although the strength of Supreme Hei Yu of the Cosmos Temple could only be considered at the bottom among the Invincible Supremes, he was still a true Invincible Supreme. He was definitely not someone Jian Wushuang could match.","As for the Dragon clan, there was no need to talk about it. The Third Generation of the Dragon Bloodline was already at the Invincible Supreme cultivation realm. It was rumored that there was even a Second Generation Dragon in deep sleep.","If Third Generation Dragon was already an Invincible Supreme, what would the Second Generation Dragon be like?","Jian Wushuang was terrified.","All that, coupled with Great Void Divine Emperor’s words, pushed Jian Wushuang to make a decision in his heart. Instead of taking the risk and putting himself in danger, he might as well increase his power first.","When it was time to truly destroy them, he would crush them as easily as crushing dry weeds and smashing rotten wood, leaving no room for mercy!"]},{"number":4442,"title":"Chapter 4442 Epic","paragraphs":["4442 Epic","It had been three months since Jian Wushuang returned to the Divine Life Palace.","People came to visit him in an endless stream.","These people were either the Masters of Holy Lands or the Emperors of Divine Kingdoms. They were all Almighty beings who could shake the entire universe with a single stomp of their feet.","In the beginning, Jian Wushuang was quite patient and chatted with them over wine. However, as time passed, he found that he had no time to cultivate, so he simply closed the door and refused to see the guests, leaving the other Supremes of the Divine Life Palace to talk to them.","!!","...","The Divine Life Palace. The sixth mountain range.","Jian Wushuang’s manor.","Supreme Blood Wave and the Supreme Jun Fu had come as guests.","The three of them sat by the lake next to the manor. Leng Rushuang made them a cup of spirit tea and left obediently, not interrupting their conversation.","“Master Blood Wave, I’ve been meaning to ask you three questions. I’d like you to answer them for me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What?” Supreme Blood Wave raised his eyebrows and teased, “Jian Wushuang, you’ve been a popular person in the universe recently. I didn’t think that you’d still have things to ask me.”","“Alright, if you have any questions, just ask them directly. There’s no need for such formalities between us,” Supreme Blood Wave Supreme with a smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded. After pondering for a while, he slowly asked, “Master Blood Wave, what is the so-called ‘Great Catastrophe War’ that the people in the universe often talk about? What is the ‘Offworld Battlefield’? In addition, Supreme Tarot was at his peak back then, and there were few in the universe who could be his match, but who was the one that killed him? How did he just die in an instant like that? Even his Divine Kingdom was destroyed?”","When Supreme Blood Wave Supreme, he looked at the Supreme Jun Fu and did not rush to reply. Instead, his expression gradually turned solemn. After a long while, the Blood Wave spoke, “Jian Wushuang, even if you didn’t ask, I was going to tell you. Since you asked, I’ll answer your questions.”","“First of all, when we talk about the Great Catastrophe War, I’ll have to tell you about this universe.”","“Jian Wushuang, do you think that the universe is unique?”","Jian Wushuang was shocked when he heard this. He took a deep breath and replied, “I don’t know, but it’s the only universe I’ve ever seen.”","Supreme Blood Wave Supreme in response and took a sip of the spirit tea before saying, “Before the Great Catastrophe War, all of us were the same as you. We thought that the universe was unique, until the Great Catastrophe War happened.”","“A hundred thousand chaos cycles ago, a palm-sized spatial rift suddenly appeared at the edge of the universe.","“In the beginning, no one thought much of the crack in the void. After a long time, a man with three heads and six arms crawled out of the crack.”","“This person calls himself ‘Zhen Kui’, and he came from another universe. He’s terrifyingly powerful. He’s only a High Supreme realm martial artist, but he can kill a Top Supreme without the opponent having a chance to retaliate!”","In fact, even a Half Invincible Supreme would not be a match for him. It would be a great celebration if they could survive his attack!","After this Zhen Kui arrived in the universe, he immediately started a massacre and brought about a bloody storm. Countless races were exterminated by him, and countless powerful beings died at his hands. For a moment, the entire universe was filled with wails and turned into a land of smoke.","“There are no words that can be used to describe the tragedy of the universe at that time.”","After a pause, Supreme Blood Wave looked at Jian Wushuang and sighed. “It’s a pity that a hundred thousand chaos cycles ago, the number one genius of that era, Jie Dong, died to Zhen Kui. If Jie Dong hadn’t fallen, he would probably be one of the most powerful figures in the universe by now.”","Blood Wave sighed with emotion.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank. The number one genius from 100,000 chaos cycles ago, Jie Dong! He was the previous owner of the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron, and he had died like this?","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang could not help but feel a sense of pity.","Supreme Blood Wave continued, “It was only then that we finally understood that there was another parallel universe other than our universe.”","“And this universe, we call it... ‘Void’!”","“Void?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and there was a flash of light.","Supreme Jun Fu nodded and said in a deep voice, “That’s right. Because their cultivation method is completely different from ours, they rely on cultivating a breath of ‘void’ Qi. That’s why we call them the Void Universe.”","“In terms of overall strength, the cultivators in the Void Universe are much stronger than us, if both are in the same cultivation frealm! As such, they’re particularly troublesome and difficult to deal with.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and he was in deep thought.","“Jian Wushuang, the Great Catastrophe War was started by this man named ‘Zhen Kui’. When he was slaughtering everyone in the universe, he was finally noticed by the top experts in the universe. Three Invincible Supreme Masters took action and suppressed him!”","“Even so, this person still managed to use a secret technique and escape with serious injuries. He returned to the Void Universe.”","“The universe fell into a state of peace.”","“Seven chaos cycles after he fled, the rift in the void which had been mended by a mighty expert was once more torn open!","“Tens of thousands of people from the Void Universe crawled out of the crack!”","“Our entire universe was suddenly plunged into the endless flames of war. Countless races in the universe were in deep waters and scorching flames!”","“This battle will be known as the ‘Great Catastrophe War’!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang finally understood. He could imagine how fierce the Great Catastrophe War was! It was an event that swept across the entire universe!","“What happened after that? How did this battle end?” Jian Wushuang continued to ask.","Supreme Blood Wave chuckled upon hearing this. He raised his head and looked up at the sky with a hint of reverence in his eyes as he said, “After that, the Lord Cosmos God rose to power among the myriad of races. He helped the building collapse and saved it from the brink of collapse! The victory and defeat of this battle were decided in one fell swoop!”","“Under the leadership of Lord Cosmos God, this battle was finally reversed. We turned defeat into victory and killed all the cultivators of the Void Universe!”","“It was also because of this battle that Lord Cosmos God’s title as the number one person in the cosmos was established. We respectfully refer to him as ‘Cosmos God’!”","Jian Wushuang could not calm down for a long time.","That era must have been an epic era with many geniuses, bright stars, and magnificent waves.","Blood Wave smiled. He picked up the spirit tea and blew on the steam rising from it. “Jian Wushuang, the Offworld Battle you asked about is a product of this battle.”","“Although we managed to kill the cultivators of the Void Universe under the leadership of Lord Cosmos God, the crack in the void has yet to close. Even now, there are still experts of the Void Universe trying to enter through the crack from time to time.”","“However, Lord Cosmos God is personally in charge of that place, and there are also several Invincible Supremes patrolling the area all year round. Generally, people from the Void Universe are not able to enter our cosmos, thanks to Lord Cosmos God and the others.”","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment before cupping his hands at Supreme Blood Wave. “Thank you for clearing my doubts, Master Blood Wave. I understand.”","“There’s no need to be so polite.”","...","Supreme Blood Wave nodded his head and put down the teacup in his hand.","“Next, I’ll tell you how Supreme Tarot died.”"]},{"number":4443,"title":"Chapter 4443 Supreme Tarot’s Death","paragraphs":["4443 Supreme Tarot’s Death","The Divine Life Palace. The sixth mountain range.","Jian Wushuang’s manor.","There was a faint mist on the cloud lake. Wisps of white mist rose from the surface of the lake and then dispersed. The water and the sky were the same color, giving off a profound feeling. It was as if one could comprehend the universe’s grand meaning just by staring at it’.","Jian Wushuang, Supreme Blood Wave, and the others were sitting on the bow of a black boat. The boat swayed on the surface of the lake without any wind, leaving two long and calm ripples, as if leaving scars on the surface of the lake.","!!","Jian Wushuang, Supreme Blood Wave, and Supreme Jun Fu brewed tea and burned incense. It was a rather elegant scene.","“Jian Wushuang, Supreme Tarot was extremely powerful back then, and his name was well-known. It is not a big secret that he died in the universe, but it is rarely spread in the universe. Firstly, it is because they are afraid of distorting the truth. Secondly, they are afraid of causing panic and putting people themselves in danger.”","Supreme Blood Wave lifted his wide sleeves and picked up a ceramic teapot. He then poured a cup of tea for Jian Wushuang and Supreme Jun Fu.","The water was green in color, and waves of spiritual Qi mixed with the light fragrance of tea spread out. This cup of tea was very valuable. If an ordinary mortal drank from this cup, he would immediately shed his mortal body and become an Immortal.","Even Supreme martial artists like them would feel comfortable and their divine power would be nourished after drinking it.","“People are in a state of panic?”","Jian Wushuang picked up the teacup and took a sip. He then frowned and asked, “Supreme Blood Wave, what is the meaning of this?”","“Supreme Tarot wasn’t killed by someone from our universe,” Blood Wave replied.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and there was a flash of fierceness in them.","“Supreme Blood Wave, you’re saying that Supreme Tarot died at the hands of someone from the ‘Void Universe’?”","Supreme Blood Wave nodded his head, and his expression gradually turned serious. “That’s right. Three hundred chaos cycles ago, a group of experts called themselves ‘Devourers’. For some reason, they broke through the Offworld Battlefields and descended upon our universe. The leader of this group was known as the Devouring Emperor!”","“At that time, Supreme Tarot, who was on duty to suppress the Offworld Battlefield, happened to bump into them in the universe.”","As a result, the battle had entered a stalemate the moment it started!","No one knew the exact details of that battle. They only knew that the Supreme Tarot, who had been at the peak of the universe and had been undefeated through tens of thousands of battles, had suddenly died!","After that, Devourers came to the Tarot Divine Kingdom and killed billions of people. The Supreme Tarot could only send the Tarot Divine Sword into the depths of the universe before he died, forming the Tarot Ruins.","“After that, Lord Cosmos God arrived and exterminated the Devourers group. However, what’s worth mentioning about that battle is that the Devouring Emperor actually exchanged three blows with Lord Cosmos God and was not defeated. In the end, he even brought the Devourers group and retreated safely.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang frowned and his eyes flickered.","Others might not know how powerful Supreme Tarot was, but Jian Wushuang had fought with him in the Trial Space for 10,000 years, so he was very clear about it.","Supreme Tarot was an unparalleled mighty person whose Sword Dao illuminated the night. There were very few people in the entire universe who could defeat him, let alone kill him. There was no chance of escape.","“Jian Wushuang, it seems that the Devourers organization was the one who caused the disaster in Nine Luminaries Great Star Field,” Blood Wave continued.","“Eh? It’s them?” Jian Wushuang was shocked and his eyes lit up.","He naturally remembered the world-ending catastrophe in Nine Luminaries Great Star Field. If it were not for Heart Slayer and the others, he would have died in there.","However, from what those mysterious black-robed men had said, they were there for his master, Xuan Yi.","Jian Wushuang’s thoughts flashed like lightning and he instantly grasped a few key points.","Devouring Emperor... Void Universe... Offworld Battlefield... Cosmos God... And his own master, Xuan Yi!","These seemingly unrelated people were connected by an invisible thread.","Back then, during the Universe Great Clan Gathering, Cosmos God had told him that his master, Xuan Yi, was an old friend of his.","Then, what was the purpose of this situation?","What role did his Master, Xuan Yi, play in the overall situation?","And himself, Jian Wushuang... What was his identity?","Jian Wushuang fell into silence, his eyes flashing with thoughts.","He started to recall everything that had happened between him and Xuan Yi, from the beginning until now.","After a long time, Jian Wushuang heaved a long sigh and his eyes were filled with confusion. He looked up at the boundless starry sky and shook his head, “Master, Master, what do you want to do?”","Supreme Blood Wave and Supreme Jun Fu noticed this and exchanged a glance. “Jian Wushuang, what’s wrong?”","“It’s nothing,” Jian Wushuang turned around and smiled at them.","A moment later, Blood Wave and Jun Fu left.","Jian Wushuang sat at the bow of the boat alone, frowning and deep in thought.","“My Husband.” Leng Rushuang appeared behind Jian Wushuang. She stretched out her slender hand and gently smoothed out the frown between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows.","“What’s wrong? Is there something bothering you? You can talk to me, perhaps I will have an idea.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, shook his head, and said with a smile, “Shuang’er, I’m fine. Don’t worry about me.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang stretched out his finger and gently scratched the bridge of Leng Rushuang’s nose. He then stood up and headed into the manor.","He had a premonition that the universe would be in chaos again soon.","Before that, the only thing he could do was to increase his strength.","As long as he was strong enough, he would be able to deal with the Void Universe, Devourers, or his master Xuan Yi’s plans.","Only strength was the foundation to stand tall in this world.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang stepped into the cultivation room and started a long seclusion.","For him, it was not difficult to break through to the Intermediate Supreme realm. He just needed to go with the flow and continuously condense his divine power.","After he broke through to the Intermediate Supreme realm, his strength would make another qualitative leap.","...","...","In the blink of an eye, 3,000 years had passed.","In the past 3,000 years, Jian Wushuang had been constantly condensing his strength and stabilizing his cultivation. Finally, he had pushed to the peak of the Primary Supreme realm!","For a Perfect Chaotic Lifeform like Jian Wushuang, breaking through the barrier of a major cultivation realm would be tens of millions of times more difficult than for ordinary people.","However, breaking through such a small cultivation realm was much easier.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to take the step to break through to the Intermediate Supreme realm...","A Cosmic God decree suddenly arrived at the Divine Life Palace.","“Jian Wushuang, the Cosmos God has ordered you to come to the Supreme Temple!”","Supreme Blood Wave’s voice rang in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes, and a sharp light flashed in his eyes.","..."]},{"number":4444,"title":"Chapter 4444 Chaos at the Offworld Battlefield","paragraphs":["4444 Chaos at the Offworld Battlefield","Why would Lord Cosmos God’s decree be sent to the Divine Life Palace at this time?","Jian Wushuang frowned, but he could tell from the tone of Supreme Blood Wave that the situation was urgent. Jian Wushuang did not waste any time. He disappeared from the manor in a flash.","When they arrived at the Supreme Temple, it was a solemn scene. Supreme Blood Wave and Supreme Jun Fu were standing respectfully, cupping their hands as they listened.","At the head of the hall, a young man with red lips and white teeth was standing tall with a decree in his hand.","This person was one of the disciples of the Cosmos God, Lan Su.","“Jian Wushuang greets Master Lan Su.”","Jian Wushuang glanced at Supreme Blood Wave and the others, then cupped his hands and bowed slightly.","“There’s no need to be so polite, Supreme Wushuang.”","Lan Su gave Jian Wushuang a friendly smile. He was quite polite to Jian Wushuang, who had almost become his Junior Brother at the Great Clan Gathering.","Jian Wushuang nodded and then asked, “Lord Lan Su, you have traveled thousands of miles to the Divine Life Palace. May I know what is the matter?”","“Yes,” Lan Su replied. “I’ve indeed come to the Divine Life Palace to discuss something important.”","At this point, Lan Su paused, and a serious expression appeared on his face. He looked around at the people in the hall and said solemnly, “Everyone, the Offworld Battlefield is in chaos.”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone was shocked.","“What? The Offworld Battlefield is in chaos?”","“Isn’t the Offworld Battlefield personally suppressed by Lord Cosmos God? Why is it chaotic?”","“The void has already been at peace with us for tens of thousands of chaos cycles. Why is it suddenly like this?”","“How’s the situation there?”","“Are the people from the Void Universe about to attack?”","“Don’t tell me we’re going to start another Great Catastrophe War?”","Everyone’s faces paled, and even Supreme Blood Wave and the others’ expressions changed slightly.","Looking at this scene, Lan Su’s expression softened a little. He shook his head and said, “There’s no need to be so nervous. The situation isn’t that serious. My Master is personally watching over the Offworld Battlefield. There won’t be trouble in a short time.”","Hearing this, everyone let out a long sigh of relief.","“Lord Lan Su, why have you come to the Divine Life Palace?” Jian Wushuang asked with a frown.","Lan Su glanced at Jian Wushuang and replied with a smile, “It’s like this. This time, a large number of Void Warriors from the Void Universe have swarmed out of the battlefield. Lord Cosmos God can’t do everything himself. Just relying on the Supremes who were originally on the battlefield is no longer enough to suppress this rebellion. It’s too strenuous.”","“Hence, Lord Cosmos God ordered me to find manpower from the universe. Every faction with a Supreme in their sect must send at least one Supreme to the Offworld Battlefield to suppress the chaos!”","“As for the Divine Life Palace, there are only two spots for the battle. In other words, your palace must send two Supremes to the Offworld Battlefield.”","Everyone in the Divine Life Palace looked at each other and did not speak for a while.","Lan Su was not in a hurry to get an answer. He said in a deep voice, “Everyone, this matter concerns the safety of the universe. I hope that everyone can put aside their own lives and assist Cosmos God to end this rebellion.”","“Alright, I have to make a trip to the Dragon clan now. I also have to inform the other major forces, so I’ll make a move first.”","“Ten years later, I will wait for you at the port of the Mystic Sun Star Field. We will go through the universe passage and head to the Offworld Battlefield together.”","Lan Su did not stay any longer and strode away.","It could be seen that although the situation was not that serious, it was still urgent.","After Lan Su left, everyone in the Supreme Temple frowned and did not speak.","Putting aside the fact that Lord Cosmos God had personally given the order, even if Lord Cosmos God had not given the order, they would definitely have to go to the Offworld Battlefield.","Just as Lan Su had said, this matter concerned the safety of the entire universe. Once the chaos in the Offworld Battlefield gets out of hand, a large number of Void Warriors from the Void Universe would flood into the universe. When the nest was overturned, would the eggs remain intact?","However, it was difficult to send the two Supreme martial artists to the Offworld Battlefield.","The Divine Life Palace was currently in a state of turmoil and was lacking a pillar of support. If anything were to happen to the person they had sent, the Divine Life Palace might collapse completely like a broken dam.","A moment later, Supreme Blood Wave muttered, “The Offworld Battlefield is extremely dangerous and full of killing intent. If an ordinary Supreme martial artist were to go, they would most likely die. The danger is too great.”","He paused.","Blood Wave seemed to have made a decision. “How about this? Supreme Tian Yi and I will be the ones to head to the Offworld Battlefield, while Supreme Jun Fu will be in charge of guarding the Divine Life Palace.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Tian Yi nodded his head.","The two of them were at the Top Supreme realm. Even if they were to encounter a Half Invincible Supreme enemy, they would still have the power to fight. Furthermore, the two of them had fought side by side for many years. When the time came, they would be able to support each other and take care of each other on the battlefield.","Supreme Jun Fu did not have any objections to this. He had yet to fully recover from his injuries, so he could stay in the Divine Life Palace and recover from them.","Just as the decision was about to take effect and Supreme Blood Wave and Supreme Tian Yi were about to pack up and head to the port of the Mystic Sun Star Field...","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King took a step forward in tacit understanding and spoke in unison.","“I, Jian Wushuang, will go to the Offworld Battlefield to fight for the Divine Life Palace!”","“I, Ninth Kalpa King, will go to the Offworld Battlefield to fight for the Divine Life Palace!”","As soon as they finished speaking, everyone was stunned.","“The two of you seem to have a tacit understanding,” Supreme Blood Wave chuckled.","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King could not help but look at each other with surprise in their eyes.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “Supreme Blood Wave, even if Lord Lan Su didn’t come today, I was prepared to take a trip to the Offworld Battlefield.”","“Oh?” Supreme Blood Wave narrowed his eyes. When Jian Wushuang had asked him about the Offworld Battlefield and Supreme Tarot’s death, he had already guessed that Jian Wushuang might have some connection with the people in the Void Universe.","However, Jian Wushuang was extremely talented and was the hope of the Divine Life Palace’s rise in the future. If anything happened to him on the Offworld Battlefield...","“Jian Wushuang, the Offworld Battlefield is too dangerous. What you need to do now is to grow slowly...”","...","Just as Supreme Blood Wave was about to refuse, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and said in a deep voice, “If we’re talking about danger, Supreme Blood Wave, then I’m afraid that with my current level of power, it’ll be a bit less dangerous.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with confidence.","Supreme Blood Wave was stunned for a moment before he fell silent.","He had almost forgotten that Jian Wushuang could kill a Half Invincible Supreme with his sword.","Compared to himself, Jian Wushuang was much stronger.","Supreme Blood Wave was not an indecisive person. His eyes flickered as he thought of this. He took a deep breath and said in a deep voice, “Fine. Jian Wushuang, you’ll go to the Offworld Battlefield on behalf of the Divine Life Palace and suppress the chaos!”"]},{"number":4445,"title":"Chapter 4445 Mystic Sun Port","paragraphs":["4445 Mystic Sun Port","“I, Jian Wushuang, will carry out your orders!”","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang’s eyes sparkled and he cupped his hands.","On this trip to the Offworld Battlefield, he was determined to win. Firstly, it was to suppress the chaos, and secondly, it was for himself.","He already had a guess about his Master Xuan Yi. With Xuan Yi’s strength, if he was still in this universe, there would definitely be some news about him.","It was highly possible that Xuan Yi was on the Offworld Battlefield.","Furthermore, it was time for him to find out more about the Devouring Emperor.","Finally, his power had reached a bottleneck. Even if he stayed in the universe to cultivate in seclusion, it would be of little use. Whether it was the Cosmos Temple or the Dragon clan, they were both Immortal forces with Invincible Supremes. With his current power, he could not pose any threat to these two top forces.","Rather than that, he might as well go to the Offworld Battlefield and increase his strength through battle.","Besides that, there was another point.","It was Supreme Bing Ye!","Jian Wushuang remembered that before Great Void Divine Emperor left, he had said that he would bring Supreme Bing Ye to the Offworld Battlefield.","Jian Wushuang had once sworn to the heavens that he would kill Supreme Bing Ye and the others. Otherwise, he would fall into the abyss and cease to be human.","He, Jian Wushuang, was never a man of empty words.","“Supreme Blood Wave, what about me?” Ninth Kalpa King said from the side.","He frowned when he saw that the Blood Wave Supreme had arranged for Jian Wushuang to be there but did not mention him.","Supreme Blood Wave glanced at Ninth Kalpa King and could not help but smile bitterly. Ninth Kalpa King was also a stubborn person, and he was afraid that he would not be able to stop him if he did not let him go. “Okay, okay. You can go with Jian Wushuang.”","Suddenly, a hint of joy flashed in Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes. He cupped his hands and shouted, “I, Ninth Kalpa King, will carry out your orders!”","“Alright, since this matter is settled, you may all withdraw.”","Supreme Blood Wave rubbed the space between his brows as a hint of exhaustion appeared on his face. Supreme Master Gai Fu was currently in a deep sleep, and he was in charge of managing the Divine Life Palace. This was truly exhausting.","“Yes.”","Everyone left.","When they arrived at the entrance of the Supreme Temple, Ninth Kalpa King glanced at Jian Wushuang and said with a faint smile, “Jian Wushuang, I’m not as strong as you now, but we can compete to see who can kill more Void Warriors in the Offworld Battlefield.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but show an interested look in his eyes. He nodded and said, “Alright.”","“Yes, Jian Wushuang. The Mystic Sun Star Field is not close to here. You and I should go back and make preparations. We will set off together in a year.”","The two of them exchanged a few more words before they went their separate ways.","When Jian Wushuang returned to his manor in the sixth mountain range, he told Leng Rushuang about the expedition. Leng Rushuang’s heart tightened.","Fortunately, Leng Rushuang was not a pretentious person. No matter how reluctant she was, she could only remind Jian Wushuang to be careful.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but sigh.","Over the years, the two of them had been away more than together, and there were almost no opportunities for them to be intimate.","“Fine, I’ll spend this last year with Shuang’er.”","Jian Wushuang made up his mind.","...","A year later.","Outside the Divine Life Palace.","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King bade farewell to Supreme Blood Wave Supreme and the others who had come to see them off. Then, they steered the Cosmic Boat and flew toward the Mystic Sun Port. They were on their way to the Mystic Sun Star Field.","On the deck of the Cosmic Boat.","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King stood side by side. One of them was wearing a wide black robe and a hood that covered half of his face. The other one was wearing a white robe, with cold eyes and white hair hanging down.","The two of them, one in black and the other in white, were the two most heaven-defying geniuses in the universe!","“Jian Wushuang, almost none of the Void Warriors who crawled out of the Offworld Battlefield have cultivation realms below the Supreme level. Moreover, they can release a strange light wave. They are not easy to deal with,” Ninth Kalpa King said indifferently with his hands behind his back.","Although he was arrogant, he was not impetuous. He had collected a lot of information about the Void Universe in the past year.","The more he understood, the more serious and furious he became!","The cultivators of the Void Universe were cruel and bloodthirsty by nature, and they treated the people of their universe with extreme cruelty. In every chaos cycle, countless experts across their universe had been tortured to death.","“A strange light wave?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and his eyes were filled with curiosity.","“That’s right.” The Ninth Kalpa King nodded and replied, “The cultivators of the Void Universe all have an accompanying magical power. It’s that strange light wave. We call it ‘Void Explosion’!","“It’s because of the existence of this ‘Void Explosion’ that an ordinary Void Warrior of the Void Universe is usually stronger than the cultivators of the same cultivation realm in our universe.”","Jian Wushuang nodded his head after some thought. However, he did not really care. He thought that no cultivator in the Void Universe would be stronger than him in the same cultivation realm.","He was very confident.","“Other than that, the experts of the Void Universe have all kinds of appearances. There are three-headed and six-armed ones, and there are also headless ones with axes. In short, they look more like evil beings, but the good news is that they’re easy to identify.”","“All the members of the Void Universe have a long scar on their shoulders. I’m not sure about those below the Supreme realm level, but it holds true for all those above the Supreme level. A Primary Supreme level Void Warrior has a long scar on their shoulder, the Intermediate Supremes have two long scars on their shoulders, and so on. A Void Warrior with the power of an Invincible Supreme has five long scars on their shoulder!”","Ninth Kalpa King explained slowly.","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Whoosh.","The two of them were discussing while flying toward the Mystic Sun Star Field. Their speed was not slow, just like meteors crossing the sky.","...","...","The stars moved, and the galaxies revolved.","In the blink of an eye, ten years had passed.","“Jian Wushuang, the Mystic Sun Star Field is up ahead.” Ninth Kalpa King narrowed his eyes and looked forward as he spoke.","As far as the eye could see, a vast Star Field formed by countless nebulas, planets, and stars appeared in front of them.","“Yes, let’s go. They should be here by now.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Then, the two of them got off the Cosmic Boat, put it away, and walked toward the ferry of the Mystic Sun Star Field.","The Mystic Sun Port was also the gathering point of many universe passages. It was connected to all the major Star Fields and top forces in the universe.","The two of them had just arrived at the Mystic Sun Port when they saw Lan Su and the rest already sitting cross-legged and waiting.","“Eh? Supreme Wushuang? Supreme Ninth Kalpa? The Divine Life Palace has actually sent two of you this time?”","Sensing the approaching auras of Jian Wushuang and the other person, Lan Su slowly opened his eyes and looked over. A slight surprise flashed in his eyes.","...","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King were the most precious trump cards of the Divine Life Palace. He had thought that the Divine Life Palace would not send the two of them this time.","“Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King greet Lord Lan Su.”","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King cupped their hands. Then, they looked at the few figures standing beside Lan Su and sneered.","They did not expect to meet so many ‘acquaintances’ here."]},{"number":4446,"title":"Chapter 4446 Departure!","paragraphs":["4446 Departure!","At this moment, the young man with two horns on his head, dressed in a golden robe, and an arrogant look standing beside Lan Su was none other than Long Qing.","“Jian Wushuang!”","At the same time, Long Qing also noticed Jian Wushuang. Suddenly, his eyes were filled with killing intent.","Beside him, there were two other Dragon clan experts. They were both Fourth Generation Dragons.","However, the strength of these two people was much weaker than Long Qing’s.","“He is Jian Wushuang?”","“It’s him? A mere Primary Supreme martial artist can cause our Dragon clan to go to war? The guy that ran back with his tail tucked between his legs after provoking our clan?”","The two Dragons clan disciples exchanged glances as bewilderment flashed in their eyes.","“Long time no see, I’ve missed you so much.” Jian Wushuang squinted at Long Qing and sneered.","Compared to Supreme Bing Ye, his hatred for Long Qing was far greater!","Back then, he had been chased by Long Qing and was almost killed!","One stomp after another, his divine body was destroyed!","Of course, if it were not for this person, he would not have gotten to know Overlord Patriarch and obtain the Chaos Overlord Body.","“Good, very good. Jian Wushuang, I thought that I would have to wait at least ten million years to kill you. I didn’t expect you to join this expedition!”","Long Qing looked at Jian Wushuang with a cold glint in his eyes and a cruel smile on his face.","“Jian Wushuang, let’s have some fun on the Offworld Battlefield.”","After that, Long Qing turned his eyes and looked at Ninth Kalpa King who was next to Jian Wushuang again. He said in a cold voice, “And you, Ninth Kalpa King, you were the one who belittled me at the end of the Great Clan Gathering, right? Hehe, I’ve always kept score in my mind. When we get to the Offworld Battlefield, I’ll play with you two!”","Ninth Kalpa King’s expression was cold. He did not even lift his eyelids when he heard this and calmly replied, “You think you’re worthy?”","“You!” Long Qing was instantly enraged, and the veins on his forehead were throbbing.","Jian Wushuang could not help but find it funny. Ninth Kalpa King seemed indifferent and reticent, but once he spoke, he could hit the target’s sore spot.","Lan Su, who was watching from the side, could not help but frown and said, “Everyone, you are the elites of our universe. You are the main force of our suppression. How can we start an internal conflict before the enemy is destroyed?”","After a pause, Lan Su said in a deep voice, “Everyone, now that we are facing a great enemy, I hope that all of you can put aside your past grudges and focus on annihilating the outsiders first. Otherwise, if I were to discover that all of you have affected the war situation because of your personal conflicts, don’t blame me for reporting this and informing Lord Cosmos God.”","As soon as he said that, everyone fell silent, but their faces were still ugly.","Lan Su only had the cultivation level of a High Supreme realm. If not for the backing of the Lord Cosmos God, he would have been slapped to death long ago.","Seeing this, Lan Su could only smile bitterly in his heart. He shook his head helplessly and said, “Alright, let’s wait a little longer. It’s almost time for us to set off. You’re the first batch to head to the Offworld Battlefield, I’ll have to come back to transfer the second batch.”","The crowd nodded and no longer spoke.","After that, more and more people came from all over the universe.","Jian Wushuang met many familiar faces, such as the Nine Star Saint of the Nine Star Holy Land and the Moluo clan’s Moluo Yangu.","There was also a group of High Supreme realm cultivators from the Cosmos Temple.","In the two great battles, the Divine Life Palace suffered heavy losses, and the Cosmos Temple was not any better. Almost all of the Supremes had died.","It was already rare for them to send out a High Supreme.","The High Supreme from the Cosmos Temple had been arrogant, but when he saw Jian Wushuang, he immediately lowered his head like a mouse seeing a cat. He was afraid that Jian Wushuang would cause him trouble.","Jian Wushuang had suppressed the two Half Invincible Supremes and had become famous.","...","Three months later.","Lan Su looked at the people who had arrived, nodded, and said, “Alright, the first batch of candidates has all arrived. We can set off now.”","At this moment, there were eleven Supreme Martial Artists standing on the Mystic Sun Port.","The 11 Supremes were all extremely powerful. Besides Jian Wushuang, who was a Primary Supreme, Ninth Kalpa King, who was a Intermediate Supreme, the rest of them were at least at the High Supreme realm.","The next moment.","Lan Su flipped his right hand and four small white flags appeared.","“Go.”","He shouted in a low voice, and four small white flags shot into the sky, forming a barrier.","Ding!!","In the void, a bright light suddenly shone. Rays of light outlined each other and formed an array.","Rumble!","Immediately after, the boundless void was torn apart and a vortex was formed. In the center of the vortex, a golden beam of light fell and formed a ring of light at the ferry.","“Let’s go,” Lan Su turned around and said to Jian Wushuang and the others. Then, he took a step forward and shot into the vortex in the sky.","Jian Wushuang and the others nodded. They all circulated their divine power and turned into a flowing light that shot into the vortex.","Whoosh!","A moment later, the vortex closed, and the sky cleared up again.","Jian Wushuang and the others had already disappeared.","...","Time flew by.","In the blink of an eye, 100 years had passed.","...","In the past 100 years, Lan Su led Jian Wushuang and the others through the universe tunnel, crossing the starry sky and rushing toward the Offworld Battlefield.","Their speed was extremely fast, and they would often disappear into the universe passage in a flash. When they reappeared, they were already several Star Fields away.","Gradually, they left the center of the universe and arrived at an extremely remote place.","Whoosh!","On a desolate planet, the figures of Lan Su, Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, Long Qing, and the other 11 Supreme martial artists leaped out of the void.","“Eh? Where is this place?”","Everyone exited the cosmos passage and immediately looked around.","Not a blade of grass grew on this planet, and the divine power was extremely thin. Astral storms were everywhere.","There was a strong astral wind zone on this planet. The black wind was like sword energy that cut through the void.","Vaguely, one could see that in this astral wind zone, there were many powerful and brutal Giant Astral Beasts lurking, their eyes constantly shooting out red light.","Lan Su raised his head and looked ahead. He turned back and said, “Everyone, after passing through this astral wind zone, we will reach the part of the Offworld Battlefield where our universe’s forces are stationed. We can’t use the universe passage here, so we have to rely on our own strength to cross this area.”","...","Everyone nodded in agreement.","These Giant Astral Beasts generally did not have the strength of an Ultimate Ruler, and even the most powerful ones among them had barely reached the level of a Supreme. The people present were mostly High Supremes, so they naturally did not take the beasts seriously.","Among the crowd, only Long Qing, who was walking at the back, first looked at the astral wind zone in front of him, and then looked at the back of Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King. He licked his lips, and an undetectable cold sneer flashed across his face."]},{"number":4447,"title":"Chapter 4447 Crossing","paragraphs":["4447 Crossing","“Let’s go.”","Lan Su turned around and glanced at them. Then, he took a step forward and turned into a stream of light. He took the lead and shot toward the astral wind zone.","Jian Wushuang and the others followed closely behind. Like a sharp knife, they directly pierced into the astral wind zone.","Buzzz.","!!","In the astral wind zone, gusts of black astral wind tore through the void, and terrifying sonic booms rang out in the surroundings.","These black squalls were powerful enough to tear any cultivator below the Supreme realm into pieces. Even though they were Supremes, they still felt a little pain when crossing the zone.","Fortunately, they were all the mainstays of the universe, great figures who ruled over a region. Although these black gales could cause them trouble, it did not pose much of a threat.","Jian Wushuang activated his Chaos Overlord Body. Suddenly, the divine patterns on his body glowed and his body emitted a bright golden light. The strong wind that was like a sharp knife suddenly became gentle like a spring breeze.","Roar!","Roar!!","The Giant Astral Beasts hid in the astral winds and roared.","These giant beasts were all made up of meteorites. Other than having the instinct to kill, they had almost no fear.","Jian Wushuang did not even need to draw his sword. With a casual punch, the power of thousands of mountains was enough to crush a Giant Astral Beast.","The others also unleashed their own techniques, and in an instant, divine techniques shot out and bombarded indiscriminately, crushing the Giant Astral Beasts in an instant.","Gradually, Jian Wushuang and the others entered the depths of the astral wind zone.","Lan Su walked in front and said in a deep voice, “Everyone, be careful. Not far ahead is the most dangerous place in the astral wind zone. There is an Astral Beast King. If there is only one, it is not a big deal. However, if it causes a beast tide, it will pose a threat to us.”","“Therefore, everyone, please keep your voices down and don’t make any noise. We don’t want to provoke the Astral Beast King.”","Everyone nodded in agreement.","Whoosh!","The group’s speed was not slow, and they soon reached the depths of the astral wind zone.","They could see Giant Astral Beasts that were several times larger than before, lying in the astral wind and sleeping.","Waves of powerful auras exuded from their bodies. Even though everyone was a Supreme expert, they still felt a slight sense of pressure.","Lan Su walked in front and turned around to make a ‘shush’ gesture, indicating for the crowd to not make a sound.","Just as Jian Wushuang walked past an Astral Beast King...","Bang!","Suddenly, a black light wave was shot out by Long Qing, who was at the back, and it hit the Astral Beast King beside Jian Wushuang.","Boom!!","In an instant, the Astral Beast King’s body exploded and black blood splattered on Jian Wushuang.","Roar!","Roar!!!","In an instant, the entire astral wind zone fell into chaos!","Countless Giant Astral Beasts woke up, opened their eyes, and stared at Jian Wushuang.","They could sense the aura of Jian Wushuang killing their own kind!","In an instant, countless Astral Beasts pounced on Jian Wushuang!","“Long Qing!”","Lan Su’s face darkened. He turned to Long Qing and said, “Long Qing, what’s the meaning of this? I’ve told you again and again not to disturb the Giant Astral Beasts, did you hear me?”","The others also frowned.","“I didn’t do it on purpose, I was just careless,” Long Qing spread his hands and said fearlessly.","If Cosmos God was here, he would naturally not dare to act presumptuously. However, this Lan Su was merely a disciple of Cosmos God, and his cultivation was inferior to his. Even though he did not wish to offend Lan Su, he did not have much fear either.","Clang!","The Tarot Divine Sword was instantly unsheathed, and a sharp sword pressure spread out. Jian Wushuang was expressionless, but he sneered in his heart.","He had long guessed that Long Qing would set him up here.","“Slash!”","A giant beast roared and charged at Jian Wushuang. An extremely sharp sword light slashed down!","This sword split the entire astral wind zone in spectacular fashion, and the vast sky was directly torn into two sides.","Roar!","The Astral Beast King, which was on par with a Supreme realm cultivator, was cut in half from head to tail, and countless drops of divine blood fell.","However, Jian Wushuang’s sword did not make the beasts retreat. Instead, they rushed toward Jian Wushuang in a rage!","In just a few breaths, Jian Wushuang was drowned in the huge beast tide.","Ninth Kalpa King, Nine Stars Saint, and the others frowned. They were about to help when they saw Lan Su’s expression turn ugly and say, “Don’t do anything. Let Jian Wushuang deal with it himself. Otherwise, it will only trigger a bigger beast tide and all of us will be dragged into it.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he gave Long Qing a cold look, and a touch of disgust flashed in his eyes.","Roar!!!","Jian Wushuang, who was submerged in the beast tide, kept slashing with the Tarot Divine Sword. Every time he slashed, he killed a Giant Astral Beast.","“As expected, killing can increase the power of the Tarot Divine Sword.”","...","In the center of the beast tide, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he smiled.","Ever since he had obtained the Tarot Scabbard, he had discovered that the Tarot Divine Sword’s power would increase with each kill. The eye on the hilt of the sword would become even more demonic.","The more powerful the enemy he killed, the more powerful the Tarot Divine Sword would be.","For example, after he had killed Supreme Yuding, he felt that the power of the Tarot Divine Sword had increased by at least 10 percent!","Although it seemed to be only 10 percent, to Jian Wushuang, 10 percent of his power was already a huge improvement!","Most importantly, with the Tarot Scabbard, he did not have to worry about the Tarot Divine Sword absorbing too many impurities that would affect its quality.","This was because all it needed to do was to nourish it in the Tarot Scabbard for a while, and the impurities would be cleared.","Seeing the Giant Astral Beasts, Jian Wushuang was naturally excited. He was originally thinking about how to trigger a beast tide and kill it with a legitimate reason to increase the power of the Tarot Divine Sword.","He did not expect Long Qing to send the beast tide directly into his hands.","However, the number of Astral Beast Kings in this area was limited.","In just a few minutes, all the Astral Beast Kings were killed. Ordinary Astral Beasts were not of much use to Jian Wushuang.","...","Jian Wushuang sheathed his sword and walked out of the center of the beast tide with an indifferent expression.","Looking at Jian Wushuang’s unscathed appearance, Long Qing could not help but feel bored. He shook his head and said, “What Astral Beast King? They’re completely useless.”","Lan Su heaved a sigh of relief when she saw that Jian Wushuang was fine. He then stared at Long Qing coldly and said, “I advise some people, if they bring their personal grudges to the Offworld Battlefield, don’t blame me for reporting it to my Master and punishing the family behind them.”","Then, he snorted coldly and led the group to cross the other side of the astral wind belt.","A moment later.","Jian Wushuang and the other 11 Supreme experts passed through the astral wind zone safely.","In the void, a vast camp appeared in front of everyone."]},{"number":4448,"title":"Chapter 4448 Meeting Cosmos God Again","paragraphs":["4448 Meeting Cosmos God Again","“We’re here.”","Lan Su stopped and smiled.","“Everyone, our campsite is right in front.”","Hearing this, everyone could not help but look at each other, their faces full of curiosity.","!!","From time to time, Supreme experts could be seen walking around in a hurry. Among them, there were many Supreme with weak auras and injured divine bodies.","“Eh? Was that Supreme Bi An? Didn’t he disappear for hundreds of chaos cycles?”","“And that person over there... is he the once famous Supreme Qian Fang? The entire universe thought he had fallen, I didn’t expect him to be in the Offworld Battlefield wars the entire time!”","“The one whose divine body was on the verge of being shattered just now was Supreme Cangwu, right? Back then, when Supreme Cangwu was at his peak, he was actually injured so severely here.”","“It seems like the Void Warriors of the Void Universe are not easy to deal with.”","Everyone’s faces could not help but surge with a serious expression.","At this moment, a Primary Supreme realm divine general rushed over and cupped his hands, “Lord Lan Su, Cosmos God has been waiting in the main hall for a long time. He ordered me to bring all of you to the main hall to hear the announcement the moment I see you.”","“Yes!” Lan Su did not dare to delay. He quickly led Jian Wushuang and the others toward the main hall.","In the main hall, Cosmos God sat on the main seat. However, he appeared much more exhausted than he had been during the Universe Great Clan Gathering.","When Jian Wushuang saw Cosmos God again this time, he had more respect for him.","If not for Cosmos God’s efforts to turn the tide back then, the entire universe would have been destroyed by the Void Warriors of the Void Universe.","Furthermore, over the past tens of thousands of chaos cycles, Cosmos Gods had been stationed in the Offworld Battlefield while teaching others without discrimination, nurturing a large number of experts within the universe.","It could be said that a large part of the reason why the entire universe could be so stable today was due to Cosmos God.","“We pay our respects to Lord Cosmos God!”","The eleven Supreme martial artists all knelt on the ground and cupped their hands.","“No need to be so polite.” Cosmos God chuckled and stretched out his hand to support them. Instantly, a gentle force gushed out and helped everyone up.","Following that, Cosmos God surveyed the crowd and said, “I believe everyone has some understanding of the Void Universe by now, right?”","The crowd muttered and nodded.","“Well, I won’t go into detail about the Void Universe. I’ll tell you about the situation in the Offworld Battlefield first.”","At this point, Cosmos God’s face turned solemn. With a wave of his right hand, an image appeared out of thin air and was displayed before everyone.","In this scene.","A 30-foot-long crack in the void stood in the void like a pair of mysterious doors.","Countless monsters with terrifying appearances crawled out of the cracks in the void while roaring.","Some of these monsters had three heads and six arms, some had tails and huge mouths, and some had eyes all over their bodies.","Their auras were completely different from Jian Wushuang and the other ordinary Supremes, but their strength far exceeded that of Supremes of the same realm.","Outside the crack, a team of Supreme experts led by an Invincible Supreme cultivator was fighting against these monsters.","The battle was extremely tragic!","From time to time, Supreme experts could be seen dying. The famous Supreme experts who usually acted tyrannically in the depths of the universe were dying like raindrops on the battlefield.","No one retreated, no one was afraid, and everyone fought to the last moment.","The hall was completely silent. Before coming here, no one would have thought that the Offworld Battlefield would be so tragic.","“5,000 years ago, for some unknown reason, the crack in the void suddenly became bigger, and a large number of cultivators of the void poured out. These cultivators of the void didn’t fight on their own like before, but instead gathered together. If I’m not wrong, they can move freely. They should be from a force in the Void Universe under the command of one person.”","Cosmos God said in a deep voice, his eyes filled with solemness.","Everyone’s expression changed slightly.","According to what Cosmos God said, the attacking Void Warriors of the Void Universe were from a single sect. It was not difficult to deduce that the power of the opposite universe far exceeded their imagination.","After all, they had gathered all the top forces in the universe to defend against the Void Universe’s attack.","In other words, this universe could only compete with one sect in the void universe?","Seeing the change in everyone’s expressions, Cosmos God continued, “That’s not all. The main thing is that the crack is getting bigger and bigger. I’m afraid it won’t be long before the crack opens completely and forms a passage. At that time, I’m afraid that the Void Universe on the other side will attack us with all its troops. If we fail in this defence, the entire universe will fall into a catastrophe!”","Hiss!","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air.","One of the Supreme martial artists asked, “Lord Cosmos God, could it be that even you are unable to exterminate these Void Warriors?”","Cosmos God glanced at him and said in a deep voice, “Three thousand years ago, a huge black arm bound by chains stretched out from the crack in the void. I exchanged a blow with the black arm. Although I forced it back, I could sense that the owner of the black arm was not much weaker than me. In fact, they might even be on par with me.”","As soon as these words were spoken, it was undoubtedly adding fuel to the fire in everyone’s hearts.","Even Jian Wushuang’s face was extremely solemn.","Looking at everyone’s nervous expressions, Cosmos God could not help but chuckle. “Of course, things are not beyond salvation. All we need to do now is to resist the attack of the Void Universe, and I’ll look for the Heaven-Suppressing Divine Flag, one of the Seven Supreme Great Ancestral Weapons. Once I find the Heaven-Suppressing Divine Flag, there’s a high chance that I’ll be able to seal the crack in the void completely.”","“Alright, you all know the situation in the Offworld Battleground. Remember, don’t spread what I just said. Otherwise, the universe will get shocked and people will panic. Before the people of the Void Universe even attacks, our universe will collapse on its own.”","After Cosmos God finished speaking, he turned to Lan Su and instructed, “Lan Su, now you will separate them and put them into the nine teams. They will be under the command of the nine teams.”","“Yes, this disciple will do as you command.”","Lan Su quickly cupped her hands and nodded. She led Jian Wushuang and the other 11 Supreme experts to join the nine teams in the camp.","In the Offworld Battlefield, Cosmos God was in charge of the overall situation. He was in charge of the base camp, and there were a total of nine teams under him.","Each team was led by an Invincible Supreme, and there were two Vice-Captains under the captain.","...","The two Vice-Captains were usually Half Invincible Supreme experts or Top Supreme experts.","Lan Su led the group and broke them up, joining the nine teams.","Jian Wushuang was assigned to Team 7."]},{"number":4449,"title":"Chapter 4449 Supreme Blacksource","paragraphs":["4449 Supreme Blacksource","The campsite of Team 7 was in a lush bamboo forest.","Lan Su did not send Jian Wushuang in personally. Instead, he informed Jian Wushuang that Lord Cosmos God had already sent a voice transmission to Team 7 and told Jian Wushuang to go in and report himself.","Before leaving, Lan Su kindly reminded Jian Wushuang that although the leader of Team 7, Supreme Blacksource, had a bad temper, he was not a bad person. If there was any disagreement, he asked Jian Wushuang to be more tolerant.","“Supreme Blacksource?”","!!","Jian Wushuang was dressed in a black robe. His right hand was holding the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword hanging from his waist as he walked into the bamboo forest step by step.","He was no stranger to Supreme Blacksource.","There were not many Invincible Supremes in the universe, and almost every one of them was a world-shaking and glorious existence.","As for Supreme Blacksource, he was one of the most famous martial artists among the Invincible Supremes.","If Supreme Tarot was the number one Sword God of all time, then Supreme Blacksource was the number one Saber God of all time.","8,000 chaos cycles ago, he had reached the Invincible Supreme level.","However, he had always been a loner. Hence, he did not leave behind any orthodoxy or power in the cosmos. The cosmos did not know much about him.","The bamboo leaves fell one by one. The deeper he went, the wider the path in the forest became. Not long after, a bamboo house appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","The door of the bamboo house opened, and more than ten Supreme martial artists sat cross-legged at the door. They were all wearing the same white robe. When they saw Jian Wushuang, their eyes were full of curiosity and they kept looking at him up and down.","Although they had been in the Offworld Battlefield, they had heard of Jian Wushuang. He seemed to be the number one genius in the universe and had the power to fight above his level.","They were skeptical about this.","Jian Wushuang also sized them up. There were a total of 20 Supreme experts, all of whom were at least Intermediate Supreme realm. Among them, there was a Top Supreme realm and a Half Invincible Supreme realm.","Their robes were also different from the other Supreme experts. Although they were also wearing white robes, there were golden threads sewn at the corners of their robes.","“These two should be the vice-captain of Team 7.”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly. The two of them had a murderous aura. With just a glance, he could feel a shocking killing intent.","Jian Wushuang continued to raise his head and looked at the deepest part of the bamboo forest.","There was only one person standing there.","The man was tall and burly. He carried a long black saber on his shoulder and wore a white cloak. The back of the cloak was embroidered with the words ‘Team 7’ with black threads. His back was facing Jian Wushuang.","Just by standing there, he was like a mountain in front of them, and a huge pressure spread out.","The next moment.","The man slowly turned around.","A square face with long scars and an imposing aura appeared in front of Jian Wushuang!","This person was none other than the captain of Team 7, the Invincible Supreme Blacksource!","Surpeme Blacksource had entered the Dao with the Saber, and he had once been an Invincible Supreme who had shaken the Nine Heavens and ten lands!","His body was filled with monstrous killing intent. Jian Wushuang only met his eyes for a moment and he felt an extremely terrifying and suffocating cold killing intent.","With one look, one could tell that this person was definitely a super expert who had walked out of a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood!","“Jian Wushuang?”","Supreme Blacksource’s eyelids lifted slightly as he looked at Jian Wushuang expressionlessly.","“Supreme Master Blacksource.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands slightly in salute with an indifferent expression.","Supreme Blacksource nodded his head, then said, “Jian Wushuang, I’ve heard of you. You seem to be the number one genius in the universe now, right? I don’t care how talented you are, but let me warn you first. Once you enter the Offworld Battlefield and become my subordinate, don’t bring your arrogance as the number one genius here. You only need to know two things here, and that is to obey and survive! Do you understand?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. Seeing Supreme Blacksource’s indifferent expression, he nodded and said, “Don’t worry, I understand.”","“Yes, this is for your own good.” Supreme Blacksource noticed Jian Wushuang’s expression. Unlike the other geniuses, Jian Wushuang’s face was not filled with disapproval the moment he gave the warning. Thus, his expression softened and he nodded.","“Alright, Rong Ya, bring Jian Wushuang to change into the robes of Team 7.”","“Yes, Captain!”","One of the two Vice-Captains, Supreme Rong Ya, who was a peak Supreme and had short hair, replied respectfully. He then looked at Jian Wushuang and said with a smile, “Supreme Wushuang, this way, please.”","“I’m sorry to trouble you!” Jian Wushuang nodded at him.","After a while, under the guidance of Supreme Rong Ya, Jian Wushuang quickly changed into the clothes of Team 7. Like the others, he wore a plain white robe with the words ‘Team 7’ embroidered in black thread on the chest.","“Supreme Wushuang, please don’t take what Captain just said to heart. He’s a straightforward person, and he didn’t mean to pick on you. Every single one of us who just joined Team 7 received some pointers from him because he was afraid that we’d lose our lives on the battlefield due to our drive and lack of composure,” Supreme Rong Ya said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded to show that he understood.","The two of them chatted as they walked. Basically, it was Supreme Rong Ya who introduced them while Jian Wushuang listened quietly. He nodded from time to time to indicate that he understood.","Jian Wushuang had a good impression of Supreme Rong Ya after their conversation. He did not think that he was overbearing just because his position and cultivation were higher than Jian Wushuang’s. On the contrary, he was rather gentle.","“Alright, Jian Wushuang, your bedroom is in front of us. If there is no war, the team has no restrictions on the individual. You can cultivate in peace. However, if there is a war and you receive a letter from Captain Blacksource, you must gather at once no matter what you have to do. Otherwise, it is not easy to extinguish Captain Blacksource’s thunderous anger.”","After saying that, Supreme Rong Ya handed Jian Wushuang a token and left.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes, pushed open the door of his bedroom, and walked in.","This chamber occupied a large area. In the center of the chamber was a futon with an array drawn beside it. It could help the cultivators sitting on the futon to quickly recover their divine power.","Creak.","Jian Wushuang closed the door and sat on it with his legs crossed. He was deep in thought.","“Since I’m already here, I’ll just take things as they are. The Offworld Battlefield is filled with danger, and even Invincible Supremes face the risk of dying. The level of danger is far beyond what the universe can compare to. Right now, I’m still too weak. I have to think of a way to increase my strength first.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. He then closed his eyes and began to condense his strength in order to break through to the Intermediate Supreme realm.","...","At the same time, Ninth Kalpa King, Long Qing, and the others had also settled down. Among them, Long Qing had even reached the sky with a single step and directly joined Team Three, making up for the position of the fallen Vice-Captain of the third team and becoming the Vice-Captain.","Time flew by, and 60 years passed."]},{"number":4450,"title":"Chapter 4450 The Outbreak of War!","paragraphs":["4450 The Outbreak of War!","At the same time.","A million miles away from the universe camp.","A crack that was like a vertical eye and was about 100 feet long kept twisting. An aura that was completely different from this universe was being taken out of it.","The space in front of the crack had turned into hell.","“Hahahaha, a bunch of weak and pitiful trash!”","A monster with a height of 10,000 meters and a naked upper body laughed madly. It had no head or neck, and its face was on its stomach.","Boom, boom, boom!","Scarlet shockwaves were like bombs that exploded everywhere.","On the left shoulder of this headless monster, there were six long scars that looked like sharp claws. It was particularly evil and ferocious.","“Six... Six Scar-level Void Warrior!”","Team 8, who was in charge of guarding the void crack, let out a scream of extreme shock.","A Five Scar Void Warrior corresponded to a Half Invincible Supreme expert in this universe, while a Six Scar Void Warrior corresponded to an Invincible Supreme expert!","Zerowood Supreme, the Captain of Team 8, held a divine spear that could tear the sky in his hand. His expression was extremely grave.","“Follow my lead!” Zerowood Supreme spoke out coldly in the next moment. Taking a step forward, he transformed into a streak of light that shot toward the headless monster!","“Yes!” Behind him, more than ten Supreme experts suppressed the fear in their hearts and used their own techniques to fly into the sky.","“Eight-Part General, eat this bunch of trash!!”","Upon seeing this, the eyes of the headless monster on its chest flickered with excitement. Taking a heavy step forward, it stretched out its large hand and grabbed at Zerowood Supreme!","Behind him, eight figures walked out side by side from the darkness.","“Hiss, hiss, hiss, it’s really delicious.”","A monster with three snake heads and the lower half of a human’s body stuck out its tongue at the same time.","“Kekeke, the taste of meat is really intoxicating.”","An extremely fat ball-like monster with a cracked mouth that extended all the way to the back of its ears laughed sinisterly.","“Kill! Kill them!”","A strange man who looked like a warrior with bull horns but had thick, sharp fangs roared in excitement. The fighting will in his eyes were crazed to the extreme.","These eight people were all extremely strange. On their left shoulders, several long scars were shining. The one with the least long scars was a man with an extremely pale face and black eye shadow under his eyes. He also had two long scars!","In other words, the weakest of the Eight-Part Generals was an Intermediate Supreme martial artist!","Bang! Bang!","In the next moment, the eight generals’ figures flashed and disappeared behind the headless monster, charging toward Team 8!","“Ah!”","In an instant, countless miserable howls sounded.","An Intermediate Supreme Martial Artist exploded into a mist of blood as the headless monster’s palm brushed past him. His body and soul were destroyed.","The starry sky was dyed red.","“Damn it!”","Zerowood Supreme’s face turned gloomy as the Coiling Dragon Divine Spear in his hand slashed out in all directions. The chilling spear light was enough to cause several tens of stars to explode at the same time!","Boom!","As this spear shot out, a massive hole instantly appeared in the vast sky, while a series of sonic booms instantly rang out. It was as though the spear that Zerowood Supreme had used was not a spear, but a nine-clawed divine dragon that was roaring arrogantly at the heavens and earth.","Under this spear, the entire world would have to bow down!","“Hahaha, good! I’ll eat you!”","The headless monster laughed even louder.","A pitch-black wave of destruction condensed in front of his chest.","“Void– Explosion!!”","...","The universe base.","“Bastard!!!”","The usually amiable expression on the face of Cosmos God was completely different this time around. His eyes were extremely cold.","Cosmos God stood up and looked up at the endless void. In his eyes, countless Great Daos evolved. Dao radiances circulated and formed yin and yang. His gaze pierced through the endless void and saw the tragic battlefield outside the void crack.","A cold voice came out of his mouth.","“Pass on my orders. Teams Six and Seven, head to the Cosmic Rift immediately to reinforce Team 8!”","“Yes, Sir!”","Lan Su’s expression was solemn. He knew that this was a serious matter!","...","Team 7was stationed at the campsite.","In Jian Wushuang’s bedroom.","“Supreme Wushuang, get up immediately and head to the main hall as soon as possible. This is an urgent matter!”","...","A voice rang in Jian Wushuang’s mind like muffled thunder.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a trace of regret flashed across his face.","He was so close to breaking through to the Intermediate Supreme realm!","At that time, his combat strength would have another upgrade!","“Forget it!” Jian Wushuang shook his head. He understood that Supreme Blacksource had summoned them in such a hurry. Something urgent must have happened on the Offworld Battlefield.","Without any delay, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and disappeared from the room as if he had used spatial bending.","...","“Everyone’s here?”","Supreme Blacksource had an unsightly look on his face. He swept his gaze across the faces of the squad members in front of him, and only after seeing that everyone had already gathered did his expression lighten up a little.","“Everyone, Lord Cosmos God has ordered us to rush to the tear in the void immediately! Supreme Blacksource said in a low voice.","As soon as these words fell, everyone could not help but look at each other.","...","“Captain, why is it so urgent this time? Hasn’t that void rift been very stable recently? what happened?” one of the team members asked doubtfully.","Supreme Blacksource turned to look at him upon hearing this. Taking a deep breath, he replied, “There is chaos in the crack in the void. A Six Scar level Void Warrior is leading a team and rushing out!”","“What? Six Scars?”","“It’s been a few chaos cycles since a Six Scar level creature appeared, right?!”","“If I’m not mistaken, Zerowood Supreme’s Team 8should be patrolling the Void Rift right now. Wouldn’t that mean they’re finished?”","Everyone’s expression changed.","Supreme Blacksource’s expression was heavy. Upon hearing this, he nodded and slowly replied, “That’s right. According to the news sent over by Lord Cosmos God, Team 8has almost been completely annihilated. Only Zerowood Supreme, a Vice-Captain, and a few other team members are left defending the place!”","After saying this, Supreme Blacksource took a deep breath and said no more. “Alright, there’s no time to waste. You all should quickly set off with me to reinforce Team 8! Let’s try to kill all the Void Warriors that came out of the Void Rift in the Offworld Battlefield!”","“Yes!” Everyone responded with a loud ‘yes’ and three-inch battle light shot out from their eyes.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes also flickered and his eyes were full of fighting intent.","He remembered that the ‘Devouring Emperor’, who had killed Supreme Tarot, was from the Void Universe. Since he had received Supreme Tarot’s inheritance, he would have to kill the ‘Devouring Emperor’ sooner or later to fulfill Supreme Tarot’s last wish.","Thus, it would be best for him to familiarize himself with the Void Universe’s combat style.","Furthermore...","Jian Wushuang, was also in need of a battle to be the last stepping stone to break through to the Intermediate Supreme realm!","“Let’s go! Suppress the chaos of war!”","Supreme Blacksource waved his hand, transforming into a black wave that soared into the skies and headed straight for the Offworld Battlefield.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang and the others executed their own divine skills and followed closely behind!"]},{"number":4451,"title":"Chapter 4451 Battling the Eight-Part Generals","paragraphs":["4451 Battling the Eight-Part Generals","Boom! Boom! Boom!","“Hahahaha! Go die die die die die die!”","The headless monster laughed maniacally as red shock waves shot out from his palm. These red shock waves were like bombs that exploded in the starry sky, causing the entire sky to shake and be riddled with holes.","Fortunately, this battle happened on the Offworld Battlefield. Otherwise, if it happened in the depths of the universe, with this person’s terrifying power, the entire universe and even thousands of Star Fields would be destroyed by him.","“Damn it.”","Supreme Zerowood was half-kneeling as he stepped on a meteorite, his chest heaving up and down violently. The Coiling Dragon Divine Spear in his hand, which had been refined from the bones and Dragon souls of the Third Generation Dragons, had already been broken into two.","“Captain, what do we do now? We can’t hold on much longer!”","The Vice-Captain of Team Eight, Supreme Qing Guang, said in a low voice.","Supreme Zerowood turned his head to take a look, and his face instantly turned extremely ugly to behold.","Team Eight had almost been completely annihilated. Apart from the Vice-Captain, Supreme Qing Guang, there were only two members left alive. These two were also seriously injured, and their divine bodies were on the verge of collapse. They could die at any moment, and they had no combat power to speak of.","After taking a deep breath, Supreme Zerowood asked in a deep voice, “Is there any news from Lord Cosmos God’s side?”","Supreme Qing Guang nodded his head and quickly replied, “Captain, Lord Cosmos God said that he has already sent out Teams Six and Seven. They are currently on their way here.”","“Sui Xi and Blacksource are coming?” Hearing those words, Supreme Zerowood’s expression relaxed slightly. Taking a deep breath, he spoke out with a voice filled with killing intent, “Hold on for a few more incense sticks. I’m going to bury all these monsters here!”","Boom~!","“Supreme Divine Technique, One Thought Divine Kingdom!”","Supreme Zerowood clenched his fists tightly, causing countless black chains to spread out from him, forming an eternal kingdom!","“Come in!”","Supreme Zerowood made a grabbing motion with his right hand and immediately pulled the Five Scar headless monster into his One Thought Divine Kingdom.","“Kill!”","As for the Vice-Captain, Supreme Qing Guang, his killing intent also burst out. He displayed a Supreme divine ability that could destroy the heavens and earth and blasted it toward the Eight-Part Generals!","...","Thud, thud, thud.","Supreme Blacksource took the lead, walking at the very front. Jian Wushuang and the other 20-plus Supremes followed closely behind, constantly performing teleportation techniques as they leaped and flickered in the void.","About half an incense’s time later.","Buzzzzzz!","Supreme Blacksource stomped his foot forward, causing a white wave to form as he came to a complete halt!","“The Spatial Rift is right in front of us. Everyone, be careful.”","He took a deep breath and looked up.","With one look, he could not help but feel a chill in his heart.","Not far ahead, beside a crack that looked like a vertical eye, it had turned into a purgatory of asura.","A large amount of divine blood floated in the void, and there were divine power fluctuations everywhere after the death of a Supreme. A strange man with three snake heads was biting a Supreme in his mouth, chewing and tearing.","The Supreme martial artist had not died yet. He looked into the distance with a dazed look, his eyes filled with despair.","On the other side.","The headless monster grabbed Supreme Zerowood’s head with its large hand, and it lifted him up as if he were a little chick, repeatedly bombarding him in the air.","“Weak weak weak weak! You guys are too weak!”","The headless monster’s hands pulled viciously, tearing Supreme Zerowood into two and throwing him to the side as if he was a sack.","Crash...","Before Supreme Zerowood’s divine body could be resurrected again, the headless monster had already strode forward. It raised its huge foot and stomped down on Supreme Zerowood’s divine body.","“You dare?!”","Upon seeing this, Supreme Blacksource was instantly enraged.","“Die!”","His right foot stomped down and turned into a pitch-black blade energy that could tear the sky and the earth apart and cut through the sun and moon.","The blade light of his saber crossed a hundred thousand miles, cutting across the galaxy and sweeping away the sun and moon!","Ding! Ding!","In an instant, the saber ruthlessly struck the headless monster’s right leg, which was about to stomp down!","A crescent-shaped blade light flashed, and with a tearing sound, the headless monster’s entire right leg was instantly cut off!","Roar!","The headless monster roared in pain and took a few steps back.","“Zerowood, can you hold on?”","Supreme Blacksource reached out and helped Supreme Zerowood up. Zerowood had just finished regrouping his divine body.","“Blacksource, this guy is very difficult to deal with.” Supreme Zerowood panted slightly, a solemn expression on his face.","“Another one has come.” The eyes of the human face on the chest of the headless monster flickered as it continued to examine Supreme Blacksource.","Fwip!","Countless tentacles poured out of the cut wound on his right leg. Then, with a flash of light, these tentacles condensed into a huge right leg.","...","His injuries instantly recovered.","“Let’s go,” he said.","The headless monster snorted coldly and turned around to enter the Spatial Rift again.","Behind him, the Eight-Part Generals also sneered and shook their heads.","“You still want to leave after killing our people?”","A clear and cold voice resounded in the void.","Then, a thin young man in a white robe walked out from the dark void and cut off the headless monster’s path.","On the back of the white cloak, the big and dazzling words ‘Team Six’ were embroidered with black thread.","The Captain of the sixth team, Supreme Sui Xi, had arrived.","Behind him, more than ten team members slowly walked out side by side.","Nine Stars Saint joined Team Six. He nodded at Jian Wushuang and called him ‘Alliance Master’.","...","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. He knew that it was an urgent matter and it was not the time to chat, so he told him to stay alive.","“Oh?”","The human face on the chest of the headless monster turned around and looked back at Supreme Sui Xi. Then, it turned to look at Supreme Blacksource. Not only was he not afraid, but the corners of his mouth curled up into an excited arc as he laughed in a low voice.","“Interesting, very interesting.”","The next moment!","He suddenly raised his head and laughed wildly, “Eight-Part Generals, eat them!”","Boom!","Countless amounts of energy condensed in the center of his palms, and a huge mouth actually grew out from his palms.","As the mouth opened, a scarlet cannonball of light instantly condensed and shot out toward Supreme Blacksource!","Clang!","Supreme Blacksource swept out with his massive saber, sending a cannonball flying as he coldly snorted, “Team Seveen, kill!”","“Yes, Sir!”","The members of Team Seven roared and used all kinds of divine techniques to kill the Eight-Part Generals!","“Hiss hiss hiss.”","Among the Eight-Part Generals, the monster with three snake heads but a human body suddenly stuck out his tongue and laughed. “There’s more food coming to our door.”","He squinted his eyes, his face full of greed. His dark green pupils twisted and turned, his gaze constantly sweeping across everyone’s faces.","Finally, his eyes fell on Jian Wushuang.","“Interesting. Such a weak little guy dares to come and find trouble with us?”","Bang! Bang!","He took a step with his right foot and suddenly turned into a shadow, rushing toward Jian Wushuang!"]},{"number":4452,"title":"Chapter 4452 Baidu","paragraphs":["4452 Baidu","Pfft!","In just a breath’s time, the three-headed snake monster had already appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. It opened its mouth wide enough to swallow the sun and moon snake and bit at Jian Wushuang fiercely!","Countless foul-smelling gales blew over.","“Four Scars? So he has the strength of a Top Supreme martial artist?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was grave and the Tarot Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","The strength of these Void Warriors far exceeded their corresponding realms. Although this three-headed snake monster was only a Top Supreme martial artist, it was far more terrifying than ordinary Top Supreme realm experts!","Even Jian Wushuang did not dare to let his guard down.","“Slash!”","Just as Jian Wushuang raised the Tarot Divine Sword and prepared to fight the three-headed snake monster, Supreme Rong Ya had already taken the initiative to attack. He swept his right foot across and smashed the three snake heads that were biting at Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, your cultivation realm is still too low. You are no match for him. Leave him to me.”","Supreme Rong Ya glanced at Jian Wushuang and then fixed his gaze on the snake-headed man. His face was filled with fear.","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded and did not refuse.","At this critical moment, it was not the time for him to show off.","“Hiss, hiss, hiss, are you in a hurry to come up and court death?”","The corners of the three-headed snake monster’s mouth curled into a mocking smile as it looked at Supreme Rong Ya. A cruel glint flashed in its eyes.","Supreme Rong Ya was clearly a realm higher, but he did not show the slightest fear. On the contrary, his eyes were filled with greed.","“Baidu, I’ll leave that kid to you.”","The three-headed snake said to the pale-faced young man with black eye shadow.","This person had the weakest cultivation among the eight generals, but he also looked the most like a human.","“Alright,” he said.","Baidu tilted his head. He looked numb and stiff.","Buzz.","Countless black light waves condensed in his hand, forming a thin sword.","The next moment!","Two bursts of void power exploded under Baidu’s feet. He charged forward like a white lightning bolt and struck at Jian Wushuang!","“Void power can be used like this?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and the Tarot Divine Sword slashed down instantly!","Clang!","The Tarot Divine Sword and the sword formed from the void power collided, and the thin void power sword was instantly shattered.","Bang! Bang!","Jian Wushuang twisted his neck and punched out with his right fist. As if he was pushing a sun, countless bright golden lights gathered on his right fist and it landed heavily on Baidu’s face.","Boom!","In an instant, Baidu’s body was sent flying as if he had been hit by a giant hammer. His entire head exploded from the punch!","“Void Warrior, that’s all you’ve got?!”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. Baidu was a Void Warrior with Two Scars, which was equivalent to the power of an Intermediate Supreme. Even if his power was far beyond that of an Intermediate Supreme, he would only be a Top Supreme.","Jian Wushuang no longer took Top Supreme beings seriously.","“Is that so?”","Countless thick tentacles emerged from his neck, and he was back to normal in the blink of an eye.","“Oh? The speed of recovery is much faster than us.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with slight surprise, and then he looked interested. “Come on, let me see how strong you Void Warriors are.”","“Don’t you... let me down!”","Bang!","Jian Wushuang soared into the sky and a majestic sword pressure spread out with him as the center!","...","The battle between the two sides had entered its most intense state!","Supreme Blacksource and Supreme Sui Xi attacked at the same time, killing the headless monster from the front and back!","When two Invincible Supremes joined forces, it was not as simple as one plus one!","Either one of them had the terrifying power to flatten the universe and destroy a force!","At this moment, as the two of them joined forces, the entire starry sky exploded as if the universe was being reconstructed and a chaotic world was being opened up!","There were no words that could describe the power of the two!","In their hands, the sun and the moon were just balls of mud that they could play with their fingers. The galaxy that pressed across the sky was just a stream that flowed under their feet. They could overturn the entire universe with a casual move. Even a slight fraction of the power of their divine techniques was enough to flatten countless stars.","Although the headless monster was strong, it could even be said that it had the ability to suppress either one of the two. However, when the two of them joined forces, it was immediately pushed back and could only roar.","On the battlefield, terrifying divine techniques exploded one after another as saber and sword lights tore through the sky. If someone from the depths of the universe were to see this scene, they would definitely exclaim that this was a world-ending battle!","With the addition of Team Six and Seven, the Eight-Part Generals who had been able to crush the enemy easily were immediately contained and the situation was reversed!","Among them, other than the headless monster, the one with the highest cultivation base was the fat monster with a cracked mouth that reached the ears.","...","The teeth in his mouth were uneven and long, but when he opened his mouth and bit down, he crushed a Supreme divine weapon that was coming at him.","“Hahahaha, Void Explosion!!”","A terrifying purple light wave gushed out of his mouth like lightning, forcing back the five Supreme experts who were attacking him!","The Eight-Part Generals were too powerful. Although each of them was facing several enemies and was firmly suppressed, they were not really in a desperate situation. They could even fight back.","It could be said that any one of the Eight-Part Generals would be an Overlord of a region if they were placed in the depths of the universe!","...","“Sundering stars!”","A 10,000-foot blue sword light condensed in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless as he casually struck down!","The entire sky was being torn apart.","Boom!!!","...","In an instant, the Void Warrior named Baidu was sent flying again.","“H-how can he be so strong?” Baidu’s pupils contracted. This was the first time he had met someone in this universe whose cultivation was lower than him but could still suppress him!","His numb and stiff face was now filled with fear.","Boom!","He leaped up again and the void power in his hand turned into a long sword. In a flash, he appeared above Jian Wushuang’s head and slashed down.","Crash.","However, the sword was caught by Jian Wushuang’s outstretched fingers.","Countless violent void power exploded between Jian Wushuang’s five fingers, but it could not shake him at all.","“I heard that you guys have an accompanying divine ability called ‘Void Explosion’. If you don’t use it now, you won’t have the chance anymore.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and flicked his finger. Boundless power gathered at his fingertip and sent Baidu flying.","He looked down at this person from above, his eyes indifferent.","“Okay, okay, okay, then I’ll do as you wish!”","Baidu struggled to stand up and clenched his fists in front of him.","“Void– Explosion!!!”"]},{"number":4453,"title":"Chapter 4453 Void Explosion","paragraphs":["4453 Void Explosion","Boom!","In an instant, the starry sky suddenly froze!","Immediately, the two long scars on Baidu’s left shoulder glowed with red light. Then, rays of energy flowed out of his body and formed a red ball of light between his palms!","Buzz buzz.","The space around the red ball of light seemed to be squeezed by a huge force and started to shatter.","An extremely strange aura that was completely different from divine power spread out, representing destruction.","“Die!”","The next moment, Baidu raised his head and stared at Jian Wushuang. He pushed his hands forward!","Roar-!!!","In an instant, the red light ball was like a bomb that could destroy the world. It crossed countless spaces and headed straight for Jian Wushuang!","The power of this attack was hundreds of times greater than the energy of this person’s previous attack, and it was even enough to threaten a Half Invincible Supreme!","“Is this the Void Explosion? It’s no wonder that in the same realm, a Void Warrior is much stronger than us cultivators.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and stared at the terrifying red ball that was approaching him at a high speed. His interest grew.","Then, Jian Wushuang made a move that would make everyone go crazy.","He slowly stretched out his hand and grabbed at the terrifying red ball.","“Supreme Wushuang!”","Supreme Rong Ya, who was engaged in an intense battle in the distance, noticed this scene. His expression instantly changed as he shouted, “Supreme Wushuang, dodge!”","The other Eight-Part Generals noticed what was happening. They were surprised that Baidu was forced to use Void Explosion against a Primary Supreme. Then, they sneered.","Jian Wushuang ignored it, squinted his eyes, and continued to reach for the terrifying red ball.","In less than a second, Jian Wushuang’s right hand touched the terrifying red ball.","Boom!!","A violent and twisted power suddenly burst out from Jian Wushuang’s palm!","Craaaash!","Jian Wushuang’s outstretched arm exploded inch by inch.","“Is this the power of the void?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up as he carefully felt the power in the terrifying red ball.","It was a power that was completely different from the Supreme divine power.","Bang bang bang!","Just as the terrifying ball had blown up Jian Wushuang’s entire arm and was about to hit his divine body, Jian Wushuang said, “Suppress!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang activated Chaos Overlord Body to its limit. Divine patterns that looked like twisted tree roots gushed out of the surface of his skin. The purple ‘Chuan’ character between his eyebrows instantly became demonic and dazzling.","Countless Sword Qi burst out from Jian Wushuang’s body!","In an instant, the terrifying round ball that was originally destructive and invincible shattered inch by inch.","Countless divine power evolved on Jian Wushuang’s arm damaged arm and regenerated it.","Jian Wushuang looked at Baidu indifferently and said, “Your divine technique is indeed very powerful. It’s a pity that you’re too weak.”","After he finished speaking, the Tarot Divine Sword reappeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","Jian Wushuang was like an unsheathed divine sword, full of sharp aura.","He could feel that the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand was already restless and ready to draw blood.","“Alright, die.”","The Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand slashed at Baidu!","“No! How can I die at the hands of you low-class cultivators!” Baidu shouted and turned around to rush toward the crack in the void.","“You want to escape?” Jian Wushuang sneered.","“Innate divine ability, Life Intimidation!”","Boom!","In an instant, the pressure of a being of the highest level descended on the area.","Under this pressure, the entire starry sky seemed to stagnate, and time and space seemed to freeze at this moment.","Baidu, who was running away, stopped immediately. He turned his head and looked at Jian Wushuang as if he had found something shocking. His pupils suddenly enlarged and he cried out, “You... why do you have ‘his’ life aura?”","“Hmm? His aura?” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but frown. He took back the Tarot Divine Sword that he had already slashed down.","He stepped in front of Baidu and looked down at him. “Who’s the ‘he’ you’re talking about?”","“You don’t know him?” Baidu was stunned for a moment, as if he was surprised by Jian Wushuang not knowing who he was talking about, but then he burst into laughter.","“Hahahaha, you actually have ‘his’ aura in your body. Pathetic fellow, you’re dead! They’ll come for you!”","“What are you talking about?”","Jian Wushuang frowned. He could feel that the person in front of him was not speaking nonsense. He must know something.","“You want to know?”","At that moment, Baidu was no longer afraid of death. Instead, there was a strange look in his eyes.","...","“Lowly and pitiful fellow, you’re now entangled with ‘him’. You’ll die. No matter where you run to, those lunatics will find you. You’ll definitely die!”","Bang!","With that, Baidu’s body exploded!","At this moment, he actually chose to self-destruct!","A terrifying power exploded and caused a white wave to sweep across the sky. Jian Wushuang retreated and waved his hands repeatedly to push away the shock wave formed by Baidu’s self-explosion.","“What is this person talking about?”","Jian Wushuang stood with his sword in hand, his expression uncertain.","The words that Baidu said before his death were like a curse, echoing in his mind.","“Who is he? Who are those lunatics who wanted to kill me?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered with thoughts.","He was not stupid. He soon realized that Baidu only said that after he used his innate ability, Life Intimidation.","...","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was keenly aware that the man’s first words revealed the words ‘life aura’.","“Life aura, huh?” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. It could be said that his Master, Xuan Yi, had created all his Special Life Form ability.","“Then... the ‘he’ that this person said earlier, is it Master Xuan Yi?”","“Then the lunatics he was talking about, is he the one who chased after master in Nine Luminaries Great Star Field?”","Vaguely, Jian Wushuang seemed to feel that there was an invisible thread controlling everything in the endless darkness.","The owner of the thread was his Master, Xuan Yi.","He was now 100 percent sure that his mysterious Master was definitely inextricably linked to the Void Universe.","Jian Wushuang even felt that there was a hidden meaning behind his Master’s every step.","He began to wonder if his first meeting with Xuan Yi was a coincidence, but in fact, it was all part of his plan.","In addition, Jian Wushuang was most concerned about another question. If his Master was really in the next great battle, what role would he play in the battle?","“Forget it. The most important thing for me now is to improve my strength!”","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang stopped thinking and turned his eyes to look at the battlefield.","As Jian Wushuang finished his battle, the other people’s battles also came to an end."]},{"number":4454,"title":"Chapter 4454 Closing in Step by Step","paragraphs":["4454 Closing in Step by Step","On the battlefield.","The Eight-Part Generals, led by the headless monster, had no choice but to retreat under the pressure by Team Six and Seven.","The headless monster tried to escape a few times, but it was stopped by Supreme Blacksource and Supreme Sui Xi.","One after another, saber gleams that could tear the world apart streaked across the sky, traversed the sun and moon, and suppressed all directions!","Under the combined efforts of Supreme Blacksource and Supreme Sui Xi, the headless monster was gradually forced into a corner and had no way out.","“That useless Baidu was killed!”","The headless monster noticed Jian Wushuang killing Baidu and snorted. It then looked at the three-headed snake and said in a low voice, “Wang Liu, before we retreat, kill the guy with the sword first.”","The three-headed snake was facing the joint attack of two Vice-Captains at the Top Supreme realm. When he heard the order, he nodded. The three heads opened their mouths at the same time and shot out hundreds of light balls, forcing the two people away.","Then, he rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","“Hiss, hiss, hiss. You actually killed Baidu. Looks like I underestimated you.”","The three-headed snake’s green pupils twisted and it let out a strange laugh.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the man with a serious expression.","On this person’s left shoulder, there were four long scars that looked like hideous scratches, reflecting a scarlet light.","The three-headed snake was far more powerful than Baidu!","Jian Wushuang felt as if he had become its prey when the three-headed snake stared at him. All the hair on his body stood up.","“I’ll eat you!”","Bang!","The three-headed snake turned around and disappeared.","When it reappeared, it was already above Jian Wushuang. It opened its huge mouth and bit down fiercely!","“It’s so fast!” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly and he instantly slashed out with the Tarot Divine Sword.","An earth-shaking roar was heard as the sword energy struck the three-headed snake’s huge mouth!","Bang bang bang!","It was as if a bomb had exploded in the three-headed snake’s mouth. However, the three-headed snake did not seem to feel any pain when it was hit by the sword light. Instead, it bit down hard and swallowed the sword light into its stomach.","“No wonder you were able to kill Baidu. Your sword strike’s power is already at the level of Three Scars.”","The three-headed snake sneered and changed the topic, “If I’m not wrong, you must be a Heaven’s Favorite-level figure in this universe, right?”","Jian Wushuang did not speak. Instead, he gathered all his Supreme divine power and was ready to attack.","“Oh, you’re so boring.” The three-headed snake curled its lips when Jian Wushuang ignored it. Then, its dark green pupils shrank into a thin line and endless void power burst out from its body!","“Alright, let me eat you!”","Boom~!","The void power on the three-headed snake exploded again. It opened its huge mouth that could Swallow the sun, moon, and stars and bit at Jian Wushuang fiercely!","“Tarot Sword Manual, second move, Daybreak!”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was cold as he turned into a ray of golden light and slashed at the three-headed snake!","The sword was so sharp that it could cut the Milky Way and split Mount Buzhou!","Boom~!","The two of them collided with each other, and the power of the Tarot Divine Sword exploded. In an instant, the middle head of the three-headed snake was cut by half by a golden line, from its mouth to its tail!","This time, the three-headed snake could not hold it in any longer and let out a low groan of pain.","Jian Wushuang’s figure appeared behind the three-headed snake. He did not look proud at all even though he had cut the three-headed snake in half. Instead, his face grew more solemn.","“Tarot Sword Manual, third move, Dusk!”","Boom!","In an instant, the sword technique of Dusk was activated by Jian Wushuang. With Jian Wushuang as the center, a huge pit appeared under Jian Wushuang’s feet and then spread!","A strong suction force came from the center of the pit and instantly pulled the three-headed snake into it!","“Bury!” Jian Wushuang’s five fingers that were spread out suddenly clenched!","In an instant, the force of heaven and earth suddenly exploded from the pit. The force of the collision was so majestic that it could instantly crush a Top Supreme expert into meat paste!","At this moment, the three-headed snake, which was still roaring angrily, was suddenly filled with fear.","In this pit, he was like an earthworm trapped in a huge millstone, his body was instantly crushed thousands of times!","In the distance, the headless monster, who had been forced into a dead end, noticed this scene, and its expression instantly turned extremely ugly.","For the first time, he looked at Jian Wushuang with respect.","As for Supreme Blacksource and Supreme Sui Xi, they also saw Jian Wushuang suppressing the three-headed snake, and their eyes flashed with a strange light.","“Blacksource, it seems that a monster has appeared in your team.”","Supreme Sui Xi smiled.","With the two of them working together, the headless monster had already used all its tricks. Now, it was an arrow at the end of its flight, so it was rare for him to relax a little.","“He can’t be considered a monster. He’s just a little more talented than others. He still needs more experience.”","There was no change in Supreme Blacksource’s expression. However, he was also surprised by Jian Wushuang’s battle prowess.","“Is that so?” Supreme Sui Xi looked at Supreme Blacksource with a smile that was not a smile and said, “Blacksource, why don’t you transfer him to my Team Six?”","...","“Get lost.”","Supreme Blacksource glared at him without the slightest hesitation, then groaned, “Let’s not talk about this. Let’s kill this headless monster first.”","Supreme Sui Xi nodded her head and looked at the headless monster again. Her face was cold.","Even though she had guarded the Offworld Battlefields for thousands of chaos cycles, she had only seen a few Six Scar monsters.","This was a big fish, and she definitely could not let it go!","“Divine technique, One Qi for Three Purities.”","Whoosh!","In an instant, three figures that were exactly the same as Supreme Sui Xi walked out from his body.","...","On the other side.","“Void Explosion!”","...","The three-headed snake, Wang Liu, felt the terrifying pressure in the dusk pit. Without any hesitation, it used its innate divine technique, the Void Explosion!","In an instant, the two heads of the three-headed snake, Wang Liu, exploded.","After the two snake heads exploded, they turned into pure void power energy and rushed toward the head in the middle.","Roar!","The three-headed snake, Wang Liu, opened its mouth and a beam of light as thick as a bucket was instantly shot out!","This terrifying light wave was extremely powerful. The moment it appeared, it pierced through the twilight pit and left a long black scar in the void.","After piercing through the twilight pit, the terrifying light wave shot toward Jian Wushuang again!","“Come!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and clenched the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand. The battle intent in his eyes turned into sparks and flickered to the extreme!","“Break!!!” Jian Wushuang roared and divine power that was tens of thousands of times more powerful than that of an ordinary Supreme surged into his hands.","“Slash!”","In an instant, the Tarot Divine Sword transformed into a heaven-splitting sword rainbow that cut through the sun, moon, and stars!","Under this strike, the Tarot Divine Sword trembled madly and let out a sound that was like the low chanting of Buddha and the weeping of gods and demons.","Boom!!!","Suddenly, the sword cut straight into Wang Liu’s Void Explosion wave!"]},{"number":4455,"title":"Chapter 4455 The Descent of Void God","paragraphs":["4455 The Descent of Void God","Boom!","In an instant, two huge shock waves spread out from the center of their battle!","The entire void exploded inch by inch!","Even the other Supreme martial artists who were fighting in the distance were thrown off their feet by the shock wave and retreated.","In an instant, the Tarot Divine Sword’s dragon-like sword rainbow was locked in a stalemate with this strange light wave.","Roar!","Wang Liu opened his mouth and roared again. The strange light wave in his mouth grew in power again, getting gradually thicker.","Pfft!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang was sent flying and the white robe representing Team Seven was torn apart.","“Void Warriors are indeed very strong.” Jian Wushuang stepped on the void and left two long traces in the air.","He could not help but pant slightly. This Wang Liu was a Four Scar Void Warrior, which meant that he was equivalent to a Top Supreme in his universe. In terms of strength, he was even more terrifying than the Half Invincible Supreme Yuding that he had fought before.","The twilight pit was broken into pieces inch by inch. Wang Liu walked out step by step, his eyes flashing with killing intent.","“Despicable and weak trash, bugs! You’ve completely angered me! You should die!”","After Wang Liu finished his words, his face was filled with madness as he wanted to kill Jian Wushuang.","However, at this moment.","The headless monster’s earth-shaking roar came from afar.","Supreme Blacksource stood there in the air, an aura of unparalleled might erupting from him as he barked out coldly, “Divine technique, Abyss Half Moon Slash!!!”","Boom!","In an instant, the huge black blade in his hand expanded with the wind. In just half a breath’s time, it had expanded to a full 10,000 feet long, turning into a lightning black dragon with bared fangs and brandished claws. It opened its fangs and directly chopped down on the headless monster’s left shoulder!","Rip!","The headless monster was directly torn apart by the blade, and countless drops of divine blood fell.","Supreme Sui Xi followed closely behind. Her movements were not slow at all, and she also used her killing move.","“Divine technique, Five Spirit Sacred Armor!”","Boom!","In an instant, countless meteors condensed out of thin air and fell like rain!","Bang bang bang!","The two of them joined forces and attacked. After a round of attacks, the headless monster’s body exploded continuously, turning into countless pieces of minced meat.","It had to be said that the Void Warriors from the Void Universe were extremely powerful. If they were ordinary cultivators, even if they were Invincible Supremes, they would have died long ago after facing the destructive attacks of Supreme Blacksource and Supreme Sui Xi.","The countless pieces of flesh floating in the void started to grow tentacles again.","In just a breath’s time, the tentacles merged together and turned back into a headless monster.","He panted heavily, and his aura had weakened significantly. The eyes of the human face on his chest were fixed on Supreme Blacksource and Supreme Sui Xi.","“Hehe...”","“Hehehe...”","He let out a low and eerie laugh and immediately said, “You can’t kill me.”","“Is that so?”","Supreme Blacksource and Supreme Sui Xi were expressionless as they walked toward the headless monster.","The headless monster’s lips curled into a mocking smile.","Then, the headless monster suddenly released an extremely powerful pressure.","This pressure did not belong to him. The moment this pressure was released, Supreme Blacksource and Supreme Sui Xi’s expressions changed drastically!","The power of this pressure was far above them.","They were very familiar with this pressure!","At the same time, the headless monster closed its eyes, and its expression became pious as it chanted in a low voice, “Great Void God, I’m your citizen, Ahlaa...”","A magical low moan came out of his mouth.","The three-headed snake, Wang Liu, who had been charging at Jian Wushuang with a furious look, gave up after giving Jian Wushuang an unwilling look. He stopped and started to chant in silence like a headless giant, “Great Void God, I am your citizen, Wang Liu...”","At the same time, the other members of the Eight-Part Generals, the ball-shaped monster with a mouth that stretched to its lower jaw, the bull-horned warrior with thick fangs...","The Eight-Part Generals began to silently recite this magical incantation.","An extremely terrifying aura gushed out of their bodies.","Under this aura, be it Invincible Supremes like Blacksource and Sui Xi, or Jian Wushuang, they felt as if they had fallen into an ice cellar. A great horror of life and death surged up, enough to suffocate people.","Bang! Bang!","Muffled sounds came from the crack in the void.","Hualala.","Immediately after that, the piercing sound of iron chains sliding across the floor could be heard.","“What’s going on?”","Jian Wushuang suddenly felt a strong throbbing in his heart. It was an instinctive feeling that made him want to escape from this place immediately.","...","It was as if an indescribable, terrifying existence was about to descend upon the world!","“Bang bang bang!”","The muffled sound grew louder and louder, as if the Thunder God was angry and smashed the giant hammer in his hand!","Boom!","Suddenly, the crack in the void exploded!","An extremely huge pitch-black arm bound by countless chains suddenly stretched out of the crack in the void!","No words could be used to describe the black arm. The arm was so big that it completely exceeded Jian Wushuang’s imagination.","A fingernail alone was dozens of times larger than the sun, and a palm alone could cover several Star Fields!","A vast, evil, and ancient aura burst out and turned into black clouds.","Just the arm alone was so huge. It was hard to imagine how big the owner of the arm was!","“This is?”","...","In an instant, Supreme Blacksource and Supreme Sui Xi were overwhelmed with shock, and their eyes were filled with shock.","Jian Wushuang almost fell from the sky. He felt as if he had fallen into an icehouse and his liver and guts turned cold.","This was definitely one of the most terrifying existences he had ever met!","“This is the arm that had fought with Lord Cosmos God back then!”","In the distance, the Captain of Team Eight, Supreme Zerowood, who had been rapidly recovering from his injuries, was immediately interrupted and cried out in shock.","Boom!","The next moment, the arm was raised high and slammed down on Jian Wushuang and the others!","“Run!!!”","Without any hesitation, both Jian Wushuang and Supreme Blacksource unleashed all the divine power in their bodies and turned into countless rays of light that shot out in all directions.","However, some people’s reactions were a step too slow.","Bang!","The two senior Supreme martial artists had just flown up in streaks of light, and their palms had already slammed down fiercely!","The void within a million miles shattered at the same time!","Hundreds and thousands of mushroom clouds rose from the gaps between his fingers!","“No!”","The two senior Supreme martial artists only had time to let out a roar of shock and anger before they were smashed into dust, their bodies and souls destroyed!","Boom!","Then, the arm was raised again, and five fingers as thick as the Milky Way slammed forward!","This time, the palm quickly wrapped Jian Wushuang and the others!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically."]},{"number":4456,"title":"Chapter 4456 The Arrival of Cosmos God","paragraphs":["4456 The Arrival of Cosmos God","At the same time.","The main palace of the base in the Offworld Battlefield.","Cosmos God sat on the main seat with his eyes closed in deep thought.","His two disciples, Lan Su and Lan Lan, stood by his side and remained silent.","!!","All of a sudden, Cosmos God statue seemed to have sensed something, and it abruptly opened its eyes.","“Void God has appeared!”","He raised his head and stared at the crack in the void. His eyes pierced through the billions of miles of space and saw the huge black arm!","Hearing this, the two disciples, Lan Su and Lan Lan, were shocked.","Void God! That was was someone who had fought with Master before!","“Little Su, Little Lan, you guys guard the base.”","The expression of Cosmos God was heavy. His shoulders trembled slightly before he disappeared from the main hall.","After Cosmos God left, Lan Su and Lan Lan could not help but look at each other. Their hearts started to sink.","...","The Offworld Battlefield.","Rumble!","The entire starry sky had been blown up. The headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals under it stood in their original positions, staring at this scene with sparks of excitement in their eyes!","The second palm strike from the pitch-black arm had already arrived!","In an instant, Qi waves surged and countless Qi activities surged. The world seemed to have fallen into doomsday and was about to be destroyed.","Jian Wushuang, who was running away quickly, felt his vision go dark. When he looked up again, he saw a broad palm covering the sky and replacing the vast sky.","“No!!!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with anger. An unprecedented sense of life-and-death crisis kept ringing in his body, like an alarm bell, telling him to leave quickly!","Clang!","The Tarot Divine Sword appeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand in an instant.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang no longer held back. All the divine power in his body exploded!","Boom boom boom boom!!!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang slashed out thousands of white swords lights to block the palm.","However, it was useless. Everything was useless!","The sword radiances that could cut down monstrous beings in the universe were like mosquito bites when they fell on the palm. They could not be stopped at all.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang did not intend to stay where he was. Instead, he took advantage of the impact force generated by the sword light to retreat quickly and leave the attack area of the palm.","“Tarot Sword Manual, fifth move, Tarot!”","Under the pressure of this life-and-death crisis, Jian Wushuang had gone completely mad and brazenly used his most powerful unique skill!","Boom!","In an instant, the indomitable phantom of Supreme Tarot appeared behind Jian Wushuang.","The phantom was as big as a star, but in front of the arm, it was only the size of a finger. It was extremely small.","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang shouted with all his strength.","In an instant, he held the Tarot Divine Sword and slashed down. The phantom behind him followed like a shadow and did the same action as Jian Wushuang.","A towering and surging sword essence soared into the sky. This Tarot sword strike, which had defeated the Half Invincible Supreme Bing Ye, slashed down on the palm that was pressing down inch by inch in the blink of an eye!","Buzz!","The Tarot Divine Sword directly exploded on the black palm, forming a mushroom cloud the size of a star.","The palm was still majestic and unmoving as it quickly descended.","Jian Wushuang’s vision turned into darkness and the whole world was filled with the palm.","Fortunately, the air blast from the Tarot Divine Sword attack directly formed a terrifying shock wave and spread out. Jian Wushuang was extremely fast, but the shock wave caused him to fly even faster!","Boom!","Finally, the palm landed.","At this critical moment, Jian Wushuang brazenly used all kinds of secret skills that could improve his cultivation in a short time and increased his speed to another level!","Just as the palm was about to land, Jian Wushuang roared and rolled to avoid the palm.","The fingertips of the arm fell with a loud bang when they were less than a thousand feet away from Jian Wushuang.","Nine Stars Saint was also caught in the palm and he was several meters behind Jian Wushuang. He was not so lucky. His desperate roar stopped abruptly and he was turned into dust.","“Alliance Master...”","At the last moment of his death, he looked at Jian Wushuang with eyes full of fear and desire, as if he wanted Jian Wushuang to save him.","“Nine Stars–!!!!!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were instantly filled with anger.","The Nine Stars Saint was a core member of the Sword Alliance and one of the most important people on the Ancient Path of Stars.","...","Thump!","However, before Jian Wushuang could do anything, the monstrous air billow that came from the palm had already formed a shock wave and sent him flying.","Like a broken gunny sack, Jian Wushuang drew a long arc in the air and fell far away.","Pfft!","Jian Wushuang struggled to stand up from the ground. He could not suppress the blood in his mouth and spat it out.","Jian Wushuang stared at the place where the palm was falling and his face was extremely gloomy.","Whoosh.","And that palm had already been raised again.","Under the palm, nearly ten Supreme martial artists had turned into dust and smoke. They had completely fallen.","Bang! Bang!","This demonic god-like palm slowly lifted up, and thick, pitch-black demonic Qi swirled around his five fingers.","...","The third palm strike came.","This palm completely covered everyone.","Supreme Blacksource and the others could not help but feel their scalps go numb as they watched this palm strike.","More people’s hearts were like dead ashes, and they completely gave up on resisting.","Jian Wushuang’s face was extremely gloomy. The sword move, ‘Tarot’, had completely drained all of his divine power.","It was already difficult for him to launch another attack, let alone escape from the attack range of the palm.","In the distance, the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals looked at this scene, and cruel smiles appeared on their faces.","“Great Lord Void God, end the lives of this group of trash.”","Boom~!","The giant hand, which was bound by black chains and had dark and shriveled skin, lifted up again and slapped down for the third time.","Everyone gave up.","Except for Jian Wushuang!","“No! I won’t die here! Never!” Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and his eyes were filled with madness.","He flipped his right hand and the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron appeared in his hand.","He was going to detonate the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron!","He wanted to control the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron to self-destruct and stop this palm!","All of this was too crazy and too shocking!","No one could imagine the effects of a Supreme Great Ancestral Weapons’s self-destruction!","“Hiss!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and looked at the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron in his hand. He could not bear to see it.","However, in just a breath’s time, this trace of reluctance was replaced by madness and determination!","Rumble!!","This palm was getting closer and closer.","It covered the sky and the sun.","The strong wind caused Jian Wushuang’s black hair to fly in the air. The pressure from the giant palm had already cracked Jian Wushuang’s chaotic domineering body like a spider web.","“It’s time!”","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to detonate the Wuxu chaotic cauldron.","“Impudent!”","As if the Chaos Immortal King had opened his mouth, an old voice, which seemed to have traveled through the primeval universe and the ancient yellow times, suddenly exploded in the starry sky!"]},{"number":4457,"title":"Chapter 4457 Defeating the Enemy","paragraphs":["4457 Defeating the Enemy","Buzzzzzz!","After the voice exploded, all the people raised their heads and looked over.","They saw an extremely fast white waterfall that they could not even see with their eyes. It instantly streaked across their eyes.","Whoosh!","!!","Everyone only felt a blur before their eyes, and then the waterfall appeared above their heads.","It was an old man with white hair and a white beard.","Behind him, lotus flowers bloomed.","“Lord Cosmos God!”","“Lord Cosmos God is here!!”","“We’re saved!!!”","In an instant, everyone’s faces were filled with ecstasy.","It was the ecstasy of surviving a disaster.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank. He immediately put the self-exploding Chaos Wuxu Cauldron back into his Interspatial Ring.","Buzz!","After the appearance of the Cosmos God, a series of violent sounds could be heard from the crack in the void.","“Void God, you’ve crossed the line.”","Cosmos God was expressionless. He extended his finger and tapped out at that apocalyptic palm.","This finger was very ordinary.","Even though Jian Wushuang gathered all the divine power in his body and focused it in his eyes, he could not see anything special about the finger.","However, it was this finger that gently touched the center of the pitch-black palm, but it made the giant palm that had been crushing all the way unable to advance an inch further!","“Pierce!”","A cold voice rang out from Cosmic God.","The next moment!","Boom!","In an instant, countless bright radiances exploded. The Great Dao directly materialized and turned into a rolling deity wheel. At the tip of this finger, the six Daos of reincarnation rose, Immortal birds and cranes circled, and true dragons and phoenixes roared!","Suddenly, endless celestial light fell, and countless starlight surrounded his body. The Great Dao sometimes turned into the huge Yin-Yang Eight Trigrams, and sometimes into the rolling yellow spring. It was as if the whole world was condensed in this finger!","Roar!","“Arghh!” A shrill roar came from the other side of the crack in the void.","Immediately after, the palm began to retract at an extremely fast speed as if it had been electrocuted.","Swish!","In an instant, the Eight-Part Generals, led by the headless monster, were blown into pieces by the aftershock of this finger.","The huge arm grabbed the minced meat of the Eight-Part Generals and pulled them back into the crack in the void.","Chi chi chi.","After a few seconds, the pile of minced meat gathered together and turned back into the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals.","“Damn it!”","“We will be back!”","“Hiss, hiss, hiss, the guy with the sword, you’re lucky this time, but you won’t be so lucky next time.”","The aura of the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals had weakened to the extreme. However, even so, there was not a hint of fear on their faces. Instead, they looked at the Cosmos God with provocative expressions.","The three-headed snake, Wang Liu, looked at Jian Wushuang with a cruel look and sneered.","Whoosh!","In just a breath’s time, the black arm wrapped around the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals and retreated back into the crack in the void.","Everyone looked at each other. They rejoiced that they had survived the disaster, but more than that, they felt a strong sense of grievance.","“Do you think you can just come and go whenever you like?”","This time around, the usually mild-mannered Cosmos God was devoid of any expression. He was as cold as a block of ice.","It was only to see his figure sway, and his entire person disappeared once more. He actually took a step and charged into the crack in the void!","“Lord Cosmos God!”","In an instant, countless people’s hearts tightened.","No one would have expected that Cosmos God would actually charge into the tear in the void!","“There’s no need to worry. Since Lord Cosmos God dared to head to the other universe, he naturally has the confidence to return.”","Supreme Blacksource swept the crowd with his gaze as he spoke in a low voice.","Supreme Sui Xi also took a deep breath and said slowly, “The owner of that arm earlier is the strongest being in the Void Universe. Since he dared to cross the line to kill us, Lord Cosmos God can naturally go over and kill them too.”","“Everyone, please calm down and wait quietly.”","When everyone heard this, they could not help but look at each other, then nodded and no longer spoke.","To be honest, the battle with the Eight-Part Generals was already overwhelming. However, the appearance of the giant arm instantly reversed the situation and began the massacre.","...","It was like an adult suddenly intervening in a fight between two families’ children.","Everyone’s heart was filled with grievance.","Fortunately, Cosmos Gods had arrived.","Roar!!!","Bang bang bang!","A huge explosion came from the crack in the void.","About half an incense’s time later, Cosmos God rushed out from within.","In his hands, he carried the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals.","His face was slightly pale. The incompatibility between the two universes was too great. The higher the cultivation base, the stronger the incompatibility, and the more he would be rejected by the different universes.","Even he could not stay in the Void Universe for too long, so he had to leave.","“Lord Cosmos God has returned!”","...","“Lord Cosmos God, are you alright?”","Everyone chimed in and quickly stepped forward.","“This old master is fine.” The Cosmos God shook his head and looked at the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals that were sealed by a secret technique.","In the hands of Cosmos God, the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals, which were extremely difficult to deal with previously, were as weak as infants.","“Retrieval.”","The gaze of the Cosmos God turned cold. He immediately executed his great divine technique and squeezed the Eight-Part Generals and the headless monster into a pearl the size of a pigeon egg.","“You want to leave after killing someone? Did I give you permission?”","Cosmos God shook his head and turned his gaze toward Supreme Blacksource and the others. “Team Six, stay behind and guard the Spatial Rift. The rest of you, come back with me.”","Everyone looked at the Eight-Part Generals and the headless monster that had been captured by the Cosmos Gods and felt as if they had let out a breath of turbid air. They were extremely pleased.","“Yes!”","Thus, everyone agreed.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Under the lead of Cosmos Gods, everyone turned into streams of light and headed toward the main camp.","Jian Wushuang’s face was expressionless, but his heart was as heavy as a heavy stone.","The tragedy of the Offworld Battleground was far beyond his imagination.","One had to know that in the depths of the universe, Supremes could suppress an area and command several Star Fields. There was almost nothing that could threaten the life of Supremes.","However, on the Offworld Battlefield, the lives of Supreme martial artists were like grass. If they were not careful, they would die.","In the battle just now, the total number of Supreme experts who had died in Team Six, Seve, and Eight had far exceeded the number on the fingers of two hands.","Thud!","A big hand was placed on Jian Wushuang’s shoulder.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and saw that Supreme Blacksource was looking at him.","“Alright, this is your first battle in the Offworld Battleground. Relax. It’s common for Supremes to die here. Even for me, I might die one day.”","He patted his shoulder.","A faint smile appeared on Supreme Blacksource’s lips as he changed the subject. “You did well this time. You can go back now.”","“Yes.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, took a step forward, and turned into a soaring sword light. He quickly headed toward the base camp."]},{"number":4458,"title":"Chapter 4458 The Return","paragraphs":["4458 The Return","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh!","Streaks of light streaked across the vast starry sky.","Along the way, no one said a word and kept silent.","He had won this battle, but it had been too tragic and moving.","!!","Jian Wushuang was expressionless and also silent. Nine Stars Saint’s desperate gaze before his death kept replaying in his mind.","He was not particularly close to Nine Stars Saint, but he would remember Nine Stars Saint’s help with the disciples of the Nine Stars Holy Land when the Six Forces besieged the Divine Life Palace.","“Void God...”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and a murderous intent flashed in his eyes.","...","A moment later.","They had arrived at the base camp outside the outer region battlefield.","Other than Team 6, which was left to patrol the spatial Rift, the Captains of the other teams all brought their team members and stood at the entrance of the main camp to welcome everyone.","It was obvious that they already knew about the war that had broken out on the Offworld Battlefield.","It was the first time Jian Wushuang had seen a member of Team 9.","Everyone walked into the base camp step by step and nodded slightly to the members of Team 8 as a form of greeting.","Jian Wushuang walked at the back. Just as he was about to step into the base camp, he stopped.","“It’s him?”","Jian Wushuang frowned and looked at the second team.","The Captain of the second team was Great Void Divine Emperor, whom he had met once in the Great Void Temple!","“I didn’t expect him to be the Captain of Team 2!”","“Oh? This guy is here too?” Great Void Divine Emperor also saw Jian Wushuang and he raised his eyebrows.","Every once in a while, Cosmos God would transfer a group of Supremes from the universe to the Offworld Battlefield. If he had not seen Jian Wushuang today, he would not have known that Jian Wushuang had come to the Offworld Battlefield.","Standing beside Great Void Divine Emperor was Supreme Bing Ye, who had already recovered from his injuries. He was wearing the Vice-Captain’s white robe. He also saw Jian Wushuang and his body trembled.","“Jian Wushuang! It’s Jian Wushuang!”","Then, he lowered his head, and a hysterical and sick smile appeared on his face.","“Very good! Jian Wushuang, I didn’t expect you to come to the Offworld Battlefield. Hehehe, it’s time for us to settle our scores!”","His chest heaved up and down violently as he laughed wildly, but he did not make a single sound.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes swept across Supreme Bing Ye’s face and the corners of his mouth curled into a cold smile.","Very good, his greatest enemies were all in the Offworld Battlefield!","The hatred between them had long reached the point where they would not rest until one of them was dead. Unless one of them died, this hatred would continue.","Thud!","Jian Wushuang lifted his foot and continued to walk forward.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re really lucky. You survived even when Void God attacked.”","An ear-piercing sound rang in Jian Wushuang’s ears.","Jian Wushuang turned his head and saw Long Qing, the Vice-Captain of Team 3 in a white robe, spreading his hands and speaking with a mocking expression.","Before Jian Wushuang could reply, Long Qing shook his head and said with a smile, “But it’s fine. It seems like the heavens are prepared to let you die in my hands.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang glanced at him and then ignored him. He walked forward step by step.","There was still a lot of time, and he would naturally get rid of these enemies one by one.","He walked into the main palace.","Cosmos God was already seated on the main seat, holding the headless monster and the pearl condensed from the Eight-Part Generals in his hands.","He swept his gaze across everyone’s faces. With a wave of his right hand, a warm-colored radiance was released from Cosmos God’s hand and sprinkled on everyone.","In an instant, the injuries on everyone’s bodies rapidly recovered, and the exhausted divine power in their bodies recovered at a rapid rate.","“We thank you, Cosmos God!”","Immediately, everyone cupped their hands.","“It’s fine! It’s been hard on all of you this time.” Cosmos God nodded.","Following that, Cosmos God waved his right hand once more. The small bead in his hand rose into the air and left his palm.","Whoosh!","The next moment, the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals’ figures expanded in the wind and stood in the hall.","“Damned old thing!!!”","“Kill!”","Instantly, the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals’ faces were filled with ferocity, and they were about to shout and kill.","However, with the presence of a Cosmos God, what could they do?","Whoosh.","With an indifferent expression, Cosmos God flicked his finger. Instantly, Immortal radiance shot out from his hand and turned into a cage, trapping the headless monster and the Eight-Part Generals.","...","Within the cage, the headless monster rammed into the cage a few times. After realizing that it was completely unable to shake the cage, it turned to Cosmos God and licked its lips.","“Cosmos God, you kept us here until now because you want to know about Lord Void God, right?”","Cosmos God did not say anything.","The headless monster shook its head and said, “So what if I tell you? It wouldn’t be long before Lord Void God undid the seal and led an army to flatten this universe! At that time, not only will you die, but everyone in the hall will not be able to escape! The billions of living beings in your universe will become our slaves, hahahaha!”","At this point, the headless monster laughed out loud. His face was filled with savagery, and there was no trace of fear.","“You’re looking for death!”","The expression of Cosmos God turned stern. With a flick of his finger, the headless monster’s body began to melt inch by inch. In just a few breaths’ time, its body and spirit were completely destroyed!","Following that, Cosmos God flicked his fingers continuously, and the Eight-Part Generals began to die one by one.","In front of a Cosmos God, be it the headless monster or the Eight-Part Generals, there was no difference. It was just like how Jian Wushuang and the others were faced with the pitch-black arm. They had no power to resist at all.","Bang bang bang!","A series of muffled sounds could be heard. Soon, the Eight-Part Generals were all dead, leaving only the gloomy-faced three-headed snake Wang Liu.","...","Just as Cosmos God was about to kill him, the three-headed snake, Wang Liu, suddenly spoke, “I can tell you about the Void Gods and even the deployment that our universe has for you, but I have a condition.”","Hearing this, Cosmos God frowned and said indifferently, “What condition?”","Upon hearing this, the three-headed snake, Wang Liu, revealed a cruel smile and his green pupils turned.","The next moment, he looked at Jian Wushuang.","“I want to fight with this man. Life or death, it’s up to fate!”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone was shocked.","Whoosh...","Everyone looked at Jian Wushuang.","Cosmos God took a glance at Jian Wushuang before looking back at the three-headed snake, Wang Liu. He shook his head and said, “No, change your condition.”","However, the three-headed snake, Wang Liu, shrugged and shook his head. “That’s a pity. Come, kill me. ”","“You think I won’t?”","Cosmos God snorted coldly when he heard that. Dao light circulated on his fingertips as he was about to kill him.","At this moment.","“Fight me? I agree.”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and said expressionlessly."]},{"number":4459,"title":"Chapter 4459 Battling Wang Liu","paragraphs":["4459 Battling Wang Liu","“I accept this battle!”","When Jian Wushuang took a step forward and said this, the whole place fell silent.","Everyone looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze.","“Master, you can’t! Jian Wushuang is a Heaven’s Favorite of our universe. If anything happens to him, it will be a great loss for our universe!”","!!","Supreme Blacksource’s eyes flickered as well. “You can’t do this! Jian Wushuang is only a Primary Supreme, while the three-headed snake is already a Void Warrior with Four Scars. According to the exchange of realms, it is already a Top Supreme. With the addition of the Void Explosion, it is comparable to a Half Invincible Supreme!”","Everyone urged.","At this moment, a voice that seemed out of place rang out in the hall.","“What’s wrong? Once we know about the deployment of the Void Universe, we can respond in advance and even wait for them to come. This is a matter of great importance. What’s wrong with letting Jian Wushuang fight? In my opinion, even if Jian Wushuang were to take the initiative to die, he would be doing the universe a great service, let alone letting him fight.”","The person who spoke was none other than the Supreme expert from Cosmos Temple who had joined Team 6.","Rustle, rustle, rustle.","Instantly, many gazes fell on him.","The Vice-Captain of Team 6, Supreme Rong Ya, sneered. “Your words are so nice, then why don’t you take his place and die? As far as I know, Jian Wushuang got to where he is all by himself. He doesn’t owe anyone anything, right? What do you mean by doing a great service?”","“I...”","Immediately, the Supreme expert from Cosmos divine Palace opened his mouth and thought for a long time before he grunted. “This three-headed snake, Wang Liu, didn’t specifically look for me.”","When everyone heard that, they could not help but laugh. Just as they were about to say something, Cosmos God shook his head and said, “Alright, be quiet.”","Only then did everyone shut up.","Cosmos God looked at Jian Wushuang and asked in a deep voice, “Little Guy, if you were to fight him, how confident are you in winning?”","Jian Wushuang laughed and stretched out his hand. He grabbed at the void and said firmly, “100 percent!”","“Alright!” Upon hearing this, the eyes of the Cosmos God gleamed. He nodded and said, “Jian Wushuang, I’ll let you represent our universe in this battle!”","The others still wanted to say something, but seeing that Cosmos God had already made up his mind and Jian Wushuang also looked as if he had made a solemn vow, they could only nod and say no more.","On the other hand, when Wang Liu heard this, the corners of his mouth suddenly opened and he pulled out a cold smile.","“Oh, I seem to have been underestimated?”","Slurp.","Wang Liu’s forked tongue licked the corner of his mouth, and his dark green eyes narrowed with a trace of cruelty.","“Alright, I’ll arrange the battlefield for you.”","Cosmos God casually tore out a tear in the void, forming a Divine Kingdom.","The Divine Kingdom had blue skies and vast lands, lofty mountains, vast oceans, lakes, rivers, and mountains. It had everything.","This ability to easily split the heavens and create the world was truly amazing.","Following that, Cosmos God extended his right hand and grabbed Wang Liu out of thin air, throwing him into the Divine Kingdom battlefield.","“Thank you, Cosmos God.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at him, then took a step forward and turned into a flowing light, shooting into the Divine Kingdom battlefield.","In the hall, Jian Wushuang and Wang Liu’s figures disappeared. Instead, a scroll of mountains and rivers appeared. In the scroll, Jian Wushuang and Wang Liu were in the Divine Kingdom battlefield.","“Let’s wait and see. Since Jian Wushuang said that he was 100 percent confident, he won’t be wrong.” Cosmos God spoke indifferently.","Everyone responded respectfully and raised their heads to look at the scene with serious expressions.","...","Within the Divine Kingdom Battlefield.","Jian Wushuang and Wang Liu were standing on the surface of a big lake with their hands behind their backs.","The two of them did not waste any time talking and immediately started the battle!","Bang!","Jian Wushuang took a step with his right foot and the entire lake was overturned, forming a huge wave that reached a height of 1,000 feet!","In the middle of the waves, Jian Wushuang held the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand. He turned into a blue sword light and rushed out!","Whoosh!","The thousand-foot wave was instantly broken and Jian Wushuang’s figure appeared above Wang Liu’s head!","“Slash!”","An ice-cold voice exploded!","Jian Wushuang activated his divine power and slashed down.","“Hiss hiss hiss.”","Wang Liu flicked his tongue and the image of Jian Wushuang’s flying sword was reflected in his green pupils. He opened his mouth and spat out a red light wave!","Whoosh!!!","In an instant, this red light wave collided with the Tarot Divine Sword, creating an extremely powerful shock wave!","Bang!","In an instant, the shock wave spread out and razed everything within a 10,000-foot radius to the ground!","Tens of millions of tons of water in the lake dried up and evaporated, turning into water vapor and forming monstrous white waves.","Fortunately, this Divine Kingdom was created by Cosmic God, and the space was extremely stable. Otherwise, if it was placed in the outside world, it would probably be enough to shatter the void and blow up several planets!","...","Boom!","Both of them retreated. Wang Liu was smashed hundreds of feet into the ground and a huge human-shaped pit appeared. As for Jian Wushuang, he was sent flying backward. He crashed into three mountain peaks before he finally stopped.","The move just now was just a small test between the two of them. Therefore, the two of them did not suffer any injuries.","“Daybreak!”","With his back against the mountain wall, Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot heavily and his body shot out again. He turned into a golden light and charged toward Wang Liu.","“Void Crack!”","Wang Liu’s three snake heads were stuck together. He raised his hands and clamped at Jian Wushuang fiercely!","In an instant, two halos appeared in his hands, and he caught the golden Daybreak light that was coming at him at high speed!","Ding ding ding!","The huge force pushed Wang Liu back and his feet left two deep scars on the ground.","In his hands, countless sparks flew.","...","“Go to hell!”","Wang Liu sneered and the three snake heads opened up to bite Jian Wushuang’s head!","“Are you talking about yourself?!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and he immediately activated Chaos Overlord Body. His right foot swept across like a nine-section whip and heavily hit the snake head!","Wang Liu’s snake head suddenly shook and Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to pull out the Tarot Divine Sword. He flicked Wang Liu away and said coldly, “Tarot Sword Manual, fourth move, Four Seasons!”","Whoosh!","In an instant, the entire Divine Kingdom battlefield twisted, and the Tarot Divine Sword disappeared.","Crack, crack, crack.","All of the Divine Kingdom, be it mountains, rivers, or lakes, was instantly frozen. The temperature dropped by dozens of degrees, and countless snowflakes began to fall from the sky.","As far as the eye could see, the entire world was covered in white snow, as if it was covered with a white haze. It was a world of glaciers, and it was the middle of winter!","“What?” Wang Liu raised his head and looked at the sky full of snow. His body could not help but stiffen.","Buzz.","A grain of snow fell on his shoulder. In an instant, a terrifying force of ice passed through his body and froze his entire shoulder!"]},{"number":4460,"title":"Chapter 4460 Curse of the Snake God","paragraphs":["4460 Curse of the Snake God","“Good!”","In the main hall of the universe base, everyone looked at the battle scene on the screen and immediately clapped!","“No wonder there was news from the universe saying that Jian Wushuang was the number one Heaven’s Favorite and that he had the power to fight above his level. I was skeptical before, but now it seems that the rumors were not exaggerated at all.”","“Hehe, this old man remembers that this technique was created by that fellow Tarot, right? Looking at Jian Wushuang, he has already obtained Supreme Tarot’s true inheritance. In the future, he might be able to surpass Supreme Tarot and take the title of the number one Sword Master in history.”","!!","“It’s been a long time since I’ve seen someone with such a profound understanding of the Sword Dao in the universe since Supreme Tarot. I really miss it.”","“This kid’s future is limitless.”","“In my opinion, I’m afraid it won’t be long before the Tarot Divine Sword changes its name to the Wushuang Divine Sword.”","The crowd laughed.","In the beginning, they were quite worried. However, when they saw that Jian Wushuang could suppress Wang Liu perfectly, they immediately felt relieved.","Only Supreme Blacksource was frowning slightly.","He did not know why, but he had a bad feeling.","...","Within the Divine Kingdom Battlefield.","Jian Wushuang stepped on the void and his black hair flew in the air. He looked down at Wang Liu, who had fallen into the snow and turned into an ice sculpture. He said coldly, “Explode!”","In an instant, the three-headed snake, Wang Liu’s body exploded and shattered into countless ice fragments.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. He could feel that the Sword Qi in the snowstorm had completely crushed Wang Liu into dregs.","“Hiss hiss hiss.”","However, at this moment!","Whoosh!","Countless tentacles surged out and twisted together, turning into the appearance of the three-headed snake.","His aura did not decrease at all. He raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang with eyes full of ridicule.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. Even he had to admit that the Void Warrior’s recovery ability was so terrifying that even he could not help but be moved.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and sneered. “Let’s see how many hits you can take.”","“Four Seasons, Winter to Spring!”","Boom!","In an instant, the wind and snow disappeared, and the spring thunder exploded!","A continuous drizzle came down like a Heavenly Tribulation song.","A million raindrops were a million Sword Qi!","Murderous intent was everywhere!","“Fall!”","Jian Wushuang said coldly.","In an instant, millions of raindrops of Sword Qi rolled down at the same time!","Each Sword Qi was a full-force attack from Jian Wushuang. This move had once killed Supreme Yuding and over 10,000 doppelgangers of Supreme Bing Ye!","Rumble!","In an instant, the three-headed snake, Wang Liu, only had time to shoot a few fake bullets before his body was destroyed by millions of Sword Qi again, and his bones were crushed!","In the main hall, the crowd cheered once again when they saw this.","However, this time around, Supreme Blacksource was not the only one frowning. Even the eyes of Cosmos God flashed with a sharp glint.","...","Within the Divine Kingdom Battlefield.","“Something’s wrong! There’s a problem!”","Jian Wushuang stopped and frowned.","There must be something wrong with this abnormal situation!","He had fought with the three-headed snake, Wang Liu, on the Offworld Battlefield. He understood Wang Liu’s strength. He was definitely not this weak!","Until now, Wang Liu had not used his trump card, the Void Explosion.","This guy must be planning something in his mind!","Jian Wushuang was naturally intelligent. He understood everything in an instant.","“Why did Wang Liu challenge him to a one-on-one fight? Why didn’t he use his unique skill?”","This could only prove one thing.","That was that Wang Liu was holding back his big move!","“Fine, I’d like to see what you’re up to!”","Jian Wushuang snorted coldly and a fierce look flashed in his eyes.","“Four Seasons, Spring to Summer!”","Rumble!","...","Instantly, the raindrops that filled the sky disappeared, and a blazing sun suddenly rose up and hung high in the Nine Heavens!","The Summer of the Four Seasons Sword Technique was the most violent and terrifying move of the Four Seasons!","Jian Wushuang did not believe that Wang Liu would dare to deal with it as easily as before.","“Go!”","The next moment, Jian Wushuang waved his right hand heavily and the blazing sun immediately crashed toward Wang Liu!","Rumble!","The entire Divine Kingdom Battlefield shook madly. The earth began to dry up and crack, and dozens of ravines appeared in the sky!","The heavens fell and the earth cracked!","This time, Wang Liu’s expression finally changed!","His pupils contracted violently, and a serious look appeared on his face as he said, “Void-Explosion!!”","In an instant, both of Wang Liu’s heads exploded. Thousands of energy accumulated in his mouth, and a terrifying light wave was born!","...","Roar!","The next moment, the light wave shot out and collided with the huge sun that was crashing down!","Whizzzzz!","The void distorted. Soon after, this Divine Kingdom Battlefield that was created by the hands of Cosmos God, the extremely stable space, started to be filled with dense cracks that were like cobwebs!","Countless destructive energies exploded from the point of impact, crazily surging in all directions, completely razing the mountains and rivers in this Divine Kingdom into chaos!","In the main hall, the Supreme martial artists who were observing this scene were all shocked.","The power of their battle has already reached the level of a Half Invincible Supreme!","“No! Even ordinary Half Invincible Supremes wouldn’t be able to unleash such a powerful might!”","“It can be said that the two of them are infinitely close to being the Invincible Supreme realm!”","“Jian Wushuang is indeed worthy of the title of the number one Heaven’s Favorite in the universe!”","“It’s been so many years since Jie Dong died at the hands of Void warriors 100,000 chaos cycles ago, I haven’t seen such a heaven-defying person!”","“It’s a blessing for our universe to have such a genius!”","Everyone’s gazes were fixed on him as they exclaimed in admiration.","Even the eyes of Cosmos God seated high up on the main seat flashed with a strange glow.","“Xuan Yi, you’ve got a good disciple.”","The corners of his mouth curled up into a smile.","...","“Ah!!!”","Wang Liu roared madly. The terrifying light wave in his mouth continued to become thicker and its power increased.","“Innate divine power, Primordial Universe!”","“Secret skill of Dragon blood!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were also filled with anger. He activated all kinds of secret skills and surging divine power and went all out!","The next moment.","Boom!","The two energies finally exploded, and a huge mushroom cloud rose.","The entire Divine Kingdom began to shake like crazy, as if it would be destroyed in the next moment!","At this moment, the three-headed snake, Wang Liu, suddenly let out an extremely deranged laugh.","“This is the time!”","His body exploded and turned into a small snake as thick as an arm. He flicked and turned into a flowing light, appearing beside Jian Wushuang in an instant!","Then, he opened his mouth wide, revealing two sharp and thick fangs that glowed with a cold light. He bit at Jian Wushuang’s neck fiercely!","“Void technique, Snake God Curse!!”"]},{"number":4461,"title":"Chapter 4461 The Seal","paragraphs":["4461 The Seal","Whoosh!!!","A ghostly light flashed on the fangs of the small snake that Wang Liu had transformed into and he bit Jian Wushuang’s neck ruthlessly!","All of this happened too quickly!","It was so fast that before Jian Wushuang could react, Wang Liu’s fangs had already pierced through Jian Wushuang’s skin and bit into his neck!","!!","Jian Wushuang felt a sharp pain and he could not help but roar. Just as he was about to pull Wang Liu off his neck, he saw Wang Liu turn into a dim light and enter Jian Wushuang’s body.","“Ah-!!!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body burst with crackling sounds.","“Hahahaha, from now on, Jian Wushuang, I am you, and you are me!”","“We share one body!”","Jian Wushuang did not open his mouth to speak, but a sinister voice that was completely different from his own came from his throat.","Jian Wushuang’s purple-gold pupils changed rapidly and turned into dark green vertical pupils!","“Get out of my body!” Jian Wushuang growled with a ferocious expression.","He could feel an extremely strange power taking control of his body!","This was not possession. If it was, no one had ever possessed him, a Perfect Chaotic Lifeform!","Wang Liu wanted to take over!","“Hahaha, Jian Wushuang, stop struggling. This is a curse from the Snake God. You can’t resist it.”","“Come, don’t resist me. With the two of us working together, you will have both divine power and void power!”","“At that time, the two universes will prostrate at our feet! We will become the true Masters of the Universe!”","“What Void God, what Cosmos God, they will only become ants at our feet. The two of us will sit high in the clouds, looking down on all living beings, and enjoy the Supreme power of life and death in the universe!”","“Jian Wushuang, think about it. It’s wonderful!”","The deep and evil voice with a strange laugh came out of Jian Wushuang’s throat again.","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and his tongue turned into a forked snake’s tongue.","In a short moment, Jian Wushuang had completely turned into a half-human, half-monster!","“I’ll say it one more time. Get out!!!” Jian Wushuang panted heavily and growled.","The control of his body was his bottom line, and he would never allow anyone to touch it!","“Hiss, hiss, hiss, Jian Wushuang, I told you, you can’t resist.”","“Why do you think I chose you out of so many people?”","Jian Wushuang made a sound again.","This scene was extremely strange.","It was as if there were two people living in the same body, one evil and one sinister, conversing with each other.","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang finally understood Wang Liu’s intention!","From the beginning to the end, everything had been carefully planned!","He had been waiting for this moment!","Jian Wushuang was silent. He could feel that Wang Liu’s power was constantly swimming in his body and snatching control of his body.","“You want to take my body? Never!”","There was a hint of madness in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","Even if he were to perish together with his body, he will never let anyone else control his body!","...","The universe base, within the main palace.","“Jian Wushuang!!!”","Everyone was shocked by this sudden change. It all happened too quickly, so fast that they did not even have time to react.","Jian Wushuang was clearly suppressing Wang Liu with an absolute advantage. However, in the blink of an eye, there was a sudden change. Wang Liu was fighting for the control of Jian Wushuang’s body.","The conversation between the two of them was also transmitted through the images.","This made their hearts skip a beat.","If... Jian Wushuang really agreed to what Wang Liu had said. By combining divine power and void power, a real monster would be born between heaven and earth!","With Jian Wushuang’s talent, once he grew up, he would be able to move freely between this universe and the Void Universe and become a peerless demon that no one could subdue!","The faces of Supreme Blacksource and the others instantly turned ashen.","He was not close to Jian Wushuang, but after a few encounters, they had become comrades who had gone through life and death together.","“Impudent!”","Instantly, the expression of Cosmos God turned grim.","“Absorb!”","He grabbed with his right hand and pulled Jian Wushuang out of the Divine Kingdom Battlefield.","“Old Man, are you going to kill me? Can you bear to see your universe lose such a genius?”","Jian Wushuang did not show any fear when he was pulled out. Instead, he looked at Cosmos God Dao with confidence and no fear.","...","This was the plan he had made long ago.","It would be best if he could possess Jian Wushuang.","Even if he could not possess Jian Wushuang, he could still take Jian Wushuang away if Cosmos God wanted to destroy everything. To him, it was a good deal.","“Hmph, you think I don’t have a way?”","Cosmos God raised his eyelids and said.","“Old Man, you don’t have to lie to me. So what if you’re strong? The cultivation systems of our two universes are completely different. You can’t do anything to me.”","“Is that so?” Cosmos God’s right hand made a grabbing motion and Jian Wushuang seemed to be sucked in by a whirlpool as he shot toward the palm of Cosmos God.","“Divine technique, Seal!”","Bang!","In an instant, the Cosmos God spread out his five old fingers and slapped Jian Wushuang’s head!","In an instant, countless gentle divine powers gushed out from the palm of the Cosmos God and turned into a warm current that rushed into Jian Wushuang’s body.","...","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled violently.","Roar! Roar! Roar!","He let out painful roars.","However, Cosmos God was expressionless. He pressed his big hand firmly on Jian Wushuang’s head.","Everyone’s hearts clenched when they saw this scene.","After the time for one incense stick to burn.","Jian Wushuang’s trembling body gradually calmed down.","He closed his eyes and fell into a deep sleep.","On his neck, a complicated black rune that looked like a seal appeared.","In the center of the seal, there was a small snake.","“Send Jian Wushuang to rest.”","A hint of fatigue flashed across the eyes of the Cosmos God as he spoke to Lan Su and Lan Lan, who were standing by his side.","“Yes!” The two disciples quickly acknowledged and shot out a gentle divine power. They carried Jian Wushuang and walked toward the resting palace in the distance.","After the two of them left with Jian Wushuang.","Supreme Blacksource and the others exchanged glances, then hurriedly asked, “My Lord, how is Jian Wushuang? Are you alright?”","Cosmos God glanced at them and said, “I’ve already performed a divine skill to suppress and seal the three-headed snake, Wang Liu, in Jian Wushuang’s body. I think he should be fine. However, since divine power and void power are different, I can’t completely get rid of it.”","“I can only say that it may seem fine, but if it’s left there, it might explode one day and cause endless trouble.”","Everyone could not help but look at each other with sorrow in their hearts."]},{"number":4462,"title":"Chapter 4462 Isolated","paragraphs":["4462 Isolated","In the blink of an eye, three years had passed.","Jian Wushuang finally woke up.","“I...”","Jian Wushuang sat up from the bed and pinched his swollen eyebrows. Then, his thoughts came to him like a tide.","He remembered that he was fighting for control with Wang Liu in the Divine Kingdom Battlefield. Then, his consciousness fell into a deep sleep.","And now...","He carefully felt his body. The Wang Liu curse that had been hidden in his body had disappeared. He now had 100 percent control over his body.","However, at some point in time, a black sealing rune appeared on the right side of his neck.","“What is this rune?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. If he had guessed correctly, Wang Liu’s disappearance should be related to the rune.","Creak.","Just as he was deep in thought, the door to the room was pushed open and Cosmos God walked in.","“I pay my respects to Cosmos God.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at him hurriedly.","“There’s no need to be so polite.” Cosmos God smiled warmly and said, “Little Guy, how do you feel now?”","“No problem,” Jian Wushuang replied.","“That’s good.” Cosmos God nodded. Following that, his expression turned solemn as he said, “Jian Wushuang, I only used my divine power to suppress and seal the power of Wang Liu in your body. I wasn’t able to get rid of this power completely. You must not be careless.”","“Don’t worry, I won’t.”","Jian Wushuang thought for a moment.","The two of them chatted for a while more. When Cosmos God saw that Jian Wushuang did not show any signs of abnormality, he left the room.","Jian Wushuang was left alone in the room.","He sat cross-legged on his bed and pondered over the words of Cosmos God.","Although Wang Liu’s existence had been sealed, he was like a time bomb that could explode at any moment.","It was impossible for him to entrust his fate to someone else.","He had to kill Wang Liu, who had become a parasite inside him.","In that case, the first thing he had to do was to understand the structure of the void power. Only by understanding the void power would he have a chance to destroy the power left behind by Wang Liu.","“How do I understand void power...”","After a while, Jian Wushuang had no choice but to stand up and walk outside.","Outside the room, the Supreme experts were in a hurry.","Jian Wushuang was about to greet them, but he could not help but frown.","The Supreme experts looked at him and were stunned. Then, they moved away and kept a distance from Jian Wushuang.","Soon after, they began to whisper to each other.","“Hey, did you guys hear? Jian Wushuang’s body has been taken over by someone from the Void Universe!”","“That’s right, it’s said that the one who possessed him was a Four Scar-level Void Warrior!”","“Quickly get away from him! Although Lord Cosmos God used his great divine power to suppress the Void Warrior in his body, he was not able to completely remove it. In other words, the Void Warrior in Jian Wushuang’s body could erupt at any time!”","“Yes, yes, yes. It’s better to be safe than sorry. That’s a Four Scar Void Warrior. If the captain doesn’t make a move, who can subdue him?”","“Quick, quick, quick, stay away from him. Otherwise, if he suddenly becomes violent and kills someone, won’t we be in danger?”","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown as the discussion continued.","It seemed like he was being isolated?","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang did not take it to heart. It was good to isolate him for some peace and quiet.","Jian Wushuang walked forward step by step. At that moment, a group of laughter could be heard.","“I saw it with my own eyes when Jian Wushuang was possessed! Tsk, tsk, that miserable look was simply amazing! I can’t even describe it!”","“I’m telling you, if you see Jian Wushuang, you’d better stay away from him. Otherwise, if he kills someone, whoever is close to him will be in trouble.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold.","He looked up and saw a group of ordinary Supreme martial artists surrounding the black-robed Supreme martial artist from Cosmos Temple and listening to his story.","The person who had spoken earlier was the black-robed Supreme from Cosmos Temple.","“So he was the one fanning the flames behind the scenes.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold as he walked over.","He remembered that at the beginning, in the main hall, it was this person who said that it was his duty to fight Wang Liu. Even if he was going to die, it was for the sake of the universe.","Thud, thud, thud.","The sound of footsteps rang out.","The crowd, who had been listening to the black-robed Supreme cultivator’s story with a satisfied expression, suddenly froze when they saw Jian Wushuang walking over.","“Jian, Jian Wushuang is here!”","“Run!”","“Jian Wushuang’s seal must have been broken!”","Instantly, everyone was so frightened that they scattered like birds and beasts.","...","The black-robed Supreme martial artist’s heart skipped a beat. He lowered his head and was about to escape.","“You want to leave?” Jian Wushuang sneered, stretched out his five fingers, and grabbed in the air.","Suddenly, the black-robed Supreme martial artist flew back into Jian Wushuang’s hand like a chick that had been caught.","His five fingers instantly clenched tightly around his throat as he slowly raised him up.","“Jian, Jian Wushuang, what are you doing? This is the base camp, are you planning to kill me?”","The black-robed Supreme cultivator’s face flushed red as he forced himself to remain calm.","“You think I don’t dare to?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glinted coldly as countless Sword Qi burst out from his fingers and surged into the black-robed Supreme cultivator’s body.","As long as Jian Wushuang activated it slightly, the Sword Qi that surged into the black-robed Supreme’s body would instantly kill him and destroy his body and soul.","The black-robed Supreme martial artist felt the Sword Qi that was rampaging in his body. Suddenly, a great horror of life and death surged in his heart, and his face could not help but turn pale.","“J-Jian Wushuang, I didn’t mean it. I apologize to you.” His lips trembled, and his eyes flashed with a pleading look.","...","Now that Jian Wushuang was the number one genius in the universe and was deeply protected by Cosmos God, he was really not sure if Jian Wushuang would be punished for killing him.","“If I ever hear you fan the flames and talk behind my back again, you should know the consequences.” Jian Wushuang snorted coldly and slowly let go.","The black-robed Supreme martial artist fell to the ground on his butt.","“Get lost!” Jian Wushuang looked down at him expressionlessly and said.","“Yes.” The black-robed Supreme martial artist did not dare to show the slightest expression of dissatisfaction and hurriedly left.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help shaking his head. This kind of person was just a jumping clown. It was not worth it for him to make a big fuss over that guy.","Then, Jian Wushuang strode away and went to Team 7.","Within Team 7, Supreme Blacksource was seated cross-legged in meditation.","“Captain.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at him.","“You’re okay now?” Supreme Blacksource glanced at Jian Wushuang indifferently and said, “Have a seat. I have something to tell you.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded his head and took a step forward to sit down in front of Supreme Blacksource.","“Jian Wushuang,” Supreme Blacksource said. “You should know about the death of Supreme Gui He, the Vice-Captain of our Team 7, right?”"]},{"number":4463,"title":"Chapter 4463 Five Thousand Years of War","paragraphs":["4463 Five Thousand Years of War","Team 7 was in a bamboo forest.","The bamboo shoots were dark green, and the green jade entered his eyes.","Supreme Blacksource and Jian Wushuang sat opposite each other, their white cloak casually lying on the ground.","“Jian Wushuang, you should know about the death of the Vice-Captain of our Team 7, Supreme Gui He, right?”","Supreme Blacksource asked calmly.","“I know.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","The establishment of a team was divided into one team Captain, two Vice-Captains, and ten team members.","The Captain of Team 7 was Supreme Blacksource, while one of the two Vice-Captains were Supreme Rong Ya, who was on good terms with him, and the other was Supreme Gui He.","In the battle outside the domain, Void God’s arm had descended, and countless Supreme realm experts had died at his hands.","Supreme Rong Ya was lucky enough to avoid this calamity, but Supreme Gui he was not so lucky. He died at the hands of Void God during the second strike.","It was just that the matter was urgent at the time and he did not have time to worry too much. Now that the matter had finally come to an end, he naturally had to choose a replacement for the Vice-Captain position.","Supreme Blacksource glanced at Jian Wushuang. He was not the wishy-washy type, so he immediately said, “Jian Wushuang, what I mean is that you should be the Vice-Captain of our Team 7 team. What do you think?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said, “Captain, isn’t the position of Vice-Captain usually reserved for Half Invincible Supreme realm experts or Top Supreme realm experts?”","Supreme Blacksource chuckled upon hearing this. “Jian Wushuang, with your strength, which Top Supreme, or even Half Invincible Supreme, can defeat you? Although your cultivation level is not there yet, in terms of battle power, you are no different from a Vice-Captain.”","“This...” Jian Wushuang thought for a while and said, “Captain, I just came to the Offworld Battlefield not long ago. I’m afraid I can’t convince the public, right?”","Jian Wushuang did not reject the position of Vice-Captain as it was dispensable. However, he would politely decline if it would cause more trouble.","Supreme Blacksource glanced at them upon hearing this, then shook his head. “Jian Wushuang, don’t worry about that. I’ve communicated with all the members and they’ve all agreed to let you be the Vice-Captain. Speaking of which, Rong Ya was the one who personally recommended you to be the Vice-Captain.”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang had no reason to refuse. He stood up and cupped his hands, “Then, I, Jian Wushuang, will accept your invitation.”","“Good.” Supreme Blacksource smiled and nodded.","A moment later.","Jian Wushuang changed into a Vice-Captain’s robe and token. The members of Team 7 greeted him respectfully.","...","Spring came and autumn went, and the sea turned into fields.","In the blink of an eye, 5,000 years had passed.","In these 5,000 years, Jian Wushuang led Team 7 to conquer the North and the South, to suppress the Offworld Battlefield.","He kept fighting with the Void Warriors at the void spatial rift. In a short 5000 years, he had experienced nearly 10,000 battles.","This made him more familiar with Void Warriors.","In the past 5000 years, the sealed three-headed snake, Wang Liu, did not show any signs of abnormality. However, as time went on, the power that Wang Liu left in his body became more and more violent.","Especially when Jian Wushuang was in a great battle and he was in a weak state, Wang Liu would crazily hit the seal and try to take over his body.","There was even one time when Jian Wushuang used the Tarot Sword Strike against a Five Scar level Void Warrior. He was directly controlled by Wang Liu’s power.","If not for Supreme Blacksource suppressing him firmly and allowing Cosmos God to suppress Wang Liu once again, Jian Wushuang would probably have completely demonized and started a massacre on that day.","However, it was not as if he did not gain anything in these 5,000 years.","Jian Wushuang’s name had shaken the entire Offworld Battleground and the entire Team 7 was convinced.","Time passed just like that. Jian Wushuang led his team to guard the crack in the void, not allowing Void Warriors to take even half a step out.","The cultivators from the Offworld Battlefield wars were constantly being transferred from the universe to the Offworld Battlefield. Overlord and Moluo Yangu also arrived one after another.","However, in the first battle, Moluo Yangu was killed by a Void Warrior.","This also made Jian Wushuang increasingly indifferent and numb to life and death.","Just when Jian Wushuang thought that he would spend the rest of his life like this...","An emergency transfer order from Cosmos God had him transferred back to his base camp from the Void Rift.","...","Base camp, main hall.","The Captain and Vice-Captain of Team 9 stood on both sides with solemn expressions.","Jian Wushuang strode forward with a sword hanging from his waist and a white cloak on his body.","After 5,000 years of killing, the Tarot Divine Sword’s power reached another level. Jian Wushuang, who had always been cold, now had a touch of iron-blooded killing spirit between his brows.","As he walked into the hall, the people standing on both sides of the hall raised their eyebrows. They felt that Jian Wushuang had come with a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood, and his body was full of soaring killing intent.","Supreme Bing Ye and Long Qing were the Vice-Captains of Team 2 and 3 respectively. Naturally, they were also in the main hall and could not help but let out a cold snort when they saw this.","In the past 5,000 years, Jian Wushuang’s fame had been increasing day by day. He had long been like the sun in the sky. They had a great enmity with Jian Wushuang, so now that they saw him again, they were naturally more dissatisfied and wanted to kill him.","“Jian Wushuang pays his respects to Cosmos God!” Jian Wushuang knelt down on one knee and cupped his hands as he said in a deep voice.","“You may rise.” Cosmos God laughed and lifted his hand to help Jian Wushuang up.","After doing all this, the gaze of Cosmos God swept across everyone’s faces. He said, “I’m sure everyone is confused as to why I’ve suddenly gathered all of you here.”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone looked at each other and could see the doubt in each other’s eyes.","However, no one spoke. They waited quietly for Cosmos God to continue.","Cosmos God was rather satisfied with the situation. After nodding his head slightly, he said in a deep voice, “I’ve received news earlier that the Void Universe is very likely to organize a great chaos and attack the void crack with all its forces.”","“However, we don’t know the exact time of the great chaos, as well as our current strength in the Void Universe.”","...","“Therefore, I’m going to choose five of you to go deep into the Void Universe and investigate the details of this great riot!”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone was shocked!","Deep into the Void Universe?","This was no small matter and was extremely dangerous. Long before the Void Rift appeared, Cosmos Gods had already sent people into the Void Universe on the other side.","The leader of that group of candidates was none other than the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace!","However, even now, there was no news from the powerful Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, and it was unknown whether she was alive or dead.","It could be said that entering the Void Universe was a suicide mission.","Hiss!","Everyone in the hall looked at each other and sucked in a cold breath.","Only Jian Wushuang raised his head the moment he heard this. His eyes were shining.","..."]},{"number":4464,"title":"Chapter 4464 Heading to the Void Universe","paragraphs":["4464 Heading to the Void Universe","Void power!","To Jian Wushuang, he urgently needed an opportunity to understand void power.","In his body, the void energy curse left behind by Wang Liu was becoming more and more serious. It would go berserk once in a while. Even though there were Cosmos Gods who would step in to suppress it every time, he couldn’t possibly stay in the Offworld Battlefield in the future and wait for the help of Cosmos Gods every time, right?","If he didn’t get rid of this Wang Liu, sooner or later, he would cause a great disaster!","Thus, Jian Wushuang had long wanted to find an opportunity to understand void power in depth.","Now, the opportunity had come!","There was no better opportunity to understand the void power than to personally Enter the Void Universe!","The gaze of Cosmos God swept across the crowd, taking in everyone’s reaction. He then said indifferently, “Are you guys scared?”","“This...”","The crowd looked at each other, not saying a word.","During the great catastrophe that year, the palace Master of the Divine Life Palace was only half a step away from becoming a Cosmos God. The people he led were also at the unparalleled Ruler level.","But even so, not a single one of them walked out alive.","The cultivation of the people in the hall was much lower than that of the palace Master of the Divine Life Palace. Going to the Divine Life Palace like this was no different from courting death.","For a moment, everyone hesitated.","“Lord Cosmos God, I, Blacksource, am willing to go!”","Right at this moment, Supreme Blacksource took a step forward and spoke in a deep voice.","One after another, a few team leaders stepped out of the crowd and spoke.","They were the leaders of a team, so they had to set an example.","Upon seeing this, the face of Cosmos God, which was already covered in frost, finally relaxed. He said, “The people going to the Void Universe this time can’t have cultivation levels higher than an Invincible Supreme. As such, the nine Captains don’t have to think about going to the Void Universe. Just focus on guarding the extraterritorial battlefield.”","With that, the nine Captains could not help but look at each other before saying, “Lord Cosmos God, what do you mean by that?”","Cosmos God pondered for a moment before replying, “The magnetic field of the Void Universe is completely incompatible with the magnetic field of our universe. The higher the cultivation base of those from our universe, the easier it is for them to be rejected and suppressed. On the contrary, the lower the cultivation base of those from our universe, the lesser the rejection and pressure.”","“Thus, it’ll be quite difficult for you Invincible Supremes to go to the Void Universe, while it’ll be easier for ordinary Supremes to go. First, it’ll be less conspicuous, and second, it’ll be more convenient for you to take action. In any case, you’ll only be investigating in secret when you go to the Void Universe, and there’ll be no need for you to take action. It doesn’t make much of a difference whether you’re powerful or not.”","When everyone heard this, they came to a realization.","After Cosmos God finished speaking, he turned his gaze to the Top Supremes and Half Invincible Supremes in the hall. He was waiting to see who would be willing to take the initiative to head over.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing at the back, had a glint in his eyes.","He knew that it was his time!","“Lord Cosmos God, I, Jian Wushuang, am willing to head to the Void Universe!”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and said in a deep voice.","After he finished speaking, the crowd that was still hesitating suddenly became restless.","A glint flashed in Supreme Bing Ye’s eyes as he stepped out from the crowd and said, “Lord Cosmos God! I, Bing Ye, am willing to go to the Void Universe. For the survival of the universe, I, Bing Ye, am willing to go through water and tread on fire, even if it costs me 10,000 lives!”","After saying that, he tilted his head slightly, glanced at Jian Wushuang, and sneered.","Long Qing, who was standing beside the Captain of Team 3, also realized something. He exchanged a glance with Supreme Master Bing Ye and said, “Lord Cosmos God, I, Long Qing, am also willing to head to the Void Universe!”","The commotion in the hall grew even more intense.","The conflict between Jian Wushuang, Bing Ye, and Long Qing spread throughout the entire universe. Now that Jian Wushuang had signed up to go to the Void Universe, the two of them immediately followed him. It was easy to guess what they were thinking.","“Bing Ye, Long Qing, I’m afraid that you’re only going to the Void Universe to settle your personal grudges, right?”","Ninth Kalpa King, who was also in the hall, sneered.","In the 5,000 years of war, besides Jian Wushuang’s most dazzling performance, the second one was Ninth Kalpa King!","Like Jian Wushuang, he also had the ability to fight across cultivation realms. In a war 3,000 years ago, he killed a Void Warrior with Four Scars and was promoted to the Vice-Captain of Team 9.","The next moment.","The Ninth Kalpa King cupped his hands and said indifferently, “Lord Cosmos God, I, the Ninth Kalpa King, wish to be on this expedition to the Void Universe!”","As soon as these words fell, the commotion in the hall became even more intense.","Where there were people, there were factions.","There was no surprise in the Offworld Battlefield.","In the past 5,000 years, apart from the team Captains, the four most outstanding people, Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King, Bing Ye, and Long Qing, formed four factions.","The Ninth Kalpa King had originally been indifferent about going to the Void Universe, but he had suddenly said that he wanted to go to the Void Universe. They naturally understood what he meant.","He was afraid that Jian Wushuang would be killed by Supreme Bing Ye and Long Qing in the Void Universe.","For a time, people from the four factions walked out and said that they wanted to go to the Void Universe.","The entire hall was in an uproar.","Looking at the great hall that was getting more and more boisterous, the expression of Cosmos God turned dark and ugly.","Finally...","Bang!","Cosmos God slammed the table heavily and said coldly, “Enough! Do you guys think that going to the Void Universe is a sightseeing tour?”","Whoosh!","Instantly, the entire place fell silent as cicadas in winter. Everyone lowered their heads and no longer made a sound.","...","The eyes of Cosmos God flickered. Seeing that everyone was no longer speaking, he snorted coldly and said, “How about this? I’ll personally pick the people who will go to the Void Universe this time.”","“Yes!”","Everyone obediently lowered their heads and didn’t dare to make a sound.","“Supreme Lingyu!”","“Supreme Gongyang!”","“Supreme Bing Ye!”","The gaze of Cosmos God swept across everyone’s faces as he picked out his troops.","“I, Lingyu, accept your orders!”","“I, Gongyang, accept your orders!”","“I, Bing Ye, accept your orders!”","The three of them immediately walked out from the crowd and cupped their hands in acknowledgment.","...","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang frowned.","He had to go to the Void Universe this time!","Just as he was about to take the initiative to volunteer again, the gaze of Cosmos God wandered around and finally fixed on Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang!”","“I, Jian Wushuang, accept your order!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he agreed!","“The four of you will set off three days later. Go through the Void Rift and head to the Void Universe to gather information!”","Cosmos God spoke in a deep voice. With a wave of his hand, he made the decision for the four people who would be heading to the Void Universe!","“The four of you must remember that your main task is to gather information. You must be extremely careful and not reveal your aura. Otherwise, even I won’t be able to save you and you’ll die without a doubt!”","Finally, Cosmos God cast a deep look at the four of them."]},{"number":4465,"title":"Chapter 4465 Arriving at the Void Universe","paragraphs":["4465 Arriving at the Void Universe","“Yes!”","Jian Wushuang, Lingyu, Gongyang, Supreme Bing Ye, and the others narrowed their eyes.","Just as Cosmos God had said, the Void Universe was filled with danger. The moment the four of them revealed their auras, they would be annihilated by the entire Void Universe.","Let alone the four of them, even if the Invincible Supreme were to come here personally, it would be impossible for him to come out alive.","yes, you may leave. I will order someone to send a treasure that can conceal one’s aura to your chambers.","Cosmos God spoke.","After that, the crowd dispersed.","As he walked out of the hall, Supreme Bing Ye turned his head and gave Jian Wushuang a cold smile.","The threat in his words was obvious.","Jian Wushuang ignored him and walked out with Ninth Kalpa King and the Overlord.","“Alliance Master, I’m afraid that Bing Ye is up to no good when you go.”","Overlord said worriedly.","“We’re not afraid of him in this universe, but we don’t know what’s going to happen in the Void Universe. If he wants to fight you in the Void Universe with the intention of perishing together, we’ll definitely expose our aura.”","Jian Wushuang could not help but smile. He looked at him and shook his head, “Don’t worry, he won’t dare to.”","“You don’t dare? What do you mean, Alliance Master?”","Overlord was stunned.","Jian Wushuang did not answer. Instead, Ninth Kalpa King, who was beside him, sneered and replied, “Because he’s afraid of death.”","Overlord looked at Jian Wushuang and the Ninth Kalpa King, who were smiling at each other. He could not help but be stunned.","“Alright, don’t worry. Supreme Bing Ye doesn’t have the courage to fight Jian Wushuang in the Void Universe. However, he’ll definitely try to hinder you in secret, which is inevitable.”","As the three of them spoke, they walked out of the hall and stopped.","Ninth Kalpa King turned to look at Jian Wushuang and said in a deep voice, “Jian Wushuang, I won’t say much. In short, be careful.”","“Good. You stay here and be careful of that Long Qing. He has been trying to find a chance to take revenge. Now that I’m gone, I’m afraid he’ll turn his attention to you,” Jian Wushuang replied in a deep voice.","“Just him?” Ninth Kalpa King’s face was filled with contempt.","...","Team 7, bamboo house.","Supreme Blacksource left the bamboo house after giving Jian Wushuang a few simple instructions.","He was carefree by nature. Although he did not want to risk going to the Void Universe with Jian Wushuang, since Cosmos God had already made the decision, he would not pretend to be sad and reluctant.","Just as he said, when they went to the Offworld Battleground, everyone should have prepared to hang their heads on their waists and die at any time.","Not long after, Lan Lan knocked on the door of the bamboo house.","“Lord Lan.”","Jian Wushuang nodded at her.","“Jian Wushuang, Didn’t I tell you? Don’t call me Lord Lan, it’s too polite, just call me Little Lan.”","Lan Lan said with a smile.","“Uh... alright.”","Jian Wushuang touched his nose in silence. Lan Lan was probably dozens of chaos cycles older than him.","The two of them exchanged some pleasantries before Lan Lan flipped her right hand and took out a black waist token. “Jian Wushuang, this is something my master specially refined some time ago. It can block divine power aura to a certain extent. This is the root for you to settle down in the Void Universe. You must keep it well.”","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned serious as he took the waist token.","Suddenly, a gentle light gushed out from the waist token and turned into an invisible light shield, which covered Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power aura disappeared slowly.","At the same time, some news about the Void Universe appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“Jian Wushuang, although this waist token can conceal the divine power aura on your bodies, the biggest feature of the Void Universe is that it can not be imitated,” Lan Lan said seriously.","“Void Scar and Void Explosion?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes.","“That’s right.” Lan Lan nodded and replied, “Void Scar and Void Explosion. One is derived from their magical power, and the other is derived from their realm. This can’t be replaced or imitated.”","“Therefore, when you go to the Void Universe, you must control yourselves and not fight. Don’t let anyone see that there are no Void Scars on your left shoulder.”","“I understand.” Jian Wushuang nodded thoughtfully.","“Alright,” Lan Lan replied, “I’ll be leaving now. Take care.”","...","Three days later.","Jian Wushuang, Supreme Bing Ye, and the other three arrived at the crack in the void under the lead of Cosmos Gods.","“If I’m not wrong, the Void Universe on the other side should be the periphery of a sect. If possible, the four of you must join this sect to gather information.”","“Also, the waist token I gave you can send messages back from the Void Universe at any time. If you find out anything, you must send a message back immediately.”","Cosmos God stood with his hands behind his back as he warned.","“Yes.”","...","The four of them nodded and stepped into the crack in the void without any hesitation.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang only felt darkness before his eyes, and then he felt dizzy.","It was as if the entire world was being overturned.","Whizzzz.","It was as if he had passed through endless time and space, the universe’s desolation. Immediately after, a bright light continuously enlarged in front of his eyes.","Thud!","Jian Wushuang’s body fell and he jumped out of a black hole.","“This is the Void Universe?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked around.","A green mountain came into view, and the sound of flowing water could be heard.","...","A monster with the body of a four-hooved horse and the head of a human was staring at them with a long halberd in its hand.","On his left shoulder, there was a long scar that was particularly eye-catching.","A One Scar-level Void Warrior!","“Enemy..!” In the next moment, the human-headed horse-bodied monster quivered and was about to let out a long howl.","“Not good!”","Everyone’s heart sank when they saw this.","This monster with a human head and a horse’s body must have been sent by the Void Universe to patrol this crack in the void.","Just as everyone was thinking of making a move, Jian Wushuang had already turned into a sword light and dashed forward!","The sky was torn apart. In an instant, the monster with a human head and a horse’s body had just shouted the word ‘enemy’ when Jian Wushuang slashed down with his sword, cutting it in half.","Then, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. With a wave of his hand, the Heaven-Suppressing Monument was activated and the monster was suppressed in it.","All of these actions were extremely fast.","By the time the other three reacted, Jian Wushuang had already finished.","Seeing this, Lingyu, Gongyang, and Supreme Bing Ye could not help but look at each other and let out a sigh of relief.","Fortunately, they had stopped him in time. Otherwise, they would have been exposed if he had really shouted.","“Jian Wushuang, thank you.”","Lingyu and Supreme Gongyang cupped their hands in gratitude.","On the other hand, Supreme Bing Ye snorted coldly without a trace of gratitude on his face."]},{"number":4466,"title":"Chapter 4466 The God Refining Sect","paragraphs":["4466 The God Refining Sect","“Alright, we can’t stay here any longer. Let’s leave first.”","Jian Wushuang put away the Heaven-Suppressing Monument and said.","“Yes!”","Lingyu and Gongyang quickly responded. Bing Ye glanced at Jian Wushuang and said in a strange tone, “What’s wrong? Do you think you’re the Captain? The Captain has called for everyone?”","Jian Wushuang ignored him. If they were not in the Void Universe, he would have stabbed Bing Ye to death.","Although Supreme Bing Ye said that, he still followed Jian Wushuang to a mountain peak.","Boom! Boom!","A hole appeared in the middle of the mountain. Jian Wushuang took the lead and walked in.","Thud.","Jian Wushuang waved the Heaven-Suppressing Monument and it floated in front of everyone.","The Heaven-Suppressing Monument was a space restriction Dharma Treasure. Originally, it was not of much use to Jian Wushuang. He did not expect that it would be useful in the Void Universe.","Inside the Heaven-Suppressing Monument, a human-headed horse-bodied monster the size of a thumb looked at the four of them nervously.","“You, who are you? What do you want to do? I am the Third Elder of the God Refining Sect. I advise you to release me now! Otherwise, once our God Refining Sect’s Supreme Master finds out that I’m missing, you guys won’t be able to escape no matter what!”","Jian Wushuang, Master Lingyu, and the others looked at each other and raised their eyebrows.","It seemed like... this person did not know anything about the alternate universe?","Also, this place is called the God Refining Sect?","Jian Wushuang cleared his throat and asked in a hoarse voice, “You still have the nerve to ask who we are? We’ve been sleeping here for a long time, and you’ve disturbed our sleep!”","“What? Are you sleeping in the Void Forbidden Land?”","The human-headed horse-bodied monster was shocked and quickly said, “Senior, this lowly one unintentionally disturbed Senior’s deep sleep. I beg Senior to forgive this lowly one’s faults and let this lowly one off!”","Thud, thud.","His two front legs went soft, and he knelt down, immediately kowtowing like pounding garlic.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile.","It seemed that the fellow in front of him could be used as a stone to ask for directions when he first came to the Void Universe.","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and continued to ask in a hoarse voice, “Let me ask you, why is your God Refining Sect here? What’s the situation outside?”","The human-headed horse-bodied monster did not suspect anything and quickly replied, “Senior, this Void Forbidden Land is guarded by one of the top forces in the universe every void era. In recent years, it has been guarded by our God Refining Sect again.”","“Oh? Will it be guarded by your God Refining Sect?”","Jian Wushuang frowned.","The situation was not right.","One had to know that in his universe, there were constant wars in the Offworld Battlefield all year round. Void Warriors would constantly surge out through the cracks in the void. If not for the presence of Cosmos Gods, their universe would have been broken through long ago.","However, looking at this person’s appearance, he was not suspicious of them, and did not doubt in the slightest that they had come from another universe.","This proved that this person was probably unaware of the existence of other universes.","Furthermore, if the Void Warriors who attacked their universe had attacked them through the crack in the void that had just appeared...","It was impossible for this person not to know.","When they appeared just now, it was impossible for this person to be the only one guarding the place.","There must be something he did not know.","...","Six hours later.","Jian Wushuang walked out of the cave and a thoughtful look flashed in his eyes.","Through beating around the bush just now, he finally got some information.","This place was called the Void Forbidden Land.","This place was similar to the northernmost area of the universe where Jian Wushuang was. It was a forbidden land of the Void Universe.","There were countless cracks in the void in the Void Forbidden Land. These cracks were different from the cracks in the void that were formed when the universe and the void were shattered by the battle between experts. These cracks led to the various heavens and realms.","No one knew where these cracks or rifts would lead to.","He only knew that very few people who entered a spatial rift could come out again.","In addition, every void era, there would be different top forces in the Void Universe that would guard the Void Forbidden Land.","Right now, the one guarding the Void Forbidden Land was the God Refining Sect, which was not far from here.","The God Refining Sect was a top sect in the Void Universe. The sect’s Void Warriors mainly refined corpses, and their biggest trump card was the suppression of a huge nameless Immortal corpse.","According to the man-headed horse-bodied monster, other than the Sect Master and the highest Elder, who were the core existences, even he could not come into contact with the nameless Immortal corpse.","“Jian Wushuang, the situation is more or less clear now. What should we do next?”","Supreme Lingyu said as she walked out of the cave and looked at Jian Wushuang.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up and he said, “In my opinion, it’s impossible that the God Refining Sect doesn’t know about our universe. It’s just that this person’s status is too low and he can’t get in touch with this kind of information. The things in this universe should be like our universe. The news has always been blocked and only the top figures in the universe know.”","“Thus, if we want to find out their plans to attack our universe, it’s probably useless to just hide and ask. There’s only one way, and that’s...”","At this point, Jian Wushuang stopped talking and looked sideways at Supreme Lingyu. His eyes were burning as he said, “That is to enter the God Refining Sect!”","At this moment, Supreme Gongyang and Supreme Bing Ye walked out. They could not help but be shocked when they heard Jian Wushuang’s words.","...","“Absolutely not! As the top sect in the Void Universe, the God Refining Sect must have an Invincible Supreme with Six Scars. If we go in, we will be in danger of being discovered at any time!”","“That’s right, this move is too risky!” Supreme Lingyu and Supreme Gongyang shook their heads.","Supreme Bing Ye sneered in disdain and said, “Brainless fool, if you enter the God Refining Sect rashly, isn’t that the same as sending yourself to your death?”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang did not get angry. Instead, he raised his eyebrows and replied indifferently, “Then what do you all want to do?”","“Naturally, we’ll lay low and plan for the long term.” Supreme Bing Ye stood with his hands clasped behind his back as he proudly replied.","“Idiot.” Jian Wushuang looked at him and sneered, “Now, the Void Universe will send an army to attack our universe through the cracks in the void at any time. After you’ve slowly planned it out, I’ll be able to go back to the universe to collect the corpses!”","“You!” Upon hearing this, Supreme Bing Ye was instantly enraged. divine power surged from his body as he prepared to fight Jian Wushuang.","“Come on, I didn’t have the chance to kill you in the previous battle and you were saved by Great Void Divine Emperor. Instead of waiting for your death here obediently as you said, I might as well kill you first.”","Jian Wushuang twisted his neck and looked back at him fearlessly.","Instantly, the air froze.","..."]},{"number":4467,"title":"Chapter 4467 Joining the God Refining Sect","paragraphs":["4467 Joining the God Refining Sect","In the void, Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye exuded a hostile aura.","Supreme Bing Ye’s face was filled with anger as he glared at Jian Wushuang. His eyes seemed to be spitting fire.","Jian Wushuang also looked back at him coldly.","In this Void Universe, he didn’t want to get into a conflict and tried to look at the big picture. However, this didn’t mean that he would be bullied by others and that Supreme Bing Ye would step on his head!","“Alright! What are you guys doing? We’re here to gather information, not to have an internal conflict!”","Supreme Martial Artist Gongyang and Supreme Martial Artist Mingyu hurriedly tried to smooth things over.","Supreme Bing Ye’s expression flickered. In the end, he coldly snorted and turned his head away, not saying anything else.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but sneer.","Fortunately, the battle had stopped before it had erupted.","Supreme Lingyu took a deep breath and said, “Everyone, I agree with Jian Wushuang’s opinion. Now that the situation is urgent, we can only seize the time and quickly find out the true news of the Void Universe and send it back to the Lord Cosmos God so that he can make arrangements.”","“Otherwise, even if we stay here and hide, it’ll just be a waste of time.”","“I agree.”","Gongyang pondered for a while before nodding.","The three of them turned to look at Supreme Bing Ye.","“Bing Ye, what do you think?”","Supreme Bing Ye’s face turned even uglier.","“Haven’t the three of you already made your decision? Why do you still need to ask me?” Supreme Bing Ye snorted coldly and agreed to the plan.","“The most important question now is how to enter the God Refining Sect?” asked Supreme Lingyu.","Jian Wushuang and the other two did not say anything. They just frowned.","“I think, why don’t we sneak in?”","Gongyang scratched the back of his head and asked.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang looked at him and shook his head, “No, going in like this is really courting death.”","The few of them discussed for a while, and the plans they had decided on were all rejected by Jian Wushuang. Supreme Martial Artist Gongyang couldn’t help but say in a slightly angry tone, “You can’t do this, you can’t do that! Jian Wushuang, tell me, how do we get in?”","Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to answer him. Instead, he turned back to look at the human-headed horse-bodied monster that was suppressed in the Heaven-Suppressing Monument and said, “Go in openly!”","“Eh? What?”","“Enter openly? Isn’t that really seeking death?”","“Jian Wushuang, I think you’d better step aside and let me command you.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Gongyang and Supreme Lingyu were stunned, while Supreme Bing Ye sneered.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang ignored Supreme Bing Ye. Instead, he looked at Supreme Gongyang and Supreme Lingyu and said, “Have you all forgotten what that horse-headed monster said? That the God Refining Sect is about to recruit all the heroes in the world as disciples? To us, as long as we are careful, the possibility of entering the God Refining Sect is not small. Once we enter, we will not be suspected.”","“You are all Lords who have established your own forces in this universe. Would you suddenly suspect that one of your disciples is an empty warrior in disguise?”","“No, you wouldn’t even think in this direction. Instead, if you were to sneak in, you would be instantly suspected once you were caught, and then various investigations would be launched.”","“At that time, even if they don’t find out that we’re from another universe, they’ll definitely imprison or kill us.”","The three of them could not help frowning and thinking carefully about the feasibility of Jian Wushuang’s words.","That’s right. With their strength, only the most powerful experts in the God Refining Sect could see through their lies.","As for them, as one of the most powerful experts in the entire universe, would they pay attention to the selection of disciples?","He would not. At most, he would only pay a little attention to the few with the highest talent!","Hence, this seemingly dangerous method of entering the God Refining Sect was actually the safest.","“Everyone, the most difficult thing for us is when we enter the God Refining Sect. No one knows what their entrance examination is. The unknown means danger. You guys should think it over.”","Jian Wushuang said and then ignored them.","For Jian Wushuang, it was imperative for him to go to the God Refining Sect. Not only was it to find out the news that the Void Universe had invaded his universe, but more importantly, he had to go in and understand the structure of void power!","Only then would he be able to understand the void force and completely get rid of the time bomb tied to him, the three-headed snake, Wang Liu!","“Wealth comes from danger, I’ll risk it!”","“The risk is high, but it also means the reward is high!”","Supreme Gongyang and Supreme Lingyu looked at each other and gritted their teeth.","As for Supreme Bing Ye, his eyes flickered and no one knew what he was thinking.","After a while, he finally said, “Fine.”","After that, the four of them got the exact time when the God Refining Sect would accept disciples from the human-headed horse-bodied monster. When there was nothing else to ask, Jian Wushuang put the human-headed horse-bodied monster and the Heaven-Suppressing Monument into his Interspatial Ring.","The God Refining Sect was one of the top sects in the Void Universe, so they must have a life tablet that recorded life and death. Once the human-headed horse-bodied monster died in their hands, the life tablet would shatter, and the God Refining Sect would take action immediately.","They kept it in their Interspatial Ring. By the time the God Refining Sect realized that an elder had disappeared, they would have already entered the sect.","After doing all this, the four of them changed their appearances and turned into monsters. Then, they shot toward the God Refining Sect.","Jian Wushuang transformed into a strange man with long pointed ears and a pair of wings on his back, while Lingyu and the others transformed into monsters with crystals all over their bodies or monsters with the head of a goat and the body of a human.","For Supreme martial artists like them, doing this was simply too easy.","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh.","Gusts of strong wind blew past their ears. Not long after, the four of them crossed the starry sky and saw an incomparably towering mountain peak suspended above the stars in the distance.","...","He had arrived at the God Refining Sect!","At the foot of the mountain, hundreds and thousands of Void Warriors with different auras and strengths were waiting outside the gate of the God Refining Sect.","The monsters were of all kinds of shapes and sizes. Jian Wushuang and the other three’s appearances were ordinary among the monsters.","“Let’s go,” he said.","The three of them looked at each other and took a deep breath. They did not care about Supreme Bing Ye, who had disappeared for a while and reappeared. They strode toward the gate of the God Refining Sect."]},{"number":4468,"title":"Chapter 4468 The Assessment of the God Refining Sect","paragraphs":["4468 The Assessment of the God Refining Sect","At the base of the God Refining Sect, it was a chaotic and noisy scene.","Void Warriors from all directions gathered here. Some sat cross-legged and cultivated their void power, while others were looking for people to talk to, trying to form a good relationship.","Jian Wushuang and the other three could not help but look at each other.","It seemed that the Void Warriors of this Void Universe were not much different from their own universe.","!!","According to the human-headed horse-bodied monster, if one wanted to join the God Refining sect, their cultivation had to be at least at the Star-level, which was equivalent to the Ruler realm of their universe.","As far as the eye could see, the people who had come to join the God Refining Sect were basically Two to 1-Star Void Warriors. In other words, they were cultivators who were close to the second level of Rulers in their universe, to the level of Ultimate Supremes.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang and the others lowered their cultivation aura to the Ruler realm. Under the waist token made by Cosmos God, the aura that the four of them revealed was no different from the surrounding Void Warriors.","In order to reduce the risk of being exposed, Jian Wushuang and the others did not talk to the Void Warriors around them. Instead, they sat quietly with their legs crossed and waited for the God Refining Sect to open its gate.","Time passed by in a flash.","More and more Void Warriors were gathering around the God Refining Sect. Among them, there were even One Scar level Void Warriors!","The One Scar level corresponded to the Primary Supreme level of this universe!","In the universe that Jian Wushuang and the others were in, once one stepped into the Supreme realm, they would be an almighty who looked down on the universe. All of them would be overlords or the mainstays of top sects with top battle power!","A month later.","Rumble!!!","The gate of the God Refining Sect suddenly opened, and countless bolts of lightning formed by void energy were generated, emitting a powerful aura.","A green-colored middle-aged man with two feelers on his head walked out of the gate. He was wearing linen clothes, carrying a coffin on his back, and his waist was tied with a blue rope.","What the God Refining Sect refined was not anything else, but corpses!","According to the human-headed horse-bodied monster, there was a Coffin Mountain in the God Refining Sect. The mountain was filled with coffins, and inside the coffins were the corpses of the Almighty beings who had died in the universe.","Every disciple of the God Refining Sect would enter Coffin Mountain to refine a divine corpse that belonged to them after entering the sect.","This was also the reason why the God Refining Sect was able to dominate the Void Universe despite not having many Scar-level Void Warriors in the sect.","Once he refined the Immortal’s body, he would have a clone that was as strong as him, or even stronger, on top of his foundation.","This was the foundation that the God Refining Sect relied on to suppress the Void Universe!","The man with the tentacles from the God Refining Sect had a powerful aura. As soon as he walked out, he caused the crowd to exclaim.","“I didn’t think that the Grand Elder of the God Refining Sect, Shen Xu, would be personally overseeing this operation!”","“Elder Shen Xu is a Three Scar Void Warrior!”","“What’s the situation? This is the first time that the God Refining Sect has accepted a disciple, and they’ve sent an expert at the level of a Grand Elder to take charge, right?”","The sounds of discussion rang out, and everyone’s expressions were somewhat disbelieving.","Among the people who had come to join the God Refining Sect, the Void Warrior with the scar on his face had originally been high and mighty. However, after seeing Elder Shen Xu, he immediately bowed his head and did not dare to maintain the slightest arrogant attitude.","This Elder had two feelers on his head and green skin. His eyes were as calm as water as he scanned everyone’s faces. Then, he said, “This time, our God Refining Sect is recruiting disciples, so I will personally take charge. Those who try to take advantage of the situation and steal the corpses better leave quickly. Otherwise, if I find out, don’t blame me for not showing any mercy.”","As soon as he said that, there was a commotion in the crowd.","A look of struggle flashed across the faces of nearly a hundred Void Warriors. They looked at Elder Shen Xu from time to time and lowered their heads in deep thought. In the end, they could only sigh and retreat obediently.","That’s right, every time the God Refining Sect was recruiting disciples, there would be some Void Warriors with bad intentions who joined the God Refining Sect just to steal corpses.","Elder Shen Xu looked at the people walking out from the crowd and nodded in satisfaction. He then said in a deep voice, “In that case, I hereby announce that the entrance examination of the God Refining Sect begins now!”","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, a huge stone base appeared in front of everyone.","“What’s that?”","Supreme Lingyu and Supreme Gongyang narrowed their eyes and whispered.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and said, “I guess it’s used to test talent. Or it’s used to test how compatible it is with the cultivation of the God Refining Sect.”","“Then aren’t we...” Supreme Master Gongyang said worriedly.","Not to mention talent, they were not even from this universe.","“We’ll see,” Jian Wushuang replied in a low voice.","Supreme Gongyang and Supreme Lingyu could not help but look at each other and nod helplessly.","On the other hand, Supreme Bing Ye did not say anything to Jian Wushuang this time, which surprised Jian Wushuang and made him frown.","Ever since he had come to the God Refining Sect, Bing Ye had disappeared for a period of time. When he had regrouped with them, he had become silent and seemed to be rather foolish.","“What the hell is he doing?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and he had a bad feeling.","At the same time, the test officially began.","Elder Shen Xu pointed at the Foundation Stone that was floating in the air and said in a deep voice, “This is a talent assessment stone. Firstly, it will assess your talent in cultivation. Secondly, it will assess your compatibility with the cultivation techniques of my God Refining Sect. You just need to line up one by one and stand on this Foundation Stone. At that time, this cornerstone will naturally give a comprehensive evaluation based on your talent and degree of compatibility, and display light.”","“Of course, whenever the Foundation Stone glows, it is already proof of your talent and intelligence. You can stay. However, if the Foundation Stone doesn’t have any reaction, then regretfully, your talent is not enough and you will not be able to pass the selection. At that time, please return to where you came from and you will not be able to enter our God Refining Sect.”","Elder Shen Xu glanced at the crowd and continued, “There are four types of light that shine from the stone. Red represents low-tier aptitude, blue represents medium-tier aptitude, purple represents high-tier aptitude, and gold represents super-tier aptitude.”","The people nodded upon hearing this. They all looked proud and full of fighting spirit. It was obvious that they had heard about the Foundation Stone’s assessment and were fully prepared.","“Alright, since everyone understands the rules, let’s begin the assessment!”","Then, according to the strength of their cultivation, the people who came for the assessment automatically formed a long line at the entrance of the God Refining Sect.","Jian Wushuang and the others suppressed their cultivation to 3-Star Void Warriors so that they were not conspicuous. They were placed at the back of the line.","“It’s starting.”","...","Jian Wushuang and the other three looked at each other and took a deep breath.","Whether or not they could enter the God Refining Sect and find out the deployment of the Void Universe would depend on this!"]},{"number":4469,"title":"Chapter 4469 The Assessment","paragraphs":["4469 The Assessment","Rumble!","With Elder Shen Xu’s command, hundreds and thousands of disciples began their assessment.","A 3-Star Void Warrior with three heads and six arms walked to the front of the Trial Foundation Stone. He held his breath and let out a loud shout. He took a step forward and stepped on the Trial Foundation Stone that was quietly suspended in the void.","The Trial Foundation Stone did not move at all, but a thick red light suddenly rushed out and spread out, hovering above everyone’s head.","!!","Red light, low-grade talent!","Everyone raised their heads and looked up. Some of them had looks of disdain and contempt, but most of them were looking at the 4-Star Void Warrior with a hint of envy.","After all, the God Refining Sect’s assessment was famous for being strict. There were once geniuses with superior aptitude in other sects or Void Warriors who had made a name for themselves in the universe who came to the God Refining Sect to participate in the assessment. However, they only ended up with inferior aptitudes.","Therefore, just as Elder Shen Xu had said, as long as one could make the Trial Foundation Stone shine, it meant that one had extraordinary talent. The God Refining Sect would then take one in.","The 4-Star Void Warrior looked at the dense red light above his head with a happy expression. However, there was still a hint of gloominess in the depths of his eyes. It was obvious that he was not satisfied with his low-tier aptitude.","Elder Shen Xu looked at the 4-Star Void Warrior indifferently and announced with a blank expression, “Red light, low grade...”","Suddenly, a purple light appeared in the thick red light in the sky. Although the purple light was so thin that it could be blown away by the wind, it floated little by little and finally stopped above the red light.","“What?”","Elder Shen Xu’s calm expression changed instantly, and he raised his eyebrows. Then, he looked at the 4-Star Void Warrior. His originally expressionless face revealed a smile as he said, “Congratulations, purple light, medium talent.”","It was no wonder that Elder Shen Xu’s attitude had changed. Even the other probationary people looked at the 4-Star Void Warrior with more respect. It should be known that all the disciples of the God Refining Sect who had flashed a purple light in the talent assessment stone would at least become a 7-Star Void Warrior in the future. In the face of this rising star, there were naturally many people who went to curry favor with him.","The 4-Star Void Warrior laughed out loud. He was full of heroic spirit and was full of heroic bearing. He strode to the right side of the square that could only be entered after passing the assessment and stood below the gate of the God Refining Sect.","The other disciples of the God Refining Sect also looked at the 4-Star Void Warriors below and smiled kindly.","Soon, another strange-looking Void Warrior walked to the front of the Trial Foundation Stone. This person’s cultivation had already reached the level of a 5-Star virtual warrior, which was one level higher than the previous person. His expression was excited. He took a heavy step and suddenly flew up, landing on the Trial Foundation Stone.","And this time, the Trial Foundation Stone still did not move at all, but it did not even flash.","The strange-looking Void Warrior was stunned. He seemed to have sensed something. Frowning, he stomped on the black stone again.","The final result was still the same. There was no flash of light.","“Damn it, how could this be...” The strange-looking Xu Shi was stunned for a moment, then roared and quickly stomped on the Trial Foundation Stone with a ferocious face.","However, no matter how he stomped and smashed, or exploded his void power, the Trial Foundation Stone still did not have the slightest reaction.","The strange-looking Void Warrior was unwilling to accept this. He waved his fists desperately, unable to accept such an outcome.","At this moment, Elder Shen Xu waved his sleeve and a white halo was shot out. It wrapped around the strange-looking Void Warrior and floated out of the mountain Gate.","Elder Shen Xu shook his head and said, “The next one...”","The people who were taking the test all felt the same way. This was the cruelty of cultivation. Once one set foot on this path, there was no chance to turn back. They could only climb up with all their might, and there was no room for any slack. Otherwise, they would be eliminated immediately.","Jian Wushuang and the other three stood at the back and watched the scene expressionlessly.","“It’s going to be our turn soon!” Supreme Gongyang said nervously.","After all, they were not from the Void Universe, and their cultivation systems were completely different. Even if they had the token given by Cosmos God, it could only hide the divine power aura on their bodies. As for whether the Trial Foundation Stone would detect it, no one was sure.","One after another, there were people who passed the test of the Trial Foundation Stone. There were even golden lights that filled the sky, reaching superior-grade qualifications!","The crowd immediately burst into exclamations. Even Elder Shen Xu, who had been expressionless all this time, had a gentle smile on his face. He reached out his hand and personally led the person with great talent into the mountain Gate.","Superior aptitude meant that it was almost certain that this person would enter the Scar level in the future!","“Next...”","Gongyang took a deep breath and stepped forward.","He was a High Supreme realm expert, and he had been through a lot in the universe. He was a top existence who ruled over a region.","However, at this moment, he was so nervous that his forehead was sweating.","This was the Void Universe, the base camp of the God Refining Sect, a top power in the void universe with a Six Scar level Void Warrior!","If they were discovered, it was very likely that they would die here.","“Jian Wushuang, will Gongyang be alright?” Supreme Lingyu asked worriedly.","“I don’t know.” Jian Wushuang stared at Supreme Gongyang’s back as he gradually walked away, and his heart was in a state of extreme distress.","“Come, state your name,” Elder Shen Xu glanced at Supreme Gongyang and said indifferently.","In his eyes, Gongyang, who was protected by Cosmos God’s waist token, was no different from an ordinary 3-Star Void Warrior.","“I’m Yuan Yang.”","Supreme Master Gongyang cupped his hands and gave an alias.","“Yes, you may begin,” Elder Shen Xu looked at him indifferently and said.","“Yes.” Supreme Gongyang nodded his head. Then, he strode forward and stepped on the Trial Foundation Stone.","At this moment, not only Supreme Gongyang, but also Supreme Lingyu, Jian Wushuang, and the other two were extremely nervous.","One breath passed...","Two breaths passed...","A full nine breaths had passed, but the Trial Foundation Stone did not react, and there was no light.","“It’s probably because we’re not from this universe, so we can’t detect our talent,” Supreme Lingyu said as she pondered.","Although this result was a little disappointing, it was not unacceptable.","After all, as long as his identity was not exposed, everything could still be salvaged in the long run.","It was not just Supreme Lingyu who thought so. Supreme Gongyang, who was on the Foundation Stone, and even Elder Shen Xu thought so.","...","“Zero talent. You may leave...”","Just as Elder Shen Xu’s indifferent voice rang out and Supreme Gongyang took his leave...","Ding!","Ding ding!","Ding! Ding! Ding!","That Trial Foundation Stone suddenly emitted a sharp warning sound!"]},{"number":4470,"title":"Chapter 4470 Exposed","paragraphs":["4470 Exposed","A sharp alarm suddenly sounded in front of the gate of the God Refining Sect!","In an instant, the faces of Supreme Lingyu, Jian Wushuang, and Supreme Bing Ye changed drastically!","F*ck, exposed!","Elder Shen Xu, who had already lowered his head and was about to call another Void Warrior for the trial, suddenly raised his head and looked at Supreme Gongyang.","!!","“You’re not from our universe!” Elder Shen Xu’s eyes lit up as he glared at Supreme Gongyang!","In the next moment, he raised his hand and slapped toward Supreme Gongyang!","A terrifying void energy directly exploded out and ruthlessly smacked toward Supreme Gongyang!","“Damn it!” Gongyang’s expression changed, and he no longer concealed anything. The Supreme divine power in his body was mobilized, and his aura began to soar!","In the blink of an eye, Supreme Gongyang released his aura, and the pressure of an High Supreme broke through the vast sky. He was not the slightest bit weaker than Elder Shen Xu!","Then, Gongyang raised his right hand and met Elder Shen Xu’s palm!","Bang! Bang!","In an instant, a terrifying and violent power swept up like a tsunami in the Heavenly River. The remaining power that spread out directly crushed the nearby Void Warriors into powder!","“Let’s go!” Supreme Gongyang roared and stomped heavily on the ground. He transformed into a beam of light that soared into the sky and shot into the distant starry sky!","“Jian Wushuang, Bing Ye, we can’t do this. Let’s retreat!”","After saying this to Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye, Supreme Lingyu’s divine power suddenly burst out and turned into a soaring escape light, rushing in the opposite direction of Supreme Gongyang.","Elder Shen Xu’s brows twitched as he realized something. He immediately sent a voice transmission to the sect before he stared at Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye.","“They’re in cahoots. Yangmo, stop them!”","Boom!","The lid of the coffin on Elder Shen Xu’s back exploded. A dried corpse with dark and shriveled skin and facial features that were like melted candles rushed out of the coffin and roared at the sky.","Then, the mummified corpse charged toward Jian Wushuang and Bing Ye.","This was not the end of it. From the God Refining Sect behind Elder Shen Xu, several rays of light that were not any weaker than Elder Shen Xu’s shot out.","Most of the escaping lights rushed toward Supreme Gongyang and Supreme Lingyu, while the remaining ones surrounded Jian Wushuang and Supreme Bing Ye.","“Let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. Just as he was about to escape, he saw the numb and dull-looking Supreme Bing Ye suddenly reach out and grab Jian Wushuang’s wrist!","“Bing Ye!” Jian Wushuang was furious.","He had not expected that Supreme Bing Ye would actually make things difficult for him at this time.","He turned his head coldly and saw that Bing Ye’s mouth was curled into a cold and sarcastic smile.","In the next moment, his body began to freeze inch by inch before finally shattering.","Illusionary Lunar Flower, Clone!","Jian Wushuang instantly understood!","It was likely that the sudden disappearance of Supreme Master Bing Ye was for this moment!","Whoosh!","In an instant, the dried corpse that Elder Shen Xu had refined, along with Three Scar-level experts, landed in front of Jian Wushuang and surrounded him!","One of them was a skinny old man with black spots all over his face and eyes all over his body. On his left shoulder, there were five long scars!","Five Scar-level Void Warrior!","A Half Invincible Supreme level expert!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s face turned extremely gloomy.","...","At the same time.","On a mountain peak that was extremely far away from the God Refining Sect.","A young man with silver hair and icy eyes slowly opened his eyes, and a smug look appeared on his face.","“Hmph, it’s a good thing I’ve anticipated this. For safety’s sake, I’ll send my avatar first.”","Supreme Bing Ye stood up. His gaze pierced through the countless clouds and looked in the direction of the God Refining Sect.","“Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang, let’s see if you’ll die this time. Hahahaha!”","Supreme Bing Ye’s sinister laughter rang out from the mountain peak.","The next moment, Supreme Bing Ye took a step with his right foot and his body disappeared from the mountain peak.","...","In front of the God Refining Sect.","Including the mummified corpse, a total of four Scar-level Void Warriors surrounded Jian Wushuang and blocked all his escape routes!","“Speak! Where are you from, and what do you want to do by joining the God Refining Sect?”","A monster with a sickle-shaped head looked at Jian Wushuang coldly and said.","Jian Wushuang’s expression remained unchanged, but he was extremely vigilant.","This was definitely one of the biggest crises he had ever encountered!","He knew in his heart that as long as he was not careful in his answer, he would be killed by the cultivators of the God Refining Sect!","...","At that time, even if he was an Invincible Supreme, he would find it difficult to survive, let alone a mere elementary Supreme.","“I don’t understand what you’re talking about,” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and replied with a calm expression.","“Pretending? Weren’t you with the three who escaped just now?”","The Scar-level Void Warrior with a sickle-shaped head who had asked the question earlier sneered.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and replied, “My Lord, I think you’re mistaken. I just met them on my way here. I don’t know them.”","“Hehe, do you think I’m an idiot?” The sickle-shaped Scar-level Void Warrior replied in disdain.","“I’m telling you, you can’t escape today. If you tell me the truth, I can still give you a quick death. Otherwise, don’t blame me for refining you into a divine corpse! I’ll turn you into a slave, enslaved by the disciples of my God Refining Sect!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold, but he replied calmly, “My Lord, I really don’t know what you’re talking about. I just said that I only met them by chance on the road.”","At the same time, Jian Wushuang’s right hand quietly pressed on the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword.","A trapped beast still fought!","If these people really did not believe him, they would fight to the death!","...","“You’re so stubborn, you...”","Just as the sickle-shaped head of the Five Scar Void Warrior flashed a trace of anger on his face and was about to explode...","Among these people, the Void Warrior at the Five Scar level, who had the highest cultivation and was the biggest threat to Jian Wushuang, waved his hand and said indifferently, “There’s no point in saying more. How about this, you go to the Trial Foundation Stone and test it. Whether what you said is true or false, you will naturally have the result.”","After he finished speaking, the Five Scar Void Warrior with eyes all over his body stared at Jian Wushuang’s face.","“Alright!” Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang nodded and strode toward the Trial Foundation Stone.","He knew that if he showed any hesitation, this Five Scar level Void Warrior would kill him without hesitation!","At the same time, he began to frantically think of a way to escape!","Bang! Bang!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang took a step, flew up, and stepped on the Foundation Stone!","Suddenly, an ancient power gushed out of the Trial Foundation Stone and began to scan Jian Wushuang’s body."]},{"number":4471,"title":"Chapter 4471 Joining the God Refining Sect","paragraphs":["4471 Joining the God Refining Sect","Whizzzz!","When Jian Wushuang stepped into the Trial Foundation Stone, an invisible power gushed out from the Trial Foundation Stone and scanned Jian Wushuang’s body.","Jian Wushuang’s back was facing the Grand Elders of the God Refining Sect and his face was extremely gloomy.","Behind Jian Wushuang, the Four Scar-level Void Warriors blocked his way of retreat. They were staring at his back.","!!","In addition, there were even more disciples who had come to participate in the God Refining Sect’s selection. They looked at Jian Wushuang in confusion.","They did not know what had happened. They only knew that Jian Wushuang and the others had attracted the experts of the God Refining Sect, the Scar-level Void Warriors!","One breath passed...","Two breaths passed...","The Trial Foundation Stone still had no reaction.","The time that was supposed to be fleeting seemed extremely long at this moment.","In an instant, the Five-scar Void Warrior narrowed his eyes.","As for the sickle-headed Void Warrior who had threatened to kill Jian Wushuang, he sneered.","Just as the Trial Foundation Stone was about to sound the alarm, Jian Wushuang had already quietly held the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword and was ready to directly unsheathe it and perform the Tarot Sword Strike to gain the upper hand!","The seal on his neck suddenly loosened!","A force that belonged to the three-headed snake, Wang Liu, rushed out of his body and instantly entangled with the scanning of the Trial Foundation Stone that had gradually retreated!","Boom!","In an instant, the color of the world changed, and a light that had never appeared on the Trial Foundation Stone before shot out!","In front of the gate of the God Refining Sect, dark clouds instantly covered the sun and the sky turned dark. This was because the light that flashed out was actually a black light that was like the Milky Way!","Moreover, unlike the previous time when the light only covered the God Refining Sect’s Mountain Gate, the black light shot up into the sky and finally formed a huge, thick black cloud in the sky!","At this moment, the entire God Refining Sect was prostrating under the black cloud. It was like an ancient giant beast prostrating in the sky, forming a sense of urgency!","Everyone raised their heads at the same time and looked at the black light in a daze. They were all shocked and lost their voices!","A rare silence fell over the entire area!","Black light!","It was actually a black light!","Red represented low-grade talent, blue represented medium-grade talent, purple represented high-grade talent, and gold represented top-grade talent!","What did that black color represent?","At this moment, everyone looked up at the black light. It was like smoke and tide, covering the sky and the sun, mighty and mighty!","The black clouds pressed down on the city, and the armor light opened up to the sun!","At this moment, the sky seemed to have collapsed, leaving only the thick black clouds!","Under the dark cloud, Jian Wushuang’s black robe fluttered even though there was no wind. He looked very evil.","The four Grand elders, including Elder Shen Xu, who was in charge of the selection of the God Refining Sect disciples, were all stunned.","Immediately, this confusion was replaced by shock!","As for those Void Warriors who came to participate in the selection, they had long exclaimed in shock.","“This... what was this? What happened?”","“Why is it black?”","“This black light is too terrifying! The intensity of the light is something that even the golden light that represents superior talent can not compare to!”","“This black light is unprecedented. What does it mean?”","The few talented disciples who had detected the golden light and had proud expressions on their faces immediately became gloomy.","Everyone was confused. Even a Grand Elder who had just joined the God Refining Sect asked curiously, “Elder Mi Feng, what is the meaning of this black light?”","This Elder Mi Feng was the Five Scar level Void Warrior with the highest cultivation base in the crowd. His eyes flickered and his face flashed with a strange light. After a long time, he finally said, “This black light represents an extraordinary-grade talent!”","“The God Refining Sect has been established for more than 1,000 void eras and has held a total of 1.49 million disciple selections. Among the 1.49 disciple selections, even I have only seen the black light twice!”","“Once was the Second Sect Master of the God Refining Sect. The other time was our current Sect Master!”","“Legend has it that this black light has only appeared three times. Other than the two times I’ve seen it, the most ancient one was the Founding Master of our God Refining Sect!”","“It can be said that once a black light appears on the Trial Foundation Stone, it means that the person has already stepped into the threshold of the peak of our universe!”","“His future achievements will definitely not be below us Sect Masters!”","Elder Mi Feng finished speaking with a sharp gaze.","The elder who had asked the question trembled as if he had been struck by lightning.","As for the Elder with the sickle-shaped head, his eyes were filled with shock and disbelief. He asked in a sharp voice, “Him? Can he be on par with our Sect Master in the future?”","Under his gaze, Elder Mi Feng nodded affirmatively. Then, he put on a smile that he thought was kind and walked toward Jian Wushuang. He asked with a smile, “Sir, what’s your name?”","Jian Wushuang did not know how to react, because he didn’t know how the situation had suddenly reversed and he had shot out a never-before-seen black light.","Even though he did not know what the black streak of light meant, it was not hard to tell from Elder Mi Feng’s expression that the black streak of light he had shot out was something extraordinary.","Otherwise, what he would be facing now would be a cold and fierce attack, and not the smile of this Five Scar Void warrior.","Turning his head, Jian Wushuang loosened his grip on the hilt of the Tarot sword and said with a smile, “Senior, you can just call me Wushuang.”","“Wushuang? That’s a good name.”","...","Elder Mi Feng smiled, then asked in a rather friendly manner, “Wushuang, everything that happened before was a misunderstanding. Let me ask you now, are you willing to join our God Refining Sect? From your aura, you should be around 3-Star right? I promise you that as long as you join my God Refining Sect, I will guarantee that you will be able to break through to the Scar level within a void era! How is it?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart finally calmed down.","He knew that his first step had been a success!","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and smiled, “I’m extremely honored!”","“Hahahaha, what a great honor!” Elder Mi Feng laughed out loud when he heard this and reached out to shake Jian Wushuang’s hand.","“Wushuang, on behalf of the God Refining Sect, I welcome you!”","“Let’s go. Now, follow me to the God Refining Sect to register. After that, I will personally bring you to Coffin Mountain to find the most suitable coffin for you!”","As Elder Mi Feng laughed, he took Jian Wushuang and turned into a ray of golden light. Instantly, they flew toward the mountain peak of the God Refining Sect.","The two of them disappeared, leaving behind a group of candidates who looked at each other with envy."]},{"number":4472,"title":"Chapter 4472 Coffin Mountain","paragraphs":["4472 Coffin Mountain","“This person is rich!”","“Tsk tsk, Elder Mi Feng is one of the three Grand Elders who hold real power in the God Refining Sect. He is a true core figure of the God Refining Sect. His words and actions can directly affect the entire God Refining Sect, and he plays an important role in the God Refining Sect! Wushuang actually had such dog sh*t luck to become Elder Mi Feng’s subordinate!”","“In my opinion, we should build a good relationship with Wushuang as soon as possible. Not to mention that he can help us in the God Refining Sect, as long as he doesn’t fan the flames in Elder Mi Feng’s ears, it’ll be a great fortune for us.","“What kind of coffin do you think Elder Mi Feng will choose for Wushuang?”","!!","After Jian Wushuang left, he left behind countless discussions in front of the gate of the God Refining Sect.","The sickle-headed Void Warrior’s expression was uncertain.","“Impossible! How can this person be so talented?”","“And from what I saw earlier, it was clear that the otherverse cultivators were quite close to this person. How could they have only gotten to know each other on the way here?”","“Right! This person must have used some secret technique to create this illusion!”","The sickle-headed Void Warrior muttered to himself. Then, he raised his head slowly and looked at Jian Wushuang and Elder Mi Feng, who had disappeared. The corners of his mouth curled into a cold smile.","“Hmph, just you wait. Wushuang, I’ll catch you!”","“When the time comes, not only will I kill you, but I will also kill you! That Elder Mi Feng will also have to pay the price for today’s matter!”","...","Within the God Refining Sect.","With Jian Wushuang in tow, Mi Feng flew forward.","The entire God Refining Sect was filled with Yin Qi. The sky was red, the earth was black, and there were demonic flames and ghostly fog rising everywhere. At first glance, it did not look like a sacred land of a divine sect, but more like a ghost domain.","This was normal. According to the information that Jian Wushuang had learned, the God Refining Sect was famous in the entire Void Universe for its Corpse Refining Technique. The sect had been immersed in corpse Qi all year round. As time passed, it had become like this.","“Wushuang, from today onwards, you shall follow me in your cultivation,” Elder Mi Feng said with a smile as he walked in front.","“Don’t we need to go through the Sect Master and the others to decide?” Jian Wushuang asked, pretending to be honest.","Hearing this, Elder Mi Feng’s face revealed a hint of pride. He said, “I can decide what I want to do. Why do I need others to decide and interfere?”","As he said this, a domineering aura emanated from his body.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. It seemed like Elder Mi Feng had a high status in the God Refining Sect.","However, this was good as well. It saved him the opportunity to climb up the ranks. He could come into contact with the higher-ups of the God Refining Sect and understand the matter of attacking this universe.","“Alright, then I’ll be in your care from now on, Elder Mi Feng.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and changed the topic. He pretended to be simple and honest and asked, “Elder Mi Feng, what’s the background of those three people? Why did he suddenly escape and attract so many powerful beings from the sect to pursue him?”","As soon as these words fell, the originally happy atmosphere suddenly froze.","Elder Mi Feng stopped in his tracks and turned to look at Jian Wushuang. He asked with a frown, “Why do you want to know about this?”","“I...” Jian Wushuang’s eyelids twitched. He knew that he had been too hasty, so he explained, “Elder Mi Feng, I was just curious. If I asked something I shouldn’t, please punish me.”","Elder Mi Feng looked at Jian Wushuang for a moment. After a long time, he said, “That group of people isn’t from our universe. According to my guess, they must have entered our universe through the Void Forbidden Land. Alright, this matter is of great importance and is a secret of our entire universe. Don’t tell anyone about what I just told you.”","“Also, don’t ask around in the universe. If you want to know, you’ll naturally understand when you grow up in the future.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he nodded.","Just as he had guessed, just like his universe, only the most top-tier people in the universe knew about the Offworld Battlefield and otherverses.","After that, Jian Wushuang did not ask anything about the alternate universe. He chatted with Elder Mi Feng and headed toward Coffin Mountain.","A moment later, they arrived at Coffin Mountain.","Even though Jian Wushuang had seen a lot of storms, he could not help but tremble when he saw Coffin Mountain. He could not hide the shock on his face.","He saw a huge mountain peak that was as tall as the heavens appeared in front of him.","This mountain was so big that it could tear the sky apart and support the sky.","Coffin Mountain was filled with cracked black soil. There was no vegetation on the mountain, only coffins of different sizes and shapes lying quietly on the mountain.","A huge wave of death Qi hit Jian Wushuang in the face. He could not help but shiver.","“Wushuang, Coffin Mountain is the foundation of our God Refining Sect. The reason why our God Refining Sect is able to suppress the void and stand tall in the universe is because of the divine corpses in these coffins.”","“The divine corpses that could enter Coffin Mountain and lie in the coffins were all Heaven’s Favorites who could command the universe for a time. If we refine them, it means we have a partner who can fight side by side with us!” Elder Mi Feng said with a deep voice.","“Elder Mi Feng, where did these Divine Corpses come from?” Jian Wushuang could not help but ask curiously.","Elder Mi Feng glanced at Jian Wushuang and smiled. He said, “Some of these Immortal’s bodies are the ancestors of our sect who died, some died in a fight, and we bought them at a high price. As for the rest...”","At this point, Elder Mi Feng stopped and a cold, bloodthirsty look appeared in his eyes.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart turned cold. Most of the divine corpses in Coffin Mountain were probably obtained by the God Refining Sect by killing almighties in the universe on purpose.","This God Refining Sect was probably filled with blood.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang could not help but think of the time when he was in the Offworld Battlefield. Many Supreme experts had died in the foreign battlefield, and their bones had disappeared...","He was afraid that the God Refining Sect was behind all this.","In an instant, the good impression that Jian Wushuang had of Elder Mi Feng disappeared completely, leaving only coldness in his heart.","“Alright, Wushuang, let’s not waste any more time. Go in and pick your coffin.”","Elder Mi Feng did not notice Jian Wushuang’s unusual behavior. He patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder and said with a smile, “Don’t worry. I’ll be here watching you and helping you pick a divine corpse that has great potential and is suitable for you.”","“Alright!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and collected his thoughts. He descended from the sky and walked toward Coffin Mountain."]},{"number":4473,"title":"Chapter 4473 Choosing the Divine Corpse","paragraphs":["4473 Choosing the Divine Corpse","Inside Coffin Mountain, Corpse Qi filled the air.","A black mist that had condensed into a physical form shot up into the sky, covering the sun and the moon.","Wooden coffins, stone coffins, bronze coffins, and other coffins of different shapes lay quietly in Coffin Mountain, waiting for someone to come and choose.","Elder Mi Feng stood in the air with his hands behind his back as he watched Jian Wushuang pick the coffins indifferently.","!!","“Wushuang, the divine corpses in the coffins are everywhere. These divine corpses had different cultivation levels when they were alive. From ordinary Star-level Void Warriors to Scar-level Void Warriors and even Five Scar Void Warriors like me, you can find them all in this Coffin Mountain.”","“The cultivation of the divine corpse was indeed an important part worth studying. After all, it would determine the divine corpse’s future growth to a large extent.”","“However, you must remember not to choose the divine corpse just based on his cultivation level. Compared to the divine corpse’s cultivation level when he was alive, the degree of compatibility between you and the divine corpse is more important.”","“In the past, there were many new disciples who had just entered the God Refining Sect. They only chose the corpses of the gods with high cultivation levels. In the end, not only did they fail to refine the corpses, but their cultivation levels also stagnated. Most importantly, they were devoured by the corpses and lost their lives in vain.”","“Wushuang, you should understand what I mean.”","“Thus, Wushuang, the most important thing when choosing an divine corpse is the degree of compatibility with you. As for how you look at it, I can only say that it’s completely based on your first instinct.”","“Degree of compatibility?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up and he immediately walked toward the first coffin.","It was a wooden coffin lying quietly in front of him. As soon as he got close to it, Jian Wushuang felt a majestic killing intent coming from the golden spear!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang felt as if he had fallen into a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood. A burly man wearing armor, a black iron helmet, and a silver mask stood in the universe, slaughtering and trampling on all directions!","Elder Mi Feng could feel the murderous aura emanating from the wooden coffin. He nodded and said, “Wushuang, this man is Wu Kang, the top general of the Grand Moon Divine Dynasty. He uses martial arts to refine the void. Although his cultivation is a little low, only at 8-Star and not yet at the Scar level, he has a lot of combat experience. He has killed and fought countless battles in his life. If you can refine him into a divine corpse, you will definitely have a general to protect you in the future!”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Without much hesitation, he removed his hand from the lid of the wooden coffin and walked to the second coffin.","Although the purpose of Jian Wushuang’s trip to the Void Universe this time was to help the Cosmos Gods gather information, he would naturally not miss out on the method to increase his power. Thus, he ended the matter easily.","According to Jian Wushuang’s conversation with Elder Mi Feng along the way, he learned that once the divine corpse in the coffin was refined, the divine corpse would never betray him unless it was under extreme circumstances.","On the path of cultivation, regardless of whether they were close relatives or good friends, there was a possibility that they would fall out and fight to the death for an opportunity or fortune.","However, the divine corpse in the coffin would not do that. It could be said that once the divine corpse was refined, it would be equivalent to one’s most powerful avatar!","The second coffin was a bamboo coffin.","Just as Jian Wushuang placed his hand on the sword, Elder Mi Feng said, “The divine corpse in this bamboo coffin was the current Holy Maiden of the Bright Moon Immortal Sect 1,000 void eras ago. Her seduction skills were superb, and she once created the magnificent feat of seducing and killing a Scar-level Void Warrior with her cultivation of 8-Star!”","“Wushuang, if you can refine this divine corpse, it’ll also be a great improvement for you, and you can use it as a hidden chess piece.”","However, Jian Wushuang shook his head after feeling it carefully. He moved his hand away and walked toward the third coffin.","“Still not satisfied?” Elder Mi Feng frowned. In his opinion, the two divine corpses were more compatible with Jian Wushuang. Firstly, their cultivation levels were not too high, so Jian Wushuang could easily control and refine them. Secondly, the two divine corpses were extremely talented when they were alive. Even though they had died a violent death, they had much strength to be desired.","If Jian Wushuang could refine it now, he would definitely become Jian Wushuang’s right-hand man in the future.","However, he did not know that Jian Wushuang, in fact, was already a Scar-level Void Warrior if the realms of the two universes were converted.","To Jian Wushuang, the two corpses could not provide him with any help even if he refined them.","Jian Wushuang stopped briefly at the five coffins in a row. Then, he shook his head and walked past them without hesitation.","An hour later, Jian Wushuang reached the middle of Coffin Mountain.","In the five coffins, there were Heaven’s Favorites who had amazing talents but were killed. There were also top battle gods who fought in all directions. However, Jian Wushuang did not pay any attention to them.","Elder Mi Feng’s brows furrowed even more tightly upon seeing this.","“Wushuang, don’t underestimate your opponent!”","Finally, Elder Mi Feng could not take it anymore and chided him in a low voice.","“Hmm!” Jian Wushuang turned to look at Elder Mi Feng, then touched his nose and said, “Elder Mi Feng, I know what I’m doing.”","“You know what to do?” Elder Mi Feng could not help but laugh in anger when he heard this. “Alright, I’d like to see what kind of divine corpse you’ll choose!”","With this in mind, Elder Mi Feng decided not to say anything more. He closed his eyes and allowed Jian Wushuang to choose.","Time slowly passed.","Jian Wushuang had already reached the halfway point of the mountain. At this point, there were fewer and fewer Heaven’s Favorites who had shone brightly in the universe but were killed due to various reasons. In their place, there were some almighty experts who were invincible in the universe, the Scar-level Void Warriors!","In terms of fighting power, this universe was slightly higher than Jian Wushuang’s home universe and had more experts. However, a universe at the Scar level was still a universe master who could command the wind and clouds in the universe and control a Star Field!","Jian Wushuang’s speed slowed down. He no longer just touched the coffins, sensed the cultivation of the divine corpse in the coffins, and chose to leave.","He began to think.","Just as Elder Mi Feng thought that Jian Wushuang would choose some divine corpses from this spot, Jian Wushuang continued to walk up.","One Scar level...","Two Scar level...","Jian Wushuang did not stop.","“You greedy idiot!”","Elder Mi Feng was instantly infuriated and his impression of Jian Wushuang dropped.","One should know that Jian Wushuang was choosing the divine corpse. In fact, from another perspective, the divine corpse was also choosing Jian Wushuang.","Previously, the cultivation of the divine corpses was still low, so Jian Wushuang could choose any one he wanted and refine them.","In the middle of Coffin Mountain, although Jian Wushuang’s realm was much higher than that of the One Scar and Two Scar divine corpses when they were alive, he should not have been able to refine them.","However, Jian Wushuang was extremely talented. He was able to shoot out black light and was comparable to the founding ancestor of the God Refining Sect. It was possible that Jian Wushuang could refine These Scar-level divine corpses.","But looking at Jian Wushuang, it was clear that he was going to reach the top!","If this was not stupidity, then what was?","..."]},{"number":4474,"title":"Chapter 4474 Reaching the Top","paragraphs":["4474 Reaching the Top","“Wushuang, don’t waste your talent for nothing because of your greed.”","Elder Mi Feng sighed in his heart.","Facing Jian Wushuang, he had the heart to cherish a talent. Otherwise, he would not have directly spoken out to protect Jian Wushuang at the entrance of the God Refining Sect and brought him back to the God Refining Sect. He had directly omitted countless cumbersome steps in the middle.","The current God Refining Sect seemed powerful and had dominated a region, but in reality, it was already lacking in successors.","In his opinion, Jian Wushuang was the person who could carry the God Refining Sect in the future.","While he was thinking, Jian Wushuang had already crossed the middle of the mountain and continued to walk toward the top.","Furthermore, he was extremely close to the peak of the mountain!","A coffin made of ice appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Before he even got close to the coffin, Jian Wushuang felt a chill in his face. In the chill, there was a hint of anticipation.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and a strange light flashed in his eyes.","Then, Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and pressed on the lid of the coffin.","Boom!","In an instant, the entire coffin shook, and a monstrous Corpse Qi rushed out of the ice coffin!","This monstrous Corpse Qi was like smoke and tide. In an instant, it rushed out thousands of miles into the sky, forming a huge vortex of dark clouds that seemed to be pressing down.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang sensed the cultivation of the divine corpse in the coffin!","Five Scar-level Void Warrior!","The Five Scar level corresponded to a Half Invincible Supreme!","Furthermore, due to the existence of the accompanying magical power, Void Explosion, a Five Scar Void Warrior was even stronger than a Half Invincible Supreme expert!","Elder Mi Feng’s body trembled, and his eyes widened.","“Natural Phenomenon! The corpse took the initiative to recognize its master!”","Elder Mi Feng’s eyes lit up and he was dumbfounded.","At that moment, Elder Mi Feng, who had made up his mind to not speak anymore and make Jian Wushuang suffer a loss, quickly blew at his beard and glared at him.","“Wushuang, why are you still standing there? Hurry up and refine this divine corpse! I’m telling you, it’s very rare for someone to take the initiative to recognize you as their master. If you miss this chance, it’ll be hard to encounter it again!”","“Moreover, this is a Five Scar level Void Warrior! This person was my Junior Brother when he was alive, and in terms of strength and status, he is no less than me! If you can refine him, then you will be able to become one of the upper echelons of our God Refining Sect!”","“From now on, no one will be able to bully you!”","“That’s not all. The most important thing is that if you also reach the Five Scar level and completely refine my Junior brother’s divine corpse, then you will have the same level of cultivation as you, the most powerful helper!”","Toward the end of his sentence, the divine light in Elder Mi Feng’s eyes grew even more intense, and he seemed to have gone a little crazy.","One must know that his divine corpse was only at the level of Four Scars!","Furthermore, the divine corpse had reached its limit when it had Four Scars!","However, now, Jian Wushuang could directly subdue the divine corpse of a Five Scar level Void Warrior. This meant that as long as Jian Wushuang could reach Five Scar level in the future, the divine corpse would at least reach Five Scar level!","In fact, it might even reach the level of Six Scars!","Although the difficulty of advancing from Five Scar level to Six Scar level was like a chasm, and the chances were very slim, it did not mean that there was no chance at all!","To be honest, even Elder Mi Feng could not sit still when he saw this. He was jealous!","In Coffin Mountain, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and many thoughts ran through his mind.","He had to admit that he was tempted at that moment.","Five Scar level, a Half Invincible Supreme level warrior!","Even Jian Wushuang only had a 60 percent chance of winning against the strength of this cultivation realm.","“My own strength is that of a Primary Supreme, which is a One Scar level Void Warrior. I’m afraid that subduing a Five Scar level Void Warrior is already my limit.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked up. At the peak of Coffin Mountain, there were only a few coffins with terrifying auras. It was difficult for him to even get close to them, let alone refine them.","“Fine, I’ll take this divine corpse.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and slowly reached out his hand, intending to open the lid of the mysterious ice coffin.","When Elder Mi Feng saw this, even though he had seen many storms and waves, he could not help but look forward to it and his eyes sparkled with excitement.","He could already imagine what it would be like when Jian Wushuang refined the Five Scar level divine corpse and then swept across the universe and even attacked the vile creatures in the alternate universe.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to push open the lid of the ice coffin...","The Tarot Divine Sword hanging by his waist suddenly trembled!","The next moment, an extremely ancient and friendly voice sounded in his ears.","“I’m waiting for you!!!”","Boom!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body shook violently and he pulled his hand away from the lid of the coffin.","He heard the call!","It was a call from the people of his hometown!","This call came from the top of the mountain!","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with determination. Without hesitation, he strode toward the top of the mountain!","“Y-y-you! Wushuang, quickly stop!”","...","Elder Mi Feng immediately cried out in shock and stomped his feet in anxiety.","“Wushuang, what are you doing? Quickly stop!”","Jian Wushuang stopped in his tracks and turned to look at Elder Mi Feng. He said calmly, “Elder Mi Feng, this divine corpse isn’t what I want most. I’m sorry to disappoint you.”","After that, Jian Wushuang walked up to the top of the mountain step by step.","“Crazy, crazy! Wushuang, have you gone mad?”","Elder Mi Feng immediately cried out in pain. When he saw that Jian Wushuang did not hesitate at all, he could not help but say bitterly, “Wushuang, you’re wasting a heavenly treasure!”","When Elder Mi Feng saw that Jian Wushuang had turned a deaf ear to his words, he could not help but sigh repeatedly, exclaiming, “What a waste of God’s gift.”","Thud thud thud thud.","Thud thud... thud.","Jian Wushuang’s footsteps were heavy as he walked to the top of the mountain.","A huge pressure was emitted from the coffins on the mountaintop. Like the rising tide, wave after wave came crashing down on him, trying to push him off Coffin Mountain.","...","Although this pressure was unconsciously emitted by these Six Scar level Void Warriors after they died, it was still very strong.","However, it was still not something that Jian Wushuang could resist!","He felt as if he was carrying millions of mountains on his shoulders as he walked forward with difficulty.","“Chaos Overlord Body!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and activated Chaos Overlord Body!","If he used divine power, he would be rejected by the universe and alert Elder Mi Feng. However, the Chaos Overlord Body was the power of the physical body, so it would not be like this.","Bang! Bang!","Bang! Bang!","Every step Jian Wushuang took created a huge pit with a radius of 100 meters on Coffin Mountain.","“Come, I’m waiting for you...”","“Come on, I’m waiting for you...”","“Come, come!! I’m waiting for you!”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","As Jian Wushuang got closer and closer to the peak of Coffin Mountain, the soft call became stronger and stronger!","In the end, it turned into a deafening sound like rolling thunder that exploded in Jian Wushuang’s mind!","Finally, Jian Wushuang reached the top!"]},{"number":4475,"title":"Chapter 4475 The Black Iron Coffin in the Air","paragraphs":["4475 The Black Iron Coffin in the Air","Jian Wushuang had reached the top.","At the peak of Coffin Mountain, there was a black coffin made of mysterious patterns. It was locked by four chains and was floating in the air.","“I’m waiting for you!”","Thunderous roars reverberated in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","The Tarot Divine Sword hanging on Jian Wushuang’s waist kept buzzing and shaking violently.","If it was not for the fact that Jian Wushuang had complete control over the Tarot Divine Sword, it would have already shot out and rushed into the coffin.","At that moment, even though Jian Wushuang had yet to open the coffin, he already knew who was in it.","And only he could cause the Tarot Divine Sword to shake!","However, did he not die in the hands of the Devouring Emperor? Why would the corpse be here?","Jian Wushuang frowned and his eyes flickered.","Elder Mi Feng stood in mid-air as he watched this scene from afar. The expression on his face constantly converged, turning into a serious one.","“Wushuang, stop. This divine corpse is not suitable for you,” Elder Mi Feng said in a deep voice with a grave expression.","Jian Wushuang, who had his back to him, raised his eyebrows upon hearing this. He suppressed the shouts coming from the coffin and turned to Elder Mi Feng, asking, “Elder Mi Feng, what do you mean?”","Elder Mi Feng glanced at Jian Wushuang and said, “This divine corpse is not from our universe.”","“Not someone from our universe?”","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat. He vaguely understood that this might be the best time to gather information.","Hence, Jian Wushuang pretended to be confused and said, “Elder Mi Feng, I don’t understand what you mean.”","A hint of hesitation flashed across Elder Mi Feng’s eyes when he heard that. He immediately looked around to make sure that no one was nearby. Then, he waved his right hand and an endless void power gushed out to form a boundary that enveloped him and Jian Wushuang.","“Wushuang, there are some things that I shouldn’t tell you. However, your talent is astonishing, and you’ll probably become an extraordinary genius in this universe in the future. It’s only a matter of time before you learn of these things. I’ll make an exception and tell you today.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold. He knew that Elder Mi Feng was about to get to the point.","Elder Mi Feng’s voice was low as he looked into the distance. “Wushuang, our universe isn’t the only one. The Void Forbidden Land is connected to many Grotto-heaven worlds.”","“These Grotto-heaven worlds formed their own worlds, but in general, these Grotto-heaven worlds were very small, not much bigger than a Star Field.”","“However, a few of the nodes in the Void Forbidden Land led to a truly massive object, a real universe!”","“This universe is only slightly weaker than us in terms of civilization level and overall combat power. We call this universe the Divine Power Universe!”","“Divine Power Universe?” Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank. The Divine Power Universe should be referring to the universe that he was in.","“That’s right. This Divine Power Universe is boundlessly rich in resources, and it is home to countless prodigies and mighty figures. Our universe and the Divine Power Universe have been at war for more than 100,000 thousand chaos cycles!”","Elder Mi Feng nodded and turned to look at the black coffin that was suspended in the air and bound by chains. He continued, “The divine corpse in this coffin came from the Divine Power Universe on the other side of the Secret Realm of void.”","“This person is clearly only at the Four Scar level, but in terms of strength, he’s enough to kill our world’s Six Scar level giant arm!”","“It was said that this person was the unrivaled sword supremacy of the opposite universe with divine power. He was an all-powerful and unrivaled existence who could suppress the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands!”","“In fact, this man’s death was an accident. When Devouring Emperor led his organization to the opposite universe, they had met this man on their way to the universe.”","“Although the man was powerful, he was still far from being comparable to the Devouring Emperor. Therefore, he was killed by the Devouring Emperor after a great battle.”","“Our Sect Master also bought the divine corpse from the Devouring Emperorer at a high price.”","“This divine corpse’s talent and combat strength are far beyond our Scar level Void Warriors. Originally, the sect master bought it back to try to refine it to become our sect’s Guardian divine corpse. However, this person’s obsession was too strong. Even after his death, it didn’t diminish in the slightest. The Sect Master and the five Grand Elders worked together to refine this divine corpse, but they couldn’t refine it at all.”","“Thus, this divine corpse has been left here.”","Elder Mi Feng said slowly. Then, he turned to look at Jian Wushuang, shook his head, and said, “Thus, Wushuang, give up on this divine corpse. Don’t waste your efforts.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered.","So that was how it was!","At the same time, Jian Wushuang was thinking quickly in his mind.","If he were to refine Tarot, it would be equivalent to allowing Tarot to be reincarnated in another way!","At that time, even if he could not find out how the Void Universe was going to deal with their universe, he could bring Supreme Tarot back to his home universe. Once the war broke out, he would be an extremely powerful main force!","Most importantly, he had obtained the complete inheritance of Supreme Tarot. To a certain extent, Supreme Tarot could be considered his Half-Master.","How could he bear to see Supreme Tarot’s corpse lying in an alternate universe for others to refine?","He could not bear it!","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with determination. He looked at Elder Mi Feng and said in a deep voice, “Elder Mi Feng, I’ve already made my decision. I’m going to refine this otherverse being!”","“You...” Elder Mi Feng was instantly infuriated upon hearing this.","It turned out that he had wasted so much time and effort to say so much, but it was all in vain?","“You really are stubborn! Wushuang, I’d like to see just how you’re going to refine this divine corpse that even the Sect Master and the five of us Grand Elders are unable to refine!”","No matter how good-tempered Elder Mi Feng was, he was still furious at this moment.","Flinging his sleeve, Elder Mi Feng harrumphed and fell silent.","Jian Wushuang smiled at him apologetically, then took a deep breath and stretched out his hand to place it on the black coffin.","Whizz.","It was as if a stone had been thrown into a calm lake, causing ripples.","Crack, crack, crack.","The chains that bound the pitch-black coffin began to break.","...","Then, the heavy, pitch-black coffin lid covered with mysterious patterns shifted to the side.","Creak creak creak creak!","A series of unpleasant and ear-piercing sounds rang out.","The lid of the coffin slid open completely.","The next moment.","Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head and looked into the coffin.","He saw a green-robed figure with his eyes closed. His fingers were crossed and placed on his waist quietly!"]},{"number":4476,"title":"Chapter 4476 Supreme Tarot!","paragraphs":["4476 Supreme Tarot!","The person lying quietly in the coffin was none other than Supreme Tarot!","He had a handsome face, a straight nose, closed eyes, and a pair of sword-like eyebrows. His entire person was filled with a sharp aura.","At first glance, he did not seem to be dead, but in a deep sleep.","Buzz, buzz, buzz!","At this moment, the Tarot Divine Sword trembled to the extreme.","Jian Wushuang was slightly stunned. He did not expect Supreme Tarot to be so young.","No wonder even someone Sword Immortal Qiang Ruwu fell for him.","Jian Wushuang could already imagine Supreme Tarot’s carefree appearance when he wielded his sword and drank wine. He must have won over countless people.","Such geniuses were all gone.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and could not help but feel a sense of regret.","“Elder Mi Feng, what’s our next step?”","Elder Mi Feng glared at him and grunted, “Wushuang, are you ignoring my words? I thought that you had grown up and didn’t need my teachings anymore. Why are you asking me how to refine the divine corpse now?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but laugh, “Elder Mi Feng, you must be joking. I wouldn’t dare to disobey you. It’s just that I’ve always been a greedy person and want the best of everything.”","“Hmph, greed is like a snake trying to swallow an elephant. I’ve already told you this many times.” Elder Mi Feng shook his head and sighed. “Fine, you can try it if you want. I’ll teach you the Corpse Refining Technique now.”","With that, Elder Mi Feng flicked his finger and a ray of green light shot out and entered the space between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows.","Then, a method about refining a corpse appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","This spell was not complicated. The main point was to form a heart-blood connection with the divine corpse through the void energy. Then, he had to input commands to make it obey Him. After days and nights of refining, he had to make it his own.","Jian Wushuang turned around and sat down cross-legged with his back facing Elder Mi Feng. He slowly closed his eyes and a contemplative look appeared on his face.","The Corpse Refining Technique was not complicated. Jian Wushuang could understand it after a rough look.","However, the most difficult part was that Jian Wushuang had no void power at all!","The most important and basic part of this corpse refining technique was to refine a divine corpse and then form a heart-blood connection with it!","“I can only try using divine power!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he immediately made a decision.","Logically speaking, divine power and void power were both derived from a type of energy in the universe, so there should not be a problem.","Jian Wushuang immediately put his thoughts into action. He stretched out his hands, and suddenly, waves of divine power gushed out from his palms like a tide and entered Supreme Tarot’s body.","In an instant, the Cosmos God waist token on Jian Wushuang’s waist jerked and void power gushed out. From an outsider’s point of view, Jian Wushuang’s divine power was no different from void power.","“Eh? You’re really going to refine it?” Elder Mi Feng’s brows twitched, and his face contorted in anger.","“Wushuang, Wushuang, I’ll wait for you to come to me with a face full of dust and dirt.”","Elder Mi Feng shook his head and began to observe Jian Wushuang.","Buzzzz!","As soon as Jian Wushuang’s divine power entered Supreme Tarot’s body, he felt an extremely strong obsession.","This obsession was like a fully armed Porcupine, not allowing anyone to invade!","However, when Jian Wushuang’s divine power touched Supreme Tarot’s obsession...","In an instant, this obsession collapsed.","Supreme Tarot’s voice in Jian Wushuang’s mind disappeared. It was as if a nerve that had been tense for a long time had finally snapped.","Jian Wushuang understood that Supreme Tarot had been waiting for someone who was not from this universe to take away his divine corpse!","He had lived a glorious life, and after his death, he was unwilling to become a puppet in the hands of the otherverse’s people, a marionette that would attack the universe he was protecting!","Now, the person he was waiting for had arrived.","Jian Wushuang was the most suitable person for him and the person he had been waiting for the most.","Jian Wushuang was silent. At this moment, he finally realized how tragic the martyrs who died in the Offworld Battlefield to protect the universe were. They were worth singing about!","The refining process was smoother than Jian Wushuang had imagined.","Jian Wushuang completed the refinement step by step without any obstacles.","In an instant, the originally dim and lightless Supreme Tarot Divine Corpse began to glow with light.","“What!” Elder Mi Feng’s eyes widened in shock, and a dazed look flashed across his face. “This... the Divine Corpse has been refined by this Kid?”","The Divine Corpse that even the five Grand Elders and the Sect Master could not do anything about was refined by this Kid so easily?!","Elder Mi Feng’s mouth gradually opened so wide that an egg could be stuffed in it, and he was in a daze.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Rays of golden light shone from the Divine Corpse of Supreme Tarot.","His legs... his hands...","In the next moment, a beam of golden light shot out from the center of Supreme Tarot’s eyebrows!","Booom!!!","An earth-shattering explosion rang out, and endless Corpse Qi soared into the sky like smoke and tide, forming rolling black clouds.","Supreme Tarot suddenly opened his eyes!","However, there was no light in his eyes. They were stiff and numb.","Jian Wushuang tried to input a command into Supreme Tarot’s body, causing him to raise his hand.","...","Whoosh–!","In an instant, Supreme Tarot raised his right hand.","Then, Jian Wushuang tried to make Supreme Tarot’s Divine Corpse do some other complicated movements. Suddenly, the corpse became stiff and obscure.","“It seems that only by continuously refining it can I truly control the divine corpse of Supreme Tarot as if it were my own arm!”","Jian Wushuang’s lips curved into a smile.","Even so, his heart was already ecstatic to the extreme!","Supreme Tarot!","This was a peerless mighty figure who had been undefeated in 10,000 battles and made a name for himself in the universe. He had shocked all the races in the universe and swept across the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands!","Such an existence had been refined by Jian Wushuang and turned into a divine corpse under his control!","It could be said that Jian Wushuang’s strength had soared at this moment!","However, this was not what made Jian Wushuang truly ecstatic.","...","The real reason for Jian Wushuang’s ecstasy was that he didn’t let Supreme Tarot fall into the hands of these alien races.","Jian Wushuang respected Supreme Tarot from the bottom of his heart.","It could be said that the existence of Supreme Tarot had been of great help to Jian Wushuang.","Whether it was the Tarot Divine Sword or the Tarot Sword Manual, they were both able to counterattack in the face of death time and time again!","Jian Wushuang had always been grateful to Supreme Tarot.","The main reason he had refined Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse was because he did not want to see Supreme Tarot lying here all alone. He did not know when his obsession would gradually disappear and he would be refined and destroyed by the people of this universe.","Now, this situation would not happen again!","He would make the fallen Supreme Tarot shine with his own brilliance in the universe again!"]},{"number":4477,"title":"Chapter 4477 The Corpse Cave","paragraphs":["4477 The Corpse Cave","Thud!","Following Jian Wushuang’s command, Supreme Tarot stepped out of the coffin and walked in the air. He landed behind Jian Wushuang like a shadow following him.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and looked at Supreme Tarot with a hint of respect.","“Wushuang, you... you really refined him?” Elder Mi Feng’s eyes widened as he asked in disbelief.","“I... I think so,” Jian Wushuang replied with a smile.","Hearing this, Elder Mi Feng could not help but become dazed for a moment. Soon after, he let out a bitter laugh and shook his head. “Is this the treatment of a genius? The divine corpse that even the five Grand Elders and the Sect Master were unable to refine was refined so easily in your hands.”","“Wushuang, I’ll report this to the Sect Master later. Let’s go, I’ll take you back to your palace now.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Then, Jian Wushuang followed behind Elder Mi Feng and headed toward the bedroom.","Supreme Tarot returned to the coffin and was lifted up by Jian Wushuang.","Along the way, many God Refining Sect disciples who were cultivating on the ground raised their eyes and saw Elder Mi Feng and Jian Wushuang flying across the sky. Their eyes were filled with shock.","Soon after, the disciples of the God Refining Sect started discussing in low voices.","“I heard that in this year’s inner disciple selection, a disciple with talent comparable to our God Refining Sect’s Founding Grandmaster was taken away by Elder Mi Feng on the spot. Is this person?”","“That should be it. Elder Mi Feng really likes him a lot. He directly ignored the series of complicated steps and took him to Coffin Mountain to choose a divine corpse.”","“The coffin that this person was carrying on his back just now should have been chosen by him at Coffin Mountain, right?”","“I’ve never seen that coffin before. I wonder which divine corpse is in it.”","The sound of discussion rang out, and everyone was somewhat curious.","At that moment, an extremely senior disciple of the God Refining Sect sized up the coffin on Jian Wushuang’s back. His pupils suddenly shrank as if he had discovered something. He suddenly screamed, “This, this is the first coffin placed on the peak of Coffin Mountain!”","“The divine corpse in this coffin can’t even be refined by Lord Sect Master, but it’s been obtained by this man?”","As soon as he finished speaking, it was like a stone that caused a thousand ripples. Almost all the disciples’ eyes flashed with disbelief, and their faces turned dull!","Who in the God Refining Sect did not know the legend of Coffin Mountain?","Hence, the news that Jian Wushuang had refined the first coffin of the divine corpse spread like wildfire and the entire sect was shocked.","Jian Wushuang had just stepped into the God Refining Sect and he had already become famous!","...","The size of the God Refining Sect was far beyond Jian Wushuang’s imagination.","It looked like a mountain, but in fact, it was larger than several Star Fields combined.","Fortunately, Elder Mi Feng and Jian Wushuang’s cultivations were not low. Under Elder Mi Feng’s lead, they soon arrived at Jian Wushuang’s bedroom.","There was a tall Stone Mountain.","The structure of the entire mountain was similar to a beehive, and the mountain walls were filled with black caves.","Elder Mi Feng said, “Wushuang, this is the place where the ordinary disciples of our God Refining Sect live and cultivate. It’s also known as the Corpse Cave. The void energy and Corpse Qi in the Corpse Cave are dense. It can help you cultivate and refine the divine corpse. At the same time, it’s also very beneficial for the nourishment of the divine corpse.”","As if they had sensed Elder Mi Feng and Jian Wushuang’s aura, many God Refining Sect disciples walked out of the Corpse Cave.","Their faces were pale and their eyes were hollow. They were filled with a gloomy aura.","“We pay our respects to Grand Elder Mi Feng.”","When the disciples saw that it was Elder Mi Feng who had arrived, they immediately bowed.","“There’s no need to be so polite.” Elder Mi Feng nodded indifferently at them and ordered them to return.","Then, Elder Mi Feng continued to speak to Jian Wushuang. “Let’s go, I’ll take you to the top of the mountain. I remember that there are a few top Corpse Caves there.”","After saying that, Elder Mi Feng lifted Jian Wushuang up, took a step forward, and disappeared from the spot.","When he reappeared, he was already at the top of the mountain.","There were not many Corpse Caves at the top of the mountain, only nine in total. They were not densely packed like the ones at the foot of the mountain and the middle of the mountain. Instead, each corpse hole was at least a hundred miles away, and the inside was unprecedentedly huge.","A strong Corpse Qi seemed to have condensed into a substance and came from the Corpse Cave. Jian Wushuang could not help but feel slightly uncomfortable and frowned.","Seeing this, Elder Mi Feng nodded in satisfaction and smiled. “Alright, Jian Wushuang, you can go in. Remember, do not insult the divine corpse. You should respect it. They will be the most trustworthy people in the world, even more so than your family and cultivation partners.”","“Finally, you should rest well for the next few days. I’m going to report the situation to the sect master now. When this matter is over, I’ll come and pick you up to have an audience with the Sect Master.”","With that, Elder Mi Feng waved his sleeve and left.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and walked toward the Corpse Cave.","The Corpse Cave looked simple, but it was actually a whole new world. As soon as Jian Wushuang stepped in, he felt a strong void power and Corpse Qi spread out. There were halls, bedchambers, cultivation rooms, and so on. There were candles made of Dragon drool grass on the candlestick. The candlelight would never go out and the green smoke that burned could help people rest in peace while cultivating.","Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to rest. Instead, he placed Supreme Tarot’s coffin down respectfully and began to inspect the Corpse Cave inch by inch to see if there were any surveillance restrictions.","After confirming everything, Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. He set up a restriction at the door to isolate his aura.","...","Midnight.","A demonic blood moon hung high in the sky, and the low roars of the Divine Corpse, Xiao Yue, could be heard from the Corpse Cave on the limestone mountain.","In one of the seven Corpse Caves on the top of the limestone mountain.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on a stone bed, deep in thought.","The dragon incense candle burned and melted continuously, and wisps of green smoke rose.","Speaking of which, up until now, he still did not completely understand how he had passed the test of the Trial Foundation Stone yesterday and achieved a shocking and unparalleled aptitude.","...","He remembered that the scanning power of the trial’s foundation stone had begun to recede, and the next step would be similar to the alarm that Supreme Gongyang had used to detect the Foundation Stone.","At that moment, the seal on the three-headed snake on his neck loosened.","Then, the testing and scanning power of the foundation stone of the trial was led into the seal of the three-headed snake, Wang Liu.","“In other words, I have to thank Wang Liu for being able to pass the test and achieve the superior aptitude of the God Refining Sect?”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and could not help but feel a little speechless."]},{"number":4478,"title":"Chapter 4478 Probing","paragraphs":["4478 Probing","The moon was bright and the stars were few.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang spread his divine power again. After making sure that no one was nearby, he pulled the token from his waist with his right hand.","Not only could this token conceal his divine power aura, but it could also communicate with Cosmos Gods across the cosmos and report the situation.","Ding ding ding!","Ripples that looked like water mirrors suddenly appeared on the token. Then, a gentle but slightly worried voice sounded.","“Jian Wushuang, how are you?”","Following that, the lens swiped upwards, and the face of Cosmos God appeared in the water mirror.","His appearance did not change much, but there was a hint of fatigue in his eyes.","It was obvious that Cosmos Gods must have been exhausted during this period of time.","“Reporting to Cosmos God, I have officially entered the God Refining Sect.”","Jian Wushuang took a few steps back and cupped his hands at Cosmos God.","“Oh? You’ve entered the God Refining Sect?”","Upon hearing this, a look of surprise flashed across the face of Cosmos God. He said, “Supreme Gongyang had reported to me earlier that you guys had gone to participate in the God Refining Sect’s selection, but we were exposed. He couldn’t care less about you guys, so he had to escape first. I thought you had already escaped.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile bitterly. He shook his head and said, “It’s a long story.”","Then, Jian Wushuang changed the topic and said, “Lord Cosmos God, from the looks of it, Supreme Gongyang is fine?”","Cosmos God in the token water mirror nodded and replied, “That’s right. I’ve already contacted Supreme Gongyang and Supreme Bing Ye. Both of them are fine and have escaped from the God Refining Sect’s pursuit.”","“Supreme Bing Ye? Escape from the pursuit?” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang sneered in his heart. This guy did not even come to participate in the selection of the God Refining Sect. How could he escape from the pursuit?","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang had no intention of explaining this to Cosmos Gods. Instead, he asked in a deep voice, “Lord Cosmos God, what about Supreme Lingyu?”","“Supreme Lingyu...” Cosmos God fell silent for a moment before saying, “I’ve tried to contact her many times, but there was no response. I’m afraid she has been secretly executed by the God Refining Sect.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang sighed slightly in his heart. He had a good impression of Supreme Lingyu, but he did not expect that she would not be able to escape from the God Refining Sect.","Jian Wushuang guessed that it would not be long before he saw the divine corpse of Supreme Lingyu on Coffin Mountain.","However, he had already taken Supreme Tarot with him. If he were to take Supreme Lingyu with him, it would be hard to avoid suspicion.","After sighing for a while, Jian Wushuang told Cosmos God about his recent situation.","When Cosmos God heard that Jian Wushuang had seen Supreme Tarot at Coffin Mountain, a look of shock and anger flashed across his usually calm face.","“Bastard! I was suspicious that even if Tarot was no match for the Devouring Emperor, he shouldn’t have been killed so quickly without leaving any traces. I didn’t expect him to be sold to the God Refining Sect as a Divine Corpse!”","When Cosmos God heard that Jian Wushuang had refined Supreme Tarot’s Divine Corpse and brought it away from Coffin Mountain, his expression softened. He looked at Jian Wushuang with satisfaction and gratification.","After that, the two of them chatted for a while. Cosmos God told Jian Wushuang to be careful in the God Refining Sect. He had to protect himself as this was the most important thing. He also told Jian Wushuang to find out the battle deployment of the Void Universe against their universe without taking any risks. He also told Jian Wushuang to find out which position the Void Universe plans to attack next, who they will be sending, and where they were.","Also, which crack in the void forbidden land did they pass through to enter the native universe?","After that, Jian Wushuang ended the conversation with Cosmos God.","...","Roar!","In the limestone mountain, the roars of the divine corpses became more and more frequent as the night deepened. Then, they gradually stopped at the break of dawn.","The next morning.","Knock knock knock.","Outside the Corpse Cave where Jian Wushuang was, there was a strong knock on the door.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and waved his right hand to remove the restrictions. He said indifferently, “Please come in.”","Not long after he finished speaking, he saw the sickle-headed Scar-level Void Warrior walk in from outside the Corpse Cave.","“Wushuang, why are you so cautious? We are in the God Refining Sect, why do we need to set up so many restrictions?”","A voice that seemed to be laughing yet not laughing sounded.","The sickle-headed Void Warrior squinted his eyes and looked at Jian Wushuang with an inexplicable expression.","“Elder Shen Lian.” Jian Wushuang looked calm and bowed slightly to him.","This person was the one who had tried to kill him outside the gate of the God Refining Sect.","“Elder Shen Lian, what’s the matter for your sudden visit?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","He could sense a faint enmity from this Elder Shen Lian.","“Wushuang, can’t I come to visit for no reason?” Elder Shen Lian sized up Jian Wushuang and the corners of his mouth curled up slightly. “I came to find you this time, firstly to see how you are doing, and secondly, to tell you a piece of news.”","“What news?” Jian Wushuang asked indifferently.","A glint flashed in the eyes of the Elder Shen Lian as he said slowly, “Wushuang, do you still remember the few people who were with you? One of them has already been captured and executed.”","As he said that, Elder Shen Lian stared at Jian Wushuang as he wanted to see if there was anything unusual on Jian Wushuang’s face.","However, he was disappointed.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm the entire time. He asked without any fluctuation in his expression, “Oh, what does that have to do with me?”","Elder Shen Lian did not say anything. Instead, he looked at Jian Wushuang deeply. After a long while, he said with a faint smile, “Nothing much, I’m just here to inform you.”","“Unfortunately, that person didn’t reveal any other information before she died. In the end, she simply self-destructed.” Elder Shen Lian shook his head as he spoke, as if he was sighing.","Jian Wushuang did not reply. Instead, he just looked at Elder Shen Lian.","...","“Alright, Wushuang. Since you’re fine, I will take my leave.”","“Oh right, I almost forgot. I forgot to congratulate you for refining the number one divine corpse of our God Refining Sect. Tsk, tsk, even the five Grand Elders and the Sect Master can’t do anything about the strong obsession in the divine corpse, but you’ve refined it so smoothly. It’s really strange.”","Shaking his head, Elder Shen Lian left the Corpse Cave with his hands behind his back.","A long time after Elder Shen Lian left...","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s right hand suddenly hit the bed, and his originally calm and indifferent face instantly became extremely gloomy.","How could he not have guessed that this Elder Shen Lian had pretended to come and check on him just now, but in reality, he was trying to catch him off guard and was here to test him.","This person did not trust Jian Wushuang at all. He did not believe in the results of the Trial Foundation Stone.","“This person must die, or I’ll be in too much danger!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked at Elder Shen Lian’s back as he left. A cold killing intent flashed in his eyes.","..."]},{"number":4479,"title":"Chapter 4479 The Battle Between Factions","paragraphs":["4479 The Battle Between Factions","This Elder Shen Lian must die!","However, it would be difficult to kill him without anyone suspecting him.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. He thought for a long time but couldn’t come up with a good idea.","“Forget it, this matter needs to be considered at length and can’t be acted rashly, otherwise it will be a failure. You’re bringing fire to yourself.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said.","At the same time, he heaved a sigh of relief.","It was not a bad thing that Elder Shen Lian had come to look for him. At least, Jian Wushuang knew that there was a pair of eyes watching him in the dark. As such, he would be more cautious in his actions.","Whoosh.","The candles in the Corpse Cave continued to burn, and green smoke rose.","Jian Wushuang sat down cross-legged and began to study the void power while refining Supreme Tarot.","When they were on their way to the Corpse Cave, Jian Wushuang asked for a book on ‘void power’ from Elder Shen Lian. The book had analyzed the structure and analysis of void power in detail.","“Void power is the same as divine power. It is a type of energy in the universe.”","“In essence, there’s no difference between void power and divine power. They’re just a medium to use divine techniques. It’s just that the order of their particles, atoms, electrons, and protons is different because of the different laws of the two universes.”","“In other words, as long as I can figure out the deepest structure of divine power or void power and rearrange the order of particles, atoms, electrons, and protons, I can turn divine power into void power or void power into divine power!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he quickly thought about it.","This sounded simple, but in reality, it was extremely difficult to do.","There were at least billions of combinations contained in void power or divine power, and the number of times they could be broken and combined again was even more infinite.","It was like trying to rearrange a hundred million numbers to find a perfect number. It required a lot of effort and was an impossible task.","“Even though I’m a Supreme realm martial artist now and can deduce 10 billion times with a single thought, I’ll still need an extremely long time to deduce a correct result.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up and he began to think about the possibility.","The first thing he needed to understand was the composition of void power.","This required a lot of effort and time to deduce. Next, he had to mess up all these structural components and then match them with the structural components of divine power.","Only after he understood the composition of void power and divine power could he try to turn divine power into void power.","“It will take too much time for me to deduce them one by one. I don’t have the time to waste now. The God Refining Sect is one of the top sects in the void universe, so there should be a library in the sect. I should go to the library first and see if there are any books that record the most primitive structure of void power.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. He took a deep breath and stood up.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang strode out of the Corpse Cave and headed down the limestone mountain.","At the foot of the limestone mountain, an alluring woman with cat ears and fox tail was walking out of the Corpse Cave. She was wearing thin silk and had an enchanting figure.","“Oh, I finally broke through to 3-Star!”","This alluring woman stretched lazily and stretched her body. A pair of white and straight long legs were faintly visible in the silk. Coupled with the lazy expression on her face, she was particularly moving and made people’s imagination run wild.","Whoosh!","Suddenly, there was a gust of wind and Jian Wushuang appeared in front of her.","“Hello, may I ask where the Library Pavilion is?” Jian Wushuang asked politely.","The enchanting woman looked at Jian Wushuang with her beautiful eyes and said, “Hey, Who are you? I’ve never seen you on the limestone mountain.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and replied, “Miss, I just arrived at the limestone mountain yesterday. It’s normal that you don’t know me.”","“Oh?” The alluring woman blinked her eyes playfully. She then slapped her head and shouted, “Ah, I know! Are you Wushuang, the one who just entered the sect and has extraordinary talent?”","“You know me?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said.","The enchanting woman immediately pouted and said, “That’s right. Recently, I’ve been in closed-door cultivation. I keep hearing people outside the Corpse Cave saying that an extremely talented genius has come to our God Refining Sect and is loved by Elder Mi Feng. It’s so noisy that I can’t cultivate properly.”","“Is that so? I’m sorry,” Jian Wushuang replied with a smile.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s apologetic words, the enchanting woman seemed to feel a little apologetic. She waved her hand and said, “Alright, it’s none of your business.”","After saying that, the enchanting woman’s beautiful eyes turned and she said, “Hey, Wushuang, you said you were going to the Library Pavilion, right?”","“That’s right.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Ah, Wushuang, let me give you a kind reminder. It’s best if you don’t go to the library now.”","“Eh? Why?” Jian Wushuang could not help but raise his eyebrows curiously.","“You don’t understand? Fine, then this lady will give you a few words of advice.”","The enchanting woman cast a sidelong glance at Jian Wushuang and snorted, “Wushuang, our sect is divided into six branches. The five great Grand Elders each take a branch, and the Sect Master takes a branch. On the surface, the disciples of these six branches are peaceful, but in reality, they form their own factions and constantly fight in the dark.”","“You were brought back by Elder Mi Feng from outside the sect, so you should belong to Elder Mi Feng’s branch.”","“However, Elder Mi Feng’s branch is a little special. Because of its small population, it’s almost not a faction. The few disciples under him are all part of the other five branches.”","“Today, the disciples of all five branches are gathered in the library to discuss the matters of the sect competition. If you go to the library now, you will definitely be caught by the disciples of all five branches and forced to join one branch.”","“If you were an ordinary disciple, no one would care which branch you belong to. But now that you’re carrying the name of an absolute talent, the disciples of the five branches will definitely fight for you. No matter which branch you belong to, you’ll be suppressed by the disciples of the other four branches.”","“Therefore, this lady would advise you to avoid the limelight for now, and go to the Library Pavilion in a few days.”","The enchanting woman said.","“Is this a dispute between the factions in the sect?” Jian Wushuang shook his head. What a boring fight. “Thank you. May I ask how I should address you?”","The alluring woman laughed. “Hehe, you’re welcome. Wushuang, you entered the sect later than me. You can just call me Senior Sister Jiu Sha.”","“Alright, I got it.”","...","Jian Wushuang nodded and asked Jiu Sha for the specific address of the Library Pavilion. Then, he took a step forward and suddenly burst out."]},{"number":4480,"title":"Chapter 4480 Five Branch Disciples","paragraphs":["4480 Five Branch Disciples","The God Refining Sect was extremely vast.","The Library Pavilion was quite far away from the limestone mountain. After half an incense stick of time, Jian Wushuang saw a Palace that looked like a demon’s mouth according to the address given by Jiu Sha.","The palace looked ghostly. There was a black plaque hanging on it with the words ‘Library Pavilion’ written on it.","“This is the Library Pavilion? This style is really in line with the style of the God Refining Sect.”","Jian Wushuang could not help but be slightly dumbfounded. He shook his head and walked into the Library Pavilion.","It was quiet inside, and there was no one else. The disciples of the five divisions should not have arrived yet.","There were countless huge bookshelves in the Library Pavilion. The bookshelves were filled with books, and there were at least tens of millions of them.","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat and he immediately spread his divine power and shot it toward the books.","In the blink of an eye, the contents of thousands of books fell into Jian Wushuang’s mind.","Jian Wushuang slowly closed his eyes and began to read the contents of the books carefully, trying to find an explanation about void power.","Time slowly passed.","Two hours...","Four hours...","Six hours...","“I found it!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly opened and there was a flash of light in his eyes.","Whizzz.","The next moment.","An ancient yellow book flew from the shelf and into Jian Wushuang’s hand.","The content recorded in this book was to search for the most basic and original source of void power.","There was a scar on the book, which indicated who had borrowed it from the Library Pavilion. Seeing that the book was already in his hands, Jian Wushuang naturally did not need to stay in the Library Pavilion any longer. He turned around and walked out of the Library Pavilion.","Thud, thud, thud.","Just as he reached the door, Jian Wushuang heard a burst of rapid footsteps.","Immediately after, his vision was blocked by a black shadow. A group of burly God Refining Sect disciples with different appearances blocked his way.","They were all dressed in the same blood-red robe. The disciple at the front had the head of a bear, and the muscles on his arms were bulging. He was topless, and his veins were twisted like terrifying tree roots. On his left shoulder, seven red Stars were shining with a demonic light!","A 7-Star Void Warrior was equivalent to an Ultimate Ruler!","“Please make way.” Jian Wushuang stopped in his tracks. Holding the book in his hand, he raised his head and looked at the disciples calmly.","The Void Warrior Xiong Gang, who was obviously the leader of the group of disciples, lowered his head and sized up Jian Wushuang. Then, a strange look flashed in his eyes.","In the next moment, the corners of his mouth curled up. “Wushuang?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “It’s me. What’s the matter?”","Hearing this, the smile on the face of this tall and burly Void Warrior grew wider. He extended his hand and said, “Wushuang, I’m the head disciple of Grand Elder Pan Shan, Nu Xiong. I think we can sit down and have a chat.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently and said, “I’m not interested.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the entire place fell silent.","The smile on Nu Xiong’s face froze, and his outstretched hand froze on the spot.","“Hey, Wushuang, our boss has personally invited you. Don’t be ungrateful!”","“Wushuang, how can you speak to our Senior Brother Nu Xiong like that?”","“Wushuang, mind your attitude when you speak to Senior Brother Nu Xiong!”","Before the Void Warrior Nu Xiong could speak, the disciples behind him could not help but berate him.","Jian Wushuang frowned and did not speak.","Crack.","Nu Xiong retracted his hand, narrowed his eyes, and said with a fake smile, “Wushuang, it seems you’re not going to give me face?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression remained calm. He looked at him and said, “I’ll say it one last time. Please move aside. You’re blocking my way.”","When he heard this, Nu Xiong’s eyes narrowed again, and the smile on his face finally disappeared.","Just as he was about to continue speaking.","Clap, clap, clap.","Outside the Library Pavilion, a wave of clapping sounds rang out.","“Hahaha, Nu Xiong, I can’t believe that you, the Grand Elder’s head disciple of our sect, who is about to break through to the Scar-level Void Warrior, would actually be told off by a new disciple!”","A rustling sound was heard. Then, a skinny young man with bone wings led a group of people and strode in.","Grand Elder Chen Gu’s head disciple, Void Warrior Hei Chi!","Thud, thud, thud.","It was not over yet. There were more and more 7-Star Void Warriors leading the disciples of the God Refining Sect into the Library Pavilion with their hands behind their backs. Some of them were expressionless, while others had slightly mocking expressions.","It was Xuanyang, the head disciple of the Grand Elder Lan Yue!","He was the first disciple of Grand Elder Jinya, Zhengheng!","In an instant, other than the disciples of the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, the disciples of the four Grand Elders were all present.","...","“Nu Xiong, it seems that your reputation is not very useful. He doesn’t even like you,” Grand Elder Jinya’s chief disciple, Void Warrior Zhengheng, said with a smile.","Immediately, a burst of laughter came from the crowd.","The four of them had been fighting in the dark for a long time. All of them wanted to be the leaders of the younger generation of the God Refining Sect. Now that they had seen Nu Xiong suffer, how could they let go of this opportunity to hit him when he was down?","“Hmph,” Nu Xiong snorted coldly, his eyes fixed on Wushuang. His expression suddenly turned gloomy.","His pair of round eyes flickered with a brutal and murderous light.","“Wushuang, I’ll ask you one last time. Do you not want to give me face?” Nu Xiong said coldly.","Today, either Jian Wushuang submitted to him, or he would use Jian Wushuang to establish his might!","Otherwise, where would his face be?","“Junior Brother Wushuang, don’t be in such a hurry to agree. There’s no need to fear him. Come to my side, I, Hei Chi, and I’ll guarantee your safety!” Void Warrior Hei Chi said as his eyes flashed.","“Junior Brother Wushuang, come to my place. I will definitely protect you!” Void Warrior Zhengheng also quickly said.","For a moment, everyone was talking one after another, and the originally quiet Library Pavilion suddenly became noisy.","...","“So noisy.” Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s face gradually turned cold. He looked at the Nu Xiong who was blocking him like a mountain and only said one word.","“Scam!”","As soon as the word ‘scram’ came out of his mouth, it was like an explosion of rolling thunder. The entire place suddenly fell silent!","“You’re looking for death!” Nu Xiong was instantly enraged. His eyes were filled with killing intent as he reached out his hand to grab Jian Wushuang.","Endless void energy condensed in his hand.","When the others saw this, their eyes narrowed.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s right hand reached out at an even faster speed and grabbed Nu Xiong’s neck!","The next moment!","Jian Wushuang exerted a little force and lifted the Nu Xiong up.","In Jian Wushuang’s hands, Nu Xiong did not seem to be the Overlord of the God Refining Sect, but a little chick that could be easily crushed.","Nu Xiong’s expression instantly changed. No matter how much void energy he used, he could not struggle at all.","Jian Wushuang’s cold voice sounded in his ears.","“I don’t want to participate in your boring game. Don’t come looking for death.”"]},{"number":4481,"title":"Chapter 4481 Void Energy Transformation","paragraphs":["4481 Void Energy Transformation","Pant, pant, pant!","Within the Library Pavilion, heavy panting sounds could be heard.","Nu Xiong’s face turned red as he was lifted up by Jian Wushuang’s fingers.","He kept growling and pulling on Jian Wushuang’s arm with both hands while his legs kept kicking in the air.","However, no matter how hard he struggled, Jian Wushuang’s five slender fingers, with distinct joints, seemed to be cast from molten iron. He could not move them at all.","“Stop!”","“Let go of Senior Brother Nu Xiong!!”","The disciples behind Nu Xiong’s group immediately shouted at him.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless and ignored them.","To the current him, even if he did not use divine power, he could easily crush a Void Warrior like Nu Xiong. He who was not even at the Scar level, he could easily deal with him with just the physical strength of the Chaos Overlord Body.","If Jian Wushuang wanted to kill him, it would be easier than killing an ant.","“Remember, don’t mess with me.” Jian Wushuang looked at him coldly and loosened his fingers.","Plop.","All of a sudden, Nu Xiong fell to the ground on his butt. He raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang, and his forehead was oozing with beads of sweat.","In the eyes of outsiders, it seemed that Jian Wushuang had attacked first and caught him off guard.","However, only he knew what he had just experienced!","Jian Wushuang’s glance had given him a sense of great horror, as if he was on the verge of death. He had only experienced such a feeling and pressure from his master, the Grand Elder Pan Shan.","Thud, thud, thud.","Jian Wushuang held the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword hanging at his waist in one hand and a book in the other as he walked out slowly.","“This guy...” Nu Xiong turned his head and looked at Jian Wushuang’s back. He was still in shock and his back was already half-drenched in sweat.","“Senior Brother Nu Xiong, should we go after him?”","“Senior Brother Nu Xiong, this person has just entered the God Refining Sect. If he doesn’t respect you, what will he do in the future?”","“Senior Brother Nu Xiong, in my opinion, we must go and teach Wushuang a lesson! He’s really too arrogant!”","The disciples said indignantly.","“Shut up!” Nu Xiong spoke coldly, abruptly cutting off the unending words.","“A bunch of idiots, can’t you see? Even I’m no match for him, so how are you going to teach him a lesson?”","Nu Xiong stood up from the ground, took a deep breath, and said, “This Wushuang isn’t simple. From now on, you are not to provoke him in the slightest! Otherwise, if anything happens, I won’t be able to save you. Don’t blame me for not warning you in advance!”","When these disciples heard this, they could not help but look at each other. They opened their mouths as if they wanted to say something, but in the end, nothing came out and they nodded obediently.","“Let’s go!”","Nu Xiong shook his head. After such an interruption, he had already lost all his face. Naturally, there was no need for him to stay here any longer.","Whooosh.","The group of disciples followed behind the Nu Xiong.","Void Warrior Hei Chi, Zhengheng, and the other four disciples could not help but squint their eyes.","“Hei Chi, it seems Wushuang isn’t a simple person,” Void Warrior Xuanyang said.","“Yes, I’m afraid he’s a tough guy who has hidden his strength. Tsk, tsk. Just one move was enough to make the Nu Xiong so frightened and respectful. This Wushuang’s strength is probably at the same level as us,” Void Warrior Hei Chi nodded and said.","“Hmph, who cares about Wushuang’s cultivation? we’ll just not provoke him. However, if he dares to do anything in secret, I’ll definitely make him regret coming to the God Refining Sect!” Zhengheng snorted and said.","Thud, thud, thud.","At this moment, a series of heavy footsteps came from outside the Library Pavilion.","“The Sect Master’s people have arrived!”","The three head disciples, Xuanyang, Hei Chi, and Zhengheng, exchanged glances with one another. Their faces were filled with grave expressions.","To them, Jian Wushuang was just a minor injury. The real enemy was the Sect Master’s branch!","...","Whoosh, whoosh.","Jian Wushuang flew in the air and quickly returned to the limestone mountain.","At the foot of the limestone mountain, the enchanting woman named Jiu Sha was still there. Seeing Jian Wushuang’s intact appearance, she could not help but ask in surprise, “Wushuang, how are you unscathed? Could it be that you didn’t meet the disciples of the five branches?”","Jian Wushuang smiled and replied casually, “I did, but they didn’t cause me any trouble.”","“Ah? Junior Brother Wushuang, your luck is truly good.”","Jiu Sha nodded, then deliberately put on a straight face and said, “However, Junior Brother Wushuang, you must not be careless. The disciples of the five branches are not easy to deal with. You are the only disciple with extraordinary talent in our sect. They will definitely come to find you.”","“Okay, I got it. Thank you.”","Jian Wushuang gave a few perfunctory words and did not talk much. He stomped his right foot on the ground and suddenly shot into the sky, straight into the Corpse Cave at the top of the mountain.","With a wave of his right hand, the magic barrier at the entrance of the Corpse Cave was activated again. Jian Wushuang stepped onto the stone bed and sat down with his legs crossed.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang’s divine power surged into the book and he started to read the information recorded in it carefully.","The book only recorded the general formation of the void power. As for the detailed formation of the structure, Jian Wushuang still needed to continuously try to assemble it.","However, even so, it was of great help to Jian Wushuang.","...","Before this, he had been like a headless fly. Even if he wanted to form and mess up the structure of divine power and rearrange it, he felt that he did not know where to start.","However, the appearance of this ancient book was equivalent to pointing him in the right direction!","“Let’s start.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and closed his eyes slowly. He started to study and deduce repeatedly in his heart. He messed up the most original structure of the divine power and turned it into void power.","This was a huge project!","A day passed...","Two days had passed...","In the blink of an eye, half a month had passed.","During this half a month, it was calm and no one disturbed Jian Wushuang’s cultivation. This allowed Jian Wushuang to completely immerse himself in the transformation of divine power and void power!","The dragonspine incense candles on the candlestick continued to burn with green smoke that would never go out.","One day, half a month later.","...","“I found it!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his bloodshot eyes. However, he did not look tired at all. Instead, he was ecstatic.","A period of 15 days was usually as short as a breath for cultivators. It was so short that it could be ignored.","However, to Jian Wushuang, his gains in the past 15 days were huge!","For 15 days, Jian Wushuang had been deducing in his mind every minute and every second. The mental strength he had spent was simply uncountable.","However, fortunately, he finally found the most crucial point of conversion between divine power and void power!"]},{"number":4482,"title":"Chapter 4482 Successful Conversion","paragraphs":["4482 Successful Conversion","To the current Jian Wushuang, there was nothing more important than turning divine power into void power!","As long as he could convert his divine power into void power, not only would he be able to find a way to completely destroy the curse power that Wang Liu had left in his body, but he could also break through to the Intermediate Supreme realm!","He had been stuck at the Primary Supreme level for too long. Before he had gone to the Offworld Battlefield, he had already had a chance to break through to the Intermediate Supreme level. Now that he had gone to the Void Universe, he could finally break through to the Intermediate Supreme level.","To him, the Intermediate Supreme realm was just a step away.","However, his breakthrough had been delayed time and time again because of this and that. It was only when he entered the Void Universe that Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough was completely cut off.","In the God Refining Sect, there were many inconveniences in breaking through. It was inevitable that his aura would leak out.","And once the aura leaked out, it could be said that a disaster would come.","If he could turn divine power into void power, he would not need to worry about this.","As long as he could convert his divine power into void power, not only would he be able to break through to the Intermediate Supreme realm without any worries, but he would also be able to completely solve his worries. Even if he were to fight with others, he would not be afraid of the risk of being exposed.","“Let’s start now.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he stretched out his right hand.","Instantly, a large amount of divine power gushed out of his hand and turned into a ball of divine power.","“Change!”","In an instant, the most fundamental power of divine power started to change!","Whizzzz.","The ball of divine power kept twisting and changing, making a cracking sound like glass breaking.","Bang! Bang!","The next moment, the entire ball of divine power exploded!","“Did it fail?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes but he was not discouraged. Instead, he took a deep breath, and the ball of divine power condensed in his hand again.","Whoosh.","In the deepest part of the divine power, where it could not be seen by the naked eye, protons and electrons were separated and then reassembled.","Jian Wushuang held his breath and stared at the ball of divine power in his palm.","Crack, crack!","The divine power twisted and made a sound similar to glass breaking.","The ball of divine power began to flicker, as if it was changing in another direction.","Jian Wushuang could not help but show a touch of joy.","However, before he could even smile...","Bang!","With an explosion, the entire ball of divine power shattered again!","“Another failure?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. This time, he did not rush to form the ball of divine power again. Instead, he started to think about the changes in it.","After a long while, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and continued his experiment.","Bang! Bang!","Failed.","Bang! Bang!","Failed.","...","This cycle continued for three days.","Pfft!","A ball of divine power that looked like the sun suddenly jumped and made a deep sound.","In the next moment, the ball of gold power began to tremble violently.","Its aura began to move toward an unknown realm.","Jian Wushuang stared at the ball of divine power. He could feel that he was only one step away from success!","The surrounding space was being compressed crazily, and cracks appeared in the void.","Boom!!!","All of a sudden, a loud explosion was heard.","Endless smoke filled the air.","Jian Wushuang swung his sleeve and dispersed the smoke. The next moment, the ball of divine power that was originally golden had turned black.","“This is...”","The light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly grew by three inches. His usually calm face could not help but show a touch of excitement.","He stretched out his hand and touched the ball of divine power.","“Void power! This is void power!”","Jian Wushuang laughed out loud.","It was a success! He had finally succeeded!","...","He had spent a lot of effort calculating the structure and arrangement of divine power and void power. Then, after continuous experiments, he finally started from the origin of divine power and changed its structure, turning it into void power!","“Then the next step is to transform all of my divine power into void power!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he thought quickly in his mind.","As long as the first step was completed and the method to convert divine power into void power was found, then the later conversion between divine power and void power would just be done according to the book and so on.","“Transform!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice.","In an instant, the divine power in his body that was as vast as the ocean changed!","Crack!!!","The structure instantly changed and reassembled!","Jian Wushuang’s aura began to change dramatically.","A moment later.","...","“It’s done!”","Jian Wushuang smiled. He had turned all the divine power in his body into void power.","Even if he used his divine arts to fight with others, no one would be able to see any trace of divine power in his body.","Of course, this did not mean that Jian Wushuang had really become a Void Warrior.","His divine soul and life source were both from the Divine Power Universe.","The next step is to break through to the Intermediate Supreme realm.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. He decided to take this opportunity to break through to the Intermediate Supreme realm.","Once he broke through to the Intermediate Supreme Martial Artist realm, his strength would have a qualitative improvement!","“Wushuang!”","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to break through in one go, a solemn voice suddenly came from outside the Corpse Cave.","“Eh? Elder Mi Feng?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and waved his hand to remove the barrier at the entrance of the Corpse Cave.","Jian Wushuang stood up and rushed to the entrance of the Corpse Cave.","“Elder Mi Feng.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and bowed to him.","“Yes.” Elder Mi Feng nodded in response before asking, “Wushuang, how have you been in the sect? I’ve heard that you had a conflict with the head disciple of Pan Shan’s line, that little fellow Nu Xiong?”","Jian Wushuang was dumbfounded. Was Elder Mi Feng so well-informed?","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Elder Mi Feng, it’s just a small conflict that doesn’t matter. There’s no need to take it to heart.”","“Yes, that’s good.”","Elder Mi Feng stroked his beard and nodded with a smile, “Wushuang, with your talent, you’ll definitely be a dragon-like figure in our God Refining Sect in the future. There’s no need to bother with those ordinary disciples. You just need to cultivate in peace. When you break through to the Scar-level, I’ll recommend you to the sect master and make you an Elder of our sect.”","“Then I’ll have to thank you, Elder Mi Feng.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“There’s no need to be so polite with me.” Elder Mi Feng shook his head and said with a smile, “Wushuang, I should have come to take you to see the Sect Master long ago, but something happened at the last minute, and I was delayed.”","“Alright, now you’ll have to follow me. The Sect Master is very curious about you.”"]},{"number":4483,"title":"Chapter 4483 God Refinement Sect Master","paragraphs":["4483 God Refinement Sect Master","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh!","Jian Wushuang followed behind Elder Mi Feng and quickly headed toward the highest peak of the God Refining Sect.","That was where the God Refining Sect’s Sect Master was.","According to Jian Wushuang’s observation over the past ten days, he had figured out some of the strength of the God Refining Sect.","The Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Ba Huang, was a Six Scar Void Warrior. In terms of the Divine Power Universe realm, he was an Invincible Supreme!","Under the Sect Master Ba Huang, there were another five Grand Elders. Even the weakest of these five Grand Elders had reached the Four Scar level!","Under these five Grand Elders, there were nearly 20 ordinary Scar level Void Warriors.","This was the strength of the God Refining Sect on the surface.","In terms of the Divine Power Universe, it was similar to the Divine Life Palace, but it was much stronger than the Divine Life Palace.","This was because everyone in the God Refining Sect had a divine corpse that was similar to their own strength. In other words, it was equivalent to doubling the number of Void Warriors in the God Refining Sect!","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was certain that there was an even more unimaginable power in the God Refining Sect.","Jian Wushuang thought about it and kept comparing the God Refining Sect with the Divine Power Universe he was in.","Once the two universes went to war, the God Refining Sect would be a tough bone to chew.","Under Elder Mi Feng’s lead, the two of them were extremely fast. It did not take long for them to reach the highest peak of the God Refining Sect.","A palace that looked like it was made of countless white bones appeared before Jian Wushuang and Elder Mi Feng.","Countless yellow will-o’- the-wisps floated in the air, like fireflies, lighting up the sky.","“Wushuang, the Sect Master is inside. Please follow me in,” Elder Mi Feng turned to Jian Wushuang and said with a smile.","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded. From the moment he stepped into the palace, he could vaguely feel a pair of eyes watching him in the dark.","If he was not wrong, this pair of eyes should be the God Refining Sect’s Sect Master.","If he had not converted his divine power into void power, Jian Wushuang might have been worried. However, now that he had figured out the nature of divine power and void power and had successfully converted them, he was confident that even if the God Refining Sect Master had a pair of sharp eyes, he would definitely not be able to see through his identity!","Creak.","The two black iron gates of the Sect Master’s palace opened on their own, and Elder Mi Feng and Jian Wushuang strode in.","The first to enter his sight were the Grand Elders and a group of Elders who were standing on both sides of the hall. Among them, the Elder Shen Lian was also present.","He saw Jian Wushuang walk into the hall and a sinister smile appeared on his face.","At the very top of the hall, a dignified middle-aged man in an extremely long black robe with the corners of his clothes scattered on the ground and a vertical eye between his brows sat on the main seat.","He did not need to guess to know that this person was the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Ba Huang!","“Sect Master, I’ve brought Wushuang.” Elder Mi Feng cupped his hands at him, then walked to the middle of the two sides and returned to his seat.","“Disciple Wushuang greets Lord Sect Master!” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and lowered his head.","“Raise your head and look at me.” A deep and majestic voice came from the God Refining Sect Master’s mouth.","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang looked up.","The God Refining Sect Master looked at him with bright eyes. His face was expressionless, and no one could tell what he was thinking.","A mountain-like pressure suddenly spread out from his body and pressed down on Jian Wushuang like a mountain.","Jian Wushuang’s body sank.","“Wushuang, I’ve heard that when you came to participate in the selection of our sect’s disciples, you accompanied three other people, right?” the God Refining Sect Master said indifferently.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded his head. He knew that the God Refining Sect Master was trying to manipulate him.","Or rather, the God Refining Sect Master did not completely believe in his identity.","Jian Wushuang could not help but turn his eyes slightly. He glanced around and saw that Elder Shen Lian was also looking at him with a faint smile.","The two of them looked at each other.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang understood that Elder Shen Lian must have said something behind his back.","“Do you know the identity of these three people?” the God Refining Sect Master asked again.","The pressure on Jian Wushuang suddenly became heavier.","“I don’t!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and replied with certainty.","“Oh? Do you really not know, or are you just pretending?” the Sect Master asked calmly as the corners of his mouth curled up.","“Sect Master, if you have something to say, you might as well say it directly!” Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the God Refining Sect Master seriously.","Facing the overbearing gaze of the God Refining Sect Master, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were clear and he did not have any intention to retreat.","When the God Refining Sect Master heard this, his pupils could not help but shrink.","“You little fellow, you are quite bold.” The God Refining Sect Master shook his head and continued, “Wushuang, I’ll be direct. I suspect that you are in cahoots with the three spies who want to enter my God Refining Sect. Can you allow me to use the Soul-Searching Technique?”","As he said that, the divine light in the God Refining Sect Master’s eyes grew by three inches and he stared at Jian Wushuang.","Elder Shen Lian had a mocking expression on his face.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank when he heard this.","The divine universe also had the Soul-Searching Technique. It could enter the divine body and soul directly through the great Dharma power to see the cause and effect and see the past and the future clearly.","“Why wouldn’t I?” Jian Wushuang thought quickly and replied with a laugh.","He knew that he could not afford to show any signs of fear.","The moment he hesitated, it would only increase the suspicion of the God Refining Sect Master and increase the risk of being exposed.","...","He could only take a gamble!","He gambled that the God Refining Sect Master would definitely not use the Soul-Searching Technique on him!","This technique forcefully pried into the heavenly secrets Great Dao and was extremely harmful to the person who was being searched. It could be said that it destroyed the Dao Foundation and destroyed the target’s future.","And now, he had a rare super-grade talent in the God Refining Sect. The God Refining Sect Master would definitely not reverse the cause and effect and forcefully destroy this good seedling because of a groundless guess.","As expected, before the Sect Master could say anything, Elder Mi Feng stepped out and said anxiously, “Sect Master, you can’t do this!”","“Wushuang is a rare talent in our God Refining Sect. He has also refined the number one divine corpse in our sect. His future is limitless. If we use the Soul-Searching Technique on him, it will be the same as cutting off his path of advancement!”","The Sect Master of the God Refining Sect snorted and said, “Elder Mi Feng, the greater one’s talent is, the greater the danger. You should know better than me the identities of the three people who appeared outside the Mountain Gate selection that day, right? If this Wushuang has ill intentions and comes from the same place as those three, then our universe’s tens of millions of years of plan will be exposed and ruined. Can you bear the responsibility?”","Then, the God Refining Sect Master looked at Jian Wushuang coldly and said, “Wushuang, this matter is of great importance. We can’t allow even a one-in-a-million risk. Don’t blame me for being merciless.”","As soon as he finished his words, a large amount of void energy gathered in the hands of the God Refining Sect Master.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s heart sank to the extreme!","..."]},{"number":4484,"title":"Chapter 4484 Grand Elder Pan Shan","paragraphs":["4484 Grand Elder Pan Shan","Escape?","At that moment, thousands of thoughts flashed in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","He would definitely not allow the God Refining Sect Master to perform the Soul-Searching Technique. If he did, the fact that he came from the Divine Power Universe would definitely be exposed.","Although he had turned his divine power into ethereal energy, the Soul-Searching Technique allowed him to enter the river of time and trace the deepest memories.","This was something that Jian Wushuang could not change no matter how much he tried.","Rather than being exposed and killed after being soul searched, it was better to retreat now!","For a moment, Jian Wushuang’s expression remained unchanged, but he began to think of retreating.","If he had activated Primordial Universe and Life Intimidation, in addition to secret skills that burned his divine power like Dragon Blood Secret Skill, he might catch these guys off guard. Jian Wushuang believed that he might have had a chance to escape.","Moreover, he still had ‘Divine Power Composition’ as a trump card, which could confuse the heavenly secrets.","However, in that case, all of Jian Wushuang’s previous efforts would be in vain, and he would not be able to take the divine corpse of Supreme Tarot away.","“Wushuang, come.”","Just as the God Refining Sect Master was about to prepare the Soul-Searching Technique.","One of the five Grand elders, Elder Pan Shan’s eyes flickered and he suddenly said, “Sect master, Mi Feng is right. This Wushuang is a rare seedling of our God Refining Sect. With his talent, he’ll definitely become an existence on equal footing with us in the future. If we use the Soul-Searching Technique and find that he really did come from the same place as those three, then it’s fine.”","“Please reconsider this matter, Sect Master.”","Jian Wushuang, who had already fled, raised his eyebrows and looked at Elder Pan Shan.","Elder Pan Shan nodded at him and a strange light that only Jian Wushuang could see flashed in his eyes.","“Hmm?” Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat.","“Yes! Lord Sect Master, can you test if Wushuang is from the same place as those three? There are many other ways to tell, why do you need to use a Soul-Searching Technique?” Elder Mi Feng hurriedly said.","When the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect heard this, a hint of hesitation flashed in his eyes.","As if he was in deep thought, the God Refining Sect Master nodded his head after a while and said, “Alright, then we’ll do as the Elders say.”","“Wushuang, how about this? Release your void energy and let Sect Master take a look.”","As soon as he said that, the others did not have any expression on their faces. However, Elder Shen Lian let out a sinister smile.","He had asked around. Ever since Jian Wushuang entered the God Refining Sect, he had never really used void power.","Even in the Library Pavilion, when he clashed with the disciples of the four divisions and fought with the Nu Xiong, he used his physical strength.","From this, one could deduce that there was definitely a reason why Wushuang could not or did not dare to use void power.","However, just a breath later, the smile on Elder Shen Lian’s face instantly froze.","“H-how could this be?”","In the hall, Jian Wushuang spread his fingers. In his palm, there was a black ball condensed by void power that was constantly twisting.","The void energy within was extremely pure.","Jian Wushuang looked at the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect and said, “Lord Sect Master, do you think this is enough?”","In an instant, the Sect Master’s expression darkened, while Elder Mi Feng’s face flashed with satisfaction. As for Grand Elder Pan Shan, who had helped Jian Wushuang earlier, there was a strange look in his eyes. He seemed to be surprised as Jian Wushuang released his void power.","“Impossible! Absolutely impossible! There’s definitely something strange going on!” At this moment, Elder Shen Lian exclaimed.","He stared at Jian Wushuang with a gloomy expression.","Jian Wushuang looked at him with a calm expression and said, “Elder Shen Lian, I don’t know how I’ve offended you. You’ve been targeting me ever since I participated in the entrance selection. I remember that we don’t have much interaction, right? As for the Soul-Searching Technique, I’m afraid it was also you who suggested it to Lord Sect Master to perform it, right? Elder Shen Lian, I’m very curious now. Did I offend you in any way, or did I accidentally violate some of your benefits, causing you to hate me so much?”","The moment he said that, the other Elders seemed to have thought of something. They narrowed their eyes and looked at Elder Shen Lian with a complicated gaze.","They could not help but recall that Elder Shen Lian’s biological son was now the Sect Master’s head disciple and was publicly acknowledged as the God Refining Sect’s number one genius.","Before Jian Wushuang came to the God Refining Sect, Elder Shen Lian had already proposed to the Sect Master time and time again in the main hall for his son to be the next Sect Master substitute.","All sorts of thoughts appeared in the minds of the Elders in the hall.","Once this thought began to take root in his mind, it would gradually sprout and grow stronger until it could not be eliminated.","“Wushuang, you’re talking nonsense...” Elder Shen Lian’s expression changed drastically.","He wanted to continue, but was interrupted.","“Enough!” The Sect Master looked at him coldly and then looked at Jian Wushuang again. He said expressionlessly, “Wushuang, you’re a junior of the sect. You can’t frame an Elder without evidence!”","Pausing for a moment, the God Refining Sect Master continued, “Wushuang, this matter is over. However, after the sect competition, there’s a mission for you to carry out, and you can’t refuse! Do you understand?”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Very well, then you may all leave.”","The God Refining Sect Master returned to his seat and closed his eyes.","The five Grand Elders and the other elders looked at each other and left.","“Wushuang, let’s go,” Elder Mi Feng patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder and said with a smile.","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang left with Elder Mi Feng.","Instantly, the main hall fell silent. Only Elder Shen Lian remained.","He stared at Jian Wushuang’s back and his eyes were filled with hatred.","“Wushuang, just you wait! Don’t be too pleased with yourself, I will catch you sooner or later!”","Elder Shen Lian gritted his teeth.","...","...","Within the God Refining Sect.","Jian Wushuang and Elder Mi Feng were flying in the sky.","“Hmph, Shen Lian is getting more and more overboard!”","“Does he think that he can bully my disciple just because he’s from the sect master’s faction?!”","Elder Mi Feng’s expression was particularly unsightly.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. Elder Shen Lian’s attack on him and the God Refining Sect Master’s test were within his expectations. He saw it coming.","However, Jian Wushuang was surprised by Elder Pan Shan’s sudden words.","Jian Wushuang had a feeling that Grand Elder Pan Shan was not a simple person."]},{"number":4485,"title":"Chapter 4485 A Breakthrough","paragraphs":["4485 A Breakthrough","“This Shen Lian is getting more and more reckless. It seems like it’s time for me to find an opportunity to give him a good beating,” Elder Mi Feng said from the side.","Jian Wushuang was thinking about the Grand Elder Pan Shan. He could not help but ask, “Elder Mi Feng, may I ask where this Elder Pan Shan came from?”","“Pan Shan?”","Elder Mi Feng faltered upon hearing this. After some thought, he muttered, “I don’t know much about Elder Pan Shan. Even though we are the five Grand Elders, Pan Shan has always been a loner and rarely interacts with us.”","“It’s said that tens of thousands of chaos cycles ago, the previous Sect Master brought him back from a remote forbidden area in the universe. Elder Pan Shan stayed in the God Refining Sect for tens of thousands of chaos cycles, never stepping out of the sect.”","“Speaking of which, the number of times that Elder Pan Shan has fought is extremely few. However, every time he strikes, it is a thunderous strike. I’m afraid that in terms of cultivation and strength, he is not below me.”","“Is that so?”","Jian Wushuang thought for a moment. He had a vague guess.","However, whether this guess was correct or not, it would take time to verify.","The two of them chatted as they flew in the air. Soon, they arrived at the top of the limestone mountain, outside the Corpse Cave that belonged to Jian Wushuang.","“Wushuang, the sect will soon be holding the Sect Disciple Competition. Do you want to participate? If you participate, I’ll leave a spot for you.”","Elder Mi Feng asked.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and shook his head, “I don’t think so. I’ve had some Enlightenment recently and I’m afraid I’m about to break through. Sect Master has another task for me later. I want to use this time to improve my cultivation.”","“You’re about to break through?” Elder Mi Feng’s eyes immediately lit up when he heard this. He clapped his hands and laughed. “Good, good, good. Wushuang, it’s still more important for you to break through. As for the disciple competition, it’s just an opportunity to show off your talent. With your talent, why do you need the Sect Disciple Competition to prove yourself?”","Afraid that he would disturb Jian Wushuang’s cultivation, Elder Mi Feng left with a smile after giving him a few more instructions.","Jian Wushuang looked at Elder Mi Feng’s back and could not help but sigh.","Within the God Refining Sect, he had a rather good impression of Elder Mi Feng. However, the two of them were naturally hostile to each other. It was likely that they would face each other on the Offworld Battlefield.","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang stopped thinking and strode into the Corpse Cave.","Today in the Sect Master’s hall, it was really dangerous. If there was even a slight mistake, he would have been killed.","If not for Elder Pan Shan’s sudden words at the last moment, he would have either lost his life at the hands of the God Refining Sect or been chased by them, his life and death hanging by a thread.","“Pan Shan... tens of thousands of chaos cycles ago, he was brought back by the previous Sect Master from a remote forbidden area... he rarely made a move... he’s reclusive...”","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the stone bed, his eyes twinkling as he pondered over Elder Mi Feng’s description of Elder Pan Shan.","After a while, Jian Wushuang shook his head. Even if his guess was true, he would not rashly acknowledge Elder Pan Shan before he gave him a clear signal.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang slowly closed his eyes and stopped thinking. Then, he started to break through to Intermediate Supreme realm.","Bang bang bang!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang activated all the divine power in his body. Like boiling water, it started to circulate madly.","His divine body made a bone-cracking sound like frying beans.","“Absorb!”","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and inhaled. Suddenly, his body seemed to have turned into a huge Whirlpool, swallowing a large amount of void power in one gulp. Then, it was transformed and rushed toward the barrier between the Primary and Intermediate Supreme realms like a rolling wave!","Bang!","A loud boom exploded in the Corpse Cave like a bolt of lightning on a clear day!","In an instant, the entire limestone mountain shook!","If Jian Wushuang had set up hundreds of restrictions to suppress it, the impact would have formed a mighty shock wave and blown the entire limestone mountain away!","“W-what’s wrong?”","“What happened?”","“Who’s breaking through?!”","All of a sudden, the disciples who were condensing divine corpses or cultivating in the numerous Corpse Caves in the limestone mountain changed their expressions and rushed out of the caves in a panic.","“The summit! It’s the Corpse Cave at the top of the mountain, someone is breaking through!”","“I remember that the seven Corpse Caves at the top of the mountain were all occupied by the chief disciples. I haven’t heard of any chief disciples breaking through recently.”","“No, no, it’s not the chief disciple, it’s Wushuang!”","“Wushuang? Is he the one who’s been causing a stir in the sect recently, the one with superior aptitude?”","“Not bad! Some time ago, Elder Mi Feng brought Wushuang back to the sect and gave him one of the Seven Great Corpse Caves on the mountain!”","Bang!","In Jian Wushuang’s Corpse Cave, there was another earth-shaking explosion!","In an instant, the limestone mountain shook even more violently.","“Hiss! I remember that Wushuang is only a 3-Star or 4-Star, right? Why is his breakthrough creating such a terrifying commotion?”","“Could this be a super talent? Even his breakthrough is different from ours. Do you want it to be more extraordinary?”","“From the looks of it, I’m afraid he has broken through a small cultivation realm!”","“Tsk tsk, I’m afraid that when Wushuang breaks through, those five head disciples won’t be able to sit still any longer!”","“I heard that Jian Wushuang had a short fight with Nu Xiong in the Library Pavilion some time ago. He defeated Nu Xiong with only one move! In my opinion, this matter should be spread by some busybodies and deliberately exaggerated. But from this, it can be seen that Wushuang’s strength is probably not much weaker than those first disciples!”","“Tsk tsk, this time’s Sect Disciple Competition is truly exciting. I wonder if Wushuang will participate and what rank he’ll get.”","A series of whispers came from the foot of the limestone mountain. Many disciples of the God Refining Sect looked at Jian Wushuang’s position in surprise and started to discuss.","The enchanting woman named Jiu Sha, who had an extremely graceful figure and curvaceous curves, was also there. She widened her beautiful eyes and looked in Jian Wushuang’s direction.","“This guy, how long has he been in the God Refining Sect? He’s already about to break through?”","...","...","Rumble!","At the peak of the God Refining Sect, the wind was blowing and the clouds were rolling. The strong wind was howling and there were flashes of lightning. The ghostly God Refining Sect was as bright as day.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the stone bed and released waves of powerful aura. In his divine body, waves of vast divine power were charging toward the last barrier between Primary Supreme and Intermediate Supreme!","In the past, when Jian Wushuang broke through, he was worried that his aura would leak out and be detected by the Almighties of the God Refining Sect.","However, now that he had converted all his divine power into void power, even the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect would not be able to tell."]},{"number":4486,"title":"Chapter 4486 The Curtain Rises, the Wind and Clouds Move","paragraphs":["4486 The Curtain Rises, the Wind and Clouds Move","Rumble!!!","Like waves and tides, the divine power in Jian Wushuang’s body was like a turbulent river, surging toward the barrier between the Primary and Intermediate Supreme realms.","Wave after wave.","“Break!”","!!","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang’s eyes opened and a bright light flashed in his eyes. The light grew by three inches.","A surge of noble spirit rose from Jian Wushuang’s body.","A terrifyingly sharp aura surged with Jian Wushuang as the center!","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s strength had once again made a leap!","In just a breath’s time, the aura was instantly retracted by Jian Wushuang. He took a deep breath and stood up from the stone bed with a smile on his face.","“Intermediate Supreme realm, done!”","He could clearly feel that no matter if it was his divine power or physical strength, they were much stronger than before!","If this was an increase in his basic attributes, Jian Wushuang could also clearly feel that his degree of compatibility with the Great Dao of heaven and earth and his understanding of various divine techniques and powers had become clearer.","It was as if an eye-obstructing leaf had been removed. Jian Wushuang’s mind became much clearer, which was rare.","In fact, Jian Wushuang even had the thought of creating his own divine technique.","“I’ve become stronger!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with understanding. He was confident that if he were to fight with Supreme Bing Ye again, he would definitely win with ease and would not be forced into a corner.","It could be said that as long as the Invincible Supreme did not appear, he, Jian Wushuang, would be unbeatable in the Supreme realm!","In other words, even in the God Refining Sect, as long as the Sect Master did not appear, even if it was the five Grand Elders, Jian Wushuang would not be afraid as long as he had his sword in hand!","“Now, it’s time to increase my strength on the surface.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and his void power, which was originally 3-Stars, instantly doubled and rose to 6-Stars.","6-Star was equivalent to the Ultimate Ruler realm in his home universe.","“Now, I just need to keep refining Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse. If I can refine Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse to the Supreme realm, I can join forces with him and go anywhere in the universe.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and started to think about his next plan.","Now that he had just broken through to the Intermediate Supreme realm, it would be impossible for him to advance to the senior Supreme Martial Artist level without hundreds of thousands of years of hard work.","Thus, the fastest way to increase his strength was to refine the divine corpse of the Supreme Tarot!","After all, although the two universes seemed calm, the undercurrents were already brewing. No one knew when the war between the two universes would break out.","Once war broke out, a Supreme could be said to be like an ant that could fall at any time. Without the minimum combat strength of a High Supreme realm, one would not even be qualified to enter the battlefield.","Hence, Jian Wushuang had to take advantage of the buffer period before the war to reach his peak state!","Only in this way could he have a chance to protect himself in the great battle.","“Refine!”","Jian Wushuang did not stop. After thinking for a while, he took a deep breath, sat down cross-legged, and began to refine the divine corpse of Supreme Tarot.","Waves of void power gushed out from Jian Wushuang’s hands and pierced into Supreme Tarot’s body like fine needles. Like a small fire, it refined Supreme Tarot at a moderate pace.","...","At the foot of the limestone mountain.","Many of the alarmed disciples walked out of the Corpse Cave and looked at the peak of the limestone mountain, which was gradually regaining its calm. They looked at each other.","“He’s done with his breakthrough?”","“It seems Wushuang’s breakthrough went smoothly.”","“I wonder what cultivation level Wushuang is at right now. Once he breaks through, his divine corpse’s night power will surely skyrocket.”","“Hahaha, I’m already looking forward to Wushuang’s appearance in the Sect Disciple Competition!”","Many disciples laughed as they discussed the matter.","Meanwhile, in the other Corpse Caves on the top of the limestone mountain, the faces of the Void Warriors Hei Chi, Zhengheng, Xuanyang, and others darkened.","They knew that this time’s entrance disciple selection would most likely have side effects.","At the same time, in the Sect Master’s bedroom, which was very far away from the limestone mountain.","The head disciple of the Sect Master’s faction, Yan Dan, who was sitting cross-legged in meditation, twitched his eyelids.","“The void energy fluctuation from the breakthrough just now...”","“Is it Wushuang, the person with extraordinary aptitude that Father spoke of, the one that I’ve been trying my best to kill?”","“Interesting. It seems like I’ve finally found an interesting opponent for this year’s Sect Disciple Competition.”","Yan Dan, who was sitting cross-legged in the dark, slowly lifted the corner of his mouth into a sinister smile.","“Wushuang? Superior aptitude? Hahahaha, finally, there’s someone who can arouse my desire to fight!”","Boom!","An 8-Star aura spread out from Yan Dan’s body.","Immediately, this aura became stronger and stronger, stronger and stronger, fiercely charging toward the Scar-level Void Warrior!","All of a sudden, because of Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough, the situation where between the five branches became a little delicate.","Among the disciples of the God Refining Sect, the discussion about ‘Wushuang’ began to rise and fall.","...","...","Time slowly passed. In the blink of an eye, ten years had passed.","In the past ten years, the already desolate God Refining Sect became even more desolate. It was almost impossible to see any disciples of the God Refining Sect outside.","Everyone was holding their breath and cultivating in seclusion in their own Corpse Caves, hoping that they could make further progress or research their trump cards.","All of this was because he hoped that he would be able to soar into the sky and show off his talents in the upcoming Sect Disciple Competition.","This was related to their future cultivation resources, status advancement, and so on. It was extremely important.","Finally, on a certain day ten years later, the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect gave the order and the Sect Disciple Competition began.","In an instant, the entire God Refining Sect was in an uproar. Countless disciples who had been in seclusion for a long time walked out of the dark Corpse Caves.","Some of them were eager to give it a try, some were certain of victory, and it was clear that they had gained something during this period of closed-door cultivation. There were even more who looked worried and uneasy.","At the same time, on the same day that the news of the Sect Disciples Competition had spread, another piece of equally eye-catching news had also spread.","In the past ten years, the dark horse Wushuang, who was praised to be on the verge of breaking the dominance of the five branches, and who had emerged from nowhere, had refused to participate in this Sect Disciple Competition!","...","All of a sudden, the God Refining Sect disciples who had been waiting for Jian Wushuang to show his strength were dumbfounded. They were so shocked that their eyes almost fell out.","Wushuang actually rejected the Sect Disciple Competition?"]},{"number":4487,"title":"Chapter 4487 Refining","paragraphs":["4487 Refining","Within the God Refining Sect, as the time for the Sect Disciple Competition drew closer, it became more and more lively.","The five lead disciples, as well as some mysterious disciples who had been in seclusion for many years, came out of the Corpse Cave.","All of a sudden, the entire God Refining Sect was in a state of chaos.","Normally, at this time, the focus of the discussion would be those who had participated in the Sect Disciple Competition and the candidates who were the favorites to win.","!!","However, this time, it was a little strange.","“Then Wushuang, why is she unwilling to participate in the Sect Disciple Competition this time?”","Countless disciples of the God Refining Sect were confused.","At the same time, compared to the doubts of the ordinary disciples, the head disciples of the five branches heaved a sigh of relief.","Only one person was an exception.","...","Within the God Refining Sect, in a side hall of the Sect Master’s sleeping chamber.","Yan Dan, the head disciple of the Sect Master’s branch, was cultivating here.","There were no candles in the room, so it was dark.","“He didn’t participate in the tournament?” Yan Dan suddenly opened his eyes. In his eyes, wisps of black mist gushed out.","In front of him, Elder Shen Lian sat cross-legged with a cold expression.","“Father, Wushuang actually didn’t participate in the tournament. What should we do next?” Yan Dan asked with a frown.","Elder Shen Lian’s face was gloomy as he said, “I didn’t expect Wushuang to be so sneaky as to directly reject the sect competition. This way, it won’t be good for us to attack him.”","Yan Dan nodded his head and could not help but ask in confusion, “Father, I’m actually very puzzled as well. Why does Father have such a deep hatred for this Wushuang that you must kill him and be happy?”","“Idiot, I’m doing this to pave the way for you!” Elder Shen Lian’s eyes widened as he glared at Yan Dan. He snorted coldly, “This Wushuang is a rare super talent! Superior aptitude, what kind of concept was that? It could be said that Wushuang already had an entrance ticket for a Six Scar level Void Warrior.”","“That day in the Great Hall, the Sect Master wanted to use the Soul-Searching Technique, but was stopped by the two Elders Pan Shan and Mi Feng. I’m afraid that if Wushuang wants to fight for the position of Sect Master, the two Elders will help him.”","After a pause, Elder Shen Lian glanced at Yan Dan in disdain and continued, “If I don’t think of a way to kill him now, do you think you can compete for the Sect Master’s position?”","“Son, remember, everything I’ve done is to clear the obstacles for you so that you can gradually rise to the top,” Elder Shen Lian said after taking a deep breath.","Yan Dan laughed in embarrassment and replied, “Father, I thought that you truly did suspect that Wushuang came from an alternate universe.”","“That... that’s also one of the reasons.”","However, Elder Shen Lian nodded his head solemnly.","Logically speaking, Jian Wushuang had used void power and passed the test of the Trial Foundation Stone. He should not have suspected Jian Wushuang any longer.","However, for some reason, he felt that there was something wrong with Jian Wushuang.","This was his intuition.","After thinking for a moment, Elder Shen Lian shook his head and said, “Alright, let’s not talk about this anymore. Although Wushuang didn’t participate in the Sect Disciple Competition this time, it doesn’t mean that we can’t do anything to him.”","“Eh? Father, what do you mean by that? Do you mean we still have a chance to kill him?” Yan Dan’s eyes lit up as he asked curiously.","Elder Shen Lian smiled mysteriously at him and said while stroking his beard, “The other day, the Sect Master said in the hall that he would send Wushuang out for a mission after the Sect Disciple Competition. If I’m not wrong, the Sect Master must want Jian Wushuang to explore the Land of Gods. At that time, I will add a quota for the mission to the Sect Master, and that quota will naturally be you.”","“Hehe, when we leave the God Refining Sect, who can still protect that kid Wushuang? At that time, wouldn’t his life and death be in your hands?”","When he said this, a cold glint flashed in Elder Shen Lian’s eyes.","“Hahaha, Father, this is a brilliant plan!”","Yan Dan immediately laughed out loud when he heard this. He then chuckled and said, “When Wushuang dies and the current Sect Master abdicates, won’t the God Refining Sect be ours?”","“Very good!” Elder Shen Lian nodded in satisfaction and said, “Son, the Sect Master has treated you quite well. When the day comes that you become the Sect Master, don’t act like a petty person who has achieved success. You must also be respectful to the current Sect Master, understand?”","“I understand.”","The two of them looked at each other and started to imagine what it would be like when they became the Sect Master.","...","Three days later.","After the speech by the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, the Sect Disciple Competition officially began under the lead of the five Grand Elders.","The competition had officially started. All the disciples of the God Refining Sect were focused on the competition. Naturally, no one paid any attention to Jian Wushuang.","The entire God Refining Sect was in an uproar.","Countless disciples amazed the world with a single brilliant feat and soared into the sky, showing their extraordinary talents in the competition.","Each of the five favorite head disciples was like a dragon in the sky. As soon as they appeared, they instantly attracted everyone’s attention and showed their magical abilities.","The limestone mountain had become desolate.","On this day, an alluring figure rose from the foot of the mountain and flew straight to the top.","“Why is that guy still in seclusion?” Jiu Sha mumbled and shook her head.","Ever since Jian Wushuang met with the Sect Master and returned to the limestone mountain, he had been in closed-door cultivation, as if he was out of tune with the world outside.","“Ah.” With a sigh, Jiu Sha lowered her raised arm, which was about to knock on the door, and turned to leave.","At the same time, in Jian Wushuang’s Corpse Cave.","“Refine!”","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged with a solemn expression. Beads of sweat kept appearing on his forehead.","Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse floated in front of him, and an invisible flame formed from divine power was burning inside his body.","...","A sudden inspiration from Supreme Tarot divine corpse grew stronger and stronger in Jian Wushuang’s body.","Jian Wushuang felt that he had become Supreme Tarot and could control everything about him.","Rumble!!!","As the divine flame burned, the aura on the divine corpse of Supreme Tarot grew stronger and stronger!","“The most crucial moment has arrived!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and his face darkened. The flames on the Supreme Tarot divine corpse suddenly became more and more turbulent!","Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse would soon recover to the Supreme realm!","Once Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse recovered to the Supreme realm, Jian Wushuang’s strength would once again increase in an epic manner!","Jian Wushuang was confident that as long as he controlled the Supreme Tarot divine corpse that had recovered to the Supreme realm, in addition to his greatly improved cultivation, he would definitely be able to sweep away all enemies below the Invincible Supreme realm. Even if an Invincible Supreme came, as long as it was not an existence at the level of old monsters like the Overlord Patriarch or Supreme Master Gai Fu, Jian Wushuang would still dare to arm-wrestle with him!"]},{"number":4488,"title":"Chapter 4488 The End of the Great Competition","paragraphs":["4488 The End of the Great Competition","Whoosh.","The sound of the invisible divine fire burning the air kept coming from the Corpse Cave.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm as he carefully controlled the divine fire to refine Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse inch by inch.","Under this refinement, Jian Wushuang felt that he was getting better at controlling Supreme Tarot’s body. It was as if Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse had become his second incarnation.","!!","“Break!”","The next moment, Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and shouted.","As soon as he finished speaking, the Tarot divine corpse, which had its eyes closed and was floating quietly in front of him, opened its eyes!","An extremely sharp beam of light shot out from Supreme Tarot’s eyes!","Roar!","A heaven-shaking roar came from Supreme Tarot’s mouth, forming a rolling sound wave that swept in all directions.","In the next moment, Supreme Tarot stood up, opened his mouth, and inhaled. Like a whale swallowing water, he sucked in all the divine power flames into his stomach.","In an instant, Supreme Tarot’s entire body began to exude a blazing golden light.","Muffled sounds that sounded like a sledgehammer hitting a drum kept ringing out from his body.","Whizzzzz!","In the next moment, Supreme Tarot’s aura, which was originally simple and unadorned, began to skyrocket!","“The most crucial moment has arrived!”","Jian Wushuang stared at the divine corpse of Supreme Tarot. Whether Supreme Tarot could recover his Supreme cultivation level would depend on this moment!","...","“Hei Chi, victory!”","“Zhengheng, victory!”","“Nu Xiong, victory!”","...","“Yan Dan, victory!!”","As the competition went on, it became more and more intense.","Everyone’s attention was drawn to the competition.","No one paid any more attention to Jian Wushuang. The name ‘Wushuang’ seemed to have been abandoned in a corner.","In this competition, the most praiseworthy were the five head disciples, and Yan Dan was leading the scoreboard. The strength of these five people was obviously much stronger than the disciples of the same level. Once they fought, they crushed the other disciples with force without any hesitation.","Other than that, there was a new talent called ‘Fu Chen’ who had appeared out of nowhere and rose to power.","This person was also from the God Refining Sect who had come for the entrance selection this time. He was one of the people with superb qualifications. He should have been the center of attention long ago, but some time ago, he was overshadowed by Jian Wushuang’s superb qualifications, resulting in his reputation not being well-known.","However, in this competition, he had thoroughly demonstrated his strength, soaring to the sky in one move and defeating his opponents in succession.","In the later stages of the sect competition, he even defeated the two head disciples, Hei Chi and Xuanyang, and had the final match with Yan Dan. For a time, he was in the limelight.","Everyone was saying that Void Warrior Fu Chen was the strongest disciple that the God Refining Sect had recruited this time around and was the true dark horse of this competition.","After watching Fu Chen’s battle, the God Refining Sect Master had personally spoken out in praise of him.","This caused the rising star, Fu Chen, who was already in the limelight, to become like the sun in the sky.","Three days later.","The final battle began.","Fu Chen and Yan Dan fought above the Nine Heavens.","This battle had attracted everyone’s attention!","Countless people were eagerly waiting to see who would win the competition in the end!","This battle lasted for an entire day!","The aftershock of their battle actually caused a phenomenon in the heavens and earth. Black smoke rolled up like a tide, covering the clouds and the sun.","That rookie called Fu Chen was indeed powerful. toward the end, he had actually forced Yan Dan to use his strongest trump card!","Yan Dan had broken through!","On his left shoulder, the 8-Stars that represented the Ultimate Ruler realm strength disappeared, and a long, twisted scar was formed.","Yan Dan, advancing to the Scar-level Void Master realm!","With a single palm strike, Yan Dan sent Fu Chen flying, while Yan Dan stood alone in Nine Heavens. The boundless multicolored light was his background, and the sun and moon circled around his body, making him look like a god descending from the heavens.","The Great Dao of heaven and earth crowned him.","Step by step, he descended from the clouds of the Nine Heavens, like a new king who had ascended the throne.","This sect competition, with Yan Dan as the champion, had drawn the curtains.","After the competition ended, the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, the Void Master Ba Huang, ordered the entire sect to celebrate. He ordered all the disciples to gather outside the Sect Master’s main hall for a banquet.","This included the disciples who were not participating in the Sect Disciple Competition this time.","...","In the Corpse Cave where Jian Wushuang was in the limestone mountain.","“It’s done!”","...","Jian Wushuang’s face was slightly pale and his eyes were weak.","When Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse recovered his initial-stage Supreme cultivation, all his divine power was sucked dry at the moment of his breakthrough!","When he saw Supreme Tarot standing in front of him with a sword-like aura, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile.","Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse had finally recovered to the level of a Primary Supreme!","Jian Wushuang’s strength, which had already soared by a large margin, suddenly became like a tiger that had grown wings. His strength had once again taken a leap!","Although Supreme Tarot had only recovered his initial stage Supreme realm cultivation, which was not even one-tenth of his peak, he was still able to crush a large group of Supreme stage people.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and the smile on his face disappeared. He started to recover his divine power.","At this moment, a clear and majestic voice boomed in the sky above the God Refining Sect. It was directly transmitted into the ears of everyone in the God Refining Sect.","“The Sect Disciple Competition has ended. Tomorrow morning, all disciples of the God Refining Sect will head to the Sect Master’s main hall to hold a banquet!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes when he heard that. He then remembered that there was a competition between the sect’s disciples.","Jian Wushuang did not have any regrets about not being able to participate. For him, the so-called Sect Disciple Competition was just like playing house. Jian Wushuang was not even interested in it.","...","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes and started to recover his divine power.","...","The next day, at 7 am.","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and stood up. He left the Corpse Cave and headed toward the Sect Master’s hall.","Supreme Tarot’s divine corpse was wearing a black robe. His eyes were closed and he followed behind Jian Wushuang like a shadow.","In the sky, countless disciples turned into divine beams and flew toward the Sect Master’s hall from all directions.","“Eh? Isn’t that Wushuang? He’s finally willing to come out of seclusion?”","“Sigh, I was looking forward to Wushuang’s ranking in the sect competition. In the end, Wushuang didn’t even participate. What a pity.”","“In my opinion, it’s a wise decision for Wushuang to not participate in the Sect Disciple Competition. Otherwise, if he didn’t perform well, wouldn’t he be letting down his peerless talent?”","“That’s right. What if Wushuang’s performance isn’t good and he’s defeated right after entering the arena? Wouldn’t it be very awkward then?”","Whispers and discussions could be heard.","Nu Xiong was among them, but he did not speak. Instead, he looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated expression.","He had fought with Jian Wushuang for a short time, so he was the only one who knew how terrifying Jian Wushuang’s strength was.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless, as if he had not heard anything, and he rushed toward the Sect Master’s hall.","Just as they were about to reach the sect master’s main hall, a clear voice suddenly rang out.","“Junior Brother Wushuang!”","Then, he saw a beautiful figure flying from behind and standing next to Jian Wushuang.","“Senior Sister Jiu Sha?”","Jian Wushuang turned his head and raised his eyebrows slightly. His eyes flashed with surprise.","There was something wrong with Jiu Sha today."]},{"number":4489,"title":"Chapter 4489 Watch Him Rise From the Top","paragraphs":["4489 Watch Him Rise From the Top","Jiu Sha landed beside Jian Wushuang in one step, her chest rising and falling slightly.","She was wearing a tight-fitting red veil and a phoenix coronet on her head, which made her curvaceous figure even more charming.","“Junior Brother Wushuang, you’re finally willing to come out of seclusion?”","Jiu Sha laughed as she looked at Jian Wushuang from head to toe. Then, her heart suddenly jumped and her eyes gradually revealed a look of surprise.","“Wushuang, you’ve broken through to 8-Star?!”","“Yes, I was just lucky.” Jian Wushuang smiled at her.","“That’s amazing. No wonder you didn’t participate in this year’s Sect Disciple Competition. You must have been conserving your energy to break through to the next cultivation realm.”","Jiu Sha stretched out her pink fist and punched Jian Wushuang’s chest lightly as she laughed mischievously.","“Hehe, let’s not talk about this. Senior Sister Jiu Sha, looking at your outfit, are you going to get married?” Jian Wushuang changed the topic.","As soon as these words fell, Jiu Sha’s pretty face, which was still in high spirits, suddenly fell. She sighed and said, “That’s right, Lord Sect Master has already made the decision to betroth me to someone else and become a Dao Companion.”","“Oh? Who is so blessed to be able to marry Senior Sister Jiu Sha?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said.","Upon hearing this, Jiu Sha did not reply. Instead, she raised her head and looked at the Sect Master’s hall in the distance. She said in a daze, “You should have heard of this person before. He is the son of Elder Shen Lian and also the head disciple of the current Sect Master’s faction, Yan Dan. He was the one who personally proposed to the Sect Master to become my Dao Companion.”","When Jiu Sha said this, her expression was lonely, as if she was unwilling in her heart.","“Yan Dan?”","Jian Wushuang frowned. He had never heard of this person. However, just his identity as the son of Elder Shen Lian made Jian Wushuang slightly unhappy.","“This Yan Dan is the son of the Elder Shen Lian. He’s also the Sect Master’s head disciple and the champion of the Sect Disciple Competition. He has an amazing background and is extremely talented. He has all the glory in the world. You should be happy that you can become Dao Companions with him. Why do you look so sad? Don’t you like it?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and asked casually.","“Yes.” Jiu Sha nodded and replied, “But Yan Dan is too arrogant. He doesn’t respect anyone. He also likes to form cliques and gangs. His style of doing things is domineering and overbearing. I... I really don’t like him.”","After Jiu Sha finished speaking with a long sigh, her eyes were immediately filled with sadness.","In this world where strength was everything, if one had weak strength and no talent, no matter how good-looking one was, one would just be a chess piece controlled by others.","She looked at Jian Wushuang and suddenly, a thought flashed through her mind.","“Wushuang! I have an idea!”","Her beautiful eyes lit up and she immediately grabbed Jian Wushuang’s arm. She said excitedly, “Wushuang, can you help me just this once? With your talent, you’re not inferior to Yan Dan at all, and you also have the care of Grand Elder Mi Feng. As long as you say during the banquet that we’ve already pledged to be married, I believe that the Sect Master will definitely not make things difficult for me after some consideration. What do you think?”","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang frowned and was about to refuse.","What a joke. He was a spy in the God Refining Sect. What was the point of starting a family here?","Moreover, Leng Rushuang was the only person in his heart from the beginning. He would not be able to hold anyone else.","As if she had seen Jian Wushuang’s refusal, Jiu Sha quickly said, “Junior Brother Wushuang, what I said just now was naturally not for you and your Senior Sister to privately pledge to marry each other, but to deal with the Lord Sect Master. After this matter is over, I will definitely not pester you. You can rest assured.”","“No.” Jian Wushuang shook his head. Although his tone was neither warm nor angry, it was filled with an unquestionable tone. “Don’t mention this matter again.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang no longer cared about her. He took a step forward and suddenly, there was an explosion in the void as he rushed toward the Sect Master’s Hall.","“You...” Jiu Sha looked at Jian Wushuang’s back as if he was running away. She could not help but be stunned. Then, her pretty face was filled with shame and anger.","She first looked down at her proud twin peaks, then looked at her pair of white and straight long legs, and stomped her feet in anger.","“Dumbo!”","...","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh.","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and crossed a hundred thousand feet.","The land and rivers of the God Refining Sect seemed to have shrunk under his feet.","Soon, Jian Wushuang arrived at the Sect Master’s hall.","Outside the Sect Master’s main hall, there was a square that was a hundred miles in size.","The banquet was held in this square.","At this moment, the originally spacious square was filled with disciples of the God Refining Sect. Everyone had taken their seats.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s arrival, many disciples of the God Refining Sect fixed their eyes on him and their pupils shrank.","“Wushuang is here!”","“You’re finally willing to show yourself?”","“The black-robed man behind Wushuang should be his divine corpse, right? It doesn’t look like much.”","“Wait! Look, Wushuang seems to have broken through to an 8-Star!”","“8-Star? Hiss! How was that possible? I heard that he was only a 4-Star when he entered the sect.”","“I’m afraid Wushuang didn’t participate in the competition not because he was afraid of losing his reputation, but because he was in a hurry to break through!”","Whispers could be heard.","“Wushuang, come to this seat.”","Elder Mi Feng, who was at the front of the square, noticed Jian Wushuang and immediately waved at him with a smile.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded and strode toward Elder Mi Feng.","“Eh? 8-Star? Not bad, not bad. You’re indeed a person with exceptional talent. This kind of breakthrough speed is simply unheard of.”","Elder Mi Feng clapped his hands and smiled.","There were four other Grand Elders beside Elder Mi Feng.","...","Jian Wushuang had met the Grand Elder in the Sect Master’s hall before. Hence, he was no stranger to him and greeted them one by one.","Behind the four Grand Elders, Hei Chi, Nu Xiong, and the other head disciples also stood behind him.","Hei Chi, Zhengheng, and the others sized up Jian Wushuang. They were slightly surprised, but they did not show it on their faces.","He was only an 8-Star and had just started at the same starting line as them.","Only Nu Xiong’s pupils shrunk and a chill rose in his heart.","For some reason, he could keenly feel that Jian Wushuang’s pressure and threat had become even stronger!","The previous Jian Wushuang was like a mist that he could not see through. The current Jian Wushuang was like a Lightning Tribulation that was hiding behind thick dark clouds. It was powerful but did not release. Once it made a move, it would definitely be earth-shattering!","Nu Xiong could not help but lower his head. He was even more afraid of Jian Wushuang.","“Let the banquet... Begin!”","With a loud declaration, the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect, Void Master Ba Huang, slowly walked out of the master’s hall.","Beside him, Yan Dan was not following closely. His expression was filled with respect as he followed behind.","...","Thus, the banquet officially began."]},{"number":4490,"title":"Chapter 4490 At the Heart of the Storm","paragraphs":["4490 At the Heart of the Storm","The square outside the Sect Master’s hall was in a clamor.","As the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect and Yan Dan walked out of the hall, the noisy square suddenly became quiet.","The crowd looked at Yan Dan, who was half a body’s length behind the Sect Master, and their pupils shrank slightly.","the Sect Master has brought Yan Dan to the banquet alone. I’m afraid that the next Sect Master will be Senior Brother Yan Dan.","Everyone looked at each other and thought the same.","Yan Dan walked behind the God Refining Sect Master, the eighth extreme void master. He raised his head and glanced at the crowd, his face full of arrogance.","Of course, he had the right to be arrogant. Not only did he have a Big Shot father, but he was also the last disciple of a Six Scar Void Master. At the same time, he had broken through to the Scar level. In the void universe, he was a rare genius.","“Eh? That person is Wushuang?”","Yan Dan’s eyes looked around and then fell on Jian Wushuang, who was standing behind Elder Mi Feng.","“8-Star? Not bad, no wonder father wants him dead. If he’s allowed to continue growing, he might be able to threaten my position one day.”","Yan Dan laughed coldly in his heart. His eyes continued to turn and fell on Jiu Sha’s face, and a hint of surprise flashed in his eyes.","It had to be said that Jiu Sha was indeed extremely beautiful. Even among the great Holy Maidens and Goddesses, she was the most outstanding and the pearl that stood tall among the chickens.","Today, she was wearing a tight red dress and a phoenix coronet. She looked like an Immortal. Besides the charm between her brows, there was also a bit of coldness and elegance.","Jiu Sha also noticed the lust in Yan Dan’s eyes. Her face turned cold and she lowered her head to avoid looking at him.","“We pay our respects to the Sect Master!”","After a while, the thousands of disciples of the God Refining Sect knelt down and cheered.","“There’s no need to be so formal today.”","Void Master Ba Huang nodded his head in satisfaction. Looking at his disciples below him, he could not help but smile.","This would be the future pillar of the God Refining Sect!","The banquet began, and everyone toasted each other.","The atmosphere warmed up in an instant.","After half a cup of wine, the God Refining Sect Master, who was sitting at the head of the table, put down his wine cup and said with a smile, “Today’s banquet is because there are three happy events.”","“The first thing I’m happy about is the Sect Disciple Competition this time. I’ve seen that our God Refining Sect’s younger generation is outstanding and not poor. It’s enough to last forever!”","“Second, I would like to congratulate my last disciple, Yan Dan, for successfully attaining the Great Dao and breaking through to the Scar level. He is now another divine general for our God Refining Sect! Your future will surely shine!”","“The third joy is also related to Yan Dan. I hereby announce that the Lanyue Branch’s disciple Jiu Sha will be betrothed to my disciple Yan Dan. From now on, the two of them will become Dao Companions and support each other.”","After the God Refining Sect Master finished speaking, the crowd immediately burst out in cheers and agreement.","Seeing this, the God Refining Sect Master nodded slightly and then looked at Jiu Sha.","Jiu Sha lowered her head and bit her lower lip tightly. Her hands clenched her long dress uneasily, and there was no joy on her face.","Looking at this scene, the God Refining Sect Master’s smiling face slowly fell.","“Jiu Sha, why don’t you kneel down and thank the Sect Master for the good marriage he has given you? It’s a blessing that you’ve cultivated for three lifetimes to be able to become Dao Companions with Yan Dan. Why don’t you quickly thank him?”","Elder Lanyue, who had been paying attention to the God Refining Sect Master’s expression, immediately called out.","Lanyue was the only female Grand Elder among the five Grand Elders. She was also the one with the lowest cultivation among the Grand Elders.","Anyone with a discerning eye could see that Yan Dan had broken through to the Scar level, and his future was bound to be limitless. If there were no accidents, he was already a definite candidate for the next Sect Master.","Lanyue really did not want to offend Yan Dan unless it was necessary.","Jiu Sha was unmoved.","“You little girl, what do you want to do?” Lan Yue’s face turned stern.","Jiu Sha’s head lowered even further.","She bit her lower lip hard, as if she was making a decision.","The next moment.","She raised her head and said firmly, “Elder Lan Yue, Sect Master, I don’t want to become Dao Companions with Senior Brother Yan Dan!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the entire place was in an uproar!","Elder Lan Yue’s face turned ashen in an instant. The God Refining Sect Master’s face also turned extremely ugly.","He did not expect that an ordinary disciple of the God Refining Sect would dare to disobey his orders!","The smile on Yan Dan’s face also slowly froze.","Face smacking!","This was a slap to his face in front of the entire God Refining Sect!","“Impudent!”","The God Refining Sect Master’s right hand slammed heavily on the armrest of his chair, and a trace of pressure was suddenly released, pressing down on Jiu Sha.","What was the cultivation base of the God Refining Sect Master?","Six Scars Void Master, the giant arm that stood at the peak of the entire Void Universe!","However, Jiu Sha was only a Star-level Void Warrior who had not even reached the Scar-level, so how could she resist this pressure?","In an instant, Jiu Sha knelt on the ground, her pretty face pale.","If the God Refining Sect Master had not carefully controlled the strength of the pressure, she would have been crushed into dust and her soul would have been destroyed.","“Let me ask you, why are you unwilling to become Dao Companions with my son?”","...","Elder Shen Lian chided him with a gloomy face.","Jiu Sha trembled and raised her head with difficulty. She gritted her teeth and said, “Reporting to Elder Shen Lian and Lord Sect Master, it’s not that Jiu Sha is unwilling to become Dao Companions with Senior Brother Yan Dan, but my heart already belongs to someone else and he has made a private pledge to marry me!”","As soon as this sentence came out, the entire Hall was in an uproar again.","Countless people looked at each other.","In the God Refining Sect, who did not know that the Jiu Sha was already regarded as a forbidden property by Yan Dan?","Who would dare to snatch Yan Dan’s woman?","“Cheap slave! Let me ask you, who’s the person you privately pledged to marry?”","Yan Dan roared in a low voice. His face was already filled with a ferocious look and his eyes were filled with killing intent.","The God Refining Sect Master also frowned.","“It’s... it’s...”","Jiu Sha’s eyes trembled as she looked at the expressionless Jian Wushuang, who was standing behind Elder Mi Feng. She did not care about her life at all. She gritted her teeth and said, “It’s Junior Brother Wushuang!”","...","After she finished speaking, she lowered her head and did not dare to look at the crowd, let alone meet Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“What?”","“It’s Wushuang?”","“No wonder Wushuang and Jiu Sha didn’t participate in the Sect Disciple Competition. There’s a reason behind this!”","“During the Sect Disciple Competition, I saw Jiu Sha go to the top of the limestone mountain a few times. I was curious why Jiu Sha went to the top of the mountain when she lived at the foot of the limestone mountain. Now that I think about it, I’m afraid she’s going to find Wushuang!”","In an instant, the entire square first fell into a brief dead silence, and then suddenly erupted!"]},{"number":4491,"title":"Chapter 4491 Get Burned","paragraphs":["4491 Get Burned","Chatter, chatter, chatter!","Everyone in the crowd looked at Jian Wushuang.","The crowd looked at Jian Wushuang with an extremely strange expression.","Wushuang, a person with Supreme talent, was also the person who Grand Elder Mi Feng had personally welcomed into the sect.","“Tsk tsk, the person who took Yan Dan’s woman is actually Wushuang. There’s going to be a good show to watch now.”","“One of them is the most talented person in the sect, and the other is the leader of the disciples, the next Sect Master candidate in the eyes of the Sect Master. Now, it’s up to Lord Sect Master to make his choice.”","A series of discussions sounded.","Yan Dan suddenly turned his head and stared at Jian Wushuang with a fierce look in his eyes.","Elder Shen Lian’s face also darkened instantly.","On the other hand, the God Refining Sect’s Sect Master, Void Master Ba Huang, who was originally a little angry, calmed down and frowned.","Other than being Yan Dan’s Master, he was more of the God Refining Sect’s Sect Master. What he paid attention to was the art of balance.","Previously, Yan Dan had asked him for Jiu Sha and wanted him to personally ask for Jiu Sha and Yan Dan to become Dao Companions. In his opinion, it was like a child asking for a beloved toy from him. Naturally, he could not do it.","However, now, with Wushuang in the middle, the situation was different.","It was like a scale. Originally, the weight of the Jiu Sha and Yan Dan were completely different. Everything was leaning toward Yan Dan, so he did not mind agreeing to Yan Dan’s request.","However, with the addition of Wushuang, the weights on both sides of the scale suddenly became different.","To be honest, as the God Refining Sect Master, he did not have any ill intentions toward Jian Wushuang. After all, Jian Wushuang had passed the Trial Foundation Stone’s verification and had a peerless talent. Previously, he had mentioned the Soul-Searching Technique in the Sect Master’s hall only because he suspected that Jian Wushuang was a spy sent by the Divine Power Universe.","From the perspective of the big picture, he was naturally better off than Jian Wushuang. After all, Jian Wushuang was a member of the God Refining Sect. If Jian Wushuang was doing well, the God Refining Sect would naturally be well.","The two of them complemented each other and were not enemies.","If there were no accidents, Jian Wushuang would definitely become one of the pillars of the God Refining Sect in the future!","For a moment, the God Refining Sect Master did not know what to say.","If Jiu Sha had really become Dao Companions with Jian Wushuang, then the matter of Jiu Sha and Yan Dan had to be considered carefully.","After a long while, he looked at Jian Wushuang with a frown and said in a deep voice, “Wushuang, is what Jiu Sha said true?”","As soon as the Sect Master finished his words, Yan Dan looked at Jian Wushuang and said coldly, “Junior Brother Wushuang, aren’t you going a little too far?”","Jian Wushuang remained silent and expressionless.","However, in his heart, he was already extremely angry!","What was this Jiu Sha trying to do?","As early as when they were high up in the sky outside the Sect Master’s main hall, Jiu Sha had opened her mouth and begged him to put on a show with her and reject the marriage between her and Yan Dan.","However, Jian Wushuang had rejected her very clearly!","He did not expect Jiu Sha to be so selfish. She did not care about his feelings at all and publicly announced that he had pledged to marry him in the main hall.","Jian Wushuang understood that he had been used by Jiu Sha!","As for why Jiu Sha chose him, it was not because he was too charming. The two of them had only met three times, so there was no charm.","The reason was simple.","What Jiu Sha had her eyes on was Jian Wushuang’s peerless talent!","She believed that between Yan Dan and him, the God Refining Sect Master would definitely have a hard time choosing.","However, she had never thought that after this matter was over, she could just apologize to Jian Wushuang and leave as if nothing had happened. But what would happen to Jian Wushuang?","Jian Wushuang would definitely offend Yan Dan and become a thorn in the father and son’s side.","If it was an ordinary disciple, he would not be far from death if he incurred such hatred.","Jian Wushuang’s thoughts flashed quickly. He was naturally not afraid of Yan Dan and his father. To him, even if he were to tie Elder Shen Lian and Yan Dan together, they would not be enough to deal with him. However, he did not like the feeling of being used as a shield!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and said in a deep voice, “Reporting to the Sect Master, Senior Sister Jiu Sha mentioned something about a private marriage. This disciple... I don’t know anything!”","Chatter!!","As soon as he finished speaking, the crowd went into an uproar again!","He had no idea at all!","These words were simply amazing!","Everyone’s expressions changed.","Jiu Sha, who was kneeling on the ground, felt as if a knife had been stabbed into her heart. Her delicate body trembled and she almost fell to the ground.","Her face turned pale. Looking at Jian Wushuang’s cold and calm face, she could not help but laugh bitterly.","“Are you really that heartless?”","Yan Dan, Elder Shen Lian, and the God Refining Sect Master were all stunned.","Even Elder Mi Feng, who was standing next to Jian Wushuang, was surprised.","“Wushuang, are you saying this because you fear Yan Dan and the others? Don’t worry, if that Jiu Sha is really the woman you fancy, I will definitely help you get her even if I have to throw away my face.”","Elder Mi Feng transmitted his voice to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang could not help but feel touched. Elder Mi Feng was a very competent Elder. If Jian Wushuang had been born in this universe, he might have treated Elder Mi Feng the same way he treated Supreme Blood Wave.","It was a pity that the two of them were not on the same path.","Sighing in his heart, Jian Wushuang shook his head and replied, “Elder Mi Feng, there’s no need to do this. I really have nothing to do with Senior Sister Jiu Sha.”","...","“Alright.” Elder Mi Feng nodded. Since Jian Wushuang had already said so, he would naturally not force him.","“Hahahaha, lowly servant, I’d like to see who can still stand up for you now?” Yan Dan sneered. He first glared at Jiu Sha, then turned to look at Jian Wushuang with a sneer in his eyes.","He looked at Jian Wushuang with satisfaction as if he was saying, “You’re smart.”","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown.","He did not like Jiu Sha’s actions, but he was equally displeased with Yan Dan’s gaze.","“Sect Master, I beg you. Please allow me to bring Jiu Sha back now,” Yan Dan turned around and said to the God Refining Sect Master.","“Yes, go ahead.” The God Refining Sect Master nodded his head with a calm expression.","The current outcome was even better for him.","“Thank you, Sect Master!”","Yan Dan cupped his hands at the God Refining Sect Master, then looked at Jiu Sha again. He stretched out the corner of his mouth and licked his split lips. His lustful and cruel eyes swept over Jiu Sha’s enchanting and perfect figure. After laughing, he stretched out his palm and grabbed Jiu Sha.","Suddenly, in the midst of Jiu Sha’s screams, she flew up and fell into Yan Dan’s hand.","...","Yan Dan picked up Jiu Sha and walked out of the hall.","However, just as he was about to pass by Jian Wushuang, he seemed to have thought of something and suddenly stopped."]},{"number":4492,"title":"Chapter 4492 Taking Action","paragraphs":["4492 Taking Action","“Wushuang!”","Yan Dan stopped and turned his head to look at Jian Wushuang.","“What are you doing?” Jian Wushuang replied expressionlessly.","Yan Dan looked around, then lowered his voice and said, “Wushuang, I know that there must be some unspeakable business between you and this lowly servant. However, you’re quite tactful this time and know to avoid the limelight. I’ll let you off for the time being, but you must remember that after this matter is over, there will be debts to be settled between you and me.”","!!","“At that time, not only will this lowly slave die, but you will also have to be my slave and servant to erase the humiliation I’ve suffered today!”","After he finished speaking, Yan Dan sneered and planned to leave.","Jian Wushuang’s denial just now had indirectly helped him out of the predicament. Not only did he not feel grateful to Jian Wushuang, but he also felt even more resentful.","As proud as he was, Yan Dan was born with a silver spoon in his mouth. Not only did he have a Scar-level father who was an Elder of the God Refining Sect, but he was also accepted as the closed-door disciple of the Sect Master after he showed his talent. He became the head disciple of the entire God Refining Sect!","What kind of noble status was this?","As a result, he developed a haughty and overbearing character.","Since he was young, everything had been smooth-sailing for him and he had never been rejected by anyone!","However, today, Jiu Sha, a mere woman, had actually rejected him in public and even announced that she had already made a private pledge to marry someone else!","To him, how humiliating was this?","After that, although Jian Wushuang denied it, in his eyes, Jian Wushuang’s words were like a knife that stabbed his heart!","What did he mean? Could it be that I am only worthy of something that you, Wushuang, don’t care about?","Therefore, he, who already had a grudge against Jian Wushuang, hated him even more and wanted to kill him!","Most importantly, he absolutely did not believe that Jiu Sha had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang!","He had already made a plan. When he returned to his bedroom, he would first teach Jiu Sha a lesson. Through the dual cultivation method, he would directly suck Jiu Sha dry and let her know the price of humiliating his Yan Dan!","After that, he would find an opportunity to cut Jian Wushuang into pieces. On one hand, he would cut off the possibility of Jian Wushuang fighting for the position of Sect Master with him. On the other hand, he would vent his hatred!","This person and Elder Shen Lian’s viciousness could be said to be from the same line!","Just as Yan Dan made this decision and was about to leave.","Suddenly.","“Stop,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone who thought that the farce had come to an end could not help but be stunned.","Even Yan Dan, who had already stepped out of the square, squinted his eyes and turned around slowly. He looked at Jian Wushuang and asked with a gloomy expression, “Wushuang, what are you doing?”","Among the crowd, only Jiu Sha, who was pale and in despair, suddenly showed joy on her face and looked at Jian Wushuang.","At the same time, she was excited and quickly sent a message to Jian Wushuang, “Eh... Wushuang, I was forced to do such a stupid thing just now. Wushuang, I apologize to you.”","“But I beg you, save me, save... save me, or I’m really going to die!”","Jian Wushuang turned a deaf ear to her words and looked at Yan Dan indifferently. He said calmly, “Try saying what you just said to me again.”","He had originally planned not to interfere in this matter and let Yan Dan leave obediently. However, Yan Dan had to run to him and provoke him, wanting to make him his slave.","He, Jian Wushuang, had never backed down in his life!","Yan Dan squinted his eyes and the corners of his mouth curled up. He asked, “Wushuang, what if I say it again? Do you still want to stop me?”","“Stop you?” Jian Wushuang sneered and took a step forward. He instantly appeared in front of Yan Dan and said indifferently, “If you say it again, you won’t be able to walk out of this door today.”","“You dare?” Hearing this, Yan Dan’s heart was instantly filled with anger, and his eyes lit up!","A monstrous aura that belonged to the Scar-level exploded from Yan Dan’s body!","In an instant, the entire square was filled with wind and clouds. The pressure of a Scar-level Void Warrior instantly descended on the entire square, forming an upside-down tornado around him.","The pressure was like a ferocious tiger that was ready to devour its prey as it pounced on Jian Wushuang!","“Is that all?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and his aura also exploded. The pressure of an 8-Star Void Warrior spread out.","The pressure was far less terrifying than the Yan Dan. Even Jian Wushuang, who was standing in front of the Yan Dan, felt like a boat in the sea of anger and could capsize at any time.","However, even so, Jian Wushuang did not move his feet at all. It was as if he was a stabilizing force that would not budge no matter how great the waves were.","“You’re looking for death!” Seeing this, Yan Dan was even more furious.","First, he was rejected and humiliated by Jiu Sha and was almost made a cuck. Now, he was blocked by Jian Wushuang, who faced him head-on.","At this moment, how could he still hold back? A killing intent suddenly leaped out.","Bang!","The void behind Yan Dan was suddenly torn open and a green arm stretched out from the void to grab Jian Wushuang!","This arm was extremely shriveled, with meridians criss-crossing each other. The five fingernails were pitch-black, long, and sharp. In front of this grab, the entire void was like paper, instantly torn apart!","The owner of the hand was Yan Dan’s divine corpse, Da Huai!","Everyone’s eyelids twitched when they saw this.","“Yan Dan is attacking Wushuang!”","“I’m afraid Wushuang is going to suffer this time. If senior Yan Dan had not broken through to the Scar level, the two of them might have been able to fight. But now that senior Yan Dan has broken through to the Scar level, no matter how talented Wushuang is, ten of him won’t be enough to defeat Senior Yan Dan!”","The crowd quickly discussed.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he quickly thought about it.","Yan Dan’s overbearing claw was like a child’s sword dance in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. It was full of flaws. Even if he did not use his true cultivation and only used the strength of an 8-Star Void Warrior, he would be able to break it.","‘Forget it. If I concentrate on developing in the God Refining Sect and never reveal my strength, I’m afraid I won’t be able to climb to the top of the Void Universe in a short time. Only those who are at the peak of the Void Universe are qualified to know the true secrets.’","...","‘I might as well show some of my strength today. This way, it’ll be easier for me to level up and find out about the arrangements of the Void Universe against the Divine Power Universe.’","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a touch of coldness.","“Divine corpse, come!”","Whoosh!","In an instant, a figure in a black robe, with only his eyes exposed, appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","An extremely sharp Sword Qi burst out from the figure!","This figure was the Supreme Tarot divine corpse that had recovered to the Primary Supreme realm!"]},{"number":4493,"title":"Chapter 4493 Defeating the Enemy With a Single Finger","paragraphs":["4493 Defeating the Enemy With a Single Finger","Whoosh!","As soon as the divine corpse of Supreme Tarot appeared, the sharp and earth-shaking aura instantly shocked everyone!","“This is the divine corpse of Wushuang!”","“It’s said that this divine corpse is the strongest divine corpse on Coffin Mountain. Even the Sect Master and the five Grand Elders couldn’t refine it!”","!!","“Scar... Scar-level aura! This divine corpse has already reached the Scar level!”","“No wonder Wushuang isn’t afraid of Senior Brother Yan Dan. He has this backing!”","Bang! Bang!","The corpse’s expression was numb, and his movements were stiff. He raised two of his fingers to form a sword finger and pointed at the shriveled arm that was coming from the void.","In an instant, endless Sword Qi burst out from the tip of the divine corpse’s finger!","Boom!!","An earth-shattering sound rang out, and the arm that had torn everything retracted instantly as if it had been electrocuted. Then, Yan Dan seemed to have suffered some kind of backlash, and he took three steps back, his face flushed.","It was not over yet. Another painful groan came from the void behind Yan Dan. A shriveled divine corpse with black hair fell out of the void.","This divine corpse was Da Huai.","Jian Wushuang defeated the enemy with one finger!","In an instant, everyone cried out in alarm.","They did not expect that Yan Dan, the first disciple of the Sect Master who had just been crowned as the number one disciple and had the Scar-level power, would be forced back by the Tarot divine corpse with a single finger!","“Bastard!” Yan Dan’s face was livid. He stared at Jian Wushuang and growled, “I was just careless just now. Let’s do it again!”","After he finished speaking, he began to gather all his void power crazily, and the entire square began to shake.","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and the coldness in his eyes grew.","Just as the two of them were confronting each other...","“Enough!”","The God Refining Sect Master frowned. Immediately, his words were absolute. As soon as he said those words, the square, which had been like a raging sea, suddenly calmed down.","An extremely vast and powerful force separated Jian Wushuang and Yan Dan.","“Sect Master!”","Seeing this, Yan Dan felt as if he had finally gathered his strength and wanted to throw a punch, but it was as if he had hit cotton. He felt extremely aggrieved.","“Sect Master, let me teach Wushuang a good lesson!”","“You want to teach him a lesson? Don’t you think you’ve embarrassed yourself enough?”","The God Refining Sect Master snorted and looked at Jian Wushuang, “Wushuang, let me ask you, what was the meaning of this before? Why did you block Yan Dan’s path?”","Jian Wushuang’s purpose of showing off his strength had been achieved. Therefore, when he saw the God Refining Sect Master interrupt his battle with Yan Dan, he did not feel much. He cupped his hands and replied calmly, “Sect Master, I stopped Senior Brother Yan Dan because he provoked me when he passed by me just now. He said that he wanted to make me his slave. I was so angry that I did what I did.”","When the God Refining Sect Master heard this, he could not help but look at Yan Dan, his face darkening.","“Look at you, you could have just left obediently after getting what you wanted, but you had to be clever and provoke others. Now, you’ve put yourself in a difficult position, haven’t you?”","Shaking his head, the Sect Master cursed in his heart, ‘What an idiot!’","After taking a deep breath, the God Refining Sect Master looked at Jian Wushuang and replied, “Alright, you and Dan Yan are from the same sect. In the future, you will both be the pillars of my God Refining Sect. You can’t get into a big fight over a small verbal conflict. Do you understand?","“Alright, this matter is over. Let’s end the banquet.”","The God Refining Sect Master stood up and shook his head.","“Yes!”","As the God Refining Sect Master stood up, the other disciples in the square naturally did not dare to remain seated. They all stood up to send the Sect Master off.","“Wushuang, you deserve to die!”","Yan Dan glared at Jian Wushuang and the veins on his forehead popped out because of his anger.","If they were not in the God Refining Sect, he would not have been able to suppress his impulse and would have killed Jian Wushuang.","“Wushuang, don’t worry. We still have a long way to go. I’ll slowly settle the matter between us in the future.”","With that, Yan Dan strode away.","A touch of disgust flashed in his eyes when he saw Jiu Sha. It was this woman who had made him lose face today. He was afraid that if he took her back to be his Dao Companion, he would only become a joke. It would be like he had picked up something that Jian Wushuang did not want.","“And you, lowly servant. Today’s matter was all because of you. After I kill Wushuang, I’ll slowly deal with you.”","With a cold snort, Yan Dan stomped on the ground with his right foot. The floor beneath him cracked, and a small pit appeared. He transformed into a beam of light and shot into the sky, disappearing from the square outside the Sect Master’s hall.","When Jiu Sha saw Yan Dan leave, her nervous heart finally eased.","She looked at Jian Wushuang gratefully and said thank you softly.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and did not pay much attention to her. After exchanging a glance with Elder Mi Feng, he walked in the direction that the God Refining Sect Master had left.","He still remembered that the God Refining Sect Master had once told him that after the Sect Disciple Competition was over, there would be a mission for him.","...","In the Sect Master’s hall.","The God Refining Sect Master sat at the head of the table. He looked at Wushuang, who did not leave with the crowd but followed him into the Sect Master’s hall, and nodded.","“Wushuang, I originally wanted to wait for you to rest for a few days before telling you about the mission. Since you’ve come, I will tell you now.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and nodded, “Sect Master, please speak.”","...","“Alright.” The Sect Master of the God Refining Sect looked into the distance. He did not speak immediately. Instead, he seemed to be thinking about what to say in his mind.","After a while, he said, “Wushuang, do you know of the Land of Gods in our universe?”","“The Land of Gods?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He had a feeling that what the God Refining Sect Master was about to say was one of the top secrets of the Void Universe.","“That’s right. Most people don’t know about the Land of Gods, so I’ll tell you about it today.”","The God Refining Sect Master’s eyes flickered and he muttered, “The Land of Gods is not one of the forbidden areas of our universe. It was formed after birth.”","“About tens of thousands of void eras ago, there were a few powerful beings from another universe that came to our universe. These beings were from the same place as those people who were with you when you first joined.”","“These alien races have unfathomable motives and are ruthless. After their identities were exposed, they started a massacre in our Void Universe. They are extremely powerful, and each of their cultivation is at least at the Six Scar level like me!”","“One of them has an even more unfathomable cultivation base, and his methods are strange. He has the power to suppress the life source, and he’s countless times more powerful than me!”","As the God Refining Sect Master spoke slowly, Jian Wushuang was shocked.","What is this...?!","..."]},{"number":4494,"title":"Chapter 4494 The Land of Gods","paragraphs":["4494 The Land of Gods","‘The Void Universe that came tens of thousands of void eras ago...’","‘They came from the same place as Supreme Martial Artist Gongyang and the others...’","‘All of them are at least at the Six Scar level, which means they are Invincible Supremes. One of them is several times stronger than the God Refining Sect’s Sect Master...’","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and his thoughts began to run quickly.","!!","The time axis of the Void Universe and the Divine Power Universe that Jian Wushuang was in was similar.","Tens of thousands of chaos cycles ago... it should have been around the time when the Great Catastrophe War had just ended.","At that time, only that group of people had entered the Void Universe and had disappeared without a trace.","Even though the God Refining Sect Master’s words were rather obscure, to Jian Wushuang, it was obvious!","The Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace!","If Jian Wushuang had guessed correctly, the alien race the God Refining Sect Master had mentioned was none other than the team led by the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace that had disappeared into the Void Universe!","Jian Wushuang’s mind was filled with thoughts, but he pretended to be listening. He continued to listen to the Sect Master of the God Refining Sect talk about the Land of Gods.","He understood that this ‘Land of Gods’ was very likely to be inextricably linked to the disappearance of the Divine Life Palace’s Palace Master.","“When the identity of this group of foreign races was exposed, our Void Universe immediately summoned the giant arms of the great beings at the Six Scar level and above to kill these foreign races.”","“This time, almost half of the Six Scar level Void Masters in our universe were gathered to fight with this group of alien races in the Small Ring Star Field!”","“Speaking of which, although the cultivation base of this group of outsiders is similar to ours, other than the strongest person who can suppress the life source, the rest of them are weaker than us in terms of combat strength.”","“Very soon, a great battle broke out. Almost all of the alien races were killed, and only the strongest of these aliens managed to escape with two or three people.”","“Then, I don’t know what kind of technique the strongest person used, but he actually dominated a Star Field and refined it into a forbidden area. He set up 999 restrictions, locking himself and the remaining two or three Six Scar level experts in it. Not only was he unable to take a step out, but we also couldn’t get in no matter how hard we tried.”","“Moreover, the higher one’s cultivation is, the stronger the rejection force will be when they step into the forbidden area. On the contrary, those with lower cultivation will not trigger the terrifying restrictive spells that can kill Immortals and Gods.”","“As time passed, that forbidden land was left behind. We called it the Land of Gods...”","The God Refining Sect Master said slowly.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but squint his eyes. He finally knew the whereabouts of the Divine Palace Palace Master.","Back then, outside the Divine Life Palace, Overlord Patriarch had said that the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had been trapped somewhere in the Void Universe. He must have been referring to this Land of Gods.","It was no wonder that the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace could not return.","“Lord Sect Master, the mission you mentioned must be related to the Land of Gods, right?” Jian Wushuang asked despite knowing the answer.","“That’s right.” The Sect Master of the God Refining Sect nodded and replied in a deep voice, “It’s been tens of thousands of void eras since that group of foreign people was trapped in the Land of Gods, and our Lord Void God used a great divine ability to seal off all the energy supplies in that area. In other words, those foreign people who were heavily injured will never recover from their injuries.”","“For the first tens of thousands of void eras, we could still sense that the outsiders were trying to break through the seal and escape, but in the last ten thousand void eras, they’ve quieted down. They’ve never tried to break through the seal again. They’re probably already like a lamp that’s on its last legs.”","“Wushuang, your mission this time is to enter the restriction and see what the situation is like.”","“First, your cultivation is only at the Star-level, so the restrictions inside will not be triggered at all, and you can walk in safely.”","“That group of outsiders has been worn down by tens of thousands of void eras. Even if they haven’t fallen, they probably don’t have much power left, so they won’t be much of a threat to you.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and thought for a moment. He nodded and replied, “I understand!”","“Very good. Then, Wushuang, you may leave first. You’re not the only one going to the Land of Gods to explore this time. I’ll also choose some disciples from the sect to go with you. Other than that, I’m afraid that the other top forces will also send their own Heaven’s Favorites. Don’t be careless and embarrass the God Refining Sect...”","The Sect Master said slowly.","“Yes.”","After a few more words from the God Refining Sect Master, Jian Wushuang took his leave.","...","After returning to the Corpse Cave on the top of the limestone mountain.","Jian Wushuang immediately opened a ward to seal off all auras.","To him, even if the God Refining Sect Master did not allow him to go to the Land of Gods, he would still find a reason to go.","The Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had stayed in the Void Universe for tens of thousands of chaos cycles. Even if he had been trapped in the Land of Gods for nearly all his time, he must have known a lot about the Void Universe.","This was of utmost importance.","In addition, Jian Wushuang also had some doubts and wanted to ask the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, provided that the Palace Master had not died.","For example, what was going on with his life level?","The more he cultivated, the more he realized that his life level as a Special Life Form far surpassed that of a perfect special life form!","Or rather, it was not a perfect-level Special Life Form at all!","His life level had far surpassed the perfect level!","After that, Jian Wushuang used the token given to him by the Cosmos God to activate the water mirror and report the matter to Cosmos God.","Regarding the ‘Land of Gods’, Cosmos God did not seem surprised. It was obvious that he had already known about this.","He only told Jian Wushuang to be careful and then hung up the call.","...","It was late at night.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the stone bed and refined the Tarot divine corpse.","Knock! Knock! Knock!","Just as Jian Wushuang was immersed in his cultivation and preparing to go to the Land of Gods...","An unexpected person came and knocked on the door of Jian Wushuang’s Corpse Cave.","...","After removing the magic barrier, Jian Wushuang frowned and looked out of the Corpse Cave’s door. He was suddenly stunned.","Outside the Corpse Cave, under the blood-colored moonlight, an old man with white hair and a white beard, his face full of age spots, was standing quietly at the entrance of the Corpse Cave with his hands behind his back.","“Elder Pan Shan?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and asked in confusion.","Pan Shan, one of the five great Grand Elders... What was he doing here?","“Wushuang, I have something to tell you. Am I not welcome?” Pan Shan’s expression was indifferent. He glanced at Jian Wushuang and said.","“Elder Pan Shan, what are you saying? Come in and sit.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and shook his head. He then stood up and extended his hand to invite Elder Pan Shan to enter the Corpse Cave."]},{"number":4495,"title":"Chapter 4495 The Identity of Elder Pan Shan","paragraphs":["4495 The Identity of Elder Pan Shan","In the God Refining Sect, a blood moon hung in the sky. The shadow of the moon was sparse, and the roars of the corpses could be heard continuously.","Elder Pan Shan strode into a Corpse Cave on the peak of the limestone mountain and sat down cross-legged with Jian Wushuang.","“Elder Pan Shan, is there a reason for your late-night visit?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he spoke.","He had a vague guess about Elder Pan Shan. As for whether his guess was correct, he would have to see why Elder Pan Shan had come to find him so late at night.","Elder Pan Shan looked at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Wushuang, this old man has a few questions to ask you.”","“Elder Pan Shan, please speak.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Alright.” Elder Pan Shan acknowledged and pondered for a moment. He then asked, “Wushuang, you’ve heard about the other races in the universe, right?”","“...Yes, I have.” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up and he immediately replied.","“Alright. You said that you met those other race members on the way to our sect, and have never known them before. Now, let me ask you, which Star Field did you meet them from?”","“Feng Luo Starfield.”","Jian Wushuang answered without any hesitation.","He had long expected that someone would question him in detail, so he naturally did his homework.","The Feng Luo Starfield was neither too far nor too close to the God Refining Sect. There were not many people here, and it was unlikely that anyone would coincidentally stay in the Feng Luo Starfield.","“Good, then this old master will ask you again, which Star Field do you come from?” Elder Pan Shan nodded and asked again.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed and he did not answer. Instead, he stared at Elder Pan Shan and asked, “Elder Pan Shan, why did you come here this time? Why don’t you just speak directly, there’s no need to beat around the bush.”","After all, he was not from the Void Universe and could not withstand a detailed interrogation. As for Elder Pan Shan, although he suspected that Pan Shan came from the Divine Power Universe, this matter was of great importance and he could not afford to gamble. If his guess was even the slightest bit wrong, then it was very likely that he would fall short of success and lose everything. He had to be cautious.","“Wushuang, you don’t need to care about what I mean. You just need to answer truthfully,” Elder Pan Shan said emotionlessly.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang fell silent. After a long while, he took a deep breath and replied, “The Liyang Star Field.”","“The Liyang Star Field?”","Hearing this, Elder Pan Shan laughed and shook his head, “Wushuang, oh Wushuang. The Liyang Starfield and the Feng Luo Starfield are in the South and North of the God Refining Sect. If you came from the Liyang Starfield, how did you meet those other races in the Feng Luo Starfield?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. Just as he was about to speak, Elder Pan Shan continued, “Also, Wushuang, our universe isn’t that big, but it’s not that small either. You didn’t just rely on your talent and closed-door cultivation to become a Star-level Void Warrior. You must have left traces of your growth in the universe, but I have asked around and have never heard of your name, Wushuang.”","“If you still want to argue, I can personally go to the Liyang Starfield and see if there’s anyone who knows you.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang slowly narrowed his eyes. His five fingers touched the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword, and his thumb gently rubbed the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword.","The sound of a sword rang out.","After a moment, Jian Wushuang seemed to have thought of something. He let go of the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword and smiled, “Elder Pan Shan, if you have anything to say, just say it.”","Jian Wushuang finally understood. If Elder Pan Shan had really come to expose him, he would not have come alone. The God Refining Sect Master would have led the way and set up an ambush in the surroundings.","However, the divine power he spread out did not detect any signs of an ambush outside.","When Elder Pan Shan heard this, he became silent. He looked at Jian Wushuang for a long time before he said slowly, “You guys were too careless this time. You weren’t careful enough. If the God Refining Sect really had the intention to investigate, you wouldn’t have been able to hide at all.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change, but his heart skipped a beat.","This sentence was already equivalent to a clear indication.","“I know, but it’s an emergency. I don’t have time to plan everything out,” Jian Wushuang replied in a deep voice.","Elder Pan Shan sighed and seemed to understand Jian Wushuang’s dilemma. He replied, “Don’t worry. On the day you joined the sect, I have already taken care of all these things for you. Some time ago, the God Refining Sect sent people to the Liyang Starfield to verify your information. I have also arranged for them to handle everything.”","Pausing for a moment, Elder Pan Shan turned his head and looked through the Corpse Cave into the endless starry sky. It was as if he was looking at another universe from this universe. He seemed to be reminiscing and said in a hoarse voice, “Wushuang, how’s the situation under that starry sky?”","Jian Wushuang did not answer.","Elder Pan Shan did not ask any further. He knew that even at this moment, Jian Wushuang still had a trace of wariness in his heart. This was understandable. After all, from Jian Wushuang’s point of view, he could not rule out the possibility that Pan Shan had played him at his own game and asked him a question in reverse.","However, Elder Pan Shan was mumbling to himself.","“Back then, the seven of us were ordered to come to this universe. We thought that we would be able to investigate the situation of this universe very quickly, but we didn’t expect that our identities were exposed too early, and we were hunted down by the top powers of this universe...”","“Song Feng, Feidu, and the other Fellow Daoists were killed one after another. The Palace Master escaped with his men. I was supposed to die, but. managed to survive and entered the God Refining Sect by accident...”","Jian Wushuang did not interrupt Elder Pan Shan as he spoke slowly. Instead, he listened quietly.","He knew that Pan Shan had been silent for tens of thousands of chaos cycles, and that he had been holding these words back for tens of thousands of chaos cycles. He needed someone to listen to.","Although his words were plain, Jian Wushuang could feel the tragedy, danger, and magnificence of the past.","A moment later.","When Elder Pan Shan finished, he rubbed his eyes and said, “Wushuang, in the past tens of thousands of years, I have never been able to contact my hometown. It’s not good for me to leave so rashly because I know that Lord Cosmos God will definitely send people over again to continue the path that we have yet to complete and the things that we have yet to complete.”","“I’ve been waiting for tens of thousands of chaos cycles, and you’ve finally come.”","“This is the information I’ve gathered in the God Refining Sect over the past tens of thousands of chaos cycles. If you have a way, please pass it on to Lord Cosmos God. This is an extremely important matter, and you must not let anyone else know of it.”","“This was because... I suspect that there are people from this universe in our universe, and they hold high positions!”","After saying that, Elder Pan Shan flipped his right hand and a bamboo tube appeared in his hand. He handed it to Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4496,"title":"Chapter 4496 The Awakening","paragraphs":["4496 The Awakening","In the Divine Power Universe, there was also a spy from the Void Universe?","Jian Wushuang frowned.","In an instant, familiar faces flashed past Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","However, after thinking for a long time, Jian Wushuang still could not determine who had been sent by the Void Universe.","“Wushuang, I am only suspicious. As for whether or not this person really exists, I can’t be certain, so there’s no need for us to think too much. We just need to be careful. When the battle erupts again, this person will naturally surface,” Elder Pan Shan said in a deep voice.","“That’s reasonable.”","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and nodded. Then, he took the bamboo tube that Pan Shan handed to him and put it into his Interspatial Ring carefully.","This bamboo tube looked light, but it was extremely heavy. It was the blood, sweat, and tears of Pan Shan for tens of thousands of void eras.","“Alright, Wushuang. This old man has come this time for a most important matter.”","Elder Pan Shan took a deep breath, then flipped his right hand again. A hexagonal red crystal ball appeared in his palm.","An extremely pure and boundless void energy spread out from it.","“This is...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly narrowed.","“It’s a treasure,” Elder Pan Shan said solemnly. “For the past tens of thousands of void eras, other than gathering information in the God Refining Sect, I have spent most of my time researching this item.”","“This old man calls it the Void Power Crystal Core. It’s formed from the most original power of void power. As long as you swallow this Void Power Crystal Core, the void power inside can instantly change the structure of your divine body, making you a true Void Warrior.”","“After swallowing this Void Power Crystal Core, not only will you be able to derive the most iconic thing of a Void Warrior, which is the Void Star or the Void Scar, you will also awaken your accompanying magical ability, the Void Explosion!”","“Furthermore, the most important thing is that if you want to turn it into divine power, you only need to think about it and you can turn it back into divine power. The void explosion will not disappear and will be displayed in the form of divine power. As for the effect, I have been in the God Refining Sect for a long time and have not used it before. But I think it should not be too weak.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly grew!","This item was going to shock the heavens!","It could be said that the existence of this Void Power Crystal Core would truly break through the barrier between the Void Universe and the Divine Power Universe, allowing them to achieve a perfect fusion and achieve an ultimate sublimation!","One of the main reasons why the Void Universe was stronger than the Divine Power Universe was that the Void Universe had one more trump card than the Divine Power Universe. It was the accompanying divine power of the Void Warriors, the Void Explosion!","Even Jian Wushuang did not dare to underestimate the power of the Void Explosion. Its power was comparable to all the moves in Jian Wushuang’s Tarot Sword Manual, except for ‘Four Seasons’ and ‘Tarot’!","What kind of concept was this?","Not just anyone could compare themselves with Jian Wushuang in the Divine Power Universe!","It could be said that in the same cultivation realm, if a person from the Divine Power Universe was not a genius with battle power far beyond the same realm, he would only be crushed by a Void Warrior of the same realm!","However, this Void Power Crystal Core could give the person with the Divine Power Universe the ability to rival the Void Universe!","The preciousness of this item could be seen from this point alone.","Jian Wushuang looked at Elder Pan Shan again, his eyes filled with admiration.","“Wushuang, swallow this Void Power Crystal Core. Once you swallow it, you’ll no longer have any flaws. From now on, you’ll be able to connect the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe,” said Elder Pan Shan.","“I can’t!” Jian Wushuang shook his head upon hearing this.","This was Elder Pan Shan’s blood, sweat, and tears, the blood and sweat of an Invincible Supreme for tens of thousands of chaos cycles. How could he possibly covet it?","“Don’t talk nonsense. Since this old man wants you to take it, you should take it. Don’t learn from that girl’s pretentious act.”","Elder Pan Shan pushed the Void Power Crystal Core into Jian Wushuang’s hand and immediately turned around to leave.","“This...” Jian Wushuang nodded silently and put it away solemnly.","When he reached the entrance of the Corpse Cave, Elder Pan Shan stopped and turned his head. He said softly, “Wushuang, if you can really enter the Land of Gods, and if my old friends are still alive, remember to tell them that I’m doing very well. Don’t miss me.”","With that, Elder Pan Shan no longer hesitated. With a step, his thin and hunchbacked figure disappeared under the thin blood-colored moonlight.","Jian Wushuang looked at Elder Pan Shan’s disappearing back and a complicated look flashed in his eyes.","He suddenly remembered that in the history of the Divine Power Universe, there was a record of a Daoist called ‘Ban Shan’ who once dominated the universe and suppressed the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands. However, for some reason, the once-influential Daoist Ban Shan suddenly disappeared.","This Grand Elder Pan Shan was probably the Daoist Ban Shan who had mysteriously disappeared back then.","...","After Elder Pan Shan left, Jian Wushuang sat down with his legs crossed and carefully examined the hexagonal red crystal ball.","“Produce the Void Scar and awaken the accompanying divine ability, Void Explosion...”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a thoughtful look. After a moment of contemplation, he no longer hesitated and swallowed the Void Power Crystal Core!","Boom!","In an instant, a sharp pain came from Jian Wushuang’s divine body!","Even though Jian Wushuang had the Chaos Overlord Body, which was one of the top three divine bodies in the eternal world, it was torn apart in an instant. His entire divine body was being burned as if it had been thrown into a furnace that was hundreds of millions of degrees.","“Hiss!” Jian Wushuang could not help but shout and his divine body exploded.","The next moment.","His divine body gathered again. The pain twisted his divine soul. It felt like hundreds of millions of needles were stabbing his pores. His divine body was crushed again.","As it crumbled, Jian Wushuang could feel an extremely terrifying and powerful force emitting from the Void Power Crystal Core. It started to change Jian Wushuang’s life structure bit by bit and pushed toward the Void Warrior.","After being shattered and reassembled dozens of times...","The intense pain slowly disappeared.","An aura that was completely different from Jian Wushuang’s before burst out from his body.","“Success... It’s done?”","Jian Wushuang’s face was pale, and he was panting slightly. Bean-sized beads of sweat formed on his forehead.","...","He turned his head slightly to take a look. On his left shoulder, there were two long, scarlet red scars. They were like scars, spreading and twisting from his left shoulder.","Jian Wushuang could feel that although his divine body and cultivation did not seem to have changed, there was something different about him.","“This is void power?”","Jian Wushuang could feel the void power in his body that was as vast as a river. He could not help but squint his eyes.","In the next moment, he was not in a hurry to awaken the accompanying divine ability, Void Explosion. Instead, he reached out to touch the black seal on his neck and a cold smile appeared on his face.","“It’s time to get rid of you.”"]},{"number":4497,"title":"Chapter 4497 Eliminating Hidden Dangers","paragraphs":["4497 Eliminating Hidden Dangers","The moon was high up in the sky.","At the top of the limestone mountain, in one of the seven Corpse Caves, it was Jian Wushuang’s mansion.","It was undergoing a shocking change that reversed the structure of life.","Waves of enormous void power surged like the ocean and swept in all directions.","This was a completely new power.","On Jian Wushuang’s left shoulder, there were two long scars that looked like hideous scars. They reflected an evil scarlet light, which was terrifying to look at.","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes. This power was completely different from the void power that was transformed from divine power.","In the past, when he had stayed in the Void Universe, he had been like a fish out of water. His divine body had always felt uncomfortable, and he had felt out of place.","However, now, he could feel that he had completely integrated into this universe, just like in the universe of divine power. There was no discomfort at all.","The floating void force in the air around him only needed to be lightly inhaled, and it would pour into his divine body like a whale sucking in water. He did not need to change its structure or transform it anymore.","“It’s time to get rid of you.”","A cold glint flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. Immediately, the void power that was flowing in his body started to circulate crazily and it charged toward the seal on his neck.","The power of the curse that Wang Liu had left in Jian Wushuang’s body was not strong after being suppressed by Cosmos God. However, it was like a needle hidden in cotton. No matter how dense and surging the divine power in Jian Wushuang’s body was, there was nothing he could do about it as the two powers were not compatible.","However, the situation was different now.","Rumble!!","In an instant, all the void power in Jian Wushuang’s body was activated and it rushed toward the curse of Wang Liu that was hidden on his neck!","Crack!!!","In an instant, the seal was broken.","The power of Wang Liu that remained in Jian Wushuang’s body was overjoyed. Just as it was about to fight for control of Jian Wushuang’s divine body, it saw countless forces of void power condense into a heavy hammer and hit him fiercely!","“What?”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned dark green and his body was covered with black snake-shaped scales.","He did not open its mouth, but his throat rolled and made a sound that was different from Jian Wushuang’s.","It was Wang Liu’s voice.","Wang Liu was already dead, but his consciousness had turned into the power of the curse. It was like a deep-rooted disease that was firmly rooted in Jian Wushuang’s body.","However, now, the void power in Jian Wushuang’s body was like a security guard with nation protecting divine sword in his hand. He was crazily chasing after the power left by Wang Liu.","Jian Wushuang’s divine body turned into a battlefield.","The divine power that belonged to Jian Wushuang was in Jian Wushuang’s divine body. It was a life-and-death battle with the consciousness curse left by Wang Liu.","Jian Wushuang was sitting cross-legged on the stone bed with one side of his eyes closed and no expression on his face. However, if one looked carefully, one would notice that there was a small snake-like thing in his muscles and tendons. It was moving quickly in his body, as if it was running away from something.","After an entire day and night.","With a hysterical roar, Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and spat out a mouthful of black blood.","There seemed to be something twisting and struggling in the black blood.","“It’s done!” Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a hint of joy flashed in his eyes.","He flicked his finger and a beam of Sword Qi shot out, turning the stinky black blood into green smoke and disappearing in the air.","Wang Liu’s curse was like a thorn in the flesh. It would come out from time to time and hurt, especially when Jian Wushuang was weak after he completely burst out his power. Wang Liu would take advantage of the weakness and fight with him for control of his body.","Finally, the thorn was pulled out of Jian Wushuang’s body.","“Next, it’s time to awaken the accompanying magical power of the Void Warrior, Void Explosion!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he once again entered the deepest level of seclusion and attack.","...","Three months later.","A black crow flew out of the Sect Master’s palace and headed toward the Corpse Cave where Jian Wushuang was.","The crow’s body was stiff, and its eyes were like two rotten grapes, completely black.","This crow was also known as the corpse crow in the God Refining Sect. It was extremely fast and could travel through the void. It was the best tool for transmitting messages.","Ga ga ga!","The Corpse Crow stopped on a branch that extended out of the cliff outside the Corpse Cave, opening its mouth and letting out an unpleasant and eerie cry.","Hearing the cry, Jian Wushuang, who was in the Corpse Cave, slowly opened his eyes.","An extremely sharp light flashed across Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“Is the mission about to begin?”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and let out a breath of turbid air. He waved his hand and removed the magic barrier at the entrance of the Corpse Cave.","Gah gah.","In an instant, the corpse crow flapped its wings and flew into the Corpse Cave.","The next moment, the corpse crow spoke in the human language. “Wushuang, Wushuang, the Sect Master has invited you.”","“I know.” Jian Wushuang nodded and then stood up.","The corpse crow flapped its wings again and landed on Jian Wushuang’s shoulder.","Bang! Bang!","...","Jian Wushuang’s right foot stomped heavily and his whole body shot up like a cannonball. He carried the corpse crow and turned into a ray of light. Suddenly, he was like a shooting star, flying across the blood-red sky of the God Refining Sect and landing in the Sect Master’s palace.","After reaching the Sect Master’s Palace, the body dissipated into black mist and disappeared from the world.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and strode into the Sect Master’s hall.","In the Sect Master’s main hall, the God Refining Sect Master, Void Master Ba Huang, sat at the head of the table. On either side of him were the five Grand Elders, including Pan Shan, Mi Feng, and Lanyue.","In addition, there were two other disciples who had arrived before Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang knew both of them. One of them was Fu Chen, who had made a name for himself in the Sect Disciples Competition and the other was Yan Dan, who was now in the limelight.","Seeing Jian Wushuang enter, Fu Chen’s pupils shrank slightly and a serious look flashed across his eyes. Yan Dan, on the other hand, let out a heavy, cold snort.","Jian Wushuang ignored them and looked at the God Refining Sect Master. He cupped his hands and said in a deep voice, “Disciple Wushuang greets Sect Master!”","“Yes.” The God Refining Sect Master sized up Jian Wushuang, smiled, and nodded in agreement.","Even though he did not know what had happened to Jian Wushuang, he could tell that Jian Wushuang’s aura had become much more powerful than before.","This made his heart skip a beat. Before long, the plan on the battlefield would be completed. He would then leave the God Refining Sect and join the attacking army.","...","At that time, he would have to choose one of his many disciples to inherit the throne and become the Sect Master.","In the beginning, he only had one successor, and that was Yan Dan.","However, Jian Wushuang’s appearance made him waver."]},{"number":4498,"title":"Chapter 4498 Set Off to the Land of Gods","paragraphs":["4498 Set Off to the Land of Gods","Yan Dan.","This person was the only person that the God Refining Sect Master had already decided on to take over the throne.","However, with Jian Wushuang’s appearance and the dispute between Yan Dan and Jian Wushuang at the Sect Master’s banquet that day, the God Refining Sect Master gradually became disappointed in Yan Dan.","Sensitive, easily angered, headstrong, narrow-minded, ambitious, and not shrewd.","This was the Yan Dan that the God Refining Sect Master had seen at the banquet the other day.","How could such a person control a Holy Land and lead it to glory?","That day, he did not point out these things. For one, no matter what, Yan Dan was still his head disciple. He could not scold him in front of the whole sect. For two, if he told Yan Dan all his feelings, it would be hard to avoid imbalance in his heart and resentment.","The God Refining Sect Master naturally did not care about resentment, but there was no need for it.","On the contrary, Jian Wushuang’s performance that day had made him somewhat amazed.","He was neither haughty nor humble, and his expression was calm.","When the God Refining Sect Master looked at Jian Wushuang that day, he could not help but say something from the bottom of his heart.","‘A heart with thousands of thunderbolts and a face as calm as a Lake could become a general!’","Exceptional talent represented the upper limit of Jian Wushuang’s growth. His outstanding wisdom meant that Jian Wushuang would never bring the God Refining Sect into a land of eternal doom!","All of a sudden, Void Master Ba Huang’s heart started to waver when he thought about the position of the next Sect Master.","The hall was silent.","Since the God Refining Sect Master did not say anything, the others naturally did not dare to make any noise.","After a long while, the God Refining Sect Master finally opened his mouth and said, “I’m sure you know why this Sect Master has gathered you here today, right?”","Before anyone could say anything, Yan Dan stepped forward and said, “Lord Sect Master, I’m guessing that the mission is about to begin?”","“That’s right.” The God Refining Sect Master nodded his head. He then looked at the crowd and said in a deep voice, “I’ve just received news that the other sects and forces have already sent their disciples to the Land of Gods. You should also not delay and set off for the Land of Gods immediately!”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang, Fu Chen, and Yan Dan lowered their heads and said.","At this moment, they knew that the three of them were the candidates to go to the Land of Gods.","“Wushuang, oh Wushuang, let’s see if you’ll die after we leave the God Refining Sect!”","Yan Dan lowered his head and looked at Jian Wushuang, sneering.","A vicious plan began to form in his mind.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless, but he had his own thoughts.","It would be fine if Yan Dan acted obediently along the way, but if he wanted to be stupid and court death, Jian Wushuang did not mind sending him on his way.","“Alright, you three can set off.”","“Remember, don’t force anything, and be careful of people from other sects.”","The Sect Master said in a deep voice. Then, he waved his sleeve and a giant bird that looked like a bone dragon flew out from the back mountain of the God Refining Sect.","This giant bird had no hair, no flesh, only white bones. Its eyes were completely black.","On his back, there was a high platform for people to step on.","Jian Wushuang and the other two took a step forward and immediately flew up, landing on the high platform on the back of the giant bird.","Screeeeeech!!","The giant bird stretched out its head and let out a long screech. It immediately carried Jian Wushuang and the others and shuttled through 108,000 miles. They left the God Refining Sect and shot toward the Land of Gods.","The God Refining Sect Master took a deep look at the place where Jian Wushuang and the other two had disappeared. He shook his head and only looked away after a long while.","In the main hall, Elder Ban Shan also looked at the three people who had disappeared and was lost in thought for a long time.","...","God Refining Sect, Elder Hall.","At the residence of Elder Shen Lian.","Thud, thud, thud, thud.","A series of hurried footsteps could be heard.","A trusted disciple of Elder Shen Lian walked in hurriedly.","“Master, Young Master Yan Dan, Wushuang, and Fu Chen have already left the God Refining Sect on the giant bone bird,” the trusted disciple knelt on the ground and said in a low voice.","“Oh? They left just like that?”","In the center of the hall, Elder Shen Lian, who was sitting cross-legged, opened his eyes. A sharp glint flashed in his eyes.","“Alright, alright. I’ll leave now. If the Sect Master asks where I’ve gone, just say that I’ve come to a sudden realization and left the sect to look for a breakthrough opportunity. Do you understand?”","“I understand!” the trusted disciple quickly replied.","“Mmm.” Nodding his head in satisfaction, Elder Shen Lian stood up. He took a step and disappeared from the Elder Hall.","“Wushuang, Wushuang, the Land of Gods will be where your bones are buried!”","In the void, Elder Shen Lian’s cold voice was heard.","...","At the same time.","Not far away from the God Refining Sect, there was a group of bright stars.","This place was close to the Void Forbidden Land and was sparsely populated. Very few people would pay attention to this place.","...","However, such a place was where the Crimson Whale Gang, the largest gang of space pirates in the surrounding billions of miles, was located.","This group of space pirates was notorious for robbing Void Warriors who passed by in space all year round. The entire Void Universe gritted its teeth at them, but there was nothing they could do.","The reason for this was that the Chief of Crimson Whale Gang was a Four Scar Void Master!","Under the leadership of this Four Scar Void Master, the entire Crimson Whale Gang had become extremely rampant. Even Scar-level Void Warriors would have a headache when they saw him and could only obediently pay in treasures to bribe him to avoid trouble.","Crimson Whale Gang’s headquarters was located in the middle of the stars, like the belly of a giant whale.","At this moment, the Chief of Crimson Whale Gang, who struck fear in the hearts of others at the mere mention of his name, was kneeling obediently at the feet of a silver-haired youth with icy eyes.","“L-Lord Bing Ye, I’ve received news that the Land of Gods has opened. All the major forces and sects in the Void Universe have sent their elite disciples to the Land of Gods to break through the restrictions and find the alien races.”","The Chief’s entire body trembled as he spoke, not even daring to take a deep breath.","It could be seen that the Chief was extremely afraid of this silver-haired youth.","“Hmm.” The silver-haired youth with icy eyes nodded expressionlessly and asked, “Luo Ming, I asked you to send someone to inquire about ‘Jian Wushuang’ in the God Refining Sect. Do you have any news?”","“Lord Bing Ye, I’ve sent someone to ask around. There’s no one named Jian Wushuang in the God Refining Sect. Instead, there’s someone named ‘Wushuang’ who passed the selection and entered the God Refining Sect. He has a rare talent in the God Refining Sect.”","...","“Wushuang?” The silver-haired youth squinted his eyes and sneered, “Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang, you’re really lucky. You didn’t die that day. Instead, you managed to enter the God Refining Sect and become a super talent, a Heaven’s Favorite disciple.”","Shaking his head, the silver-haired youth continued to ask, “Let me ask you, how is Wushuang’s current situation?”","“Wushuang, huh? My Lord, according to my spy, Wushuang has already left the God Refining Sect and is following two other disciples to the Land of Gods!”","“He also went to the Land of Gods?”","The silver-haired youth’s brows twitched, and then he laughed. “Good, good, good. Jian Wushuang, I’ll wait for you in the Land of Gods!”","With that, he lowered his head and instructed the original Crimson Whale Gang’s Chief, “Luo Ming, get ready. We’re going to the Land of Gods!”","“Yes!” The Chief head respectfully retreated.","After the Chief left, the silver-haired youth raised his head and looked into the distance. A cold light flashed through his eyes.","This person was none other than Supreme Bing Ye, who had entered the Void Universe with Jian Wushuang!"]},{"number":4499,"title":"Chapter 4499 Supreme Gongyang","paragraphs":["4499 Supreme Gongyang","At the same time.","Even further away from the God Refining Sect.","In the core of a star.","An old man with a refined temperament, a clear face, and a cautious expression slowly exhaled.","“It’s been so long. The people from the God Refining Sect who were chasing after me should have left by now.”","The old man narrowed his eyes as he pondered.","He was none other than Supreme Gongyang, who had escaped from the God Refining Sect’s disciple selection!","On the day of the sect’s disciple selection, when he saw that his identity had been exposed, he was the first to escape. He was lucky to escape from the hands of a few Scar-level Void Warriors.","After that, he went into the core of the earth and sealed his aura. He had been in seclusion until now.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Beams of light streaked across the star.","Soon after, Supreme Gongyang heard a series of discussions coming from the mouths of the passing figures.","“Have you heard that the restrictions on the Land of Gods have loosened again? All the sects have sent their elites to the Land of Gods to investigate.”","“I heard that there’s a big secret hidden in the Land of Gods!”","“Shush, silence. I vaguely heard that people who are not from our universe are suppressed in the Land of Gods!”","“What? Not from our universe? Could there be another universe?”","“Lower your voice! I’ve only heard about this matter from our sect’s old ancestor. It’s a great secret, so you must not tell anyone.”","...","Discussions broke out one after another, and Supreme Gongyang, who was hiding in the depths of the earth, could not help but raise his eyebrows.","“The Land of Gods? It’s suppressing people who aren’t from this universe?”","Supreme Gongyang’s eyes flickered madly. He could faintly feel that he had grasped onto a great secret.","“It seems that I have to make a trip to the Land of Gods.”","“I wonder how Jian Wushuang and the others are doing after all these years. Did they manage to escape that day?”","As his thoughts flickered, Supreme Gongyang flew high up into the sky. When a single person was left behind, his right hand suddenly broke out of the ground, transforming into a giant hand.","Boom!","The 7-Star Void Warrior with an elephant’s nose and ears was alone. He looked at the huge hand shadow that suddenly broke out of the ground and covered the sky. Before he could use his void technique to resist, he was grabbed by the palm of the hand.","Immediately.","Supreme Gongyang, who was in the depths of the earth’s core, soared into the sky and casually opened up a Divine Kingdom, throwing the Void Warrior into it.","A moment later.","Supreme Gongyang walked out of the void with a satisfied expression. He had already obtained the information he wanted.","“Land of Gods, I’m coming!”","Bang!","In the next moment, he stomped his right foot heavily and shot out, rushing in the direction of the Land of Gods.","...","Inside the Void Universe.","As the restrictions of the Land of Gods loosened, many top forces sent their geniuses to the Land of Gods to investigate. Therefore, the universe suddenly became very lively.","In the vast starry sky.","A huge bone bird with a wingspan of ten thousand feet was flying at high speed.","Its speed was extremely fast, and it could travel hundreds of thousands of miles with a single leap. Its wings cut through the void, creating a huge sonic boom.","Jian Wushuang stood on the high platform on the bone back with his hands behind his back. Because of his fast speed, the strong wind that was produced was like a knife cutting across his face.","This gust of wind was extremely sharp. If it was an ordinary Star-level Void Warrior, his flesh and bones would be scraped off in an instant by this gust of wind.","However, the strong wind could only move Jian Wushuang’s hair. It could not even leave a single scar on his body.","Of the three, it was not so easy for Fu Chen to deal with the astral winds. He could only continuously circulate his void power to form a protective barrier to continuously resist this divine power.","He looked at Yan Dan and Jian Wushuang, who were safe and sound on the high platform. His eyes flickered and his face was filled with fear.","He was not surprised that the Yan Dan was able to resist this bone-piercing wind. After all, the Yan Dan had already broken through to the Scar-level.","Jian Wushuang’s realm was almost the same as his, so how could he resist the strong wind so easily?","Fu Chen could not help but think to himself that the reason he had been able to display his brilliance in the sect’s disciple competition was most likely because Wushuang had not participated in the competition.","Yan Dan stood behind Jian Wushuang and kept snorting.","He was hesitating whether he should kill Jian Wushuang now.","Earlier on, his father, Elder Shen Lian, had already sent him a message. Elder Shen Lian had already left the God Refining Sect and was rushing toward them at full speed. It would not be long before the two of them would meet up.","Elder Shen Lian had a cultivation base of Three Scars.","Yan Dan was confident that with his and his father’s power, killing Jian Wushuang would be as easy as flipping his hand.","After thinking for a long time.","“Forget it. I’ll find an opportunity to kill him after I return from the Land of Gods.”","...","Yan Dan’s eyes lit up and he took a deep breath. He gave up the idea of killing Jian Wushuang immediately.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing in front of the high platform with his back to Yan Dan, naturally felt the fleeting killing intent from Yan Dan.","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang did not take it to heart and continued to look into the distance.","...","Almost a year later.","The lonely starry sky gradually became lively.","Other than the huge bone bird that the three of them were stepping on, there were also other strange vehicles that were coming from all directions.","For example, there was a huge golden gourd. On top of the gourd sat a group of young men in long black clothes with a vertical eye between their brows. On the top of the gourd was a flag with the words ‘Heaven’s Gate’ written on it.","“Oh? The Heaven’s Gate brats are here too?” Yan Dan narrowed his eyes and let out a cold snort.","This group of Heaven’s Gate disciples also saw Yan Dan and the other two who were standing on the giant bone bird. The corners of their mouths curled up into a sneer. The three-eyed man, who was the leader, even sneered. “Isn’t this the person I defeated in the sect exchange competition back then? It seems like the God Refining Sect really has talent left. They actually allowed such a weak guy to lead a team into the sealed Land of Gods.”","He shook his head as he spoke, his face full of contempt.","...","It was obvious that the two families had a grudge against each other.","Yan Dan’s face darkened as soon as he finished speaking.","“Xuan Kang, a real man doesn’t boast about his past achievements. A temporary victory is nothing. Let’s fight again this time!” Yan Dan said with an unsightly expression.","“Hahaha, how difficult is that? This time, don’t cry and ask your old ghostly father to come and save you!”","The leader of the Heaven’s Gate team laughed and left.","“Bastard!” Yan Dan’s eyes flashed with a fierce look as he watched the Heaven’s Gate team leave.","As he turned his eyes, he saw Jian Wushuang looking at him with a faint smile. He could not help but be extremely angry and scolded, “Wushuang, why are you looking at me? Let me tell you, the Heaven’s Gate has always had a grudge against our God Refining Sect. If anything happens to me, you won’t get any benefits!”"]},{"number":4500,"title":"Chapter 4500 Old Enemies in Person","paragraphs":["4500 Old Enemies in Person","Time flew by, and another month passed.","Along the way, Jian Wushuang, Yan Dan, and the others saw many disciples from various sects coming from all directions.","These people were all high-spirited and had an average cultivation of 6-Star and above. Some of them were even at the Scar-level.","However, the highest was only at the One Scar level. The higher one’s cultivation level was, the greater the rejection from the restrictions of the Land of Gods!","Many of them recognized Yan Dan. Some of them were friendly, while some of them looked at him coldly. It was clear that the God Refining Sect was quite famous in the Void Universe.","A moment later, a huge Star Field appeared in front of everyone.","They had arrived at the Land of Gods!","Around the Star Field, countless battleships and flying Dharma Treasures flew across the void. The genius disciples from the top sects and forces were all waiting for the moment when the restrictions of the Land of Gods were the weakest.","“Is this the Land of Gods?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked up.","It was not appropriate to call the Land of Gods a Star Field because it was made up of many restrictions.","A total of 99 restrictions!","Each restriction was like a millstone ring of light that sealed off all routes of entry. A total of 99 restrictions overlapped and formed a terrifying array that could kill Immortals and Gods!","These 99 restrictions were covered in celestial light. After a slight twist, they formed a 100-foot-wide void that isolated all life!","These 99 restrictions sealed off all paths of entry and also cut off all paths of exit!","According to Elder Mi Feng, the power of these 99 restrictive spells was so great that even a Six Scar Void Master would be severely injured if they entered and would have to retreat halfway. As for any Void Warrior below the Six Scar level, they would be instantly killed and their Dao would disappear if they took a single step into the restrictive spells.","Its terrifying aspect could be seen from this.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and felt the aura of the 99 restrictions. They were extremely familiar.","This was... it was the smell of divine power.","In addition, he also felt a trace of a special life source from the 99 restrictions!","This made him certain that the person who had set up the 99 restrictions that had rendered the entire Void Universe helpless was the Divine Life Palace Palace Master, who had disappeared for tens of thousands of chaos cycles and had not been heard from for tens of thousands of chaos cycles!","For a moment, Jian Wushuang was filled with emotions.","He began to look forward to the fact that the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had not died and that the two of them could meet in the Land of Gods.","Time slowly passed.","No one moved. Instead, they waited for the 99 restrictions to be at their weakest before quickly entering.","Gradually, more and more disciples from the top sects entered the Land of Gods.","...","Rumble!","A huge whale-like ship with a white bone flag and ferocious bone spikes flew over from the distance.","On this huge ship, a series of wild and savage laughter rang out.","“Little rascals, the Crimson Whale Gang is here!”","“Crimson Whale Gang’s orders. Everyone, get lost!”","“Caw caw caw! This Land of Gods shall be occupied by Crimson Whale Gang!”","On the ship, countless space pirates glanced at the disciples of the various sects and laughed.","On the deck of the ship, the silver-haired and icy-eyed Supreme Bing Ye stood with his hands clasped behind his back, his face filled with pride.","Behind him, the original Crimson Whale Gang’s Cheif, Luo Ming, bent his knees slightly, his hands hanging by his sides and his head lowered. He no longer had the air of a Great Bandit who had rampaged through the universe, but was instead as respectful as an old servant.","The crowd’s pupils constricted and their expressions changed slightly as they watched Crimson Whale Gang approach them with no fear.","“The group of galactic pirates, the Crimson Whale Gang is here!”","“This group of stinky fish and rotten shrimp, why are they everywhere?”","“Dammit! Why did this group of sh*t-stirrers come to the Land of Gods? Also, who was that person standing on the deck? Why is Crimson Whale Gang’s Cheif standing at the back, as if he’s worshiping his Master?”","Many disciples of the Holy Lands and sects said in low voices.","This group of galactic pirates, the Crimson Whale Gang, was simply too notorious in the virtual universe. Individually, they were not considered strong, but they formed groups and used underhanded methods. With the Four Scar level Chief Luo Ming leading them, they were extremely difficult to deal with.","Even some Scar Level Void Warriors would die in their hands if they did not behave.","They had never expected the Crimson Whale Gang to appear here.","Moreover, from the looks of it, the Crimson Whale Gang had already changed hands.","The silver-haired youth with icy eyes standing on the deck had an unfathomable aura.","He would probably be even more powerful than the original Crimson Whale Gang’s Chief, Luo Ming!","At the thought of this, everyone could not help but look at each other, their hearts sinking.","If this group of people from Crimson Whale Gang waited for them to enter the Land of Gods and waited at the entrance to take advantage of the situation, they would be finished.","On the platform of the giant bone bird.","Jian Wushuang raised his head as well and looked at the group of arrogant Crimson Whale Gang members.","Standing on the deck, how could he not see the leader?","Who else could this silver-haired youth be but Supreme Bing Ye?","Supreme Bing Ye also noticed Jian Wushuang, who was standing on the back of the giant bone bird.","The enmity between the two extended from the Divine Power Universe to the Void Universe, and they had long since reached a point where they would not rest until one of them was dead.","...","Now that they were facing each other, their gazes met in the air and instantly created an intense invisible spark!","The corners of Supreme Bing Ye’s mouth gradually curved into a cold smile. His lips moved slightly and he spat out nine words silently at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He recognized the nine words.","‘The Land of Gods, a battle to the death!’","Jian Wushuang’s eyes could not help but flash with coldness.","When he had first entered the Void Universe, he had wanted to temporarily put aside his personal grudges with Supreme Bing Ye. After all, the Divine Power Universe was facing an external enemy, and it was a matter of life and death. Personal grudges and old grudges could not compare to the universe being in danger.","However, Bing Ye had set him up during the God Refining Sect’s disciple selection when they entered the Void Universe. Bing Ye wanted to kill him!","He, Jian Wushuang, had never been a saint who could be manipulated by others!","“That’s good. Let’s settle the new and old grudges in the Land of Gods!” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and a cold killing intent flashed in his eyes!","On Crimson Whale Gang’s ship.","“Lord Bing Ye, that brat from the God Refining Sect is Wushuang. Does he have a grudge against you, Lord? Do you need me to kill him on the spot?”","...","Luo Ming, the Crimson Whale Gang’s Chief, who was standing behind Supreme Bing Ye like an old servant, noticed the exchange of gazes between Supreme Bing Ye and Jian Wushuang.","He immediately said in a cold voice. “You want to kill him?”","Supreme Bing Ye looked down at Luo Ming and shook his head in disdain.","Immediately, his eyes gushed with bone-piercing resentment.","“I must kill this person. I want to skin him alive and pull out his tendons so that he can experience the greatest pain and torture in this world!”","Luo Ming, who had his head lowered, heard this, and his heart trembled.","What kind of enmity was there between the two of them?","“Let’s go into the Land of Gods. I can’t avoid my battle with this man today. Let’s fight in the Land of Gods.”","After a short while, Supreme Bing Ye took a deep breath and his expression gradually returned to normal."]}]);
